window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4301,"title":"Chapter 4301 Re-Establishing Sword Union","paragraphs":["4301 Re-Establishing Sword Union","“What is this?”","Jian Wushuang picked up the token and squinted his eyes.","The handle of the token was formed by a nine-fingered Dragon Claw, and the tip of the token was a huge dragon head, roaring in anger. Although it was carved into a dead object, it gave people a sense of fear. It was as if there was a huge Dragon that could swallow the sun and moon, staring at Jian Wushuang and forcing him to let go of the token.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang snorted coldly and a vast amount of divine power gushed out immediately. It wiped away the aura that someone had left on the token.","Jian Wushuang looked at the token carefully again.","There was a line of small words engraved on the token.","The fifth generation Flame Dragon, Long Han.","“Is this Qiu Long’s real name?” Jian Wushuang was lost in thought.","The Dragon race was one of the most ancient races in the universe. They had been around since the birth of the universe’s first Ancestral Dragon, and had reproduced for countless chaos cycles. However, it was extremely difficult for the Dragon race to produce offspring, and they had only been around for seven generations. Other than a few atavism phenomena, generally speaking, the closer the Dragon was to the Ancestral Dragon, the stronger the power of the generation.","And this Qiu Long must be the fifth generation of the Dragon Clan.","“If I’m not wrong, this Dragon pattern token should be the Dragon clan’s pass.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered with thoughts. The Dragon clan’s habitat had always been the biggest mystery in the universe. Some said that the Dragon clan was 90000 miles deep in the sea, some said that it was in the center of the earth, and some said that it was above the 18 levels of heaven. In short, there were many different opinions and no one could give a true answer.","After all, ever since the birth of the Dragon clan, there had never been a real Dragon clan that had fallen in the outside world.","Therefore, the outside world naturally knew very little about the Dragon clan.","‘Perhaps I can use this token to find the location of the Dragon clan.’","Jian Wushuang touched the slightly warm token with his fingers. For him, the dragon clan was indeed powerful and could definitely cause a destructive blow to him. However, it was impossible for the dragon clan to use the entire clan’s power to deal with Jian Wushuang alone. Not to mention how much turmoil it would set off in the universe, it would be too embarrassing.","At most, they would only send a law-enforcement officer.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang reached out to touch the sandalwood sword case beside him, and a touch of coldness flashed in his eyes.","It had been twenty thousand years since he had obtained the Tarot sword in the Tarot ruins.","For the past twenty thousand years, Jian Wushuang had infused sword Qi into the Tarot divine sword to nourish it every day. Even now, Jian Wushuang did not know how many sword Qi were sealed in the Tarot divine sword that had never been unsheathed!","It was an astronomical figure that even Jian Wushuang was terrified of!","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang put the sandalwood sword case on his back and walked out of the palace in a black robe and a big black linen hood.","Due to the battle between Jian Wushuang and Qiu Long, the ruins of the 18th city had been completely repaired. Except for the sword mark that split the 18th city into two sides, the 18th city was no different from before.","In the 18th city, the Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint, Commander Mountain Shaker, and Ruler Hao Jin stood silently on both sides of the palace that Qiu Long had built.","Jian Wushuang strode in and naturally turned around to sit on the throne in the deepest part of the hall. Then, he glanced at their faces and said in a deep voice without any expression, “Everyone, now that the 18th city has been fully restored, it’s time to re-establish the rules of the 18th city.”","Hearing this, the Overlord and the others were shocked. They knew that Jian Wushuang was about to make a move.","They looked at each other in silence and sighed in their hearts. They only hoped that Jian Wushuang would not go too far like Qiu Long and take away the few Investiture of the Gods from them.","However, a hint of excitement flashed through the faces of Commander Mountain Shaker and Ruler Hao Jin.","This Ancient Path of Stars gathered all the geniuses of the universe. If they could gather them together, they would definitely become a top force in the future!","It should be known that these heaven’s favorites were either the lead disciples of their respective sects or the princes and Holy Sons of some big forces. Moreover, they all had the hope of breaking through to the Supreme level. If Jian Wushuang could be on good terms with them, he would be invincible in the universe!","Jian Wushuang sat on the throne and glanced at their faces one by one. He read their minds and said indifferently, “Everyone, this King wants to form a major power on the Ancient Path of Stars. Its name will be Sword Union. What do you think?”","Hearing this, the Overlord and the others’ expressions changed slightly, and a touch of uneasiness flashed in their hearts. Looking at Jian Wushuang’s indifferent expression, they suddenly realized that Jian Wushuang was not asking them, but giving them a notice.","After a long time, the Nine Stars Saint Son asked carefully, “Jian Wushuang, what do you need us to do?”","Jian Wushuang replied indifferently, “It’s simple. If you join the Sword Union, you will have countless divine materials and Supreme treasures. I can even give you The Investiture of the Gods. If you don’t want to join, I won’t force you.”","Hearing the words ‘Investiture of the Gods’, the Conqueror and the others were all moved. They continued to ask respectfully, “Jian Wushuang, if we join the Sword Union, what should we do?”","Jian Wushuang smiled and replied, “Everyone, I know what you’re worried about, I’m not a brutal and tyrannical person like Qiu Long. My original intention of forming the Sword Union was to help each other so that we can look out for each other after we leave the Ancient Path of Stars. I know that each of you has a sect behind you, so my Sword Union isn’t a mandatory sect, but more like an Alliance. When you’re in trouble, you can help each other.”","After a pause, Jian Wushuang continued, “Of course, you can’t just say that. You have to take an oath and integrate the rules into your own laws. If you break this oath, your cultivation will not advance for the rest of your life!”","Jian Wushuang’s tone became serious.","Hearing this, the Overlord and the others looked at each other, deep in thought.","If that was the case, it was not impossible.","After all, with Jian Wushuang’s strength and talent, it was almost certain that as long as Jian Wushuang did not die halfway, he would definitely achieve amazing achievements in the future. If he could build a good relationship with Jian Wushuang, it would definitely be beneficial for him and the sect behind him.","The most important thing was that Jian Wushuang had almost all of The Investiture of the Gods. If they wanted to get The Investiture of the Gods, they had to rely on him.","A moment later, they all nodded and knelt down."]},{"number":4302,"title":"Chapter 4302 Meeting Lady Blue Again","paragraphs":["4302 Meeting Lady Blue Again","“We’re waiting...we pay our respects to the Sword Union’s chief!”","The Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint, and the others’ voices rang out in the hall at the same time.","Jian Wushuang nodded with satisfaction in his eyes and said, “There’s no need for formalities, get up!”","For Jian Wushuang, he had ninety-one Investiture of the Gods in his hands. In fact, it was not a big deal to give up some of The Investiture of the Gods as long as he could make sure that he had no less than fifty of them.","As long as he had no less than 50 God Sealing Tablets, he would still have an absolute advantage in getting the entrance ticket to the universe banquet of all races.","If he could rely on the remaining Investiture of the Gods to recruit the Overlord and the others, the gains would undoubtedly be huge.","In the universe, be it the dragon clan or the Great Void Temple, they were all eyeing him covetously. Although Jian Wushuang was not afraid, it was still a good thing to have an extra backup plan.","And this Sword Union was one of the backup plans he had prepared.","Although these people were only at the Ultimate Ruler Realm and were not worth mentioning when compared to the Great Void Temple and the Dragon Tribe, they were all extremely talented and had limitless potential.","Jian Wushuang had gathered them together. When they grew up, they would be able to fight against any major force in the future.","After a while, the Overlord and the others all made a Dharma oath and joined the Sword Union.","At this point, a top force that would shake the universe in the future was born.","As for Jian Wushuang, he left the hall after giving a few instructions. He started to refine his divine power and improve his cultivation.","...","Meanwhile, outside the Ancient Path of Stars.","A black-robed middle-aged man with an aquiline nose was like a ghost in the dark night. He had arrived outside the Ancient Path of Stars.","He casually looked around and saw that the outside of the Ancient Path of Stars was quite deserted. There was no one around. He immediately opened up a piece of void and quietly sat down cross-legged, restraining his aura.","He was the Black Eagle Ruler. After a long journey through the universe, he had finally arrived outside the Ancient Path of Stars.","“Lord Hall Master, I’ve arrived outside the Ancient Path of Stars,” He sent a message to the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple in his mind.","“Alright, once the Ancient Path of Stars is over, you can kill Jian Wushuang here. This time, we can’t afford any mistakes! Do you understand?” A deep and majestic voice sounded in his mind. It was the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple.","“Hall Master, don’t worry. No matter how strong Jian Wushuang is, he only has the cultivation of a Ruler. As long as he shows his head, I can crush him in an instant.” The Black Eagle Ruler sneered.","“En, then I will wait for your good news in the divine Hall.”","A moment later, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple hung up the transmission with Black Eagle Ruler.","The Black Eagle Ruler’s entire body was hidden within the void as he turned his gaze toward the entrance of the Ancient Path of Stars.","“Jian Wushuang, you were lucky last time. Heart Slayer saved you. I’d like to see who else can save you this time!”","The Black Eagle Ruler sneered to himself as the cold glint in his eyes almost materialized.","...","Time passed and time changed.","In the blink of an eye, another ten thousand years had passed.","The Ancient Path of Stars was filled with new blood.","However, because Jian Wushuang had monopolized The Investiture of the Gods, as the number of people increased, there were not many fights. On the contrary, countless cultivators joined the Sword Union.","After all, only Jian Wushuang’s family was left on the Ancient Path of Stars. If they wanted to get the God Sealing Tablet, they could only rely on Jian Wushuang.","The Sword Union had become the most powerful faction on the Ancient Path of Stars!","Jian Wushuang did not stay idle either. During the past ten thousand years, he had completely stabilized his cultivation base at the Ultimate Ruler Realm. Although he was still far from breaking through to the Supreme realm, he had laid a good foundation.","There were only 50000 years left before the Grand Clan Gathering would begin.","One day, while Jian Wushuang was cultivating in seclusion, an unexpected person suddenly came to him.","“Lord Alliance leader, Lord Guardian Blue is waiting outside the palace.” An Ultimate Ruler in armor knelt outside Jian Wushuang’s room and said respectfully.","“Eh? Lady Blue?”","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and he was deep in thought.","Now, in the entire Ancient Path of Stars, the only person Jian Wushuang was not clear about was Lady Blue.","He had once asked the Overlord and the others who had arrived on the Ancient Path of Stars early. However, they also didn’t know much about ‘Lady Blue.’ They only knew that Lady Blue’s origin was mysterious and that he had never participated in disputes. It was as if he wasn’t here to fight for the God Sealing Tablet, but more to record everything that had happened on the Ancient Path of Stars.","This person...why did he suddenly come to find me?","“Tell the Lord Guardian to wait in the hall, I’ll be there soon.” Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and replied indifferently.","“Yes!”","The final Ruler in charge of sending the message hurriedly left.","Jian Wushuang didn’t delay for long. After putting away the Tarot Sword Manual, he also rushed to the hall.","Not long after, he saw Lady Blue.","Lady Blue was still dressed in a plain blue light shirt and his face was covered with a blue veil. Even though Jian Wushuang had broken through to become an Ultimate Ruler, he was still unable to see Lady Blue’s true appearance behind the veil.","Jian Wushuang could not help but feel slightly surprised.","“Lady Blue, long time no see.” After collecting his thoughts, Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at her and smiled.","“Hehe, it’s you who haven’t seen me in a long time. I see you quite often.” Lady Blue replied with a smile.","“What?” Jian Wushuang was stunned and did not understand what she meant. Just as he was about to ask, Lady Blue continued to speak and said jokingly, “Jian Wushuang, it’s really not easy to see you now. I have to send a message and report to you. You really have a big presence.”","“Lady Blue, you’re putting me down by saying this.”","Jian Wushuang could not help but wave his hand. After ordering someone to give Lady Blue a seat, he boiled a pot of spiritual tea, cleared his throat, and asked, “I wonder why you’ve come to find me?”","...","Lady Blue took a sip of the tea and looked at Jian Wushuang. She replied, “Jian Wushuang, I’m here to talk to you about the Great Clan Gathering.”","“The Great Clan Gathering? Doesn’t that mean there’s still fifty thousand years before it starts?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and a trace of doubt flashed in his heart. But he asked calmly, “Lady Blue, what do you mean by saying this now?”","Bada.","Lady Blue put down her teacup and shook her head, “Jian Wushuang, it seems that you don’t know this. The spots for the Great Clan Gathering are not chosen at the same time, but they are given out one after another according to the time period. After 50000 years, the Great Clan Gathering will really start. The same goes for the three spots on the Ancient Path of Stars.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. He was not a stupid person, so he immediately guessed something and asked, “Lady Blue, you mean to say that the first candidate for the Great Clan Gathering has already been decided?”","“Not bad.”","Lady Blue slowly nodded."]},{"number":4303,"title":"Chapter 4303 Entry Qualification in Hand","paragraphs":["4303 Entry Qualification in Hand","“Then...who’s the first candidate?” Jian Wushuang picked up the teacup, sipped the tea, and asked calmly.","Lady Blue laughed when he heard this, but she didn’t answer. Instead, she asked, “You should have an answer in your heart, right?”","Jian Wushuang’s hand that was holding the teacup stopped. He pondered for a while, then put the teacup down. He turned to look at Lady Blue and said, “I’m the first candidate?”","“That’s right.” When Lady Blue said that he had already chosen the first candidate, Jian Wushuang’s guess was pretty close.","!!","As expected, Lady Blue nodded and replied, “Naturally, it’s you. Jian Wushuang, your performance on the Ancient Path of Stars has been seen by that Lord. He sent me an order a few days ago to give you the first place to enter the Great Clan Gathering.”","After she finished speaking, she stretched out her hand and smiled.","“Jian Wushuang, congratulations.”","Even though Jian Wushuang was mentally prepared, his heart could not help but skip a beat when he heard Lady Blue’s definite answer. He felt that it was a little unreal.","That was an entrance ticket to a Grand gathering of all races in the universe that was held once every fifty chaos cycles!","In the Great Clan Gathering, the Supremes of all clans would gather to discuss the great Dao of heaven and earth. According to the previous rules, an Ultimate Ruler like Jian Wushuang would not even have the chance to touch the threshold. However, Jian Wushuang had become the first person to enter the Great Clan Gathering!","Jian Wushuang could not help sighing with emotion. On the Ancient Path of Stars, countless people had left behind piles of corpses for such an illusory quota.","A general’s success was built on ten thousand bones.","Too many people had lost their lives on this Ancient Path of Stars. They had spent countless years and effort, coming from all over the world, all for the sake of getting a spot in the universe banquet of all races.","Everyone was looking forward to becoming the lucky one to be pampered. From then on, their cultivation would skyrocket and they would become famous in the universe.","They advanced wave after wave, eager to try.","However, except for a few people who stood at the peak, most of the Ultimate Rulers on the Ancient Path of Stars had become the stepping stones of others. In the end, they had helped others while they themselves had turned into a pile of yellow soil and withered bones. They had died and their Dao had disappeared. They had been forgotten by time.","Jian Wushuang was one of them. Fortunately, he finally got the qualification to enter the competition.","He took a deep breath and in the next moment, the emotion in his eyes disappeared and was replaced with determination.","“Thank you,” he said.","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand and shook Lady Blue’s hand.","Seeing this, Lady Blue smiled and withdrew his palm. A white jade pendant appeared under his right hand.","Jian Wushuang, this jade pendant is the invitation to the Great Clan Gathering. Lady Blue pushed the jade pendant with his right hand and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang nodded and took the jade pendant carefully. He lowered his head and looked at it.","There were no words on the jade pendant. It was cool to the touch, as if it was an ordinary item. However, the moment Jian Wushuang felt it, he was shocked.","He felt as if he was in chaos. At this time, the universe had yet to be born and the world was still in a yin-yang chaos. He was like the most inconspicuous grain of sand in this chaos, insignificant to the extreme.","That feeling of being a drop in the ocean or a grain in Taicang was truly too insignificant.","The next moment.","The jade pendant turned into a warm current and disappeared into Jian Wushuang’s hand.","After that, the two of them chatted for a while. Lady Blue told him that the God Sealing Tablet had been cleared, and those who had obtained a spot in the universe banquet had to leave the Ancient Path of Stars to avoid affecting the fairness of others competing for the invitation.","After saying this, Lady Blue planned to leave.","“Well, Jian Wushuang, you’ve received the invitation to the Great Clan Gathering. My task is complete, so I’ll take my leave.” Lady Blue stood up and said with a smile.","Jian Wushuang nodded and looked at Lady Blue’s back as she left. He could not help but ask, “Lady Blue, if I may ask, what is your identity?”","Lady Blue’s steps, which had already crossed the threshold, could not help but pause. He turned around and smiled, “Is that important?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang touched his nose and knew that he had asked too much.","However, at this moment, Lady Blue smiled and added, “Jian Wushuang, we’ll meet again at the Great Clan Gathering.”","After saying that, Lady Blue no longer hesitated. In a flash, she disappeared at the door of Jian Wushuang’s Hall.","...","The moon splashed across the River of Stars, and the crows cried at midnight.","“Is it time to leave?”","Jian Wushuang stood at the entrance of the hall with his hands behind his back. He raised his head and looked at the devastating Galaxy unique to the Ancient Path of Stars. A thoughtful look flashed in his eyes.","He was now the most powerful being on the Ancient Path of Stars, and he had the ticket to the feast of all races in the universe. There was no point in staying here.","To him, leaving at this moment was indeed the best choice.","“But before I leave, I have to make arrangements for Sword Union.” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself and his eyes flickered.","After ten thousand years of development, the Sword Union had become quite well-known. There were more than a hundred top-tier Ultimate Rulers, and there were dozens of them who were almost invincible.","Besides Jian Wushuang, the Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint Son, and the young clan leader of Moluo were all unparalleled Rulers and could lead an area.","This kind of power, not to mention the Ancient Path of Stars, even in the universe, as long as a Supreme wasn’t present, it was enough to sweep everything in the world!","Although such a powerful force did not have strict sect rules, in the past ten thousand years, it had naturally formed a huge force with Jian Wushuang as the core. According to the division of strength, the status of the force was divided!","The next day, Jian Wushuang gathered all the high-level experts of Sword Union in the hall.","...","The next morning.","In the hall of the Sword Union, Jian Wushuang sat on the throne. On the two sides, starting from the Overlord and young clan leader Moluo, the high-level members of the Sword Union were arranged in rows.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. Although he didn’t speak, a sharp pressure formed naturally and pressed down invisibly. Everyone in the hall lowered their heads and didn’t dare to look at Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","The entire hall was silent.","No one dared to speak before Jian Wushuang did.","...","Unknowingly, Jian Wushuang was no longer the nameless person who could be manipulated by others. Now, he was the king who held the power of life and death in the entire Ancient Path of Stars!","He was the only powerful being on the Ancient Path of Stars who no one dared to disobey!"]},{"number":4304,"title":"Chapter 4304 Preparing to Leave","paragraphs":["4304 Preparing to Leave","“I’m going to announce something. Listen carefully. I’ll leave the Ancient Path of Stars in three days, and the God Sealing Tablet will be cleared again to select the second Ruler to enter the Great Clan Gathering.” Sitting on the throne, Jian Wushuang was expressionless as he spoke slowly.","As soon as these words were spoken, the entire Ancient Path of Stars burst into an uproar.","it seems that Lord Alliance leader has already obtained the first spot to participate in the Great Clan Gathering!","“What? Lord Alliance leader, you’re leaving the Ancient Path of Stars?”","!!","The Investiture of the Gods will be reset to zero?!","In an instant, the entire Hall exploded like a boiler, and the sounds of discussion rose one after another.","Even the Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint Son, and the young clan leader of Moluo raised their heads to look at Jian Wushuang, their pupils contracting.","“Be quiet.” Jian Wushuang pressed down with his right hand and spoke indifferently.","In an instant, the noisy hall quieted down.","Everyone forced down the words that were about to come out of their mouths and looked at Jian Wushuang with respect.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was indifferent as he glanced at them one by one. Although they didn’t speak, their expressions were mixed with joy and worry.","Jian Wushuang naturally understood what they were thinking and sneered in his heart. He was afraid that once he left the Ancient Path of Stars, the seemingly powerful Sword Union would collapse and return to its previous state of killing.","Jian Wushuang didn’t intend to solve this problem by force. After all, the Sword Union was just a backup plan he left behind. It was just for him to unite when he faced the oppression of the major forces in the future.","Therefore, he didn’t care what they did in private after he left.","In any case, some of the true experts with decent potential on the Ancient Path of Stars had already made a law oath with him.","This was something that could not be changed.","“Alright, now I want to talk about the leadership of Sword Union after I leave.”","Jian Wushuang looked at the Overlord, the Nine Stars Saint Son, and the young master of the Molo tribe, Huang Mo, and said, “The Overlord, Nine Stars Saint, and Huang Mo, after I leave, the three of you will be in charge of maintaining the overall situation in Sword Union. Is there a problem?”","“Yes! We will obey the Alliance master’s orders!”","The Overlord, Huang Mo, and the Nine Stars Saint all stepped forward and cupped their hands in acknowledgment.","Jian Wushuang nodded and glanced at the three of them. The Overlord and Huang Mo looked normal but solemn. One of them had been saved by Jian Wushuang, who had saved his life, and the other had chosen to submit to him, even if he had to die.","On the other hand, the Nine Stars Saint’s eyes, which had his head lowered, flashed with a strange look.","Jian Wushuang took in their expressions but didn’t care. He said, “As for the others, everything will be the same. There’s no need to change.”","After giving some other instructions, such as letting commander Mountain Shaker lead the Army on behalf of the Overlord and the other two, Jian Wushuang announced that everyone was leaving.","However, before everyone left, Jian Wushuang called out to Ruler Hao Jin, who was standing at the back row.","Jian Wushuang stepped down from the throne. At that moment, he no longer had any majestic aura. It was as if he had become the most ordinary teenager again.","“Hao Jin, do you blame me for not giving you a commander position before I left?” Jian Wushuang looked at him and smiled.","Ruler Hao Jin hurriedly explained, “Sir Blood Sword, I would never dare to think that way. Although I am slow, I understand that you are doing this because you don’t want me to attract too much attention and make others jealous.”","Ruler Hao Jin was the only person who addressed Jian Wushuang as Lord Blood Sword. It was as if Jian Wushuang was still the person who had led him through the Ancient Path of Stars.","“I’m relieved that you can think this way.” Jian Wushuang smiled, paused, and said, “Hao Jin, I didn’t place you in the higher-ups of the Sword Union because you said so. Once I leave, I’m afraid the Ancient Path of Stars will once again be in chaos. At that time, if you take the position of commander, you’ll definitely be the target of everyone’s focus fire. On the contrary, it’s possible that you’ll be killed.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang patted Ruler Hao Jin’s shoulder and continued, “For us cultivators, status and position are just empty titles. You don’t need to care about it. As long as you are strong enough, everything is just at your fingertips.”","“Lord Blood Sword, I understand!” Ruler Hao Jin nodded heavily upon hearing this.","Jian Wushuang replied with an ‘en’ and took out a glass Jade bottle. He said, “Hao Jin, in this Jade bottle, there are two drops of venom that I refined from Heavenly Snake Playboy’s venomous fangs. There were originally three drops, but I have other uses for the last drop, so I won’t give it to you. With these two drops of poison, as long as you don’t encounter an invincible Ruler, I imagine no one on the Ancient Path of Stars will be able to harm you.”","“Isn’t this. Little too valuable...” Ruler Hao Jin was still hesitating.","Jian Wushuang flipped his right hand again and a small black sword appeared in his hand. He said indifferently, “Hao Jin, keep this small sword well. I’ve specially refined this for you to defend yourself before I left. Three of my sword Qi are sealed in this small sword, and each one is stronger than the previous one. In terms of power, it’s much stronger than the two drops of poison. If you use it properly, you can kill even an invincible Ruler like the Nine Stars Saint with the last sword Qi!”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang’s expression gradually became serious. In the end, he said in a deep voice, “Hao Jin, you must use these five protective items with caution. Otherwise, once you use all five of them, no one will be able to save you if you provoke any other Supreme figures!”","“Yes!” Ruler Hao Jin’s expression turned serious. He didn’t dare to be negligent. He carefully put away the glass Jade bottle and the small black sword that Jian Wushuang had given him. Then, he nodded heavily and said, “Lord Blood Sword, don’t worry. I will definitely take good care of Sword Union for you!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help smiling and said, “As for the Sword Union, just leave it to fate, no need to worry about it. You, on the other hand, can be considered someone who has gone through thick and thin with me. The Ancient Path of Stars is filled with danger, and after I leave, the competition for the God Sealing Tablet will only become more intense and crazy. Thus, I only hope that you can protect yourself and increase your strength.”","After that, Jian Wushuang did not say anything more. He smiled at him and strode away.","...","Three days later.","In the 18th city of the Ancient Path of Stars, countless people were sending him off with great respect.","Jian Wushuang was wearing a black robe, a hood, and a sandalwood sword case on his back. He left the Ancient Path of Stars step by step and disappeared from everyone’s sight. It was as if the legend of the Ancient Path of Stars had finally come to an end.","[The next volume, the summit of the universe!]"]},{"number":4305,"title":"Chapter 4305 Leaving","paragraphs":["4305 Leaving","Jian Wushuang left.","He rode the wind on his flying sword, passing through 18 cities before arriving at the first city on the Ancient Path of Stars.","Some newcomers didn’t know Jian Wushuang, so they talked with each other and walked past him, describing their bright future on the Ancient Path of Stars.","Jian Wushuang looked back. He had spent tens of thousands of years on the Ancient Path of Stars. From an ordinary fifth stage great Ruler, he had become the most powerful Ruler in the entire universe.","!!","He had left behind too many legends here.","And now, they were finally going to say goodbye.","At this moment, they were sighing with emotion, but more than that, they were eager to return home.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and turned around with determination. He stepped onto the first city’s exit.","A boundless darkness attacked. When Jian Wushuang opened his eyes again, he had already appeared outside the Ancient Path of Stars.","In the tens of thousands of years, the changes outside the Ancient Path of Stars couldn’t be considered big. There were still people from various major forces stationed here, peddling and selling the divine medicines and divine materials they had brought from the Ancient Path of Stars.","They only took a glance at Jian Wushuang and then ignored him. They went back to their own work.","Although Jian Wushuang was famous now, there were only a few people who had seen him and recognized him. The scene of him fighting with Qiu Long was basically only spread among the higher-ups of the major forces.","What Jian Wushuang didn’t know was that after he walked out of the Ancient Path of Stars...","A man with an aquiline nose who was sitting cross-legged in the void suddenly opened his eyes.","“Kid, you’re finally out!”","Black Eagle Ruler’s gaze pierced through the void and fixed on Jian Wushuang. The corners of his mouth gradually curled into a cruel smile.","He had been waiting for nearly ten thousand years and was accompanied by the dull universe every day. He had long been impatient to the extreme. Now that he saw Jian Wushuang walking out of the Ancient Path of Stars, he could no longer suppress the killing intent in his heart!","Boom!","In an instant, he struck out a palm and pressed it toward Jian Wushuang!","Under this palm, the entire starry sky in front of the Ancient Path of Stars trembled madly!","A destructive might descended!","What is this?!!!","The faces of the Ultimate Rulers who were shouting in front of the Ancient Path of Stars changed as they looked up in shock.","“This...it’s the aura of a Supreme Being!”","a Supreme martial artist has made his move!!","“Not good, quickly run!”","Countless people shot up and scattered like birds and beasts. Some of the slower Ultimate Rulers were only touched by the palm and were instantly annihilated.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and his pupils shrank.","He could feel that the Supreme martial artist’s palm that had descended from the sky was firmly locked onto him.","“Who is it?”","Jian Wushuang’s face turned extremely gloomy. He had not expected that someone would come to kill him the moment he stepped out of the Ancient Path of Stars!","The Great Void Temple? Or a Dragon?","Jian Wushuang didn’t have time to think about it. The Wuqi Divine Sword was instantly unsheathed and turned into a shocking Silver Rainbow, slashing at the huge palm that was falling from the sky!","Now that Jian Wushuang had used the star slashing sword again, the power was terrifying. Even an unparalleled Ruler would be killed by this sword!","This sword was like a backward Galaxy. In a short moment, it condensed all the energy around it. Instantly, the silver sword rainbow became extremely bright and released endless brilliance as it slashed at the huge palm!","However, such a terrifying sword attack only made the giant palm slow down for a moment before it was obliterated by the terrifying power of the giant palm. It then pressed down on Jian Wushuang again.","However, this momentary pause was enough for Jian Wushuang!","Bang!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and moved away in an instant. Then, he appeared a hundred miles away.","Kacha!","As the palm pressed down, it directly turned the pressing void into a huge black hole and shattered countless void fragments.","Jian Wushuang, who was a hundred miles away, was panting slightly. He seemed to have sensed something and raised his head to look at the void.","The next moment.","He then saw a black-robed man with an aquiline nose walk out of the void with his hands behind his back.","“Jian Wushuang, do you still remember who I am?” The arrogant Man in Black sneered. He didn’t care that Jian Wushuang had dodged his palm and said sarcastically.","“It’s you?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. After taking a deep breath, he forcibly suppressed the throbbing in his heart and sneered, “How could I not remember the Black Eagle Ruler?”","This person was the Black Eagle Ruler of Cosmos Temple, who had almost killed Jian Wushuang in nine Phoenix great star area when he was traveling the universe.","Back then, if not for Nine Emperor Pavilion’s Heart Slayer stopping him, Jian Wushuang would have died in Black Eagle’s hands and his special life form would have been stripped.","Jian Wushuang, I haven’t seen you for tens of thousands of years. I’ve missed you so much. The Black Eagle Ruler stared at Jian Wushuang and said with a smile.","Although he was laughing, the coldness in his voice was enough to freeze the blood!","Jian Wushuang was expressionless when he heard that. He mobilized all the divine power in his body and his body was extremely tense.","This was a Supreme martial artist!","The highest existence in the universe!","...","Even though he was thousands of times stronger than when he had first met the Black Eagle Ruler, Jian Wushuang still felt a mountain-like pressure coming at him.","He knew that this would be the most dangerous battle he had ever encountered!","No one could help him in this battle. He could only rely on himself!","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll give you two choices now. The first is to follow me back to Cosmos Temple and accept my punishment. The second option is to strip you of your special life form as a form of respect for the might of my God slaying spear. It’s your choice.”","The Black Eagle Ruler had an arrogant look on his face, as if he was a God who had already decided Jian Wushuang’s life and death. It was as if Jian Wushuang had already become a fish on his chopping board, waiting to be slaughtered.","“Jian Wushuang, I think you will never want to experience the feeling of being deprived of your special life force. At this point, a cruel look flashed across the eyes of the Black Eagle Ruler.”","Jian Wushuang let out a sigh of relief and said, “I choose ...”","“Oh? You’re planning to surrender just like that?” The brows of the Black Eagle Ruler twitched as he gave a faint smile.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re quite tactful this time...”","Before he could finish.","“I choose for you to die!!!”","...","Boom!","Jian Wushuang stomped his feet and shot toward the Black Eagle like a missile, leaving behind a white blast of air.","A terrifying sword Qi gushed out in all directions, forming a half-moon sword light that could split the heavens and earth apart. In just a breath’s time, it had arrived above Black Eagle Ruler, slashing down at him!","“I gave you face, but you didn’t want it. You’re looking for death!”","The Black Eagle Ruler’s face instantly turned dark as a thick killing intent flashed in his eyes."]},{"number":4306,"title":"Chapter 4306 Falling Into a Dangerous Situation","paragraphs":["4306 Falling Into a Dangerous Situation","Hualala.","In the face of the sword that could split the universe and create shocking white waves, the Black Eagle Ruler’s expression turned gloomy. He snorted coldly and raised his finger to point at the sword.","“Jian Wushuang, it seems like you still don’t understand the huge gap between an ultimate Ruler and a Supreme.”","“That’s the difference in the essence of power!”","“No!” Black Eagle Ruler shook his head. In the next instant, a power that could distort time and space burst forth from his fingertip!","Clang!","After Jian Wushuang’s powerful sword was flicked by Black Eagle Ruler’s sword, it was like a fortress piled up on the beach, beginning to fall apart inch by inch!","“What?”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils contracted and an incredulous expression appeared on his face. Before he could think further, he felt a completely twisted and folded power hit his chest.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang retreated a thousand feet and a huge pit appeared in his chest.","Upon seeing this, the Black Eagle Ruler sneered with his hands behind his back, Jian Wushuang, give up your foolish struggle and recognize your current situation. The gap between the Ruler realm and the Ruler realm can not be made up for by anything.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","He had already thought highly of the might of a Supreme-being, but now that he was facing one, he realized that the power of a Supreme-being had far exceeded his expectations.","Most likely, the so-called ‘comparable to a Ruler’ was merely a killer move that could match an ordinary attack from a Ruler.","“Again!”","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang clenched the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand and his eyes were filled with fighting spirit.","Bang! Bang!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang stomped his right foot heavily and his entire body flew up again. He then slashed his sword at the Black Eagle Ruler!","“Split open the sky!”","Whoosh!","The sounds of weeping gods and devils, as well as the low chanting of Buddhas, rang out. The Wuqi Divine Sword trembled rapidly as a blood-colored sword light shot out, cleaving down toward the Black Eagle.","“Jian Wushuang, it’s useless.”","The Black Eagle Ruler shook his head in disdain. In the face of this earth-shattering sword, he merely flicked his sleeve.","A black beam of light shot out with the swing of the sleeve. This simple swing seemed to have a force of a million tons, pushing a passage through the void and smashing into the blood-red sword beam!","Chi chi chi!","The blood-red sword light was obliterated.","However, at this moment!","A deep and cold voice sounded in his ears!","innate divine power, original universe!","“Innate divine ability, life intimidation!”","Secret skill of dragon blood, divine power ignition!","Laws of the universe, tenfold will power!!!","Hualala!","In an instant, countless realms descended!","Jian Wushuang’s aura began to rise sharply after receiving the boost of various powers. In just a few breaths, Jian Wushuang’s aura was even stronger than that of the Black Eagle Ruler!","In addition to the two killing moves of the Tarot sword Codex, Jian Wushuang had also used all his other skills!","Under the suppression of the primal universe and the intimidation of life, the aura of the Black Eagle Ruler started to weaken without limit!","“Oh?”","Just as the Black Hawk Ruler was about to cry out in surprise, a cold voice rang out once more.","Star slash!!","In an instant, time and space seemed to have stagnated. Countless energies in the universe gathered in Jian Wushuang’s hand. Whether it was void fragments or dark matter in the universe, they all turned into the purest energy. Like hundreds of rivers entering the sea, they shot from all directions and finally integrated into Jian Wushuang’s hand, turning into a 50000-foot silver sword rainbow!","As soon as this silver sword rainbow appeared, it instantly snatched away all the light in the world. It was so bright that no one dared to look at it directly!","It was as if Jian Wushuang was holding a roll of Sky River in his hand. His black hair was flying and his expression was cold. He looked like a peerless sword immortal.","“Slash!”","With a cold shout, Jian Wushuang’s right hand swung down heavily, and a silver sword rainbow that was 50000 feet long finally slashed down toward the Black Eagle Ruler!","“Oh? The previous move was just a pretense, and this sword is the real killing move?”","The brows of the Black Eagle Ruler twitched as he casually commented, “This sword attack is not bad. It already has a power that is infinitely close to that of a Supreme Being. However, it’s a pity that without becoming a Supreme Being, one is still an ant.”","Shaking his head, the Black Hawk Ruler flipped his right hand, and a pitch-black, sharp short spear appeared in his hand.","The short spear exuded a strange aura. Jian Wushuang only took one look at it and he felt a sense of disgust.","“Break!”","“Break!” The Black Eagle Ruler let out a low growl and thrust his short spear into the ground. In an instant, both the original universe and the life intimidation were shattered layer by layer as if they had met their natural enemy.","“Jian Wushuang, do you still recognize this God killing spear?”","Black Eagle Ruler sneered and quickly formed a seal with his right hand. A black ring of light quickly blasted out and struck towards the 50000-foot silver sword rainbow!","Bang bang bang!","In an instant, the silver sword rainbow quickly collapsed at a speed that was visible to the naked eye.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly. He naturally wouldn’t forget about the God slaying spear. According to what master heart-Slayer had said, the God slaying spear was a treasure that Cosmos Temple used to restrain special life forms like Jian Wushuang. It could greatly reduce the advantages of special life forms like them.","“Jian Wushuang, it’s time to receive my move.”","Black Eagle Ruler sneered as he waved his right hand, sending the God slaying spear flying toward Jian Wushuang!","Jian Wushuang’s face turned grave. He quickly waved thousands of sword Qi to stop the God-killing spear!","“Bang bang bang!”","However, it was useless. The God killing spear left a long trail of flames and there was a burst of explosion in the void where it swept past. It broke through the heavy sword Qi and finally hit Jian Wushuang’s divine body ruthlessly, creating a fist-sized bloody hole in his chest!","By right, with the recovery of Jian Wushuang’s divine power, such injuries should have recovered immediately. However, just as Jian Wushuang gushed out his divine power to recover his divine body, he suddenly felt that there was a strange power on the bloody hole that had been cut open. It was suppressing the recovery of his divine body and it was spreading out in all directions at a slow speed.","This was the power of the God slaying spear!","In the next moment, Black Eagle Ruler’s body flashed and appeared above Jian Wushuang as if he had teleported. He raised his right foot and stomped down on Jian Wushuang!","Bang!","An earth-shaking explosion was heard as Jian Wushuang was stomped under his foot!","The next moment!","A divine power that was completely different from the Ruler realm came crashing down and suppressed Jian Wushuang. He could not move at all.","The Black Eagle Ruler sneered as he looked down at Jian Wushuang, who was under his foot, and said in disdain, “Jian Wushuang, your life and death are in my hands. What do you have to fight with me?”","“You, what qualifications do you have to fight with this Lord?”","Jian Wushuang fell into danger instantly!"]},{"number":4307,"title":"Chapter 4307 Desperate Situation","paragraphs":["4307 Desperate Situation","Kacha!","When the Black Eagle Ruler stomped down, Jian Wushuang felt his bones and muscles tremble. He tried to use his divine power to push the Black Eagle Ruler away. However, when he used his divine power to hit the Black Eagle Ruler, he felt as if a ball of cotton had hit an iron wall. The Black Eagle Ruler did not move at all. Perhaps the amount of divine power of the two was similar, but the quality was completely different!","There was a fundamental difference between the Ruler Divine Realm and the ultimate Ruler!","“Is this the power of a Ruler?” Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank and he came to a realization.","Only now, when he was truly facing a Ruler, did he finally understand how great the gap was between a Ruler and an ultimate Ruler!","Someone had calculated that there were tens of thousands of star areas and countless heavenly worlds in the universe, but among these tens of thousands of star areas, the number of Supreme martial artists added up to less than a hundred.","But how many ultimate Rulers were there?","There were so many that it was impossible to count!","From this, one could see just how vast the difference between an ultimate Ruler and a Ruler was!","Even the Ninth Kalpa King, who was the most powerful Ruler of the universe, was only comparable to a Supreme at his peak.","Comparable to a Supreme martial artist?","It meant that when the Ninth Kalpa King used his full strength, it could have the power of a Supreme martial artist’s attack!","However, this did not mean that the Ninth Kalpa King could really be compared with a Supreme martial artist!","“Jian Wushuang, aren’t you very powerful? Aren’t you the number one expert on the Ancient Path of Stars? Now, you better stand up.” The Black Eagle Ruler lowered his head and looked at Jian Wushuang with a sneer on his face.","As he said that, he exerted a little force with his right foot that was firmly stepping on Jian Wushuang. In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s divine body suddenly made cracking sounds as if it could not bear the heavy load.","Under this stomp, countless bones, bones, and tendons of Jian Wushuang were broken.","In the distance, many bold ultimate Rulers did not leave. Instead, they watched this scene from a distance and felt a chill in their hearts.","“Is this the terror of a Supreme martial artist? Jian Wushuang, who was invincible on the Ancient Path of Stars, couldn’t even fight back against a Supreme!”","“He’s too strong! Jian Wushuang’s previous attack was so powerful that it exceeded my understanding. It could probably kill any Ruler. I didn’t expect it to be destroyed by a Supreme’s sleeve!”","“No wonder there has never been a record of a hegemon defeating a Ruler since the birth of the universe! The might of a Supreme martial artist is too terrifying!”","“Jian Wushuang, this is bad.”","They all shook their heads. At first, they didn’t know it was Jian Wushuang. However, when Black Eagle Ruler called out Jian Wushuang’s name, they immediately understood that the handsome and cold-looking young man was Jian Wushuang, who had been in the limelight in the universe recently.","Originally, there were many people who thought that Jian Wushuang had the qualifications to be on equal footing with a Supreme after he killed Qiu Long. However, when they saw Jian Wushuang being crushed by the Black Eagle with their own eyes, they finally realized that they were too short-sighted and did not know the difference between a Ruler and a Supreme!","That gap was simply like a heavenly chasm. No matter what kind of amazing talent or magical power, it was simply impossible to cross!","The Black Eagle Ruler turned his head to look at them. He did not have any intention of driving them away. On the contrary, he felt even more pleased in his heart.","He wasn’t considered a genius, and breaking through to the Supreme-being realm could be said to have been extremely difficult. Even within the Supreme-being Divine Realm, he couldn’t be considered a strong person. Thus, he especially liked to ruthlessly step on those geniuses with amazing talent and wantonly humiliate them to satisfy the perverted pleasure in his heart.","Jian Wushuang, submit to me obediently and I might give you a quick death. Otherwise, I will crush your bones inch by inch and strip you of your cultivation and special life form. I will make you suffer extreme pain. Looking down at Jian Wushuang, the Black Eagle Ruler clicked his tongue and laughed.","“Submit? Are you even worthy?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was ice-cold as he casually slashed his sword at the Black Eagle Ruler!","Although he had been suppressed by a single kick from Black Eagle Ruler, it didn’t mean that he didn’t have the strength to fight!","“I’m not worthy? Good, good, good. Jian Wushuang, let’s see if I’m worthy or not!”","The Black Eagle Ruler master’s face turned fierce as he casually shattered Jian Wushuang’s sword. Then, a surge of supreme divine power burst out from his feet and almost crushed Jian Wushuang’s divine body!","He felt a sharp pain, but he didn’t even frown. He turned to look at the sandalwood sword case on his back, and his mind was racing.","Was he going to use this sword?","However, the moment he used it, the ones who would come to kill him wouldn’t just be a beginner-level Supreme like the Black Eagle, but the true powerhouses who stood at the peak of the cosmos!","“Jian Wushuang, since you don’t know what’s good for you, don’t blame me for being merciless. Go to hell!”","A cold glint flickered in the eyes of the Black Eagle Ruler as he finally decided to kill.","...","...","At the same time.","In the Divine Life Palace in the depths of the universe.","A simple message was passed through the nine imperial palaces, directly to the Supreme shrine!","“Report! Blood, Blood Wave Supreme, urgent news from the Nine Emperor Pavilion on the Ancient Path of Stars!”","A disciple of the Divine Life Palace hurriedly walked into the main hall. He looked extremely flustered.","“What’s the matter?” The Blood Wave Ruler asked with a frown.","The disciple of the Divine Life Palace half-knelt on the ground with beads of sweat on his forehead. “Blood Wave Supreme, there was an urgent message from Nine Emperor Pavilion just now. Jian Wushuang was intercepted by cosmos temple’s Black Eagle Supreme as soon as he left the ancient road of stars! I’m afraid he’s already in danger!”","“What?”","The Blood Wave Ruler’s expression changed drastically. He stood up from his seat with a bang and glared at the disciple of the Divine Life Palace. “What’s the situation? Tell me clearly!”","The disciple of the Divine Life Palace felt a chill in his heart when he saw the Blood Wave Ruler’s murderous gaze. He didn’t dare to delay any longer and quickly told him the message from the Nine Emperor Pavilion on the Ancient Path of Stars.","The Blood Wave Ruler was instantly enraged by his words!","“How audacious! Black Eagle, you’re looking for death!”","Boom!","A shocking killing intent could not be suppressed and soared to the sky!","The entire Divine Life Palace was enveloped by the killing intent, as if it had fallen into a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood.","“Blood Wave!”","“What happened?”","In an instant, the other great Rulers in the Divine Life Palace felt the boiling killing intent. Their faces changed, and they quickly rushed over.","The Blood Wave Ruler’s eyes were cold as he replied, Jian Wushuang was killed on the Ancient Path of Stars!","“What?”","“Who killed Jian Wushuang?”","The Supreme martial artists looked at each other, and their hearts thumped.","The Blood Wave Ruler stared into the distance and said coldly, “Cosmos Temple, Black Eagle Ruler!”","After saying this, the Blood Wave Ruler no longer paid any attention to them. He took a step forward and left the Divine Life Palace.","The next moment, his cold voice resounded in the hall.","“I’m going to save Jian Wushuang. Whoever stops me today will be my enemy!”"]},{"number":4308,"title":"Chapter 4308 Counter-Attack","paragraphs":["4308 Counter-Attack","“This...”","A look of hesitation appeared on the faces of the Supreme martial artists. Just as they were about to get up and chase after the Blood Wave Supreme to persuade him not to be so reckless, an indifferent and ancient voice rang in their ears.","“Just let him be.”","The Supreme martial artists looked at each other and finally nodded. They sighed and said, “Yes. Ruler Gai Fu.”","Outside the Divine Life Palace, Blood Wave Ruler transformed into a streak of light that shot toward the Ancient Path of Stars at full speed!","A moment ago, he was still at the entrance of the Divine Life Palace. In the next moment, he appeared in another star field.","At this moment, the Blood Wave Ruler was directly using his star field leap technique. Every time his figure flickered and leaped, he would cover a distance of hundreds of millions of miles.","However, before he could reach the halfway mark of the Ancient Path of Stars, a giant pitch-black Hand slapped towards him.","“Blood Wave, stay.”","“What?”","The Blood Wave stopped in its tracks. After it casually scattered the giant hand, it stared at the void where the giant hand had slapped.","A dignified middle-aged man wearing a purple-gold Royal robe and a purple-gold crown with flowers, birds, beasts, and insects embroidered on it walked out of the void.","This person was the mysterious and unpredictable Hall Master of Cosmos Temple.","Upon seeing this, the Blood Wave Ruler laughed in anger. “I’m really honored to have the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple personally stop me.”","The Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple smiled faintly and said, “Hehe, you’re the first seat of the Divine Life Palace. I’m naturally worried about others stopping you, so I have to do it myself.”","When Supreme Blood Wave heard this, there was no fear on his face even when he was facing the Hall Master of the famous Cosmos Temple. His eyes flickered with killing intent as he said, “Hei Yu, are you really going to stop me here?”","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple stood in the void with his hands behind his back. He shook his head and said, “Blood Wave, give up. You are no match for me. No one can save Jian Wushuang today.”","Supreme Blood Wave’s face remained expressionless, but his heart sank.","He knew that Hei Yu was right. He was indeed not a match for him.","After taking a deep breath, the Blood Wave Supreme looked at the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple coldly and said, “You’ve really gone through a lot of trouble to kill this disciple of mine, who’s only at the ultimate Ruler realm. Not only did you send a Ruler to intercept him, but you, as the Hall Master, even personally came to stop him. You’re truly capable.”","How could the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple not hear the sarcasm in the Blood Wave Supreme’s words? However, he just smiled indifferently and said, “Your Divine Life Palace has already produced a Ninth Kalpa King. You can’t produce another one.”","After a pause, he shook his head and said, “No, according to the strength of the Ninth Kalpa King in the ultimate Ruler realm, compared with Jian Wushuang, I’m afraid that after Jian Wushuang broke through to the Supreme realm, his strength is far superior to the Ninth Kalpa King. Such an existence naturally has to be killed as soon as possible to avoid future trouble.”","Supreme Blood Wave’s expression turned gloomy, and his eyes flickered.","After a short while, the Blood Wave Ruler took a deep breath and said slowly, “Hei Yu, then let’s wait and see. That disciple of mine might not die.”","“Is that so?” The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple laughed indifferently.","The Blood Wave Supreme did not reply. He could only hope that Jian Wushuang could create another miracle and escape from the hands of the Black Eagle Ruler, such as...once again, he used the life-saving magical power he used against Qiu Long.","However, what he did not know was that cosmos temple had already done a detailed investigation on Jian Wushuang, including Jian Wushuang’s divine power decomposition previously. It was also in their hands!","It could be said that they were fully prepared to kill Jian Wushuang!","...","The entrance to the Ancient Path of Stars.","“Jian Wushuang, you won’t be as lucky as last time. No one will come to save you this time.”","The Black Eagle Ruler looked down at Jian Wushuang and sneered with a cruel expression.","“Come on, Jian Wushuang. Let me torture you bit by bit. I’ll let you die in pain!”","Black Eagle Ruler sneered and exerted force on his feet. He started to crush Jian Wushuang’s divine body inch by inch, starting from his feet.","Ka ka ka!","Jian Wushuang’s indestructible divine body started to crumble under the stomping of the Black Eagle Ruler.","Furthermore, Black Eagle Ruler controlled his divine power to the extreme. He did not cause Jian Wushuang’s divine body to completely collapse and explode, but he still made Jian Wushuang feel endless pain.","“This Supreme martial artist is so scheming and vicious!”","“What kind of enmity does this person have with Jian Wushuang? To torture Jian Wushuang in such a way!”","“Jian Wushuang’s fate is really full of misfortune. It was not easy for him to kill Qiu Long on the Ancient Path of Stars. I didn’t expect that he would be intercepted by a Supreme once again.”","In the distance, some of the ultimate Rulers watching this shook their heads and sighed.","All of them despised the Black Eagle to the extreme, but none of them dared to say it out loud. They could only shake their heads and sigh.","“Jian Wushuang, do you regret that you should have been killed by me when you were in Nine Glory Star area? Otherwise, why would he be tortured like this?”","The Black Eagle Ruler laughed. However, when he looked at Jian Wushuang, who had remained silent since the beginning, he suddenly felt bored.","Why didn’t he beg for mercy at the moment of his death?","Shouldn’t he be kneeling in front of me and begging me to spare his life?","Shouldn’t he be crying bitterly, feeling despair and regret?","“Hmph! Jian Wushuang, go to hell!”","Black Eagle Ruler snorted coldly as a murderous intent surged in his eyes. He did not plan to delay any longer as he lifted his foot and stomped down on Jian Wushuang’s head!","This kick was aimed at taking Jian Wushuang’s life!","“Now!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and the Wuqi Divine Sword disappeared silently. Boundless darkness surged out from under his body and surged towards the Black Eagle Ruler.","“Eternal night!”","With a low shout, wisps of black mist instantly enveloped the Black Eagle Ruler.","“What is this?”","In an instant, Black Eagle Ruler was dragged into the eternal night Kingdom before he could even utter a single word!","A massive black ball had wrapped itself around the Black Eagle Ruler, and a snatching aura began to take away everything that belonged to the Black Eagle Ruler!","Jian Wushuang took the opportunity to jump up, took out a large amount of divine medicine from his interspatial ring, and swallowed it.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang did not dare to relax at all. He stared at the Black Eagle Ruler, who was wrapped in the black ball, and his divine power was stretched to the extreme.","Jian Wushuang!","An extremely furious roar came from the black ball. The next moment, the eternal night Kingdom started to crack inch by inch!","Like a glass orb, cracks appeared on the surface of the ground. The next moment, the entire eternal night Kingdom collapsed!","The Wuqi Divine Sword wailed and flew back to Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":4309,"title":"Chapter 4309 Fear","paragraphs":["4309 Fear","At this moment, although the Black Eagle was not dead, he was in an extremely sorry state. His appearance had aged by at least a few decades. His originally arrogant and proud face had turned ashen to the extreme. His strong body had become skin and bones, dry and thin!","“Jian Wushuang, how dare you hurt me!!” A cold glint flashed in the Black Eagle Ruler’s eyes as he was enraged to the extreme!","He was a great master, a top figure in the entire universe, but he had been injured by Jian Wushuang, a mere Ultimate Ruler!","How humiliating was this?","Jian Wushuang, you deserve to die!","The Black Eagle Ruler gritted his teeth and in the next moment, his body flashed and he pounced toward Jian Wushuang!","His figure seemed to have transformed into a Giant Eagle that could catch the moon in the sky and turtles in the ocean. He directly pierced through the void and grabbed Jian Wushuang with his five fingers!","With this grab, the void shattered and a galaxy was crushed!","A deafening eagle’s screech rang out in the universe!","“Good!”","A cold light flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. He was not afraid of the claw that could crush the star river. Instead, he took a step forward and his eyes were filled with fighting intent!","“Black Eagle Ruler, watch this sword closely!”","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang spat out two words coldly, “Daybreak!”","Ding!","A clear sound was heard. Then, Jian Wushuang and the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand disappeared.","The next moment.","A golden light suddenly appeared!","The entire universe seemed to have transformed into a ray of golden light. Under this ray of golden light, the perpetual darkness of the universe was torn apart, and it was actually reflected in a dazzling manner. In the next moment, the Ray of golden light shot toward the Black Eagle Ruler like a bolt of lightning!","Buzzzzzz!","This sword cut across the starry sky and cut through the chaos!","Sharp! Overbearing! Crushing! It was as easy as crushing dry weeds and smashing rotten wood!","This sword was like the dawn that shot out from the depths of the night, expelling everything!","Sharp! Overbearing! Crushing! It was as easy as crushing dry weeds and smashing rotten wood! All-conquering!","This was the true essence of the Daybreak sword!","The many ultimate gods watching the battle from a distance were all struck dumb by that sharp sword intent, and their bodies trembled.","How can there be such a terrifying sword technique in this world?!","“Godly swordsmanship! This sword is too terrifying!”","“Under this sword, how can there be an intact egg?”","All the spectating ultimate gods were shocked.","Even Black Eagle Ruler’s pupils contracted and his expression changed slightly.","“He’s just an Omega Ruler. Why are his sword-Arts so terrifying? That power...even I feel my heart palpitate?”","Before he could think about it, Jian Wushuang had already arrived!","As if planets had collided, Black Eagle Ruler, who had transformed into a Black Eagle of an Eagle, and Jian Wushuang, who had transformed into a ray of golden light, collided fiercely!","Bang!","A huge shock wave spread out, directly pushing back some of the small planets around the two of them by tens of thousands of feet!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang turned into a ray of golden light and swept past Black Eagle Ruler. He only stopped after he had traveled a few thousand feet.","The golden light dissipated and Jian Wushuang was left gasping for breath.","Jian Wushuang’s entire body was trembling. His right hand, which was holding the hilt of Wuqi Divine Sword, was numb.","He turned around and slowly looked at the Black Eagle.","The Black Eagle Ruler stood in the void, his appearance seemingly unchanged.","Suddenly, a change occurred!","“Pfft!”","The next moment, the Daybreak sword essence exploded!","Countless drops of divine blood gushed out of the 987.3 million pores of the Black Eagle Ruler!","It was as if a rain of blood had fallen from the sky, and the great Dao let out a wail.","At this moment, the Black Eagle Ruler was in an extremely miserable state. His hair was disheveled, and his black clothes were like tattered strips of cloth hanging from his body. Blood was flowing out of his nose and eyes, and he could no longer maintain the dignity of a Ruler.","“Jian Wushuang!”","“Arghh!” The Black Eagle Ruler let out a mournful cry and turned his head to look at Jian Wushuang. He was both shocked and furious!","The stroke just now had been extremely dangerous. If Jian Wushuang’s power had been slightly stronger, or if he had used his supreme divine power to activate it, he would have really capsized and died in Jian Wushuang’s hands!","“Where did this kid’s divine power come from?”","Black Eagle Ruler’s mind was filled with thoughts. First, the Eternal Night Kingdom had a hint of a One Thought Divine Kingdom within it. That was a One Thought Divine Kingdom, a Supreme technique of the highest level in the universe that even he had yet to comprehend.","Following that was the Daybreak sword. It was the ultimate sublimation of the sword path, an invincible sword move that gathered thousands of sword paths into one!","This kind of absolute art and divine power was enough to shake the entire universe. It was definitely not something that an Ultimate Ruler could create. Even he did not have the qualifications to touch this absolute art and divine power!","Where did he get it from?","The Black Eagle Ruler kept changing his mind as he stared at Jian Wushuang with a deep sense of fear.","This brat was only at the Ultimate Ruler Realm, but he was already able to contend with a Ruler. Once he became a Ruler, who in the entire universe would be able to deal with him?","No! He had to take advantage of the fact that this kid had yet to fully mature and kill him in the cradle!","As he thought up to this point, the Black Eagle no longer had the slightest bit of contempt or playfulness in his heart, and a cold killing intent appeared in his eyes.","“Jian Wushuang, it seems that I really can’t tolerate you!”","After saying that, Black Eagle Ruler charged at Jian Wushuang with the God slaying spear in his hand!","Bang!","The might of a Supreme-being spread out wantonly!","At this moment, the Black Eagle Ruler no longer held back. His Ruler aura was like a raging wave that slapped against the shore, covering the entire sky and pressing down on everything!","Under the might of this Ruler aura, all the races were about to submit. The Nine Heavens and ten earths trembled. With Black Eagle Ruler at the center, the surrounding 10000 feet of land turned into a raging sea as it trembled violently.","“As expected, even the Daybreak sword can’t kill him?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he sighed in his heart.","He immediately made a decision!","If he didn’t want to die today, he would have to use his most powerful trump card.","However, this was not the place to use the Tarot Divine Sword. He had to find a place with no one around.","Thinking up to this point, Jian Wushuang turned to the Black Eagle Ruler and said indifferently, “Black Eagle, didn’t you want to kill me? Then bring it on.”","After he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang turned his body and took a step forward. All of his divine power burst out and turned into speed as he shot into the distance!","He remembered that not far from the Ancient Path of Stars, there was an abandoned dead star field.","There were cracks in the void and the time and space were in disorder. A void storm could blow at any time, so no one stayed there.","“Jian Wushuang, you can’t escape!”","Upon seeing this, the Black Eagle Ruler sneered and burst out with his speed as well, chasing after Jian Wushuang.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang turned his head to look at the Black Eagle Ruler and sneered in his heart.","“Go on, Black Eagle, that will be your burial ground!”"]},{"number":4310,"title":"Chapter 4310 The Appearance of the Tarot Divine Sword!","paragraphs":["4310 The Appearance of the Tarot Divine Sword!","In the universe, two streams of light streaked across the sky like lightning.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power was completely unleashed. With just one step, he traversed a million miles. Behind him, the speed of the Black Eagle was also extremely fast. It was as if a huge Eagle Phantom was surging behind his back. With just a flap of his wings, he shuttled through the void.","“How can this kid be so fast?”","The Black Eagle Ruler’s eyes narrowed as his face turned dark.","In his opinion, although Jian Wushuang was not a Ruler, the strength of his divine power, his offensive power, and his speed all had the battle power of a Ruler. If it were not for the fact that Jian Wushuang’s divine power had yet to break through to the Ruler divine power level and he had just entered the realm of Ultimate Ruler, it would be hard to say who would win today.","However, it was a good thing that he had the God slaying spear in his hand. The innate divine power of this child’s special life form would be weakened by the God slaying spear without limit.","Thinking up to this point, the Black Eagle Ruler’s heart relaxed slightly. Licking his lips, he sneered, “Jian Wushuang, when I catch up with you, I will extract your divine soul and force you to tell me about your sword principle super powers. Then, I will destroy your divine power!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Black Eagle Ruler opened his mouth and let out an eagle cry. A pair of huge black wings appeared on his back. As he flapped them, they broke the sound barrier in an instant, causing a loud explosion. The distance between him and Jian Wushuang was quickly shortened.","“What a fast speed!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed slightly. At this rate, it wouldn’t take long for Black Eagle Ruler to catch up to him.","The abandoned star field was at least half the distance away from where he was now.","“Secret skill of dragon blood, divine power ignition!”","Jian Wushuang growled and started to burn his divine power. His speed, which was already extremely fast, increased greatly. He turned into a flowing light and charged forward!","The distance between the two of them that had been pulled apart was instantly pulled apart again!","“Oh? Did he use some secret technique?”","The Black Eagle Ruler let out a soft ‘yi’ sound, but his face didn’t reveal any surprise. He had seen too many of these secret techniques, but they all had one thing in common-they could only be used for a very short period of time.","“Hmph, Jian Wushuang, I’d like to see how long you can last with this secret skill.”","A sharp glint flashed across Black Eagle Ruler’s eyes. At the same time, he made a decision in his heart. Once he caught up with Jian Wushuang, he would kill him on the spot without saying anything more!","Otherwise, with this kid’s endless divine abilities and means, who knew what other tricks he would play in the future?","Jian Wushuang kept moving forward. As he exploded his divine power, he took out top divine medicine from his Interspatial Ring and put them into his mouth to recover his divine power quickly.","Even as a perfect-grade special life form, it was difficult for him to recover from such an outburst of divine power.","Of course, the most important factor that caused all this was the bloody hole in his chest that had been made by the God slaying spear.","Even now, the bloody hole that the God slaying spear had left on him had not recovered. A strange burning power was constantly eroding his divine body. He had to use a lot of divine power to suppress this strange power.","The two of them were extremely fast. In just a few breaths, they had completely disappeared from the intersection of the starry sky.","The many Ultimate Rulers who had been watching the battle could only sigh in regret when they saw this.","I wonder if Jian Wushuang can escape from this Supreme.","...","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang and the Black Eagle Ruler continued to move around in the starry sky. As the Black Eagle Ruler gradually killed Jian Wushuang, he could not help but notice that the star systems around him were decreasing. Even the aura of the various laws in the void was gradually becoming thinner.","However, Black Eagle Ruler didn’t care and thought that Jian Wushuang was already in a panic.","He could clearly see that the distance between him and Jian Wushuang was constantly widening.","“It’s close...”","Jian Wushuang’s Black hair fluttered in the wind. Black Eagle could feel that the distance between them was getting closer, and Jian Wushuang could also feel that the distance between him and the abandoned star area was rapidly getting closer.","He could even see the vague outline of the abandoned star field from far away!","After half an incense stick of time, Jian Wushuang suddenly stopped!","“Eh? You’re not running?”","Black Eagle Ruler’s eyes narrowed. Only then did he realize that he had arrived in an abandoned star field. There were chaotic spatial cracks everywhere, and spatial storms would blow from time to time. There was no sign of human life within a million miles.","However, he still did not mind. He shook his head and said, “In that case, Jian Wushuang, prepare to die!”","After he finished speaking, thousands of Supreme divine powers surged in his hand. He lifted the God killing spear and was about to stab Jian Wushuang.","He didn’t want to talk to Jian Wushuang anymore. He just wanted to kill him!","Suddenly.","Jian Wushuang, who had his back to the Black Eagle Ruler, spoke indifferently.","“Black Eagle, you’re wrong. The one who’s prepared to die isn’t me, but you.”","“Me?”","The Black Eagle Ruler chuckled and replied, “Jian Wushuang, speaking of which, I really admire you. You’re already at death’s door, but you don’t even know it. You’re still in the mood to talk nonsense.”","“You don’t believe me?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and slowly turned around. He looked at the Black Eagle Ruler calmly.","Black Eagle Ruler shook his head. Unwilling to waste any more time, he raised the God slaying spear and charged toward Jian Wushuang!","The God killing spear flew toward Jian Wushuang with a destructive power!","The strong wind blew Jian Wushuang’s Black hair. He looked at the God killing spear that could destroy the world and crack the void, and his expression became neither happy nor sad.","Kachaa.","Suddenly, a crack appeared on the sandalwood sword case on his back.","Kacha!","More and more cracks appeared!","All of a sudden!","The sandalwood sword case broke into pieces!","A slanted long divine sword wrapped in nine God sealing vines as a scabbard rose!","Bang!","The first God sealing vine was broken!","A terrifying energy that caused the world to tremble and chaos to boil gradually began to spread.","“Black Eagle, I was planning to save this sword for the dragon clan. Unfortunately, you’ve met it.”","Jian Wushuang sighed.","Bang!","The second god sealing vine shattered!","The aura that made the heavens and earth tremble and the chaos boil surged again!","Under this aura, countless space storms that swept across the starry sky collapsed directly. The God slaying spear that was coming at Jian Wushuang was even more sluggish in an instant. It was as if it had pierced through an invisible wall and was stuck between Jian Wushuang and the Black Eagle Ruler!","Bang bang!","Peng peng peng!","The third...the fourth...the fifth one...","The ninth one...!","When the ninth God-sealing vine was broken, the tremendous sword pressure had crushed all the stars in the abandoned star field!","Under the pressure of this sword, the Black Eagle Ruler’s entire body trembled, and he almost knelt down!","A seven-foot divine sword, completely dark gold in color and covered in mysterious divine patterns, with a Scarlet vertical eye on the hilt, was completely revealed!","The Tarot Divine Sword had finally appeared!"]},{"number":4311,"title":"Chapter 4311 The Might of the Tarot Divine Sword","paragraphs":["4311 The Might of the Tarot Divine Sword","“This, this is...!!!”","Black Eagle Ruler stared in disbelief at the Tarot sword hovering high up in the starry sky, and memories that had been sealed away for hundreds of chaos cycles suddenly began to flood out!","“Tarot Divine Sword!” Black Eagle Ruler cried out in shock!","He didn’t cultivate the way of the sword, so he couldn’t recognize the kingdom of Eternal Night and daybreak, but how could he not recognize the sword of the Supreme Tarot, which had once suppressed all the heavens and worlds and shocked the universe?","Back when he was still in the Ruler realm, the Tarot Swordmaster, who was unrivaled and stood at the peak of the universe, had used this Tarot Divine Sword to stun the world and defeat all the geniuses!","Even now, he could still remember how the Tarot Supreme had looked down on the universe with the Tarot Divine Sword.","However, hadn’t the Tarot Divine Sword been sealed away with the death of the Tarot Ruler?","Jian Wushuang, you, how did you get the Tarot Divine Sword?!","The Black Eagle Ruler could not care less about the fear in his heart. His eyes were completely red as he roared.","Jian Wushuang didn’t answer but said two words, “Sword, come.”","In an instant, thunder rumbled and the sky changed color. The Tarot Divine Sword, which was floating in the starry sky, suddenly spun and instantly shot toward Jian Wushuang!","In the next moment, the Tarot Divine Sword was in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","Jian Wushuang felt a connection with his heart and blood.","This was the feeling he had formed after countless days and nights of nurturing with sword Qi!","“Black Eagle, today, I shall offer your Supreme blood as an offering to my Tarot Divine Sword.”","Jian Wushuang held the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand. His black hair fluttered in the wind, and a terrifying burst of power that was enough to make even a Supreme-being bow his head surged.","Then, a brilliant light that could illuminate the world spread out. Under the light, Jian Wushuang’s figure disappeared and was replaced by a green-robed sword God who stood at the top of the universe.","He held a wine gourd in one hand and the Tarot Divine Sword in the other. He was carefree and unrestrained, drinking the sun and moon, riding the sword and riding the wind for 90000 miles.","“Tarot Swordmaster!”","Looking at the green-robed sword God apparition, the Black Eagle Ruler’s knees couldn’t help but go soft, and he almost knelt down.","The green-robed sword God was none other than the Tarot Swordmaster, who had been crowned the Supreme figure of the primordial Dao of swords three hundred chaos cycles ago!","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang’s voice sounded like it came from the ancient chaos.","In the next instant, the Tarot Divine Sword slashed down toward Black Eagle Ruler!","No words could describe how terrifying this sword strike was. Under this sword strike, the entire abandoned star region was turned into chaos and nothingness. Countless stars and galaxies exploded and disintegrated into the most primitive particles and molecules, and the massive sword pressure seemed to freeze the entire starry sky within a million miles!","“No!”","The Black Eagle Ruler’s eyes were filled with rage as a sense of fear and dread rose up in his heart. In the face of this life and death crisis, he couldn’t even muster up the slightest thought of resistance!","“Jian Wushuang! If you want this Lord to die, this Lord will not let you have an easy time! I’ve already told the universe the secret that you possess the Tarot Divine Sword!”","“You can’t defend the Tarot Divine Sword! Even the Divine Life Palace can’t protect you!”","“Jian Wushuang, I’ll take my leave first. I’ll wait for you to accompany me!”","The Black Eagle Ruler glared at Jian Wushuang with a face full of hatred.","Bang!","The Tarot Divine Sword was finally suppressed!","The sword Qi that Jian Wushuang had poured into the Tarot Divine Sword for tens of thousands of years suddenly burst out!","The sword Qi swept across the sky and dominated the sun and moon!","Tens of millions of sword Qi gushed out at the same time, covering the sky and the earth, covering the sun and the moon. It was as if doomsday had come, a great catastrophe of the universe!","The Black Eagle Ruler divine body began to be annihilated at an extremely fast speed under the tens of millions of sword Qi.","The sword had been sealed for 30000 years, and now it was out!","After three breaths, the world became quiet.","The Black Eagle Ruler had disappeared, not even leaving behind a single trace of dust. He had been completely annihilated into nothingness.","A Supreme martial artist of a generation had fallen!","The huge and terrifying sword pressure gradually dissipated. Jian Wushuang’s body shook and he almost fell from the sky.","The sword attack just now had almost sucked all of his divine power Dry!","Although the Black Eagle Ruler had died, Jian Wushuang’s eyes did not show any joy. Instead, they were extremely gloomy.","The thing he was most worried about had still happened.","Just before he slashed down on the Black Eagle, he could clearly feel a wave of divine energy fluctuations being transmitted out from the Black Eagle. If he wasn’t wrong, this was the message that the Black Eagle had sent out before his death.","‘The only thing I can do now is to return to the Divine Life Palace as soon as possible!’","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed and he quickly made a decision. He had to return to the Divine Life Palace before the universe could react. Only then would he have a chance to turn the situation around.","With that thought, Jian Wushuang waved his sleeve and took out universe boat from his interspatial ring.","The universe boat expanded with the wind, and soon, it was tens of thousands of feet tall. It pressed down on the void space and gave off a dark, cold luster.","Speaking of which, he had obtained this universe boat from Qiu Long after killing him. It was of a much higher grade than his own universe boat.","Jian Wushuang’s body flashed and he entered universe boat.","Boom!","The universe boat let out a roar and instantly disappeared from the abandoned star field. It broke through the speed of light, concealed its aura, and flew toward the Divine Life Palace.","...","At the same time, in a Star Domain between the Divine Life Palace and the Ancient Path of Stars.","The Blood Wave Supreme’s expression was gloomy as he glared at the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple, who was standing in front of him with an indifferent expression.","Although he was angry, he did not dare to act rashly.","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple was an ancient Supreme from the same era as Supreme Master Gai Fu. He was indeed far beyond his current level.","“Blood Wave, I’ll just wait here patiently.”","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple smiled faintly.","Calculating the time, even if there were some accidents, Black Eagle Ruler should have killed Jian Wushuang by now.","Whoosh.","At this moment, a message from the Black Eagle Ruler rang in his mind.","“Oh? Has the matter been resolved?”","The Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple raised his eyelids, and the smile on his face grew.","But the next moment!","The smile on his face froze!","The Tarot Divine Sword?!!!","He let out a low cry, and his face was filled with shock.","“Eh? The Tarot Divine Sword?”","Supreme Blood Wave’s eyes narrowed when he saw this.","The Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple did not reply. Instead, he took a deep breath and quickly suppressed the turmoil in his heart. He turned and looked in the direction of the Ancient Path of Stars. In a flash, he disappeared from the Blood Wave Supreme’s sight.","That was the Tarot Divine Sword, a Supreme treasure that even an invincible Ruler like him coveted!","“I’m afraid Jian Wushuang has changed.”","The Blood Wave Supreme narrowed his eyes, and a thoughtful look flashed across his eyes. Then, he chased after the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple!"]},{"number":4312,"title":"Chapter 4312 The Universe Is Boiling","paragraphs":["4312 The Universe Is Boiling","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple was extremely fast. He had never used universe boat, but his speed was much faster than universe boat. He was like a beam of light, flashing through the universe.","The Blood Wave Supreme followed closely behind him. For some reason, the words ‘Tarot Divine Sword’ that the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple said at the end made him feel a little confused.","Two hours after Jian Wushuang left with universe boat, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple appeared at the place where he had fought with the Black Eagle Ruler.","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple, Hei Yu, closed his eyes and sensed for a moment. Then, he suddenly opened his eyes and said, “There are shockwaves from a battle here. This sword intent should be the Tarot Divine Sword!”","The Tarot Divine Sword is really in Jian Wushuang’s hands!","Bang!","Not long after, the Blood Wave Master arrived as well. He felt the remaining shockwaves of the battle and immediately sensed Jian Wushuang’s active divine power aura.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang didn’t die.","The Blood Wave Supreme was slightly relieved. As long as Jian Wushuang did not die, he could accept any other outcome.","And...","Supreme Blood Wave’s heart throbbed.","Since Jian Wushuang was not dead, the one who was dead must be Black Eagle Ruler!","Sword beheading a Supreme!","What kind of magnificent feat was this?","“Heiyu, it seems that disciple of mine has quite a tough life. Black Eagle Ruler, you’re still not qualified to kill that disciple of mine.”","The Blood Wave Supreme looked at the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple and said with a smile.","His eyes were filled with pride.","This was the person he had brought back with his Blood Wave!","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple’s expression was uncertain. He no longer cared about the Black Eagle Ruler’s life and death. The only thing on his mind was the Tarot Divine Sword!","It could be said that the words ‘Tarot Divine Sword’ had already drawn his entire attention!","It was a pity that the universe was too vast. Jian Wushuang was like a fish in the ocean. No matter how powerful he was, he could not calculate Jian Wushuang’s location in a short time.","Moreover, as far as he knew, the Black Eagle Ruler had always been narrow-minded and vengeful. He had died at Jian Wushuang’s hands, so he would definitely try to take revenge on Jian Wushuang before he died. Therefore, it was destined that he would not only tell him the news that Jian Wushuang had the Tarot Divine Sword.","In fact, the situation was just as he had expected.","Almost at the same time, the Black Eagle Ruler’s dying message was transmitted to all the major powers in the universe!","The Tarot Divine Sword was born and was held by Jian Wushuang!","Jian Wushuang had killed a Supreme-being with the Tarot Divine Sword!","As soon as this news was released, the entire universe was in an uproar!","All the races were shocked and boiling!","The Tarot sword was a treasure of the universe. Back then, the Tarot Swordmaster had only been a top-tier Supreme Being. However, with the Tarot sword, he had become one of the invincible Supremes in the universe. He had been undefeated in tens of thousands of battles, and he had subdued the universe with a single sword. Even among the invincible Supremes, he had killed more than one!","How could those Supreme martial artists not covet this? How could they not be envious?","Moreover, the Tarot Divine Sword was in Jian Wushuang’s hands.","All of a sudden, regardless of whether they were skeptical or not, all the major forces sent their experts out of seclusion to the universe to find and kill Jian Wushuang!","They knew that it would be best to get the Tarot sword before Jian Wushuang returned to the Divine Life Palace. Once Jian Wushuang returned, it would be difficult to get the Tarot sword.","In the abandoned star area.","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple’s expression was uncertain. He raised his head and looked at the Blood Wave Supreme with a murderous look in his eyes.","He knew that the Blood Wave Master and Jian Wushuang had a good relationship. Although they were not master and disciple, Jian Wushuang had always been respectful to the Blood Wave Master. He was definitely an important figure in Jian Wushuang’s heart.","He was considering whether he should capture the Blood Wave Supreme and use him to head to the Divine Life Palace to force Jian Wushuang to hand over the Tarot Divine Sword.","Although the Ruler Blood Wave was powerful, he was still no match for him.","However, when he thought of Supreme Master Gai Fu, who was in charge of the Divine Life Palace, he dispelled this idea.","This old man was much older than him. Although he had been struggling on his last breath because of that battle, if he really kidnapped the Ruler Blood Wave, there was no guarantee that the old man would not go crazy and attack him at all costs.","At the same time.","The Ruler Blood Wave had also received a message from the Divine Life Palace.","The Tarot Divine Sword was in Jian Wushuang’s hand!","Supreme Blood Wave’s expression changed drastically upon seeing this!","He didn’t need to think to know how much of a stir this would cause in the universe!","The Tarot Divine Sword was an important weapon of the universe. It could be said that any Supreme who wielded the Tarot Divine Sword would become one of the most powerful existences in the Supreme Divine Realm, aside from the few kings who stood at the peak of the universe!","To those Supreme martial artists, this was an extremely huge temptation!","Some Supreme-beings, especially those who were proficient in sword principle, would definitely go crazy to find Jian Wushuang and seize the Tarot Divine Sword!","Jian Wushuang couldn’t protect the Tarot Divine Sword, and neither could his Blood Wave!","When Tarot Supreme first obtained the Tarot sword, he had also suffered countless assassinations. However, at that time, Tarot Supreme had already become powerful and had listened to that Lord’s lecture at the Great Clan Gathering. His strength had improved, and he had killed so many people that the universe had submitted to him. He had used his strength to make people not dare to have any ideas about the Tarot sword in his hand.","But Jian Wushuang...how far away was he from Supreme Tarot?","The Blood Wave Supreme’s heart burned with anxiety at this thought. He took a step and disappeared from the abandoned star field.","The only thing he could do now was to find Jian Wushuang as soon as possible and bring him back to the Divine Life Palace!","...","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple did not stop the Blood Wave Supreme when he saw him leaving. Instead, he used two fingers to perform a hand seal and quickly calculated Jian Wushuang’s location.","After a while.","“I found it!”","The eyes of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple flashed. He took a step and disappeared from his original spot, heading in a certain direction in the universe!","...","Within the universe.","Jian Wushuang drove universe boat and hid in the void, hurrying toward the Divine Life Palace.","He didn’t dare to waste any time or use the universe passage because he wasn’t sure if there would be anyone waiting to kill him outside the universe passage. He could only steer universe boat and constantly change routes, rushing back to the Divine Life Palace with extreme caution.","In fact, it was just as Jian Wushuang had expected.","Almost every universe passage from the Ancient Path of Stars to the Divine Life Palace had a Supreme-being waiting for them.","As long as Jian Wushuang showed up, he would be greeted with a storm of attacks!","...","However, even though Jian Wushuang was very careful, he was still stopped when he was halfway to the ancient road of life!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s life was hanging by a thread again!"]},{"number":4313,"title":"Chapter 4313 Fighting Four Great Supremes Alone!","paragraphs":["4313 Fighting Four Great Supremes Alone!","In the vast universe, a universe boat that was shining with a dark luster stood quietly.","In front of universe boat, four supreme beings with powerful auras and different appearances stood together with their hands behind their backs, blocking the way.","“Jian Wushuang, stop. I’ll spare your life as long as you hand over the Tarot Divine Sword, considering your rare talent.” A grey-haired old man wearing a robe with stars in the sky said.","If there were cultivators from the Seven Palace Star Area here, they would recognize that this old man was the Ruler of the Seven Palace Star Area, the Seven Palace Supreme who had been in closed-door cultivation for many years.","Ruler Seven Palaces had spent dozens of chaos cycles in secluded meditation within the Earth’s core, seeking enlightenment of the Dao. He hadn’t expected that the appearance of the Tarot sword would actually draw him out.","that’s right. Jian Wushuang, hand over the Tarot Divine Sword and I can guarantee your life.","Another old woman with her silver hair coiled up and holding a twisted dragon head walking stick also spoke.","This old woman was the master of Lotus Heart Island. She was also a Supreme-being expert.","“Hand over the Tarot Divine Sword, and I’ll spare your life!”","hehehe, quickly recognize the situation and don’t make any unnecessary resistance.","As for the other two Supreme martial artists, one of them had an eerie aura like a ghost, while the other had a solemn appearance. They were both famous Supreme martial artists in the universe.","Jian Wushuang stood in the universe boat and looked at the four through the black light mirror with a gloomy expression.","He had been extremely careful, and the journey to the Divine Life Palace had been full of twists and turns. Sometimes, he had even done the opposite. He had not expected that it would still be the same, and he would still be stopped.","“Could it be...are you really going to hand over the Tarot Divine Sword?”","Jian Wushuang lowered his head to look at the Tarot Divine Sword at his waist, and a touch of coldness flashed in his eyes.","He was afraid that he would still be killed if he handed over the Tarot sword. After all, he had stolen a treasure from a top-tier genius in the universe. It was better to eliminate the root to avoid future trouble.","The reason why they were still circling around Jian Wushuang was that none of them wanted to be the first to stand out and offend the Divine Life Palace, in case they got their revenge later.","However, Jian Wushuang believed that this was only temporary. Before long, someone would make a move. Between the threat of the Divine Life Palace and the Tarot Divine Sword, they would naturally choose the latter.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang walked out of universe boat step by step. He had already made a decision.","The current him, with the Tarot Divine Sword in hand, was not afraid of these Supreme martial artists!","As long as any of the four Supremes dared to make the first move, Jian Wushuang would risk everything and use the Tarot Divine Sword to kill the first person!","“Oh? Finally willing to come out?”","The Seven Palaces Supreme raised his eyes and looked at Jian Wushuang as he spoke indifferently.","The other three great masters also put on a fake smile. They looked at the Tarot Divine Sword on Jian Wushuang’s back, only revealing its hilt, and their eyes flashed with unconcealed greed.","The Tarot Divine Sword was a universe treasure!","Whoever could obtain the Tarot Divine Sword would be able to increase their strength by several times!","“Jian, Jian Wushuang, come. Give me the Tarot Divine Sword and I’ll let you go.”","In front of the Tarot Divine Sword, even these Supreme martial artists couldn’t help but swallow their saliva and lose their composure.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword from his back and pointed the tip of the sword at the four great Supremes. He tilted his head and sneered, “I’m sorry, but I won’t hand over the Tarot Divine Sword. If anyone wants to take it, you can try.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with fighting intent.","People often said that those who did not enter the Supreme Divine Realm were still ants. The difference between a Supreme and a Ruler was like the difference between a God and a mortal. Today, Jian Wushuang might as well slaughter a God and show the world!","“Jian Wushuang, are you threatening us?”","The Seven Palace Rulers were so angry that they laughed. They were universe Rulers, yet they were threatened by an ultimate Ruler?","“If you don’t believe me, you can try.” Jian Wushuang looked at him with a calm expression.","“You!”","The Seven Palaces Supreme was furious when he heard this, but he seemed to have thought of something. After snorting coldly, he did not say anything else.","The Black Eagle Ruler’s corpse was probably still cold, so he was not sure if Jian Wushuang, who was holding the Tarot Divine Sword, would be able to kill him.","For a moment, the atmosphere fell into a strange stalemate. The four great Supremes’ faces were gloomy as they looked at the Tarot Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand. Their eyes were full of greed and there was a touch of deep fear.","In the end, it was still the man in black with the sinister aura who laughed sinisterly, “If we don’t act now, we might not have a chance when the others come.”","When the three of them heard this, their faces turned cold. That’s right, the entire universe was after Jian Wushuang, and no one knew when another Supreme would come to this place.","Immediately, the master of Lotus Heart Island, a hunchbacked old woman with her hair tied up, said in a hoarse voice, “In this Queen’s opinion, the four of us should join forces to kill this brat first. As for the ownership of the Tarot Divine Sword, we’ll choose the strongest person from the four of us.”","The four Supreme martial artists looked at each other and quickly made a decision.","“Kill Jian Wushuang first!”","Looking at this scene, Jian Wushuang’s face was unmoved, but his heart was filled with the desire to fight to the death!","What about the four great masters?","Just a battle!","“Go!”","The black-robed man with a sinister aura sneered first. A nine-headed scimitar that emitted a strange aura appeared in his hand. He took a step forward and charged at Jian Wushuang!","The other three great Supremes also unleashed their Dao techniques. The seven Palace supremely pulled with his hands, and seven fist-sized round beads suddenly appeared. These seven round beads were refined from seven planets, and each round bead’s attack was no less powerful than the self-destruction of a planet. When seven round beads were used to form a formation, the power would be extremely great.","As for the old woman, she took a step forward and countless red lotus flowers appeared in the sky.","The four great masters had attacked Jian Wushuang at the same time!","“Kill!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes glinted coldly and he poured all his divine power into the Tarot Divine Sword!","...","In an instant, a terrifyingly sharp destructive aura rose sharply with Jian Wushuang as the center!","The eye on the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand suddenly opened!","Countless threads of blood filled the air.","“This aura...it really is the Tarot Divine Sword!”","When the four great Supremes felt this majestic aura that could destroy the heavens and earth, they trembled all over, and their hair stood on end.","In their eyes, Jian Wushuang’s figure became blurry and was replaced by a carefree figure who was drunk on the world and riding on a sword.","That was supremacy Tarot!","“Slash!”","A cold voice was heard. Jian Wushuang held the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand and slashed at the four great Supremes!","A dark golden sword light that could illuminate the sun and the moon burst out from the Tarot Divine Sword. It was as if a Great Tribulation had descended from the heavens, and it rudely attacked the four great Rulers!","The four great Rulers looked at the sword, and their pupils shrank. The old woman said in a deep voice, “Everyone, Jian Wushuang already has the power to kill a Supreme with the help of the Tarot Divine Sword. We must not underestimate him and follow in the footsteps of the Black Eagle Ruler!”","..."]},{"number":4314,"title":"Chapter 4314 Killing a Supreme Martial Artist Again!","paragraphs":["4314 Killing a Supreme Martial Artist Again!","When Jian Wushuang had become an Ultimate Ruler, his strength had already been infinitely close to that of a Supreme. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have nearly killed the Black Eagle with his ‘daybreak’.","Now that he had the Tarot Divine Sword in his hand, he no longer had any fear. How could his strength have increased by more than ten times?","It could be said that Jian Wushuang with the Tarot Divine Sword and Jian Wushuang without the Tarot Divine Sword had a huge difference in fighting power!","When Jian Wushuang’s sword slashed down, the world suddenly roared, the sky changed color, and the sun and moon lost all their luster!","The divine Bell of fortune, the separation of yin and yang!","Jian Wushuang fixed his eyes on the seven palaces Supreme. He could feel that the strongest of the four Supremes was the seven palaces Supreme. However, he could only use the Tarot Divine Sword once, and after that, all his divine power would be drained.","If he wanted to live, he could only hope to kill the seven palaces Supreme with this strike and deter the other three Supreme martial artists. Then, he could quickly take the divine medicine to recover his divine power.","“Go to hell!”","Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth and let out a low roar. The Tarot Divine Sword slashed down fiercely at the seven palaces Supreme!","Peng peng peng!","The sword first shattered the falling red Lotus petals with its sword pressure, then the sharp sword light forced the old woman, the black-robed Ruler, and the solemn-looking man to retreat. Finally, it cut down on the head of the Seven Palaces Ruler!","Clang!","The seven fist-sized beads in the hands of the seven palaces Ruler collided with the Tarot Divine Sword!","A monstrous sword will burst out from the Tarot Divine Sword, turning into a long rainbow and shooting straight into the sky. Under this sword will, the seven round beads instantly trembled thousands of times and released the power of stars at the same time, making crackling sounds.","Then, a shocking scene happened. The bead made of seven stars let out a wail and cracks appeared on its body. The cracks grew more and more until it finally exploded!","Bang!","The first Star Pearl exploded!","Peng peng peng!","The second one...the third...the fourth...","None of the seven Star Pearls were spared. They were all crushed by the Tarot Divine Sword!","A sword that destroyed seven stars!","“What?”","A look of shock appeared on the face of the seven palaces ‘Supreme.","One must know that each of the seven Star Pearls was made of a planet and countless divine materials and cold iron. In terms of grade, they had already reached the limit of a treasure of the universe’s laws. When the seven Star Pearls were combined, they were comparable to a Supreme divine weapon!","However, the seven Star Pearls were all destroyed by the Tarot Divine Sword!","“The power of the Tarot Divine Sword is rare.”","The Seven Palace Ruler gasped, then raised his head to look at the Tarot Divine Sword’s sword light that was still pressing down on him. His expression was extremely grave, and he shouted in a low voice, “Secret technique, seal the heavens!”","As soon as he finished speaking, countless starry rivers surged out around him. These starry rivers were like dragons and seemed to contain spiritual Qi. They all rolled up and intertwined, forming a large net that wrapped around the Tarot Divine Sword.","As a Supreme martial artist of his generation, he had thousands of secret arts and divine abilities. This heaven sealing technique was one of the strongest defensive techniques that could dissipate a Supreme martial artist’s attack.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed coldly and he said, “Innate divine ability, life intimidation!”","At that moment, time and space seemed to stop. A realm that could suppress all races descended!","This realm was invisible, but within it, Supreme seven Palace’s movements suddenly slowed down, and he couldn’t help but feel like kneeling down and bowing to Jian Wushuang.","This was the suppression and superiority of a higher life form over a lower life form!","It had nothing to do with one’s realm!","The reason why Black Eagle Ruler was so difficult to deal with was because of the God slaying spear in his hand. It could greatly weaken Jian Wushuang’s advantage as a special life form. However, Seven Palace Ruler did not have it.","Bang!","The Tarot Divine Sword fell into the net, and a scene that shocked the seven palaces Supreme happened. The heaven-sealing net, which was originally in a stalemate, was greatly reduced in power after Jian Wushuang’s life intimidation descended. In the end, it was split in two by the Tarot Divine Sword without any hindrance, and finally slashed on his body!","“No!”","A muffled sound rang out. The divine body of the seven Palace Ruler couldn’t put up any resistance against the sharp edge of the Tarot Divine Sword. He was killed and turned into ashes.","The Seven Palace Supremes were dead!","After the Black Eagle Ruler, Jian Wushuang wielded the Tarot Divine Sword and slashed at a Supreme!","In an instant, the three masters of Lotus Heart Island, who had been charging toward Jian Wushuang, stopped in their tracks and looked at Jian Wushuang in disbelief.","“How...how could this kid be like this, like this...!”","The old woman pointed at Jian Wushuang with a trembling finger, her face full of shock and anger.","She wanted to use a word to describe Jian Wushuang, but she couldn’t think of one.","Jian Wushuang suppressed the intense pain in his divine body and looked coldly at the remaining three Supreme Masters.","Killing the Black Eagle Ruler had already drained all of his divine energy. Even after fleeing for a few days, he had not fully recovered. Now that he had forcefully killed the seven palaces Ruler, his divine body had long been exhausted. He was like an oil lamp on the verge of dying, an arrow at the end of its flight.","“Don’t you all want my Tarot Divine Sword? Then come and take it.”","Jian Wushuang stared at the three Supreme Masters coldly and said indifferently.","The three of them squinted their eyes when they heard this, and a cold glint appeared in their eyes.","“Jian Wushuang, you can’t scare me. I don’t believe that you, a mere Ultimate Ruler, can forcefully activate the Tarot Divine Sword a few times. I’m afraid it’s difficult for you to even stand now, right?”","The black-robed Supreme Master stared at Jian Wushuang with a sinister aura and sneered.","“Then you can come and try.”","Jian Wushuang’s cold eyes shot straight at the black-robed Supreme Master, and he seemed to be giving in.","...","“You!”","The black-robed Ruler was so angry that a nameless flame began to burn within him.","He was ninety percent sure that Jian Wushuang was bluffing, but...he didn’t dare to take the risk. If Jian Wushuang could activate the Tarot Divine Sword again, even if it was just one attack, it was not something he could withstand.","With a cold snort, the black-robed Supreme Being no longer spoke. His expression was a mixture of various emotions.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief and quickly recovered his divine power.","If there was anyone present, they would have noticed this strange scene.","The three great Supremes were actually forced to hesitate when facing Jian Wushuang, who was only an Ultimate Ruler. Their eyes were filled with fear.","Just as the atmosphere was at its most deadlocked.","A faint voice resounded in the void again.","“I found it.”","In the next moment, a dignified middle-aged man wearing a purple-gold crown and a king’s robe embroidered with flowers, birds, beasts, and insects walked over from the distance.","...","When he lifted his foot, he was still at the edge of the sky and was just a small black dot. However, when he took a step, his figure had already appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple had arrived!","His expression was indifferent. He didn’t even look at the master of Lotus Island and the other three Supremes. Instead, he looked straight at the Tarot Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand. After staring at it for about three breaths, he turned his eyes slightly and looked at Jian Wushuang again.","“Pfft!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled violently and his face was filled with horror.","The pressure that this person’s gaze brought to him was even more terrifying than the four great Rulers’ joint attack!","Who was he?"]},{"number":4315,"title":"Chapter 4315 The Arrival of the Blood Wave","paragraphs":["4315 The Arrival of the Blood Wave","Bang!!","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple’s gaze seemed to have traveled through the universe and landed on Jian Wushuang. Jian Wushuang felt that his divine body was on the verge of collapsing under his gaze and his heart turned cold.","Who was this person?","How could he be so powerful?","!!","Almost instantly, Jian Wushuang was sure that even with the Tarot Divine Sword, he was far from being this person’s opponent!","“You are Jian Wushuang?”","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple glanced at Jian Wushuang indifferently. It was as if he had seen through Jian Wushuang and there was a strange look in his eyes.","The fourth level’s sword principle origin, a perfect-grade special life form, and the Tarot Divine Sword. With such talent and opportunity, he’ll probably be a fatal threat to Cosmos Temple if he grows any further.","“It would be a waste to just kill him. Why don’t we bring him back, extract his life level, and refine his soul...”","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple shook his head and said, “Jian Wushuang, come with me.”","After saying that, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple stretched out his hand and clenched his five fingers. In an instant, an invisible hand seemed to form in the void and lifted Jian Wushuang up.","As for the other three great Supremes, they had already shrunk to one side after the arrival of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple. They were as silent as cicadas in winter and trembling.","Just as the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple picked up Jian Wushuang and was about to leave...","An earth-shaking roar suddenly exploded in the sky!","“I am here. Who dares to take Jian Wushuang away?!”","Bang!","A bolt of blood-red lightning shot over from the distance!","The crimson lightning was extremely fast. In an instant, it landed in front of Jian Wushuang. With a wave of his hand, it shattered the hand of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple.","This person was none other than the Blood Wave Ruler, who had charged over at all costs!","“The Blood Wave Ruler!”","Jian Wushuang looked at the back of the man in front of him and felt touched. He couldn’t help but call out softly.","Supreme Blood Wave turned to look at Jian Wushuang and felt his divine body was like a lamp that had run out of oil. His eyes were filled with endless regret and he said guiltily, “Little fellow, I’m late. I’ve made you suffer.”","Jian Wushuang forced a smile and said, “You’re not late. I’m sorry for the trouble.”","The Blood Wave Supreme smiled back and stroked Jian Wushuang’s hair like a kind elder doting on his beloved junior. His eyes were full of admiration and comfort.","“What trouble? When I brought you back to the Divine Life Palace, I promised you that I would protect you for the rest of your life.”","“Little fellow, leave the rest to me.”","After saying that, the Blood Wave Supreme took a deep breath and suddenly turned around. He looked coldly at the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple and the three great Supremes and said, “I’m here. If you want to take Jian Wushuang away, you’ll have to step over me first!”","A heaven-shaking, earth-shattering aura that could cause chaos to boil and shatter rose from Ruler Blood Wave’s body!","The three great masters were like frightened quails in the face of this aura. Their legs were trembling.","“So, so strong!” The old woman’s expression changed greatly.","Only the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple remained unmoved. He glanced at the Blood Wave Supreme indifferently and said, “Blood Wave, you can’t protect Jian Wushuang.”","The Blood Wave Ruler snorted coldly as a cold fighting intent appeared in his eyes. “It’s not up to you to decide whether we can protect them or not. Let’s just fight!”","Seeing this, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple sighed and said, “Blood Wave, I wanted to spare your life at first and let you live for a few more days. Since you want to die, then you can die with Jian Wushuang.”","With that, he pulled out a blood-red God-killing spear that was three feet long.","The aura of this God slaying spear was somewhat similar to the one in the hands of the Black Eagle Ruler. However, they were also completely different. This was because this God slaying spear was much, much more powerful. The destructive aura it exuded was actually not much weaker than that of the Tarot divine sword. Furthermore, it was as if this God slaying spear had a heart beating within it, constantly letting out muffled thuds.","The Blood Wave Ruler’s heart trembled upon seeing this.","“Come on, Blood Wave. Let me see if you’ve improved after all these years.”","The Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple shook his head and waved his right hand gently. In an instant, the God-killing spear stabbed toward the Blood Wave Supreme.","This stab seemed completely ordinary and didn’t contain any sort of power. It was as if any Omega Ruler would be able to take it on, but Ruler Blood Wave’s face was extremely grave.","“Break!”","The Blood Wave Ruler formed an incantation gesture with two fingers and shouted coldly.","In an instant, three blood pillars rose up behind him. These blood pillars were like three tornadoes that connected heaven and earth, and their power was terrifying to the extreme!","Before the three blood pillars could display their power, a huge pressure had already spread out, causing the void to collapse and turn chaotic!","Quickly retreat!!!","The faces of the three island Masters of Lotus Heart Island changed drastically. They were all Supremes, but under this pressure, they felt as small as ants.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, did not feel any pressure under the special care of the Blood Wave Master.","Bang!","An earth-shattering explosion was heard!","The seemingly ordinary God slaying spear exploded with indescribable power after colliding with the three blood pillars!","It was as if the universe had fallen into a great calamity. A monstrous power that could destroy the world rose up. Just the astral winds from the collision were enough to tear apart any ultimate Ruler!","Around them, there was originally a medium-sized Starfield. In the end, the entire Starfield exploded just from the aftershock of the collision between the two!","This was a battle between gods!","A huge shock wave spread out, and it was extremely bright!","Everyone subconsciously closed their eyes.","...","It was the same for Jian Wushuang. He felt so insignificant in the battle between the Blood Wave Supreme and the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple. It was as if he was an ant in the mortal world, looking up at the battle between the gods in the Nine Heavens. It was a realm that he could not reach even with the Tarot Divine Sword.","After the shock wave dissipated, it was a long time before everyone slowly opened their eyes.","Jian Wushuang quickly looked at the Blood Wave Supreme and saw that his right sleeve had been torn apart. His face was pale.","“The Blood Wave Ruler!”","Jian Wushuang couldn’t hold it in any longer. He roared and his eyes turned red.","“I...it’s fine.”","The Blood Wave Ruler stretched out his hand and waved it with great difficulty, indicating that he was fine.","“Blood Wave, it seems like you are much stronger than you were in the previous battle.”","However, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple narrowed his eyes and said, “Although it seemed like a casual attack, in fact, that attack just now was extremely dangerous. It contained 80% of his power as an invincible Supreme martial artist, and ordinary top Supreme martial artists could not take it at all.”","The Blood Wave Supreme forcefully suppressed the searing heat in his divine body and looked up at the Hall Master of cosmos divine Palace. He took a deep breath and said, “Hei Yu, stop with the nonsense. No matter what, I will accompany you to the end today.”","..."]},{"number":4316,"title":"Chapter 4316 I’m Here!","paragraphs":["4316 I’m Here!","“Blood Wave, you’re cutting off your own path.”","The Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple shook his head and a cruel smile appeared on his face.","“Since that’s the case, I’ll satisfy you, Blood Wave!”","As soon as he said that, the God-killing spear gathered its power again. This time, a terrifying aura surged. At the tip of the God-killing spear, there was a cold red light, as if it was going to Pierce a hole in the sky.","!!","All kinds of rules evolved and settled on the God-killing spear. At this moment, even the magnetic field of the universe was changed and triggered, as if the great Dao of the universe was about to emerge.","A battle between Supreme-beings was a clash of laws!","“Supreme Blood Wave, I’ll just give him the Tarot Divine Sword!” Seeing this, Jian Wushuang clenched his fists tightly and said.","He knew that the Ruler Blood Wave was in danger of dying from this attack.","He asked himself, “Ever since I joined the Divine Life Palace, it has always been the Ruler Blood Wave who has constantly supported and protected me. What have I brought to the Ruler Blood Wave?”","He had already owed the Ruler Blood Wave far, far too much. He couldn’t let the Ruler Blood Wave risk his life for the sake of the zenith sword.","When the Blood Wave Supreme heard this, he turned around and stretched out his hand to press down on Jian Wushuang’s shoulder. Then, he shook his head and said with a serious expression, “Jian Wushuang, the Tarot Divine Sword is your opportunity. It’s also the thing you can rely on to break through to the Supreme level and stand at the peak of the universe. You can’t hand it over so easily.”","After saying this, the Ruler Blood Wave continued in a deep voice, “Jian Wushuang, believe in me. As long as I’m still alive, no one in this world can bully you.”","Jian Wushuang wanted to say something, but the Blood Wave Master had already turned around.","“Come on!”","The Blood Wave Supreme glared coldly at the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple.","Jian Wushuang looked at the back of the Blood Wave Master. For the first time, he felt so weak and hated himself for not being stronger.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","At this moment, a few more rays of light appeared in the starry sky.","“Hahaha, I’ve finally found the Tarot Divine Sword!”","“Hei Yu, don’t tell me you want to keep the Tarot Divine Sword for yourself?”","“That brat, quickly hand over the Tarot Divine Sword!”","Three rays of light descended and turned into three Supreme figures.","“The Supreme Being of the southern sea!”","“Supreme Wuji!”","the Deputy Hall Master of Blood Sky Hall!","The island master of Lotus Heart Island cried out in alarm.","The three great Rulers were attacking again!","The three of them were all well-known Supreme Masters in the universe. They were all invincible in the universe. Limitless Supreme was a top master among the Supreme Masters, and ordinary Supreme Masters like them could not compare to him.","Even the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple was shocked when he saw the three of them.","The Blood Wave Supreme’s heart sank to the bottom. There were already seven Supremes present, and the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple was an invincible Supreme. There must be more Supremes rushing over from afar.","“I’m afraid we won’t be able to settle this peacefully today...”","The Ruler Blood Wave raised his head and looked into the distance. He was looking in the direction of the Divine Life Palace.","The only thing that could save them now was the Divine Life Palace.","He had already sent a message to the Divine Life Palace...","...","Exhaling a mouthful of turbid air, the Blood Wave Supreme turned to look at Jian Wushuang and said with a smile, “Little fellow, if we were to die Here today, would you be afraid?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes swept across the seven great masters ‘faces. He suddenly felt a sense of pride and laughed, “It’s just death, what’s there to fear?”","Thanks to the Ruler Blood Wave’s delay, he had already recovered more than half of his divine power, enough for him to use the Tarot Divine Sword again!","Even if he had to die today, he would drag another Supreme martial artist down with him!","“Hahaha, what a good...what fear! Jian Wushuang, let’s join forces and fight together. We’ll turn the world upside down and fight to the death!”","The Ruler Blood Wave clapped his hands and laughed heartily as a heroic aura soared into the sky.","His Blood Waves had swept across the universe for tens of millions of years, when had he ever been afraid?","It was just as Jian Wushuang had said.","However, what was there to fear about death?","As for the three new Supreme martial artists, they had already cast their greedy eyes on the Tarot Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand.","“Things might change if we delay. Let’s kill these two first and get the Tarot Divine Sword!” He thought.","“That’s right, to prevent any accidents, let’s kill these two first!”","“Jian Wushuang, you’re just an Ultimate Ruler. You should be proud that you’re being hunted down by the seven of us even if you die!”","The seven great Supremes spoke one after another, eager to make a move.","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple snorted coldly. Since there were people who could work together to kill the Supreme Blood Wave and the others, he naturally could not do so. After all, he was confident that with his strength, the Tarot Divine Sword would eventually fall into his hands.","“Kill!”","The Deputy Hall Master of Blood Sky Hall said coldly as he took a step forward and charged toward the Blood Wave Supreme and Jian Wushuang.","The other six Supreme martial artists also charged forward.","In the blink of an eye, the Seven Supreme Masters killed Jian Wushuang and Blood Wave at the same time!","...","The enormous and terrifying power seemed to be able to destroy the world, causing the heavens and earth to boil!","The violent wind stirred up countless spatial storms!","“Kill!”","Upon seeing this, a cold killing intent flashed across Supreme Blood Wave’s eyes. The supreme divine power in his body surged and turned the surrounding area into a churning blood pool!","“Kill!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold. He raised the Tarot Divine Sword, and a brilliant sword power spread out.","The two of them were already prepared to die in this battle!","Bang!","At this moment of life and death...","A huge and sharp axe light suddenly hacked down from the distance!","“I, Supreme Giant Axe, am here. Who dares to hurt the people of my Divine Life Palace?”","...","Along with it, there was an earth-shaking roar!","A 10,000,000-feet-tall rough giant strode over from the distance!","He was shrouded in endless chaotic immortal radiance and held a Giant Axe that could split the sky and earth. In front of him, the sun was like a bullet and the River of Stars was like a bathtub. He could pluck the stars with a raise of his hand and destroy the earth with a step!","Supreme Being Giant Axe had arrived!","Immediately after, a second roar came!","“I, Ruler Heavenly Dipper, am here. Who dares to hurt the people of my Divine Life Palace?!”","In another direction, a topless middle-aged man with sharp eyes pulled the bowstring and released an arrow. A godly arrow shot out like a lightning bolt!","The arrow instantly cut through the sky, leaving a 10000-feet-long white wave in the universe. It directly blew up a planet in its way and continued to shoot forward with destructive power!","“I, The White Tiger Ruler, am here. Who dares to hurt the people of my Divine Life Palace?”","A third roar rang out.","A star-sized sharp metal white Tiger stepped out of the void and roared into the heavens. Terrifying shockwaves were deafening, and a tangible killing intent covered the world, causing all things to fall silent and all races to tremble!","On the back of this huge white tiger, there was a burly man in the middle. He was wearing a ferret robe and a white forehead pad. He was holding a scimitar. As he shouted coldly, the white tiger under him opened its mouth and roared out a destructive light wave!","Finally, an old and indifferent voice sounded in everyone’s mind as if it had traveled through the universe.","“I, Supreme Master Gai Fu, am here. Who dares to hurt the people of my Divine Life Palace?”"]},{"number":4317,"title":"Chapter 4317 Battle of the Gods (Part One)","paragraphs":["4317 Battle of the Gods (Part One)","“I, Supreme Master Gai Fu, am here. Who dares to hurt the people of my Divine Life Palace?”","When this indifferent and old voice sounded.","In an instant, the expressions of the seven great Supremes, including the Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple, changed drastically!","The five lead disciples of the Divine Life Palace had actually come together!","!!","“Even Gai Fu is here!”","The Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple’s eyes flashed wildly.","“What, what do we do now?”","The island master of Lotus Heart Island, who was the weakest among the seven people, said with trembling lips.","The five lead Supremes of the Divine Life Palace were all top Supremes who had gone through countless storms and battles!","This was especially true for Supreme Master Gai Fu, who was so ancient that they didn’t even know his origins. Even the few Supreme Masters at the peak of the universe were extremely wary of him.","“Blood Wave, I’ve been waiting for you!”","Supreme Giant Axe strode forward like a primordial Immortal King. With every step he took, the universe trembled violently and shattered countless void fragments.","Behind him, Supreme Heavenly Dipper was holding a divine arrow in his hand and following closely behind like an arrow God. His eyes were as sharp as an Eagle’s!","Once, when the universe was still in chaos and the myriad races were at war, he had shot nine Golden Crows with nine arrows in a row and was at his peak.","Although it had been dozens of chaos cycles since he had fired an arrow, no one doubted his power.","“Blood Wave, we...I’m late.”","The White Tiger Ruler leaped out. The sharp gold white tiger beneath him actually had two eyes, and every step it took ignited a black flame footprint in the air. As the light in its eyes changed, it looked at the seven great Rulers as if it was about to devour them, causing the Seven Supreme Ruler to feel a chill run down their spines.","They walked over and stood beside the Ruler Blood Wave. A monstrous aura rose up from them, as if it was going to collapse the ancient times and shake the Nine Heavens and ten lands.","“You guys...”","When the Ruler Blood Wave saw this, he nodded with a complicated expression. He wanted to say something, but in the end, all his words were condensed into one sentence.","“Alright,” he said.","When the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple saw this, his face turned extremely gloomy. However, he did not care about the four great Supremes. Instead, he looked into the void far away.","An old man with age spots all over his face and an aura of decay was walking over.","He was expressionless, as if he was an ordinary old man. However, with every step he took, he directly crossed the chaotic space and time.","Overpowering Supreme martial artist!","He was the strongest expert in the Divine Life Palace, other than the palace Master who had long disappeared!","He was the pillar of the Divine Life Palace. Even if the palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had disappeared, as long as he was still in charge of the Divine Life Palace, the palace of life would be the top power in the universe!","“Gai Fu, Jian Wushuang actually managed to lure you out?”","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple said slowly with a solemn expression.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu was expressionless as he raised his eyes to look at him. He then said indifferently, “Hei Yu, your Cosmos Temple has gone a little too far in recent years.”","“Too much?”","The Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple sneered, and his eyes were filled with mockery. “Gai Fu, if I’m not wrong, you haven’t recovered from your injuries from that battle, have you? Let me guess, how many more times can the current you attack? Twice? Or three times?”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu didn’t reply. He only quietly spat out a single word.","“Kill!”","In an instant, White Tiger Ruler, Heavenly Dipper Ruler, Giant Axe Ruler, and Ruler Blood Wave all responded in agreement!","A towering battle intent erupted from the four of them!","They looked at the seven great masters without the slightest fear or solemnity. On the contrary, they were extremely relaxed and bold!","“Blood Wave, how long has it been since the four of us fought side by side?”","Supreme Giant Axe laughed.","The Ruler Blood Wave smiled and replied, “It’s been nearly a few hundred chaos cycles since that battle.”","Supreme Heavenly Dipper didn’t say a word. He raised the divine bow in his hand, and a Scarlet arrow condensed on the bowstring.","As for The White Tiger Supreme, he took the lead and charged toward the black-robed Supreme who had tried to kill Jian Wushuang first, as well as the solemn-looking man!","“Blood Wave, Big Dipper, Giant Axe, just wait and see. I’ll deal with these ants!”","Roar!","A deafening tiger’s roar resounded, shaking all directions. The White Tiger Supreme’s heroic spirit soared to the sky, and his bloodthirsty aura shook the universe!","The White Tiger was in charge of killing, while The White Tiger Ruler was the Supreme expert who walked out from the endless killing!","“Hahaha, I haven’t moved my muscles for a long time. Leave them to me!”","The Supreme Giant Axe laughed out loud. The Giant Axe in his hand split the sky and earth apart, slashing out a shocking axe light. The axe light was hundreds of thousands of feet long and directly split a Galaxy into pieces. Then, it slashed down fiercely at the strongest expert other than the Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple, limitless Supreme!","A smile appeared on the Ruler Blood Wave’s face as he watched this scene. It was as if he had traveled through time and space to return to that unparalleled battle all those years ago, when they had fought side by side. The blood in his body began to boil.","He turned to look at Jian Wushuang and said with a smile, “Jian Wushuang, just watch how we old men will protect you.”","Bang!","As soon as he finished speaking, he stomped his foot heavily and turned into a pillar of blood that pierced the sky. With a destructive might, he charged toward the Deputy Palace Master of Blood Sky Palace and the Supreme of South Sea!","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists tightly. At this moment, he felt his blood boiling in his chest!","This was the first time he had felt the power of a sect!","...","“Bang bang bang!”","At this moment, the surrounding billions of miles of space were struck and rumbled as if they had fallen into a chaotic sea. The heaven and earth were wailing!","Countless Supreme divine arts shot up into the sky. They were extremely brilliant and spectacular, as if they had opened up a magnificent epic!","Roarrrr!","The planet-sized acute metal white Tiger opened its mouth and roared. Destructive sound waves shot out from its mouth, blasting countless giant holes in the starry sky!","“You two pieces of trash, how dare you try to attack my Divine Life Palace?”","With a sneer on his face, The White Tiger Supreme was fighting against two people alone. He was facing the black-robed Supreme and the solemn-looking man who had tried to kill Jian Wushuang at the beginning. Not only was he not at a disadvantage, but he was also overbearing and overbearing, as if a king who was in charge of killing had descended to the world.","The sharp golden white Tiger’s palm slammed down, shattering the myriad of techniques unleashed by the two, and sent the black-robed Supreme martial artist flying tens of thousands of feet!","On the other side, Supreme Giant Axe was fighting limitless Supreme. Both of them were top-tier Supreme-beings, and as they exchanged blows, a shocking fluctuation burst out!","“Bang bang bang bang!”","The entire starry sky trembled. Supreme Giant Axe was tens of thousands of feet tall, as if he had transformed into an ancient God who had created the world. His left eye was the moon, his right eye was the sun, and the veins protruding from the surface of his skin were the towering mountains!","...","Every time the giant axe in his hand slashed down, it would bring with it a power that could destroy the world, forcing limitless Ruler to retreat repeatedly, his body trembling.","“Come! Kill me!”","Supreme Giant Axe roared as he fought madly, causing all the Supremes present to shiver in fear.","The expression on the face of the limitless Supreme-being was extremely ugly, and an obvious look of fear flashed through his eyes."]},{"number":4318,"title":"Chapter 4318 Battle of the Gods (Part 2)","paragraphs":["4318 Battle of the Gods (Part 2)","The entire universe seemed to have fallen into a boiling chaos.","Countless words could be used to describe the horror of this battle!","Countless holes appeared in the sky, and the ground was constantly being shattered!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","!!","Supreme Heavenly Dipper’s expression was cold and detached. Every arrow that was shot out blocked the escape routes of the seven great Rulers, leaving bloody holes in their bodies!","The battle between the Blood Wave Supreme, the South Sea Supreme, and the Blood Sky Palace’s Deputy Palace Master was even more terrifying!","At this moment, everyone finally realized how terrifying the Ruler Blood Wave was!","3,000 great daos emerged from the Blood Wave Supreme’s body and turned into a world of corpses and blood. The divine bodies of South Sea Supreme and the Deputy Palace Master of Blood Sky Palace were continuously destroyed as they cried out in pain.","South Sea Supreme and the Deputy Hall Master of Blood Sky Hall were both high-level and top-tier Supremes in the universe, but they were unable to retaliate against the Blood Wave Supreme. They were constantly defeated and were in imminent danger.","Although the Blood Wave Supreme was only a top-tier Supreme, he was much stronger than ordinary top-tier Supremes in terms of combat power!","Although he seemed to be in a difficult position when he faced the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple, he had an overwhelming advantage when he was facing a Supreme-being of the same realm!","The battle had entered a state of slaughter from the very beginning.","With Supreme Heavenly Dipper cutting off their escape route, the seven great Supremes were like lambs waiting to be slaughtered, constantly being slaughtered!","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. At that moment, his divine power had finally recovered completely.","Immediately after, he turned his gaze to the master of Lotus Island, the acrid and mean old woman.","No one knew if it was intentional or not, but Supreme Blood Wave and the others had made the old woman stay.","“You, should die!”","Jian Wushuang looked at the old woman coldly.","When the old woman heard this, her expression changed and she shrieked, “Jian Wushuang, what are you doing?”","Jian Wushuang did not answer. Instead, he raised the Tarot Divine Sword and swept it toward the old woman.","When the old woman saw this, a cold light flashed in her eyes.","She understood that the situation had already been decided. If there were no accidents, she would not be able to escape death.","The only chance of survival was Jian Wushuang.","If he wanted to live, there was only one way, and that was to abduct Jian Wushuang and threaten the five lead Supremes of the Divine Life Palace to let him leave.","Thinking of this, a cold sneer appeared on the old woman’s face. She muttered to herself, “Jian Wushuang, Oh Jian Wushuang, since you’re looking for death, don’t blame me.”","Bang!","As soon as she finished speaking, the old woman turned over her right hand and took out a lotus lamp from her interspatial ring.","There was no fire on the lotus lamp, but there was a flirtatious Red Lotus swaying slightly, emitting a faint red light, reflecting the old woman’s face, making it even uglier.","Slash!!!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were cold and his black hair was flying in the air. He slashed the Tarot Divine Sword at the old woman!","A brilliant sword pressure descended, instantly snatching away all the brilliant light in the area. Like a river of stars, it pressed down on the old woman!","This sword cut across the sky and pierced through the sun and moon!","Looking at the dazzling Tarot Divine Sword, the old woman’s eyes were filled with surprise. Then, the surprise in her eyes was replaced by regret.","“Old friend, I’m counting on you this time.”","She looked down at the red lotus lamp in her hand and muttered to herself. With a push of her hands, the red lotus lamp immediately shot out and shone brightly in the air.","Countless rays of red light shot out, like the sunset glow at night, painting the starry sky a gorgeous red.","The lotus core of the red lotus lamp suddenly expanded in the wind and turned into a towering red lotus that connected heaven and earth.","The next moment!","Bang!","The Tarot Divine Sword ruthlessly slashed at the red lotus!","A strange scene appeared. After the Tarot sword struck the red lotus, the red lotus suddenly began to absorb the endless power of the Tarot sword like a balloon.","“What?”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank.","Kacha! Kacha!","In the next moment, the lotus lamp started to crack.","It was like a bucket with a sealed mouth that was constantly filled with water. Finally, it could not take it anymore and exploded!","Bang!","With a wail, the towering lotus flower broke into pieces!","The power of the Tarot Divine Sword had also disappeared.","Seeing this, a touch of resentment flashed across the old woman’s face. She stared at Jian Wushuang and said coldly, “Jian Wushuang, you’ve caused my treasure to be destroyed. You deserve to die!”","After she finished speaking, the old woman laughed and countless Red Lotus fire surged around her and rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang was slightly surprised, but he didn’t panic. This time, when he used the Tarot Divine Sword, he didn’t use all of his divine power. He still had some power left, which was enough to deal with the old woman.","Just as the old woman was about to catch Jian Wushuang and he was about to use the Daybreak sword to end her life.","Pfft!","...","The sound of an arrow breaking through the air rang out.","A spear-like scarlet arrow broke through the void and pierced through the divine body of the Lotus Island master. Along with the remaining force, it was sent flying!","“Ah!”","“Arghh!” The old woman screamed in pain. Divine power burst out from the Scarlet arrow and shattered her divine body.","The master of Lotus Island had fallen!","In the distance, Supreme Heavenly Dipper looked at Jian Wushuang and smiled. “Little fellow, that Red Lotus was born from the primordial chaos and is capable of withstanding a world-destroying blow. It can be considered a life substitution talisman. Be careful.”","Jian Wushuang nodded at him gratefully.","After the time for one incense stick to burn.","Supreme Giant Axe was the first to end the battle. He turned around and strode in the direction of the Blood Wave Supreme’s battle.","After the time for three incense sticks to burn.","At this point, other than the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple, the other six great Supremes had been completely massacred by the Joint Forces of Supreme Blood Wave and the others!","...","At this moment, the cold wind whimpered and the great Dao wailed. It was as if the heavens and earth were mourning for the six great Rulers.","The fall of six great masters, how shocking was this?","Once it was spread, the entire universe would be shaken!","After killing their respective opponents, Supreme Giant Axe, Supreme Blood Wave, and the other two stopped and looked into the distance with their hands behind their backs.","There were only two people there.","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple and Supreme Master Gai Fu!","At this moment, the expression of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple was extremely ugly. He was no longer as calm as before and was staring at Supreme Master Gai Fu with fear in his eyes.","“Gai Fu, you can’t even protect yourself now. Do you really want to waste your chance to attack for Jian Wushuang?!”","The Palace Master of Cosmos Temple growled.","Supreme Master Gai Fu’s expression was neither happy nor sad when he heard this. He did not reply and only extended a finger to point at the great Cosmos Temple master’s glabella.","Rumble!","In an instant, a destructive aura that seemed to come from the ancient times, which caused the universe to perish, the chaos to boil, and the great Dao to be annihilated, rose in the void and slowly condensed!"]},{"number":4319,"title":"Chapter 4319 Gai Fu Takes Action","paragraphs":["4319 Gai Fu Takes Action","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu had made his move!","At that moment, not only Jian Wushuang, but even Blood Wave, Giant Axe, and the other lead disciples squinted their eyes and stared at Supreme Gai Fu, who was standing alone in the void.","“Blood Wave, it’s been hundreds of chaos cycles, but we haven’t seen Ruler takedown attack, have we?”","The White Tiger Ruler said with a smile.","!!","The Blood Wave Supreme nodded his head and a look of reminiscence appeared in his eyes. that’s right. In the past, before we had risen to power, it was Supreme Master Gai Fu and the palace Master who supported the Divine Life Palace, allowing our Divine Life Palace to have its current glory.","Everyone smiled and discussed as they looked into the void.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu pressed down with his finger. In an instant, countless great Dao rules evolved, turning into countless mountains, rivers, Suns, moons, stars, birds, beasts, and insects.","The next moment!","The void was torn apart!","A huge finger that looked like a pillar that held up the sky slowly extended out of the pitch-black crack in the void.","No words could describe the horror of this finger. Under this finger, it was as if the Milky Way had turned into a mountain stream, and the stars had turned into sand and dust. Everything seemed insignificant and tiny in front of this finger.","The fingerprint on this finger was clearly visible, as if it had transformed into countless great Dao rules, surrounded by a storm.","Ka-chak.","This finger slowly pointed toward the Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple. Before it even landed, its terrifying power had already crushed the surrounding void as if it was a piece of rotten wood.","“This...what kind of strength is this?”","Jian Wushuang was aghast at the sight.","Just the faint pressure from this finger alone was enough to make his entire body shiver. His blood was frozen stiff, and even his right hand, which was holding the Tarot Divine Sword, was trembling slightly.","Gai Fu!!","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple roared when he saw this. He, who had been locked onto by this finger, felt as if the great Dao of heaven and earth was pressing down on him. His mind was in a frenzy.","Break for this senior!!!","He rubbed his hands hard, and the star-destroying God slaying spear appeared in his hands again. Then, he slightly tilted his head back, as if he was pulling a bow and throwing a javelin. The vast and surging supreme divine power gathered in his hands, and then he blasted it toward the finger!","It was like a needle against an awn, like the stars colliding!","Bang!","With an earth-shaking explosion, a bright light spread out from the point of collision!","At this moment, it was as if the universe had been destroyed. The earth-shaking explosion directly condensed into a physical substance, turning into rolling sound waves that crushed the surroundings.","The rumbling sound waves annihilated the surrounding void, turning it into a void of nothingness before crashing toward the Ruler Blood Wave and the others.","Jian Wushuang, be careful!","The Blood Wave master’s expression changed slightly. The shock waves from the battle had no effect on him, but to Jian Wushuang, it was no different from a disaster.","Peng, peng, peng.","He waved his palm three times in a row before he managed to break the shock wave that was coming at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned pale. Although the shock wave didn’t hurt him, it shook his mind.","A moment later, when everyone looked up again...","Whoosh!","The God-killing spear let out a wail and only managed to block Supreme Master Gai Fu’s finger for three breaths before it was sent flying by the vast power and shot to an unknown place in the universe.","The finger continued to land on the divine body of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple without any hindrance.","Bang!","In an instant, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple’s divine robe was torn apart, and the purple gold crown on his head exploded. His black hair fell down, and he looked extremely pathetic.","And this was only the beginning!","The finger continued to press down, and the divine body of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple immediately crumbled.","“Am I going to die?”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank.","Supreme Blood Wave shook his head and replied, “That fellow Hei Yu will not die so easily.”","After a few seconds, the Supreme divine body of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple completely collapsed and turned into a pool of black water.","As for Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s finger, its power had also been exhausted, and it dissipated with the wind like a sand painting.","However, Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s face was still indifferent and expressionless.","Chi chi chi.","A strange scene appeared.","The Cosmos Temple master’s divine body collapsed, and the pool of black water that he had turned into twisted continuously. Then, it turned into countless black crows, spread their wings, and flew into the distance.","A moment later, the group of black crows collided with each other and re-condensed into the appearance of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple.","Although his body had reappeared, his face was abnormally pale. He glanced at Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu from afar, his eyes filled with fear.","Just now, he had sensed a power that was no less powerful than the palace Master of the Divine Life Palace!","“Good, good, good. Gai Fu, since you’re not considering the big picture and are forcefully attacking, I’ll leave for now. But since you don’t have much time left, I’d like to see who will protect the Divine Life Palace after you die!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he turned around and stared at Jian Wushuang coldly in the distance. His eyes were full of killing intent.","Jian Wushuang, you’re lucky this time. But don’t worry, I’ll take you and your sword away sooner or later.","...","“When the time comes, I’d like to see who else can protect you!”","With that, he took a step forward and turned into a dark light, shooting into the distance.","He knew that with Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu here today, it was impossible for him to obtain the Tarot Divine Sword.","“Hmph, you want to escape?”","When Supreme Giant Axe and the others saw this, they snorted coldly and decided to chase after him.","At this moment, Supreme Master Gai Fu waved his hand and said weakly, “Let him be, you can’t stop him.”","When Supreme Giant Axe and the others heard this, they hurriedly looked at Supreme Master Gai Fu, only to see that his already aged face had aged even more. His turbid eyes were filled with lethargy.","“Supreme Ruler Gai Fu!”","Supreme Giant Axe’s face changed slightly in an instant, and his heart began to race.","He was afraid that this time, Gai Fu, who was already on the verge of death, would be even more seriously injured.","“I’m fine, don’t worry,”","...","Supreme Master Gai Fu took a deep breath, then slowly turned his eyes to Jian Wushuang.","He didn’t say anything. He just looked at Jian Wushuang deeply and said, “We can’t stay here for long. Let’s go back to the Divine Life Palace first.”","They were all decisive people, and they knew that it would not take long for other Supreme Masters to swarm over. They nodded and took Jian Wushuang with them, turning into a shocking escape light and flying toward the Divine Life Palace.","Several days later, they returned to the Divine Life Palace.","After returning to the Divine Life Palace, Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu immediately gave the order to seal off all the passageways of the Divine Life Palace and refuse visitors. He also activated the palace-protecting formation and set the Divine Life Palace to the highest state of alert!"]},{"number":4320,"title":"Chapter 4320 The Universe Is Shaking","paragraphs":["4320 The Universe Is Shaking","A few days later.","The news of the battle between the Divine Life Palace and the seven great Supremes spread like a bomb being dropped on a calm lake. It completely exploded in the universe and set off an explosion!","This news was like a flood that had collapsed a dam. With an extremely fast speed, it instantly spread throughout the entire universe, engulfing the world!","In an instant, the universe boiled and all races were shocked!","!!","The discussion of this battle could be heard from almost every corner of the universe and from anyone!","The Alliance of the five lead Supremes of the Divine Life Palace has appeared. They are invincible against the seven Supremes!","Supreme Master Gai Fu has made his move and defeated the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple with one finger!","“The death of a Ruler! It’s rare to see seven Supreme Masters fall in one day!”","The universe was filled with discussions about this battle. Only then did they realize how terrifying the Divine Life Palace, which had been silent for many years, was when they finally emerged!","Previously, when Giant Axe master and Blood Wave Master had fought their way to the Great Void Temple for Jian Wushuang, countless people had been amazed by the Divine Life Palace’s power. However, compared to this battle, Giant Axe master and Blood Wave master’s fight against the Great Void Temple was not even worth mentioning.","The universe had been peaceful for far too long.","Therefore, the commotion caused by this battle was almost unprecedented!","Everyone was discussing the Divine Life Palace’s strength and how much more powerful it had become. They were also discussing how terrifyingly powerful the Supreme-beings had become.","Of course, the most discussed topic was still the main character of the battle, Jian Wushuang!","“He killed two Supreme martial artists with his sword! Never before!”","Jian Wushuang killed a few Supreme realm experts with his Ruler body!","Jian Wushuang’s battle is enough to be recorded in history. It will shock the ancient and modern!","“I’m sure that as long as Jian Wushuang doesn’t die, the universe will become Jian Wushuang’s era when he advances to the supremacy stage!”","Countless people went crazy over it and regarded Jian Wushuang as the future Master of the Universe.","Jian Wushuang had become the center of the storm in the entire universe.","However, these discussions were only circulating among the Rulers of the universe. The true Almighty experts of the universe, the Rulers, were silent.","...","...","Within the Great Void Temple.","Bang!","The newly appointed Emperor God, Supreme Master Bing Ye, smashed the armrest of his chair with his palm. His face was ashen to the extreme.","He had never thought that Jian Wushuang, whom he had regarded as an ant and sent Qiu Long to kill on the Ancient Path of Stars, would not only survive but grow to such an amazing extent in such a short time!","He felt as if everything he had done had become Jian Wushuang’s stepping stone, which made him extremely angry.","“Trash! All trash! What Hall Master of Cosmos Temple? He can’t even take down Jian Wushuang, who is only at the Ruler realm!”","Supreme Bing Ye clenched his fists tightly as he muttered to himself in a bone-chilling voice.","Outside the main hall, The Other Palace Masters all sighed, not knowing what to say.","For the first time, for some reason, they felt a faint sense of regret.","...","In the solar star field, in the Golden Crow’s habitat.","In the sun occupied by the great Emperor Golden Crow.","“Lin ‘er, have you fully recovered from your injuries?”","A dignified voice was heard. A middle-aged man wearing a flame royal robe approached them. It was the Golden Crow Emperor.","“Father, I’ve recovered from all my injuries. I’ve also gained some enlightenment during my recent closed-door training, and my strength has improved.”","The Emperor Golden Crow was sitting cross-legged in meditation, but when he heard the voice, he stood up and turned around with a smile.","“Not bad, you’re able to become braver with every setback. With such a heart, you’ll definitely become a great person in the future.”","A hint of admiration flashed through the Golden Crow’s eyes.","“I’m still far from that. Speaking of which, all of this is thanks to father’s advice that day, allowing this child’s heart to open up, and only then did this child understand the opportunity.”","The Emperor Golden Crow said humbly, but there was a hint of pride in his eyes.","This pride came from his confidence in his own strength.","Right now, he might not be comparable to a Supreme martial artist, but he could definitely take a blow from one!","After a short pause, he continued, “Father, I’ve already made up my mind. I’ll get back up from where I fell. I heard that Jian Wushuang has left the Ancient Path of Stars and I’m going to fight him again! I’m confident that I can defeat Jian Wushuang this time!”","Then, he raised his chin and looked at great Emperor Golden Crow expectantly.","However, he noticed that the Golden Crow’s expression was extremely strange.","“Uh, father, what’s wrong? Is there anything wrong? Is father worried that I will be defeated?” The Emperor Golden Crow scratched his head and said with a smile, “Father, don’t worry. I’m definitely strong enough to fight Jian Wushuang now...”","Before he could finish, the great Emperor Golden Crow took a deep breath and interrupted him. “Lin ‘er, you’ve been in closed-door cultivation recently. You missed the latest news about Jian Wushuang.”","“Eh? Could it be that Jian Wushuang had already been killed? That’s a pity.”","Instead of answering, the great Emperor Golden Crow took out a Jade cylinder and handed it to the Emperor Golden Crow. “Take a look for yourself.”","With that, Emperor Golden Crow turned and left.","“Father, why are you acting so strange today?”","...","“What?” The Emperor Golden Crow opened the Jade cylinder.","After a while.","“A sword slashes a Ruler! Slaughtering Divine Realm experts in succession!”","The Emperor Golden Crow’s mouth was wide open and his eyes were filled with shock.","...","Nine Emperor Pavilion, headquarters.","A Pavilion made of red tiles and green stones was floating in the air.","In the pavilion, three Supreme-beings were sitting around a round table. In front of them, there was a scroll that recorded the details of Jian Wushuang killing two Supreme-beings in a row.","“Heart Slayer, isn’t Jian Wushuang the boy you saved in nine Phoenix Star area back then?”","A red-robed old man with long eyes looked at the elegant old man in the middle of the three and said with a smile.","The old man was none other than Heart Slayer, who had saved Jian Wushuang’s life in nine luminaries star field.","...","“When I saved this kid, it was just a casual act. I didn’t expect him to have such an opportunity.”","Supreme Heart Slayer said with a smile.","Among the three, the last Supreme martial artist was a purple-haired youth. He said expressionlessly, “Red-ear, Heart Slayer, we are now discussing the Nine Emperor Pavilion’s attitude toward Jian Wushuang.”","After a pause, the purple-haired young man continued in a deep voice, “The Tarot Divine Sword is an important weapon in the universe. Almost all the Supremes in the universe are eager to get the Tarot Divine Sword. I’m afraid they will join forces to put pressure on the Divine Life Palace and ask for the sword. As one of the top forces in the universe, what should we do?”"]},{"number":4321,"title":"Chapter 4321 The Attitude","paragraphs":["4321 The Attitude","In the headquarters of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, the three great Supremes were sitting cross-legged around a round table. They were discussing Jian Wushuang, who had caused a storm in the universe recently.","The meeting and discussion between the three of them would directly determine the Nine Emperor Pavilion’s attitude toward the Divine Life Palace.","“Heart Slayer, you’ve been in contact with Jian Wushuang. Tell me, what do you think of him?” The purple-haired youth said in a deep voice.","He looked young and tender, but he was one of the most original founders of the Nine Emperor Pavilion and had been famous for a long time.","Supreme Heart Slayer nodded upon hearing this. After thinking for a moment, he replied, “Although I’ve only met Jian Wushuang once, it’s not difficult for me to tell that he’s a kind person. Of course, that’s not important. What’s important is that he’s extremely talented. Even among all the heaven’s favorites throughout history, there are few who can compare with Jian Wushuang. If there’s no accident, he’ll definitely become one of the top figures who will be on equal footing with us in the future!”","After a pause, Supreme Heart Slayer continued, “Violet-haired, I know that you’re inclined to attack the Divine Life Palace and fight for the Tarot Divine Sword. but think about it carefully. Even if all of us were to exert pressure on the Divine Life Palace, the Divine Palace would still be forced to hand over the Tarot sword. Do you really think that you’d be able to obtain the Tarot sword with so many Supremes present? Can you hold the Tarot Divine Sword?”","The purple-haired young man squinted his eyes when he heard this.","Supreme Heart Slayer chuckled. He turned his head and saw that the purple-haired youth was silent. He then changed the topic and said, “I think that no matter how strong the Tarot sword is, it’s just a weapon. On the other hand, Jian Wushuang is extremely talented and has a high potential for growth. Tsk, tsk. To be able to kill a Ruler with a Ruler’s sword...what sort of talent was this? At the very least, I was far from being able to do this when I was a Ruler.”","“Moreover, the Divine Life Palace has shown great strength in this battle. We won’t be at an advantage if we fight them. On the contrary, the Divine Life Palace has always been on good terms with the Nine Emperor Pavilion. Jian Wushuang is even on the Nine Emperor Pavilion ranking list. Thus, I think that instead of going against the Divine Life Palace, we might as well go and help them. Perhaps we’ll gain more than the Tarot Divine Sword, which is full of uncertainties.”","A moment later, Supreme Heart Slayer finished speaking, and the entire place fell silent.","The purple-haired youth slowly nodded his head. After pondering for a while, he looked at the red-robed elder and said, “Red-ear, what’s your opinion?”","The man in the red robe grinned and said, “I don’t care about that. However, the current Jian Wushuang reminds me of someone!”","“Oh? Who is it?”","The purple-haired youth and Supreme Heart Slayer raised their eyebrows.","The red-robed old man’s gaze swept across their faces, as if the person he was about to mention made him feel somewhat serious. The smile on the corner of his mouth unconsciously disappeared, and he said solemnly, “100000 chaos cycles ago, the number one genius of the universe, the one who went from being the enemy of the entire world to being silenced by the entire world, the East boundary!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Supreme Heart Slayer and the purple-haired youth’s eyes narrowed slightly.","The name ‘east boundary’ was too ancient. It was so ancient that in the entire universe, only a few people knew about it, except for the Supreme martial artists with the longest experience.","Not to mention the Ruler realm cultivators, who probably had never even heard of the East realm.","A hundred thousand chaos cycles ago, the East World had risen from the dust of the mortal world, using an ordinary mortal body and a trifling Ruler’s cultivation base to slaughter Ruler gods!","He was recognized as the number one genius in the universe!","“Red-ear, are you saying that Jian Wushuang will become the second east boundary?” The purple-haired youth’s eyes flickered.","The red-robed old man nodded and replied in a deep voice, “That’s right. The situation that Jian Wushuang is facing now is actually similar to the situation that the East boundary faced back then. Moreover, the two of them have one thing in common. That is, they both killed a Supreme Divine Realm expert with a Ruler’s body!”","The purple-haired youth frowned and said, “Although Jian Wushuang could kill a Supreme, he basically relied on the Tarot Divine Sword. He can’t be compared to the geniuses from the East realm who can kill a supreme head-on, right?”","Just as the red-robed old man was about to say something, Supreme Heart Slayer shook his head and said, “No, you’re wrong. In the past, the East realm was able to kill a Supreme-being head-on. In addition to his Supreme universe law, he also had extraordinary opportunities, such as the lost Wuxu chaotic cauldron, which is a treasure no less than the Tarot Divine Sword.","“Moreover, how long had it been since Jian Wushuang had broken through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm? Once his comprehension of his abilities reaches a higher level, he’ll probably be even more terrifying than the eastern realm.”","The purple-haired youth’s expression changed slightly when he heard this. He no longer spoke and lowered his head as if he was thinking about something.","After a long while, the purple-haired youth finally raised his head and looked deeply at Supreme Slayer and the red-robed elder. “So, you mean you’re all going to help the Divine Life Palace?”","Supreme Heart Slayer and the red-robed elder exchanged a smile and nodded.","“Good.”","...","...","Just as the entire universe was stirred up by Jian Wushuang.","Within the Divine Life Palace.","The five lead Supreme Masters, led by Supreme Master Gai Fu, and Jian Wushuang were discussing the next step of the plan in the Supreme shrine.","Everyone’s expression was somewhat solemn.","Everyone knew that the battle to kill the seven great Rulers was just the beginning. The real storm was only starting to brew at this time.","Jian Wushuang looked at the grave expressions on the faces of the Blood Wave Master and the others and could not help but say, “Supreme Blood Wave, I can hand over the Tarot Divine Sword.”","This was the decision that Jian Wushuang had made after weighing the pros and cons along the way.","Although the Tarot Divine Sword was powerful, it was just a weapon. Jian Wushuang was confident that even if he handed over the Tarot Divine Sword, he would be able to have a place of his own in the universe in the future with his own strength.","Moreover, the Tarot Sword Manual was still in his hands. Compared to the Tarot Divine Sword, he valued the five unique skills recorded in the Tarot Sword Manual more.","In the end, the Tarot Divine Sword was only an external object.","The Ruler Blood Wave shook his head and replied, “Little guy, things aren’t as simple as you think. The current situation is no longer about the Tarot Divine Sword. It’s just that some of the other powers are starting to get restless. They won’t let go of this opportunity to hit someone when they’re down.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with a thoughtful look. He nodded and did not say anything else.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu sat at the head of the table and swept his gaze across everyone’s faces. He slowly said, “The Divine Life Palace has been recuperating for so many years. Since we have decided to fight, we no longer fear it. What do you think?”"]},{"number":4322,"title":"Chapter 4322 The Undercurrent Surges","paragraphs":["4322 The Undercurrent Surges","The eyes of the four great Supremes flickered when they heard Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s words.","They all understood what Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu meant!","“Not bad! The Divine Life Palace has always stood aloof from the world, but that doesn’t mean that anyone can step on our faces!” The White Tiger Ruler, who had the most irascible personality, immediately stood up and snorted.","The light in his eyes brightened as he sneered, “Speaking of which, it just so happens that this Lord hasn’t had enough fun in this battle. Let’s have another battle!”","As for Blood Wave and the other two great Supremes, although they did not directly declare war on Ruler White Tiger, their bodies were also filled with boiling fighting intent.","They had never been afraid!","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu couldn’t help but show a hint of admiration in the depths of his turbid eyes.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu nodded his head and continued, “I’ve already sent a message to all the disciples of the Divine Palace who are travelling in the universe, except those on the ancient path of starry sky, to return to the Divine Life Palace.”","“At the same time, go back and inform your disciples that they are forbidden from going out of the Divine Life Palace during this period of time. Prepare for battle!”","“Yes!”","The four Supreme martial artists responded with a loud ‘yes’.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu made an ‘en’ sound and said, except for Jian Wushuang, the rest of you can leave.","The four great masters were stunned for a moment, but they didn’t think too much about it. They then took their leave.","A moment later, only Jian Wushuang and Supreme Master Gai Fu were left in the Supreme shrine.","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at Supreme Master Gai Fu. He was puzzled as to why Supreme Master Gai Fu had asked him to stay behind.","“Jian Wushuang, give me the Tarot Divine Sword.” Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu was expressionless as he spoke indifferently.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and nodded without hesitation, “Alright,” he said.","After he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang strode forward, turned around, and pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword. He then handed it over to Supreme Master Gai Fu.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu received the Tarot Divine Sword and lowered his head to take a closer look at it. He then sighed slightly, “The last time I saw this sword, an old friend of mine was still alive. In the blink of an eye, hundreds of chaos cycles have passed since I last saw it.”","Jian Wushuang didn’t disturb Supreme Master Gai Fu. Instead, he stood quietly at the side.","After putting down the Tarot Divine Sword, Supreme Master Gai Fu looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Jian Wushuang, you must have obtained the Tarot Sword Manual, right?”","Jian Wushuang nodded. He had no intention of hiding anything in front of Supreme Master Gai Fu, so he replied respectfully, “Yes.”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu smiled faintly and said, “Jian Wushuang, it’s your good fortune that you’ve obtained Tarot’s inheritance. However, you must remember that you have to look far ahead. Other people’s Daos are still other people’s Daos, and you can’t rely on them too much. Only by comprehending and opening up your own Dao can you truly achieve something and have the qualification to reach the peak of the universe. Do you understand?”","“Many thanks for your advice, Supreme Ruler Gai Fu.” Jian Wushuang quickly cupped his hands.","He wasn’t a fool, and he could naturally tell that Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu had intentionally left him behind because he was afraid that he would only rely on the power of the Tarot Divine Sword and neglect his own growth.","“Good,” Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu nodded his head slightly when he saw this, and a look of relief flashed in his eyes.","Then, he waved the Tarot Divine Sword and handed it back to Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, I’ve already planted a seal on the Tarot Divine Sword to seal its power and aura. You can’t use the Tarot Divine Sword unless you have no other choice.”","Jian Wushuang took the Tarot Divine Sword and immediately felt that the connection between him and the Tarot Divine Sword was still there. However, there was an invisible barrier.","After a short while, Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu waved his hand and said, “Jian Wushuang, you can go.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and flew away without delay.","Only Supreme Master Gai Fu was left in the Supreme shrine, and it gradually became quiet.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu, who was sitting at the head of the table, let out a long sigh.","He raised his head, and his gaze seemed to penetrate the Divine Life Palace. He looked at the boundless starry sky and muttered to himself.","“Palace Master, is this old man’s impulsiveness right or wrong?”","Even he couldn’t help but feel a little lost about the upcoming storm in the Divine Life Palace.","...","Jian Wushuang flashed across the sky above the Divine Life Palace, causing a burst of exclamations.","“Senior Brother Jian Wushuang is back!”","“This is Senior Brother Jian Wushuang? His aura is so strong!”","Some of the disciples who had just entered the Divine Life Palace said with a strange look in their eyes.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang didn’t stop. He turned into an escape light and flew over their heads.","Soon, Jian Wushuang returned to his Manor in the sixth mountain range.","There was a small lake in the manor.","A tall and beautiful woman was standing by the lakeside of the manor. She threw some bait casually. After the bait was cast, it immediately caused thousands of koi fish to swim around like a red tide, which was quite spectacular and magnificent.","However, this beautiful woman’s brows were furrowed, and her expression did not change at all. She looked like she had a lot on her mind.","“Shuang ‘er, sorry to keep you waiting.”","Suddenly, a familiar deep voice rang in her ears.","In an instant, the beautiful woman’s right hand, which was throwing bait, froze. She turned around and ran toward the young man with a gentle smile on his face. She didn’t even care that the bait was scattered all over the ground.","“My husband, I...I’ve been waiting for you for so long.”","Pfft.","Leng Rushuang ran into Jian Wushuang’s arms and her eyes turned red.","After not seeing Jian Wushuang for tens of thousands of years, she had long missed him.","...","Especially when she heard from the disciples of the Divine Life Palace that Jian Wushuang had faked his death at Qiu Long’s hands and was being hunted down by a Supreme, her heart clenched even more.","She had wanted to leave the Divine Life Palace countless times to look for Jian Wushuang, but she knew that with her cultivation, even if she found Jian Wushuang, she would not be able to help him at all. She would only add to the chaos.","She had always been very sensible. Therefore, she could only suppress all the anxiety in her heart and wait for Jian Wushuang’s return every day and night, suffering alone.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang had finally returned.","“Shuang ‘er, don’t worry. I’m fine.”","Jian Wushuang held Leng Rushuang in his arms and gently patted her back with his right hand, comforting her in a warm voice.","“My husband, next time don’t leave me alone, okay? I’m so scared, scared that you’ll never come back, and I’ll never see you again.”","Leng Rushuang raised her head and said with tears in her eyes.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang sighed.","“Alright,” he said.","...","...","At the same time, in the extreme north of the universe, there was a huge star field that was covered by a Nebula of lightning and no light could be seen.","A black ray of light flew over from the distance at an extremely fast speed. Then, it suddenly stopped in front of this huge star field.","The black light shattered, revealing a dignified middle-aged man. He raised his head and looked at the huge star field that was filled with lightning and stars. He cupped his hands and said in a deep voice, “Hei Yu, I have come to pay my respects to the dragon clan. I have something important to discuss with you!”"]},{"number":4323,"title":"Chapter 4323 The Start of the War","paragraphs":["4323 The Start of the War","In the extreme north of the universe, this was a forbidden area of the entire universe.","For example, the Blood River, where the Dark Demon Descendant came from, was located in the northernmost area. It was desolate all year round and no one set foot in it. The water of the Blood River was enough to wipe out all existences below the Supreme level. Even if a Supreme came in person, they would not dare to step into the blood river rashly.","It was rumored that the river of blood contained a patriarch blood demon from thousands of chaos cycles ago, who was incredibly powerful. However, no one could say for sure if this rumor was true.","There were a total of nine forbidden places like the Blood River in the northernmost part of the universe. The huge Star Domain in front of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple was one of them.","This huge Galaxy was covered by the Nebula lightning all year round, and no light could be seen. It floated quietly in the starry sky like a gray cotton ball, exuding a heavy and dead aura.","However, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple knew that this place, known as the dead star area, was one of the nine great taboos. It was the entrance to one of the most powerful races in the universe, the Dragon race!","The Dragon Tribe rarely appeared, so very few people knew where the Dragon tribe’s habitat was. The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple happened to be one of those who knew.","The dragon clan had formed a world of its own. The only way to get there was through this dead star area.","The dead star area contained innate death Qi that was fatal to even Supremes. Without the dragon clan’s entry token or the dragon clan’s personal invitation, even a Supreme would be corroded by the chaotic innate death Qi and lose his life.","“I am Hei Yu, and I have come to pay my respects to the dragon clan. I have something important to discuss with you!”","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple said in a deep voice as he stepped into the void and stared at the dead-silent star area.","Even for him, he did not dare to be careless when facing the dragon clan, which had been one of the top clans since ancient times.","After a while.","Rumble!","The dead star area, which looked like a gray cloud, let out a violent muffled sound.","The next moment, a faint yellow light shot out from the dead star area, forcing back the endless Thunder Nebula and the chaotic innate death Qi, forming a passage that was wide enough for people to pass through.","“Hei Yu, our King has invited you.”","A deep, cold, and terrifying sound wave that didn’t seem human came from this dead star area.","“Thank you, Dragon King.”","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple smiled faintly. He took a step forward and appeared on the passage paved with yellow light. He walked into the dead-silent star area.","BOOM! BOOM!","A moment later, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple disappeared, and the faint yellow light dissipated as well. Gray nebulas and lightning continued to spread out, covering him.","...","Within the Divine Life Palace.","After Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu gave the order for all disciples to return from the Ancient Path of Stars, the atmosphere in the entire Divine Life Palace gradually became solemn and grim.","Everyone knew that the Divine Life Palace was about to be destroyed by a Great War.","At this moment, no one dared to relax. They all made the best use of their time and quickly began to comprehend and cultivate.","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang didn’t spend much time together before they went into seclusion.","Although Leng Rushuang was reluctant, she knew that the overall situation was more important. Only by constantly improving her strength could she catch up with Jian Wushuang.","In the blink of an eye, ten years had passed.","In a private room.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged with his eyes slightly closed, quietly sorting out his strength.","Now, he had completely stabilized his status as an Ultimate Ruler. Whether it was the strength of his divine power or the fusion of his nine laws, he had reached the peak of the Ultimate Ruler Realm.","However, the next step was the biggest problem.","Jian Wushuang knew that it was almost impossible for him to break through to the supremacy stage. The only way to improve his strength in a short time was to comprehend the divine power and increase its power.","“Perhaps, I should try to walk my own path.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. He opened his eyes and there was a flash of light in his eyes.","“Then, my Dao...what is it?”","“What is Dao?”","Jian Wushuang was deep in thought. ‘Dao’ was a very abstruse word. Throughout the ages, those who stood at the peak of the universe had all created their own Dao.","For example, the Tarot Swordmaster wielded the three-foot sword and was invincible in the art of swordplay.","As he pondered, Jian Wushuang felt as if he had vaguely grasped something. However, when he pondered carefully, it was like the moon in the water, he could not comprehend anything.","Time passed by slowly.","Just as Jian Wushuang was immersed in how to comprehend the ‘Dao’, the Blood Wave Supreme’s message suddenly rang in his mind.","Jian Wushuang, come to the Supreme shrine!","His tone was filled with urgency and solemness.","In an instant, a cold glint flashed across Jian Wushuang’s eyes. There could only be one reason why the Blood Wave Supreme had sent him a message.","The great battle against Jian Wushuang and the entire Divine Life Palace was about to begin!","“Yes.”","Jian Wushuang replied to the message, then stood up, pushed open the door of the wing room, and rushed toward the Supreme shrine.","After a while, Jian Wushuang arrived at the Supreme shrine.","In the Supreme shrine, Supreme Master Gai Fu sat at the head while Supreme Blood Wave, Supreme Giant Axe, Tian Ji, and Supreme White Tiger sat on the two sides. Under the five of them were a few Supremes that Jian Wushuang had never seen in the Divine Life Palace. They must have been traveling outside and had rushed back after receiving a message from the Divine Life Palace.","All the Supreme-beings present looked solemn. Jian Wushuang greeted them, but they only nodded slightly in response.","alright, with the exception of the Ninth Kalpa King and Supreme dufeng, who are still on the Ancient Path of Stars, everyone is here. Let me tell you the situation.","...","Supreme Master Gai Fu’s expression was a little serious, which was a rare sight. After sweeping his gaze across Jian Wushuang and the others, he slowly said, “I’ve just received news that the Great Void Temple, Great Sun Divine Kingdom, Blood Sky Hall...a total of five top forces have joined forces and sent a fleet to the Divine Life Palace. They will arrive at the gate of the Divine Life Palace in seven days.”","Other than Jian Wushuang, the other Supreme Masters were expressionless. They must have known about this long ago.","Jian Wushuang could not help but frown.","He had not expected that the first to attack him would not be Cosmos Temple, but the five major forces.","However, he didn’t say much. Everyone present was the main pillar of the Divine Life Palace, so they must have a way.","Supreme Master Gai Fu continued. “Everyone, this is the Divine Life Palace’s first battle. Therefore, we must display our might. Do you understand?”","“Yes!”","Everyone responded in agreement.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu nodded his head in satisfaction and said in a deep voice, “This battle is just their test. We must destroy the Alliance of the five Forces outside the Divine Palace!","“Three days later, everyone will follow this old man to destroy the Alliance Army!”","Bang!","...","An extremely sharp and cold light flashed across Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s eyes!"]},{"number":4324,"title":"Chapter 4324 The Arrival of the Allied Forces","paragraphs":["4324 The Arrival of the Allied Forces","In a star area far away from the Divine Life Palace.","Five cosmic battleships covered the void, emitting a cold light. The sails were made of flags with the names of the five Forces engraved on them. They kept passing through the starry sky at high speed.","They were domineering and high-profile to the extreme, pushing and crushing all the way, not making any evasive moves at all.","Some wandering cultivators or space pirates who were traveling in the universe saw the five space battleships and immediately dodged.","“Guys, look! That, that is the Great Void Temple’s warship!”","“Something’s wrong! Not only the Great Void Temple, but the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, the Blood Sky Hall, the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom, and the Starry Sky Sword Sect as well!”","“These, these five forces, where are they going?”","Along the way, the cosmos cultivators who saw this scene from afar were all shocked.","Regardless of whether it was the Great Void Temple, the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, or the Starry Sky Sword Sect, they were all top powers in the universe. They usually ruled over the universe and rarely ran amok in the universe in such a grand manner.","“Judging from the direction they’re heading, it’s the Divine Life Palace!”","In an instant, the news of the great Great Void Temple and the other five great factions joining forces to attack the Divine Life Palace spread rapidly.","The entire universe was in an uproar!","In an instant, the entire universe was in a state of turmoil. Countless people were excited. The universe had been peaceful for too long. It had been too long since they had seen a war between top powers.","“Let’s go! Let’s head to the Divine Life Palace!”","Countless people rushed toward the Divine Life Palace with the intention of watching a show.","At the same time, in the five cosmic warships, five Supreme-being powerhouses were standing on the deck of the warship in the middle and discussing in low voices.","“Do you think the Divine Life Palace will be pressured to hand over the Tarot Divine Sword if we join forces?”","A young man as gentle as Jade held a three-legged wine cup in his hand and gently sipped the wine inside.","He was dressed in a brocade robe and had a dignified appearance. He didn’t look like a Supreme Being of the universe, but more like an elegant young master.","However, his title in the universe did not match his appearance.","The bloody-handed butcher of the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom!","In the hundreds of chaos cycles since he had become a Ruler, he had destroyed more than a hundred planetary systems and killed billions of living beings. In the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom, he was a Supreme existence second only to the God-Emperor of Scarlet sun.","“Hmph, the Divine Life Palace seems powerful, but it’s actually being supported by Supreme Master Gai Fu alone. In that battle, their Palace Master disappeared and Gai Fu was seriously injured. If it weren’t for that Lord’s rescue, I’m afraid Gai Fu would have died long ago.”","Another old man wearing an eight-trigram Daoist robe and holding a horsetail whisk sneered.","It was reasonable to say that this kind of dressing should make him look like a sage, but this old man had triangular eyes, a camel’s nose, a pointed mouth, and monkey’s cheeks, which made people not like him at first glance.","However, he also had an extraordinary background. He was the Imperial advisor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, and his status in the divine Kingdom was second only to one person. Even the Young Emperor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, who had already passed away, had to address him as teacher respectfully when they met.","He glanced at the other four Supreme martial artists and continued, “The current Divine Life Palace is like a beautiful bubble that will burst with a single touch. I don’t believe that Supreme Gai Fu would dare to attack with all his might and ignore the Divine Life Palace’s overall situation.”","“Moreover, His Majesty sent me to attack the Divine Life Palace. Snatching the Tarot Divine Sword is secondary. The main purpose is to bring Jian Wushuang back to the divine Kingdom to receive divine punishment. I’ve already paid my respects to the young Emperor’s spirit in heaven.”","After he finished speaking, another middle-aged man with thick sword-like eyebrows said in a deep voice, “That’s right. I’m representing the sword sect in this crusade against the Divine Life Palace. I don’t really want to make an enemy of the Divine Life Palace. I just want to get the Tarot divine sword. I don’t think Supreme Master Gai Fu will go all out against us for the Tarot divine sword.”","The other two Supreme martial artists did not say anything, but their faces were extremely gloomy.","One of them was Jiu Kun, the Hall Master of the seventh Hall of the Great Void Temple. He was a bald elder with a skinny body.","The last person was one of the left and right guardians of Blood Sky Palace, right Guardian Nether King!","“Alright. We just have to wait quietly and see if the Divine Life Palace is tactful or not.”","The gentle-looking young man who spoke first raised his head and drank the sake in his hand. His fox-like eyes narrowed slightly, and a hint of murderous intent flashed across them.","Speaking of which, he had never killed a special life form before.","...","Time flew by.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The five space cruisers swept across the sky, setting off countless strong winds.","Under the combined power of the five great Supremes, the five top-grade cosmic battleships burst out with a speed that far exceeded the speed of light. In a short time, they had arrived at the edge of the Divine Life Palace. Even the palace gate of the Divine Life Palace, which was wrapped in layers of arrays, could be seen at a glance.","Bang! Bang!","The five battleships stopped, and the five great Supremes walked down from the battleships. They stepped into the starry sky and looked at each other, a cruel look flashing in their eyes.","In the next moment, they all shouted at the same time, “A special emissary from the great Great Void Temple has come to visit the Divine Life Palace!”","“A special emissary from the Great Sun Divine Kingdom has come to visit the Divine Life Palace!”","A special envoy from the Starry Sky Sword Sect is here to visit the Divine Life Palace!","...","A special emissary from the Blood Sky Palace is here to visit the Divine Life Palace!","Five deep sounds exploded outside the Divine Life Palace at the same time!","In an instant, the starry sky trembled!","Countless people who had come to watch the battle were excited when they saw this.","They knew that the battle between the top forces was about to begin with Jian Wushuang!","...","Divine Life Palace, Supreme divine Palace.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu sat at the head of the table, while the other Supreme martial artists stood below him.","...","Jian Wushuang, who was wearing a black robe and carrying the Tarot Divine Sword, was also there.","Hearing the explosion outside the divine Palace, everyone’s eyes flashed with a cold light.","“Everyone, let today’s battle be a Memorial to the Divine Life Palace’s undefeatable Foundation.”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu was expressionless as he slowly stood up from his seat.","In an instant, a terrifying aura that seemed to be able to crush the universe and shake the heavens and earth spread out with Supreme Being Gai Fu as the center.","It was as if a monster that had been sleeping for thousands of years was waking up.","“Yes!”","The Blood Wave Supreme, Jian Wushuang, and the others responded with no fear in their eyes.","They were not afraid of this battle.","Even the ordinary disciples of the Divine Life Palace outside the Supreme shrine were not afraid!","“It’s just a battle!”","...","“Let’s go,” he said.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu nodded his head and walked out of the Divine Life Palace step by step.","The Blood Wave Supreme, Supreme Giant Axe, and the other two lead Supreme Masters were slightly behind Supreme Master Gai Fu.","Behind them were the other ordinary Supremes of the Divine Life Palace.","The last one was Jian Wushuang!"]},{"number":4325,"title":"Chapter 4325 Hand Over Jian Wushuang!","paragraphs":["4325 Hand Over Jian Wushuang!","When Supreme Master Gai Fu led the five lead Supremes, Jian Wushuang, and more than ten ordinary Supremes out of the Divine Life Palace, many disciples of the Divine Life Palace were already waiting outside.","Their expressions were solemn as they stood up and cupped their hands at the same time.","“We’re waiting...I wish all of you great Supremes a triumphant return!”","Their voices gathered together and formed a huge sound wave that filled the sky. It shot into the clouds and shook the entire sky of the Divine Life Palace.","There was no cowardice in their expressions, only unparalleled determination.","When Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu saw this, a warm feeling flashed through his heart. These people would become the pillars of the Divine Life Palace in the future.","However, he did not show much expression on his face. He only nodded slightly in response.","Jian Wushuang, who was among the many Supreme Masters, also smiled.","Because of him, the Divine Life Palace had attracted a joint attack from all the forces in the universe. If it had been in an ordinary immortal inheritance sect, it would have been resented and blamed by the disciples of the same sect. However, in the Divine Life Palace, this scene did not happen.","Everyone supported Jian Wushuang and the many Supreme Masters who had blocked the storm for him.","This was all thanks to the Divine Life Palace’s system. Although it was silent, it was like a big family that gathered many special life forms wandering in the universe together. They supported each other and grew up together.","Among the disciples of the Divine Life Palace, Jian Wushuang even saw the demonic wind Ruler, who had a conflict with him at the riverbank of the Dao of comprehension.","After tens of thousands of years, the demonic wind Ruler had also broken through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm. At that moment, his edges had been smoothened. He looked at Jian Wushuang with unwavering support.","This is the Divine Life Palace that has been protecting me, and I’m willing to give up my life to protect it.","Jian Wushuang sighed.","They didn’t stay for long and walked toward the gate of the Divine Palace again.","Over there, the mountain that Supreme Yan Shan had transformed into condensed into a human face. With a solemn expression, he spoke, “Gai Fu, Blood Wave, I will guard the Divine Palace!”","Kacha! Kacha!","The next moment, the door of the Divine Life Palace opened.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu walked at the head of the group, with the rest of the people following behind him as they walked toward the starry sky.","There, five space cruisers were floating in the air, blocking the entrance of the Divine Palace.","The five Supreme martial artists stood with their hands behind their backs on the battleships of their respective forces. They sneered as they looked at Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu and the others who were walking toward them.","What a great formation. Almost all of the Supremes of the Divine Life Palace have come.","The Imperial advisor’s eyes narrowed as fear filled his face. He sneered.","As for the gentle-looking man, he swept his gaze across the faces of the Supreme martial artists, and a hint of greed flashed in his eyes.","He could sense that these Supremes had extremely strong life forces. If he could devour them, his cultivation base would definitely soar.","“Everyone, may I ask why you have come to my Divine Palace?”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s expression was cold as he spoke indifferently.","The five great Supremes looked at each other. To be honest, anyone would feel a little apprehensive in the face of so many Supremes, led by Supreme Master Gai Fu. If it were any other day, they would have already been fearful and respectfully addressed as ‘senior’.","However, it was different today. They were not only representing themselves, but also the five top forces behind them!","They were confident that under the combined pressure of the five great factions, even Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu would have to think twice.","The Imperial advisor’s beady eyes shifted slightly as he took a step forward.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu, you are our senior. We naturally wouldn’t dare to offend you in the Divine Palace. We’ve only come today for one thing.","“Then...that is to hand over Jian Wushuang and the Tarot Divine Sword!”","The Imperial advisor’s tone was respectful at the beginning, but his tone suddenly turned cold and filled with a chilling intent.","“Right! The Tarot sword is a universal treasure. How could it be in the hands of a mere Ruler?”","The middle-aged man from the Starry Sky Sword Sect stepped forward and stared at Jian Wushuang.","BOOM!","Two shocking sword essences shot out from the middle-aged man’s eyes. As if they had solidified, they formed a huge and sharp pressure that pressed down on Jian Wushuang.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang snorted coldly. He knew that the five great forces were going to attack the Divine Life Palace together and use him as a breakthrough point. The man from the Starry Sky Sword Sect wanted to give him a blow at the first opportunity.","The gaze seemed ordinary, but it was actually the origin of the middle-aged man’s sword principle. Once Jian Wushuang was pressed under him, it would inevitably leave a shadow in his sword heart.","However, in terms of sword principle comprehension, Jian Wushuang didn’t think that he would lose to anyone!","Bang!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward fearlessly and looked at the middle-aged man from the Starry Sky Sword Sect.","He immediately activated the fourth level of sword principle origin. Two sword essences shot out from Jian Wushuang’s eyes and collided with the gaze of the middle-aged man from the Starry Sky Sword Sect!","Bang!","Like a pin against an awn, the two lightning bolts that tore the night sky collided fiercely, creating a burst of sparks!","Jian Wushuang’s two sword essences were not at a disadvantage at all. On the contrary, there was a faint momentum of slaughtering a Dragon with the axe, which slightly suppressed the middle-aged man’s sword essence!","“You have guts, thief!”","The middle-aged man’s face was filled with shock and anger.","He had not expected that he, who was at the Supreme Divine Realm, would be suppressed by Jian Wushuang’s sword principle comprehension.","If he didn’t kill this kid this time, he would become a big problem in the future!","Just as he was about to lose his temper again, the gentle man from the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom raised his hand and gestured for him to be quiet. He then looked at Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu and said with a smile, “Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu, you’re our senior, and you’ve made great contributions to the war. We wouldn’t have come here if we had a choice.”","The Divine Lord of the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom has no other intentions in sending me to the Divine Life Palace. As long as you are willing to hand over “Jian Wushuang and the Tarot Divine Sword, I will leave. I can even make a promise to never invade the Divine Palace and make peace with you.”","...","At this point, he paused for a moment before continuing with a smile, “Of course, if senior Gai Fu is unwilling, there is naturally no one in this world who can force you. This junior does not have the ability to do so. However, as you know, my Divine Lord has always had a bad temper. He can’t tolerate any sand in his eyes. He will do what he says.","“At that time, I can’t say what the consequences will be!”","The tone of his words was gentle, but in reality, there were needles hidden in the cotton. It was filled with killing intent and threat.","When he said this, the Supreme-beings of the other four forces stroked their beards and smiled. It was obvious that they had the same intention.","When Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu heard this, he raised his eyelids slightly and looked at him with a faint smile.","“Qian Wu, are you threatening this old man?”"]},{"number":4326,"title":"Chapter 4326 Duel!","paragraphs":["4326 Duel!","“Threatening? Junior naturally wouldn’t dare.”","The gentle-looking young man called Qian Wu cupped his hands before raising his head. He looked straight at Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu and said, “This junior is merely stating the facts.”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu nodded his head and swept his gaze across the others. He then asked indifferently, “You guys have the same intention?”","“That’s right. If we have no choice, the Great Sun Divine Kingdom will never make an enemy of the Divine Palace!”","!!","The Imperial advisor flicked the horsetail whisk in his hand and said darkly.","The right protector of the Blood Sky Palace, the Dark King, who had not said a word since the beginning, said coldly, “Cut the crap. Gai Fu, I’m here on the orders of the Hall Master. I only want the Tarot Divine Sword and Jian Wushuang. Even if I pick up one of them, I’ll turn around and leave. I’ll forget about the past.”","The middle-aged man from the Starry Sky Sword Sect also said, “Supreme Master Gai Fu, I’m sure you know that our sect master, the Martial Sword Immortal, was one of the cultivation partners of the Tarot Swordmaster. Now that the Tarot Swordmaster has passed away, the Tarot Divine Sword naturally belongs to the Starry Sky Sword Sect!”","The soft and hard answers came one after another. In short, they were forcing Supreme Master Gai Fu to hand over Jian Wushuang and the Tarot Divine Sword!","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s lips suddenly curled into an inexplicable smile when he heard this. His turbid eyes narrowed as he said, “Do you think that I’ll hand over the Tarot Divine Sword and Jian Wushuang to protect the Divine Life Palace because I was seriously injured in the catastrophe?”","As soon as he said this, the faces of the Supreme-beings of the five major forces changed slightly. Just as Supreme Master Gai Fu had said, they had indeed planned to do this.","Although Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu was strong, he had long been seriously injured and was on the verge of death. He was just a Tiger without its teeth. It was precisely because of this consideration that they dared to join forces and suppress the Divine Life Palace!","“Do you think that after so many years of recuperating, I’ve long worn out my bloodlust and am unwilling to make an enemy of others?”","As soon as he finished speaking, a cold killing intent spread out from Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu.","In an instant, the five great masters’ expressions changed drastically!","Only now did they remember that Supreme Master Gai Fu, who was standing in front of them, had killed countless Supreme Divine Realm experts during the great catastrophe!","Instantly, they looked at each other, and a faint feeling of retreat rose in their hearts.","“Gai Fu, are you going to risk universal condemnation and start a war with our forces for a mere Jian Wushuang?”","Only the right protector of the Blood Sky Palace, the Dark King, asked coldly.","Hearing this, Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu sighed lightly and only spat out a single word, “Kill!”","Bang!","The moment he finished speaking, the four lead disciples standing behind him all laughed and rushed into the sky!","“During the great catastrophe, all of you hid from the world and only the Divine Life Palace fought in all directions. Now, you dare to threaten my Divine Palace?”","Supreme Heavenly Dipper sneered as a golden divine bow appeared in his hand.","In the next moment, Supreme Heavenly Dipper placed his fingers on the bowstring and pulled it back gently.","Whoosh!","A scarlet arrow covered in divine patterns automatically nocked itself onto the bowstring.","“Whoosh!!!”","Supreme Heavenly Dipper then released his fingers, and the Scarlet arrow shot out like a cannonball. It broke through the void and shot toward the Imperial advisor of the Great Sun Divine Kingdom!","“Damn it!”","The Imperial advisor was extremely shocked and angry. He had not expected that the Divine Life Palace, which had always sought peace, would be so violent and kill Jian Wushuang without any hesitation!","With a wave of his right hand, the horsetail whisk in his hand instantly emitted rays of immortal radiance, which met the Scarlet arrow that was shooting at him!","Bang!","An earth-shattering explosion was heard!","On the other side, Supreme Giant Axe’s divine body expanded instantly and turned into an ancient giant that was tens of thousands of feet tall. He held the sky-splitting divine axe and took a step forward. He crossed tens of thousands of miles and hacked down at the right Guardian of Blood Sky Palace, the Nether King!","“If you want to take Jian Wushuang away, you’ll have to ask my axe first!”","A sharp axe light with terrifying black and yellow Qi hacked at the Nether King’s Head!","The Nether King wasn’t afraid at all. He snorted coldly and flipped his right hand. A black iron chain appeared in his hand, and he gently threw it toward Supreme Giant Axe like a sun-swallowing Python.","As for The White Tiger Supreme martial artist, he leaped into the sky and roared arrogantly. Terrifying sound waves spread out in circles!","The sharp metal white Tiger under him opened its huge mouth, and countless red lightning gathered in its mouth, turning into a world-destroying storm. It blasted toward the Seventh Hall Master of the Great Void Temple, the skinny bald elder in a monk’s robe, Jiu Kun!","Supreme Jiu Kun’s face sank, and his eyes flickered. He didn’t dare to relax in the slightest. He pulled with his right hand, and the void beside him was torn apart.","Then, he stretched out his hand and grabbed a black demonic blade.","If a Buddha did not wield a saber, he would become a devil with a saber!","“Kill!”","A hoarse voice came out from his mouth. He took a step forward and turned into a black light, charging toward the White Tiger Ruler.","There were even more ordinary Supreme martial artists who flew out one after another, sealing off the void and cutting off their escape routes.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he looked at the middle-aged man from the Starry Sky Sword Sect.","although this person’s cultivation is stronger than mine, his comprehension of the way of the sword is almost the same as mine. I can use this person to test my limits if I don’t use the Tarot Divine Sword.","Jian Wushuang made up his mind. Then, he took a step forward and his black robe fluttered. Suddenly, he turned into a black Thunderbolt between heaven and earth. Step by step, he sped up and dashed toward the middle-aged man from the Starry Sky Sword Sect!","The Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand!","Speaking of which, a large part of the reason why he couldn’t defeat Black Eagle Ruler was because of the God slaying spear in his hands. Thus, he had no choice but to use the Tarot Divine Sword to kill Black Eagle Ruler.","As for the second Supreme martial artist, he didn’t give him a chance to fight in a roundabout way. He could only use the Tarot Divine Sword.","Therefore, until now, Jian Wushuang still did not know what his real strength was!","“Jian Wushuang dared to kill me?”","The middle-aged man from the Starry Sky Sword Sect couldn’t help but laugh in anger.","...","“Jian Wushuang, since you’re looking for death, don’t blame me for being impolite.”","The middle-aged man laughed coldly as a murderous look appeared in his eyes. A pure white divine sword appeared in his hand.","Jian Wushuang, go to hell!!","The middle-aged man took a heavy step forward and turned into a sharp white light, slashing toward Jian Wushuang!","The next moment!","The two, one black and one white, collided together!","An earth-shattering sword Qi exploded and swept across the starry sky!"]},{"number":4327,"title":"Chapter 4327 The Battle","paragraphs":["4327 The Battle","Clang!","In the universe, a black and a white figure holding a sword collided with each other at an extremely fast speed like a comet hitting the earth, stirring up endless Sword Qi!","The Wuqi Divine Sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand struck the snow-white divine sword in the middle-aged man’s hand, causing a long string of sparks.","“Eh? It didn’t shatter? Is it also a law-pinnacle true treasure?”","!!","The middle-aged man’s eyes narrowed slightly. The White Phoenix sword in his hand was a supreme law-attribute treasure that he had nurtured for dozens of chaos cycles. It was only a hair away from becoming a Ruler weapon, and very few weapons would be able to remain unscathed after clashing with it.","“Hmph, the sword is a good sword, but it’s a pity that the person can’t match it. It’s a waste.”","The middle-aged man snorted coldly but he did not care. He swung his right hand and endless supreme divine power gushed out to push Jian Wushuang away.","Hualala.","Jian Wushuang’s body retreated dozens of feet and his legs left two white marks in the starry sky.","“As expected of a Ruler. He really is strong.”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and gasped for breath. He thought to himself, “The greatest difference between ordinary Rulers and me is the quality of my divine power. The Ruler-level divine power that only Rulers possess far surpasses ordinary divine power. I imagine that’s what the Rulers rely on to dominate the universe.”","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he immediately shouted coldly, “Since the gap in quality can’t be crossed, then we’ll make up for it with quantity!”","Bang!","In an instant, an extremely majestic divine power gathered in Jian Wushuang’s hands.","After Jian Wushuang stabilized his Ultimate Ruler Realm, the strength of his divine power had suddenly increased to almost thirty thousand times!","“Again!”","Jian Wushuang’s Black hair fluttered in the wind. He took a step forward and charged at the middle-aged man again!","“Split open the sky!”","Bang!","The divine sword of weeping Wu trembled thousands of times in an instant, letting out a cry of the gods and the chanting of the Buddha. The sky-opening sword light immediately slashed out, slashing toward the middle-aged man like a frightened Dragon.","This strike was poignant to the extreme!","“Brat, you have guts!”","The middle-aged man was so angry that he laughed. He also stepped forward and stabbed Jian Wushuang with the White Phoenix divine sword in his hand!","Clang!","The divine swords in their hands crossed again. Before the middle-aged man could send Jian Wushuang flying, Jian Wushuang suddenly changed his move and shouted again, “Sundering stars!”","In an instant, a myriad of energy gathered in Jian Wushuang’s hand and turned into a shocking sword rainbow that was nearly 50000 feet long. Then, he struck again!","“This sword...it actually has a hint of the Dao?”","The middle-aged man squinted his eyes, and the two rays of light in his eyes intensified again.","This kid was only an Ultimate Ruler, but he had already comprehended the Dao. Each of his moves was filled with profoundness and vaguely aligned with the heavenly Dao. He also had an extremely high understanding of the laws of the universe.","“This kid’s talent is extremely rare. If we don’t get rid of him today, he will become the second Tarot Swordmaster!”","The middle-aged man’s eyes flashed with thoughts before he said in a deep voice, “Swordsmanship, Star River tornado!”","Bang!","As soon as he finished speaking, he lifted the White Phoenix divine sword in his hand and a bright star River rolled out from the void and crashed toward Jian Wushuang’s Silver sword rainbow!","This sword was like the heavens and earth overturning, and the Milky Way rolling back. Its power was terrifying to the extreme!","Countless sharp white sword Qi turned into a sun-swallowing Dragon, which swept across the ocean and rolled back toward the silver sword rainbow!","Just like a python eating, this bright star River directly wrapped around the 50000-foot silver sword rainbow.","Then, the Galaxy Sword aura suddenly exploded!","Kacha!","In an instant, the nearly 50000 Zhang Long silver sword rainbow was shattered!","“Is this the swordsmanship of the Starry Sky Sword Sect?”","Jian Wushuang looked up at the star River formed by sword Qi hanging high in the sky, and his eyes revealed a touch of amazement.","The Galaxy Sword sect was indeed a top force famous for its swordsmanship. No matter how one looked at it, it was close to perfection. He could not compare to it.","“Jian Wushuang, go to hell!”","Just at this moment, the middle-aged man jumped over and grinned.","Jian Wushuang, remember, the one who will kill you is the third elder of the Starry Sky Sword Sect, Fei Xian!","“This sword is called the White Nightmare!”","In almost an instant, the middle-aged man was still a hundred miles away in the first step. In the next step, he was already in front of Jian Wushuang. The White Phoenix divine sword in his hand turned into a white ray and led the brilliant star River that had broken the Sundering star sword rainbow to slash down on Jian Wushuang!","“Step forward and slash!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed slightly. Before the sharp sword Qi had even landed, it had already caused cracks to appear on the surface of his divine body.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang let go of the Wuqi Divine Sword and said in a low voice, “Eternal Night!”","In an instant, the divine sword of weeping Wu disappeared and a thick black mist gushed out from under Jian Wushuang’s feet and then eroded the middle-aged man.","Previously, Jian Wushuang had needed some time to prepare before using the Eternal Night sword principle. However, after he broke through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm and found his original intention of sword principle, he could use the Eternal Night sword almost instantly!","Buzzzzzz!","A muffled sound was heard. Then, the black fog, which was as sticky as ink, dragged the middle-aged man called the third Elder Fei Xian into the Eternal Night Kingdom, along with the rolling galaxy!","...","Elder Fei Xian had disappeared. In his place was a huge black ball that exuded a cold, dry, and stiff aura.","The next moment!","From within the black ball, the Furious roars of flying immortal elders could be heard.","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","Elder Fei Xian controlled the White Phoenix divine sword and charged around inside the black ball, causing the black ball to rumble!","Waves of sharp sword Qi burst out and spread everywhere!","Jian Wushuang fixed his eyes on the Eternal Night Kingdom. He had to admit that the power of a Supreme was beyond his imagination. After his Eternal Night Kingdom had reached the initial success stage, even the most powerful unparalleled Ruler would not have any chance of survival. However, the third elder of the fairy realm, who was just an ordinary Supreme, had destroyed the Eternal Night Kingdom in just a few breaths!","Break for this seat!!!","With Elder Fei Xian’s furious roar, the Eternal Night Kingdom could no longer hold on and began to peel off piece by piece!","Then, Elder Fei Xian, whose skin had dried up and half of his hair had fallen off, jumped out!","He panted heavily and stared at Jian Wushuang. His face was livid.","...","“Jian Wushuang! I recognize this move. It’s Supreme Tarot’s Eternal Night swordsmanship!”","“Speak! Is the Tarot Sword Manual also in your hands?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang didn’t show any panic on his face. He nodded and replied calmly, “Yes, the Tarot Sword Manual is indeed in my hands. But, so what?”"]},{"number":4328,"title":"Chapter 4328 Starry Sky Sword Art!","paragraphs":["4328 Starry Sky Sword Art!","Elder Fei Xian stared at Jian Wushuang. For some reason, he felt a sense of jealousy that he himself did not notice.","He was envious of Jian Wushuang’s talent. He was only at the Ultimate Ruler Realm, but he already had the power to fight with a Supreme!","He was envious of Jian Wushuang’s good fortune. He had actually obtained both the Tarot sword code and the Tarot Divine Sword at the same time. They were both universe treasures!","He was even more envious of Jian Wushuang for being protected by the Divine Life Palace and for Supreme Master Gai Fu, who had one foot in the grave, to become enemies with all the major forces in the universe for him!","!!","Elder Fei Xian took a deep breath and said coldly, “Jian Wushuang, you are not qualified to inherit the legacy of the Tarot Swordmaster.”","“The Tarot sword and the Tarot Sword Manual should not belong to you.”","“They should belong to the Starry Sky Sword Sect, to the flying immortal realm!!”","Bang!","The next moment, Elder Fei Xian clapped his right hand, and the White Phoenix divine sword immediately floated in front of him. His black hair fluttered in the wind as he said coldly, “Jian Wushuang, I admit that I’m inferior to you in terms of talent in sword principle. If you break through to the supremacy stage, I’ll definitely turn around and leave when I see you.”","“It’s a pity that if you don’t become a Ruler, you’ll still be an ant.”","Pipi pipi!","In an instant, Elder Fei Xian flicked his fingers in the void as if he was playing a lute. The White Phoenix divine sword immediately trembled violently.","Every time he flicked, the White Phoenix divine sword would split into an identical white jade flying sword. After flicking seven times, the White Phoenix divine sword had split into seven. Under Elder Fei Xian’s control, they were like seven flying rainbows that pierced through the sky, the earth, the sun, and the moon, and they slashed toward Jian Wushuang!","“Starry sky sword art, seven absolute great desolation slash!”","Buzzzzzz!","The distance of ten thousand feet was covered in a breath. In the blink of an eye, the seven white jade flying swords were like seven meteors, pressing in front of Jian Wushuang with extreme force!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang did not dare to be careless. Divine power gushed out of his body and he used the secret skill of dragon blood. Burning his divine power, he slashed at the seven white jade flying swords!","Bang!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s aura rose sharply and he hit one of the White jade flying swords hard, sending it flying.","“Again!”","Jian Wushuang shouted and his eyes were filled with fighting spirit.","With every strike of his sword, the sword Qi would surge and surge, turning the surroundings into a violent and angry sea that filled the world.","Seeing this, Elder Fei Xian sneered. There seemed to be invisible threads controlling the seven white jade flying swords on the fingertips of his five fingers. Under the change of his fingers, the attack of the seven white jade flying swords suddenly changed. They no longer attacked in a big way, but instead became tricky and sinister.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang found it extremely difficult to deal with it.","“Close.”","Taking advantage of the gap, Elder Fei Xian closed his five fingers and the seven white jade flying swords immediately combined into one. They turned back into the White Phoenix divine sword and stabbed Jian Wushuang’s chest.","Pfft!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang was sent flying backward. His divine body collapsed in the void and then regenerated continuously.","Jian Wushuang retreated in defeat with one stroke!","In the distance, some of the Supreme-beings of the Divine Life Palace who were in charge of sealing off the retreat path saw this and couldn’t help but shake their heads slightly. although Jian Wushuang is strong, compared to Elder Fei Xian, who is a top sword principle expert in the universe, he is still a little too young. There is already a gap in the quality of his divine power. It is not wise to fight head-on.","Just as they were hesitating whether to help Jian Wushuang...","Jian Wushuang, who had been flying backward, suddenly stopped.","Immediately.","A golden light suddenly appeared!","“Swordsmanship, dawn!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang disappeared and there was only a golden line left between heaven and earth. It was like a divine lightning that tore the endless night sky apart. It shot toward Elder Fei Xian with an indomitable force!","Thunder rumbled and lightning flashed!","The void was torn apart, and countless void fragments burst out.","Jian Wushuang’s entire body was covered in a golden light as he charged toward the sun, moon and stars!","this is the second move of the Tarot Sword Manual, Daybreak!!","Elder Fei Xian’s expression changed drastically when he saw this, and a sense of fear crept up his back.","For the first time, when he was facing Jian Wushuang, he felt a Great Terror of life and death!","“Dawnbreak is a sword-type divine ability that can only be used by Rulers! How did this kid know?”","His face was filled with fear, but he gritted his teeth and his eyes flashed with determination.","He had to use his trump card!","Otherwise, he would be the third Supreme to die at Jian Wushuang’s hands!","Immediately after, Elder Fei Xian’s eyes lit up, and his pupils suddenly turned into two small swords. He slowly said, “I use my sword to raise the Galaxy. The Galaxy should see me!”","“Starry swordsmanship, one sword of stars!”","BOOM!","In an instant, the stars in the sky shone brightly!","Countless forces from the depths of the stars suddenly shot up into the sky. Like meteors, they turned into bright Starlight and surged toward Elder Fei Xian!","This sword moved all the stars in the sky!","The power of countless stars shot over and converged continuously. They were so dense that they covered the sky and gathered in the hands of Elder Fei Xian.","At this moment, Elder Fei Xian’s divine body suddenly became transparent and bright. He, who was being held up by the stars, seemed to have fallen into the center of a vortex and become the master of the stars!","...","“Slash!”","Elder Fei Xian let out a loud roar, and his expression became somewhat distorted.","In an instant, a sword light condensed by the power of countless stars slashed down from Elder Fei Xian’s hand. The void was torn apart by this sword light and turned into a chaotic ocean. Countless sword Qi rolled up like a furious Dragon sweeping the sky. In the world, they formed a long pillar of sword Qi that supported the sky and the earth. It roared majestically and turned the clouds and mist within a radius of nearly 10000 miles into dust!","Bang!","In the next moment, there was a world-destroying sound as the sword hit the golden light that Jian Wushuang had turned into!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body shook violently and the Golden daybreak sword light around him was continuously reduced.","In the end, Jian Wushuang’s daybreak sword was broken and he was sent flying again!","“Jian Wushuang, die in peace.”","Elder Fei Xian lowered his eyes and continued to attack Jian Wushuang while being condensed by the Starlight.","Jian Wushuang stared at Elder Fei Xian with an extremely gloomy expression.","Just a little more!","...","As long as he was a little stronger, Elder Fei Xian would not be his match. He would not need to rely on the power of the Tarot Divine Sword and could truly kill a Ruler!","It was a pity that he was still a little short!","Just as Jian Wushuang was considering whether to remove the Supreme seal on the Tarot Divine Sword and kill Elder Fei Xian or escape...","A white-haired cold figure suddenly swept over from the horizon. With a speed that far exceeded Elder Fei Xian’s, he stood in front of Jian Wushuang.","The next moment, the white-haired figure slowly raised his hand and grabbed at Elder Fei Xian’s sword light."]},{"number":4329,"title":"Chapter 4329 The Nine-Tribulation King Has Arrived!","paragraphs":["4329 The Nine-Tribulation King Has Arrived!","Bang!","The destructive sword radiance that used Starlight as a sword slashed at the palm of the white-haired figure in an instant.","Then, a shocking scene happened!","The power of this strike was boundless, and it was indescribably terrifying. After it struck the white-haired figure’s jade-like palm, it was like a child brandishing a sword and striking the majestic Mount Tai. Sparks kept flying, but it couldn’t even cause a scratch on the palm.","!!","The white-haired figure refused to back down!","Then, a low and cold voice came out of the figure’s mouth.","“Are you doing embroidery? Who can this soft sword kill?”","Bang!","In the next moment, the white-haired figure closed his fingers, and the starry sword light was broken into pieces, making cracking sounds!","Immediately, countless stars shattered and the power was obliterated. The Starlight sword turned into powder!","As for Elder Fei Xian, when the white-haired cold figure appeared, the ferocity on his face was replaced by fear!","It was only to see him draw in a cold breath and say in disbelief, “Ninth, Ninth Kalpa King!!!”","A person’s reputation was like a tree’s shadow. Whether it was before or after the Supreme level, the reputation of the Ninth Kalpa King had been earned by his punches and kicks. His battle strength was truly heaven-defying!","While Jian Wushuang was creating a new legend in the universe, the Ninth Kalpa King was also continuing his legend on the Ancient Path of Stars.","If it was not for Jian Wushuang, the Ninth Kalpa King would have been the most influential person in the universe during this period of time!","“Ninth Kalpa King, shouldn’t you be on the Ancient Path of Stars now?”","Elder Fei Xian looked at the Ninth Kalpa King closely and said while trembling.","The Ninth Kalpa King was expressionless and said indifferently, “You’re called Fei Xian, right? An exalted Ruler bullying an Ultimate Ruler? What sort of ability was that? If you have the ability, then fight with me.”","“No! Ninth Kalpa King, let me explain...”","Without waiting for him to finish, the Ninth Kalpa King took a step forward and crossed thousands of miles. He raised his right palm and slapped it down on Elder Fei Xian’s head.","As soon as the palm was struck.","The heavens and earth were instantly overturned. The sun and moon hung upside down, and chaos reappeared. The entire space was destroyed, turning into the center of a storm. Countless spatial fragments swept up like a violent wind, surging and beating in all directions!","“Ninth Kalpa King, you’ve gone too far!”","Elder Fei Xian’s face sank when he saw this. As he retreated, he slashed out several stellar sword Qi in succession, intending to kill and block the Ninth Kalpa King!","“Ant.”","The Ninth Kalpa King said indifferently. He actually withstood the stellar sword Qi and rushed to the front of Elder Fei Xian. His white jade-like palm pressed down fiercely and hit the White Phoenix divine sword!","Bang!","There was a loud explosion!","The divine sword, which had the power of a Supreme treasure of laws, seemed to be unable to withstand the palm of the Ninth Kalpa King. It let out a wail and flew out of Elder Fei Xian’s hand. Elder Fei Xian’s face turned pale. Like a shooting star, he fell from a million miles in the sky and smashed into a star. The huge impact even shattered the star into pieces!","With just one palm, Elder Fei Xian was defeated!","After the slap, the Ninth Kalpa King no longer cared about it. The divine body of the fairy elder who had been hit by him was already on the verge of collapse. Naturally, the ordinary Supremes of the Divine Life Palace would deal with him.","He slowly turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang. His cold expression gradually melted and a smile appeared on his face.","“Jian Wushuang, long time no see.”","Jian Wushuang looked at the Ninth Kalpa King and sighed in his heart. This guy was still as strong as ever.","“It’s been a long time.”","Jian Wushuang smiled at him.","One of them was dressed in black and had black hair. He looked cold and handsome with clear eyes. The other was dressed in a robe whiter than snow. His white hair hung down casually, like an immortal who was untainted by the mortal world. His eyes were deep.","Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King were both at the perfect life level. They both came from the Divine Life Palace and had their own legendary epics. They were both recognized as peerless heaven’s favorites in this universe and era!","Everything on the battlefield paled in comparison to the two figures.","Jian Wushuang, you were able to force a Supreme Divine Realm expert to such a state with your own strength as a Ruler. I was not as good as you back then.","The Ninth Kalpa King smiled faintly, and then walked over from the other side of the starry sky with his hands behind his back.","“Now that I think about it, I’m looking forward to seeing what you’ll be like after you break through to the Supreme-being level.”","“At that time, I will definitely compare myself with you again.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled but did not answer. Instead, he changed the topic and asked, “Ninth Kalpa King, when did you come out of the Ancient Path of Stars?”","The Ninth Kalpa King narrowed his eyes, and a mischievous glint flashed in his eyes. He made a rare joke and said, “You, Jian Wushuang, got the invitation to the myriad Clan Gathering on the Ancient Path of Stars. Do you think I can’t get it and am worse than you?”","With that, he flipped his right hand and a white jade pendant appeared in his hand.","The White jade looked similar to the one that Jian Wushuang had gotten from Lady Blue, but there was a layer of golden thread on the edge of the White jade.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang said helplessly, “Ninth Kalpa King, why do you like to compete with me so much?”","The Ninth Kalpa King grunted and did not speak.","Speaking of which, he, the Ninth Kalpa King, had always been proud and aloof. He never liked to talk much to others. However, for some reason, in front of Jian Wushuang, he would always unconsciously reveal his childish nature.","Passing by Jian Wushuang, Ninth Kalpa King looked up at Supreme Master Gai Fu, cupped his hands, and said, “Lord Gaia.”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu, who was sitting high up in the sky, nodded his head upon hearing this. His expression, which had always been indifferent, also slightly nodded at this moment. He smiled faintly and said, “It’s good that you’ve returned safely.”","The following battle no longer had much to do with Jian Wushuang. After a few minutes, the five great masters who had come together were killed by Blood Wave, Giant Axe, and the other lead seats.","They were never people who hesitated in killing. Once they decided to make a move, they would directly use thunderous means to eliminate the roots!","...","After a while, only ruins were left in the cold and dark Universe. The five Supreme Masters were all dead. The star area around the Divine Life Palace was shattered into countless meteorites, floating in the starry sky. Only the five cosmic warships remained there, announcing the defeat of the five great forces.","“Back to the palace.”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu said in a low voice.","“Yes!”","Supreme Blood Wave and the others, whose bodies were stained with divine blood, responded respectfully.","Then, everyone returned to the palace. The disciples of the Divine Life Palace would deal with the rest.","After returning to the Divine Life Palace, Jian Wushuang saw Leng Rushuang waiting for him at the gate from a distance. Her beautiful eyes were full of worry.","Seeing that Jian Wushuang had returned safely, her tightly knitted brows slowly relaxed."]},{"number":4330,"title":"Chapter 4330 Declaration of War!","paragraphs":["4330 Declaration of War!","Jian Wushuang strode in and rubbed Leng Rushuang’s hair. He smiled and said, “Silly girl, just stay in the manor. Why are you waiting for me here?”","Leng Rushuang remained silent. Seeing that Jian Wushuang was fine, she smiled brightly.","“Alright, let’s go back.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and then chatted with the Blood Wave Master and the others. After making sure that there was nothing else to do, he returned to the manor in the sixth mountain range with Leng Rushuang.","!!","The Divine Life Palace fell into a brief silence.","However, it was only quiet for a few days before the news of the battle at the entrance of the Divine Life Palace spread!","In an instant, the entire universe was in an uproar!","Countless people were shocked. They couldn’t believe what the Divine Life Palace had done.","“This...this is crazy! The Divine Life Palace, which has always been peaceful, has made such a big move this time and killed the emissaries sent by five great forces!”","“It’s amazing when it’s not famous! Who would dare to look down on the Divine Life Palace now?”","“Tsk, tsk, tsk. Supreme Master Gai Fu is indeed worthy of being a survivor of the ancient catastrophe. He has such great courage to fight against five top forces in a row!”","At this moment, countless people’s perception of the Divine Life Palace had completely changed. In their previous knowledge, the Divine Life Palace was a hermit who didn’t care about worldly affairs and didn’t fight for anything. However, it was not until this great battle that they suddenly realized how terrifying the Divine Life Palace could be when it was angry!","Countless people were praising him, but some people were secretly discussing in a low voice.","Humph, the Divine Life Palace is acting on impulse. They are really seeking death.","“That’s right. It doesn’t matter if the Divine Life Palace only offends one force. Even if they offend two forces, the Divine Life Palace can take them on at the same time! However, the Divine Life Palace has directly offended the five Forces, so they’re doomed!”","“Hmph, don’t forget that the Great Void Temple still has their nemesis, the Cosmos Temple. If we count carefully, there are more than Five Forces.”","“I think Supreme Master Gai Fu was just muddleheaded for a moment. How could he have made such a stupid decision? for the sake of Jian Wushuang, he didn’t care about the big picture at all. In my opinion, the Divine Life Palace will be destroyed by Supreme Master Gai Fu sooner or later!”","“Although Jian Wushuang is talented, he is not irreplaceable. For example, the Ninth Kalpa King, who has become a Supreme, is no worse than Jian Wushuang in my opinion. There is no need to put the Divine Life Palace in such a precarious situation for Jian Wushuang.”","“If I were Supreme Master Gai Fu, I’d hand over Jian Wushuang and the Tarot Divine Sword first. Then, after the Ninth Kalpa King and the others have completely grown up, I’ll slowly plan to settle the new and old grudges together.”","All of a sudden, there were many discussions and rumors about the Divine Life Palace.","However, before the storm ended, the Divine Life Palace once again dropped a shocking bomb in the universe.","“The Divine Life Palace declares war on the Great Void Temple!”","“The Divine Life Palace declares war on the Great Sun Divine Kingdom!”","“I, the Divine Life Palace, declare war on the Blood Sky Palace!”","“The Divine Life Palace declares war on the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom!”","“The Divine Life Palace declares war on the Starry Sky Sword Sect!”","“If other forces want to make an enemy of the Divine Life Palace, the Divine Life Palace will also accompany them to the end!”","On this day, Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s voice turned into a rolling sound wave that spread to the Nine Heavens and ten lands, shaking the entire universe.","This time, all the races were shocked!","The Divine Life Palace was going to fight five people at once!","In an instant, the entire universe went crazy!","...","Within the Great Void Temple.","Supreme Bing Ye’s expression was ashen to the extreme. He couldn’t contain his anger and it rushed to the top of his head, causing his entire body to tremble.","He had sent Jiu Kun, the Hall Master of the seventh Hall, as an envoy to the Divine Life Palace to put pressure on the palace of life and hand over the Tarot Divine Sword and Jian Wushuang. However, he had never thought of having a life-and-death battle with the Divine Life Palace.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have only sent Jiu Kun, the Hall Master of the seventh Hall, but would have sent an Army to suppress the border.","But he didn’t expect that the Divine Life Palace would kill Jiu Kun without any mercy.","This was no different from a slap to his face!","“Good, good, good. You’re declaring war on the Great Void Temple, right? Your Divine Life Palace isn’t afraid, but why would my Great Void Temple be?”","A cold glint flickered in Supreme Bing Ye’s eyes as he said in a cold voice,","“Men! Reply on my behalf. I accept the challenge from the Divine Life Palace!”","...","At the same time.","In the Great Sun Divine Kingdom in the depths of the universe, the King of Day, who had created countless legends, had also sent out a letter of challenge to the Divine Life Palace!","Soon after, the top force of the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom, which was built in the endless desert, and the elusive Blood Sky Hall, all accepted the challenge!","All of a sudden, except for the Starry Sky Sword Sect, the other four great forces all issued formal letters of challenge to the Divine Life Palace, tearing all decorum.","In an instant, the universe was in turmoil, and the wind and clouds surged.","In the depths of the stars, in a Palace that hung high above the Nine Heavens, it was quiet.","This Palace had a peculiar design. It was as if it was constructed from a divine sword. It was narrow and sharp as it quietly floated in the air.","The words ‘Starry Sky Sword Sect’ were engraved on the palace’s plaque. The handwriting was sharp, like a silver hook and an iron painting. It was formed by Dragons and phoenixes swimming in the air. Just by looking at it, one would feel a sharp sword Qi coming toward them. They didn’t dare to look at it directly.","This was where the sword Master of the Starry Sky Sword Sect, Martial Sword Immortal, was.","The Martial Sword Immortal was a legendary figure in the entire universe. When he was young, he was chased out of the Starry Sky Sword Sect and had been wandering outside. Later, he met the Tarot Swordmaster and his sword cultivation improved by leaps and bounds. Finally, he returned like a king and unified the Starry Sky Sword Sect. He became the strongest Sword Master in the history of the Starry Sky Sword Sect!","The legend of the Martial Sword Immortal could not be finished in three days and three nights. However, what made people talk about it with great relish and sigh was that the Martial Sword Immortal was the only female sword immortal who dominated the world!","At this moment, in the main hall of the Starry Sky Sword Sect.","...","A cold and beautiful woman in red armor was sitting on a throne. Her black hair was tied up, and two strands of black hair hung down from her forehead.","Her eyes were cold, and there was no change in her expression. Between her brows, there was a faint red mark.","This person was the number one sword Master in the world, the Martial Sword Immortal!","She was sitting on a red sandalwood chair, and eight Supreme-being elders were standing respectfully below her.","“Sect master, are we going to ignore the Divine Life Palace’s provocation?”","An old man with white hair and a white beard said as he stepped forward.","“That’s right. The other four top forces have all sent out letters of challenge, officially declaring war on the Divine Life Palace. Sect leader, if the Starry Sky Sword Sect doesn’t respond, won’t we become the laughing stock of the entire universe?”","“Lord sect master, at this moment, you can’t be soft-hearted!”","Another thin man in black clothes and a bamboo hat said in a gloomy voice.","Although the other elders did not say anything, the determined expressions on their faces indicated that they had the same thoughts as the black-robed man.","The Martial Sword Immortal’s expression was as calm as water. His gaze slowly swept across the eight elders’ faces before he finally said, “I’ve made up my mind. I won’t fight with the Divine Life Palace. Don’t waste your breath!”","...","With that said, the Martial Sword Immortal stood up and walked out of the hall."]},{"number":4331,"title":"Chapter 4331 The Birth of the Dragon Clan!","paragraphs":["4331 The Birth of the Dragon Clan!","After the Martial Sword Immortal left, many people in the main hall of the Starry Sky Sword Sect started discussing.","“Benevolence doesn’t have power. Although Lord sect master is powerful, he is still too benevolent and not decisive enough.”","“That’s right. A woman in charge is like this. After all, she lacks a man’s spirit.”","“Sigh, the Divine Life Palace has openly provoked us, but we didn’t say a word. Wouldn’t we be the laughing stock of the entire universe?”","!!","The elders whispered to each other, shaking their heads and sighing.","In the crowd, only the thin man with thin lips and wearing a bamboo hat and black clothes remained silent. He raised his head and looked at Martial Sword Immortal’s back with a cold smile.","...","In the Starry Sky Sword Sect, in the sect master’s bedroom.","The Martial Sword Immortal sat on a long bench with her eyes closed. Sword attendant Qing Chan stood behind her and gently massaged her temples.","“Sect master, is there something troubling you?”","The sword servant Qing Chan said in a low voice.","Hearing this, the Martial Sword Immortal opened his eyes. A hint of fatigue flashed through his eyes as he said, “Qing Chan, you and I are not strangers. What do you think Elder Nine Toad’s constant opposition to our sect’s lead singer means?”","The sword servant Qing Chan thought for a while, and a hint of hesitation flashed across her face. Finally, she gritted her teeth and said, “Sect Leader, in my opinion, Elder Nine Toad can’t bear to see you as the female leader and wants to force the palace to usurp the throne!”","After she finished speaking, she saw that Martial Sword Immortal didn’t say anything, so she continued, “Sect leader! I’ll be so bold as to say this, but you may not know this, but Elder Nine Toad has been criticizing you in the sect recently. Many disciples in the sect have been criticizing you and are waiting for you to show your strength in the battle against the Divine Life Palace to regain your reputation.”","Martial Sword Immortal pinched his glabella and waved his hand, “Alright, I understand. You may leave.”","“Sect leader! The best time for you to increase your reputation is now in the battle with the Divine Life Palace...”","The sword maidservant Qing Chan wanted to continue, but Martial Sword Immortal put down his hand and looked at her expressionlessly. He said, “Didn’t you hear what I said?”","Seeing this, the sword servant Qing Chan felt a chill in her heart. She knew that she had crossed the line, so she quickly lowered her head and said respectfully, “Then please have a good rest, sect master. I’ll take my leave first.”","After saying that, the sword servant Qing Chan left.","After she left, the bedchamber suddenly fell silent.","The Martial Sword Immortal stood up from the bench and walked in front of the window. With his hands behind his back, he looked into the distant starry sky with a complicated look in his eyes.","How could she not understand what the people in the hall had said today, as well as what the sword servant Qing Chan had just said?","However, she did not care about a mere nine Toad.","“Tarot, since Jian Wushuang obtained the Tarot Divine Sword and the Tarot Sword Manual, he can be considered as half of your inheritor...think...you must really approve of him, right?”","The Martial Sword Immortal muttered.","...","Within the Divine Life Palace.","As the Divine Life Palace declared war on the five superpowers, the universe was in a state of turmoil. However, the Divine Life Palace was unusually calm.","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang didn’t spend much time together before they started another round of closed-door cultivation.","Jian Wushuang knew that this was only the beginning. Only by becoming stronger could he have the power to protect himself in the face of the violent storm style.","“Dao...what is it?”","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and looked at his palm. There, the lines were densely gathered together like a mountain range. They stretched and overlapped one another until they finally gathered into a complete palm pattern.","“Everyone’s palm prints are different, so the Dao that everyone comprehends is different.”","“The Dao can not be asked, can not be heard, can not be pursued, and can not be sought. Even when I consulted the Ruler Blood Wave, he was unable to give me an explanation. I can only rely on myself to comprehend it.”","“The Dao can only be created by one’s own self.”","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. He knew that once he truly comprehended the ‘Dao’, it would be his opportunity to break through to the Supreme Divine Realm!","After a long while, Jian Wushuang sighed. If he wanted to comprehend Dao, it was useless to stay in the Divine Life Palace. Only by going out to see the mountains and seas, watching the rising and falling of the tides, experiencing the cold state of the world and the hundreds of ways of the world could he have the chance to truly comprehend Dao.","“It seems...it’s time to go out for a walk.”","...","At the same time, in the extreme north of the universe, in the dead silent star field, one of the nine great taboos.","Chi!","A faint yellow light suddenly pierced through the endless Nebula and spread out from the inside, forming a long and dark Universe channel.","Then, they saw a terrifying looking Space Battleship slowly leaving the dead star area.","The shape of this cosmic warship was terrifying to the extreme. It was actually made up of ferocious dragon bones, and it looked like a Bone Dragon as it swept across the starry sky.","A ship...two ships...three ships...","Nine Bone Dragon battleships sailed out of the dead star area!","They stood side by side, and the aura they emitted swept across the Nine Heavens and ten lands. Instantly, countless Yuan devouring beasts that were wandering in the void within a radius of a million miles trembled and prostrated themselves as if they had seen their King and ancestors. They let out low cries to show their submission.","At this moment, on the deck of the middle of the nine skeletal dragon warships, the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple, Hei Yu, was standing side by side with an evil-looking young Man in Black armor.","The devilish-looking young man’s eyes were a faint golden color, and there were two round, forked deer horns on both sides of his head.","His cultivation was much lower than that of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple, but the pressure he exuded was no weaker than that of the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple!","If Jian Wushuang was here, he would have recognized the devilish young man as the law enforcer of the dragon clan, Long Jiu, who he had met once on the Ancient Path of Stars!","“Long Jiu, the Divine Life Palace is now surrounded by enemies. It’s the best time for us to attack. We can take advantage of this opportunity to take the Divine Life Palace by surprise.”","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple looked sideways at the law enforcer of the dragon clan, Long Jiu, and said with a smile.","Long Jiu’s face was expressionless when he heard that, and he said coldly, ” “Why do we need to take them by surprise when we do things?”","...","After that, Long Jiu waved his hand.","“Let’s go to the Divine Life Palace!”","Rumble!","In an instant, the Nine Dragonbone warships slowly left the northernmost area.","On this day, a voice that sounded like an imperial edict exploded in the entire universe!","“Xuan!","Jian Wushuang of the Divine Life Palace had wantonly killed members of the dragon clan. He should atone for his sins with his death!","The Divine Life Palace, as a sect, had failed to teach the dragon clan well and had made a mistake. They were given three days to hand over Jian Wushuang’s head, admit their mistake to the whole universe, and apologize to the dragon clan!","“Otherwise, the Dragon Tribe will come to the Divine Life Palace in person in 15 days as a warning to others!”","This voice came from the extreme north of the universe, one of the nine forbidden areas, the dead silent star area, and then exploded in the starry sky of the entire universe!","The entire universe turned pale with fright!","...","A Dragon that had not been born for hundreds of chaos cycles had finally emerged!"]},{"number":4332,"title":"Chapter 4332 I Am Willing to Die For Jian Wushuang!","paragraphs":["4332 I Am Willing to Die For Jian Wushuang!","The Birth of the Dragon Clan!","This piece of news was like a bomb being thrown into a calm lake. The entire universe suddenly boiled over and set off thousands of waves!","The Dragon race was one of the most powerful races in the entire universe!","It was said that at the birth of the universe, when the world was still in chaos, countless primordial essence accompanied and depended on each other. One primordial essence was particularly domineering. After swallowing countless primordial essence, it actually developed intelligence and shaped its physical body.","!!","This was the first Dragon in the world, also known as the ancestor Dragon!","The ancestral Dragon was the leader of all Dragons. The current dragon clan was the descendant of the ancestral Dragon.","If the ancestral Dragon hadn’t fallen in that catastrophe, the Dragon Tribe would still be the Masters of the Universe. Of course, even though the ancestral Dragon had fallen, the second and third generations of the Dragon Tribe still existed, and their strength couldn’t be underestimated. Their Foundation was far beyond some top forces.","The Divine Life Palace of the dragon clan was unable to withstand it.","...","...","At the same time.","Divine Life Palace, Supreme Divine Palace.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu sat at the head of the table, his face expressionless.","The other Supreme martial artists stood in a line below him, their expressions extremely ugly.","They had not expected that the dragon clan would appear when they were declaring war on the five Forces. Their target was Jian Wushuang!","The atmosphere had become unprecedentedly heavy.","The words ‘dragon clan’ were like a huge mountain, pressing down on everyone’s hearts. It was so heavy that they could not breathe.","“Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu, we’re not afraid of the five great powers and can fight them. However, with the addition of the dragon clan, what should we do?” The White Tiger Ruler said in a deep voice.","Even though he had always been hot-tempered, at this moment, the fighting spirit in his eyes had completely disappeared.","No one knew just how powerful the dragons, who had been living in seclusion for nearly a thousand chaos cycles and had been recuperating, had become.","Just the power displayed by the dragon clan during the battle of the catastrophe that year was far beyond what the Divine Life Palace could resist.","“That’s right, Lord Gai Fu. Once the Dragon Tribe comes, what can our Divine Life Palace do to resist them?”","Another ordinary Supreme martial artist with a long face said. His voice was filled with anxiety.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu didn’t say anything. He only lowered his eyes, and no one could tell what he was feeling from his turbid eyes.","Lord Gai Fu, the Dragon Tribe has appeared and is visiting the Divine Palace. If we are not careful in dealing with them, they will bring disaster to the Divine Life Palace!","The long-faced Supreme martial artist stepped forward and continued.","Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang, who was standing at the end of the temple, and sighed.","“Lord Gai Fu, Jian Wushuang’s life is a life, but the lives of the other disciples of the Divine Palace are also lives! Are you going to risk the lives of the thousands of Divine Palaces of life just for Jian Wushuang?”","Although he didn’t clearly state what he meant by overpowering a Supreme martial artist, which of the people present was a fool? How could he not understand the meaning behind the long-faced Supreme martial artist’s words?","To put it bluntly, there were only two paths in front of the Divine Life Palace.","Or, as the dragon clan had said, they could kill Jian Wushuang, hand over his head, and then make a public apology to the universe.","Or, they would put up a stubborn resistance for Jian Wushuang!","When the other Supreme martial artists heard this, they all fell silent and lowered their heads without a word.","Even though they had always doted on Jian Wushuang, the Blood Wave Supreme, and the Supreme Giant Axe, they opened their mouths to say something but swallowed their words when they were about to speak.","It was true that they doted on Jian Wushuang, but they were also the first seats of the Divine Life Palace. They carried the entire Divine Life Palace on their shoulders!","Jian Wushuang stood at the end of the divine Hall and looked at the silent crowd. He had already made a decision.","Everything that had happened today was caused by him alone, so he would bear the consequences alone!","He, Jian Wushuang, had never been a person who was afraid of death and needed others to sacrifice their lives to protect him!","The Divine Life Palace had already done enough for him. He could not drag the Divine Life Palace into a state of eternal damnation because of him.","Supreme Master Gai Fu, Supreme Master Qing gang is right. Hand me over. I’m willing to exchange my life for the Divine Life Palace’s safety.","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and looked up at Supreme Master Gai Fu.","Wuah.","Everyone turned around and looked at Jian Wushuang. They found that Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm and his eyes were clear. He did not have the slightest intention of pretending.","Upon seeing this, the long-faced Supreme Master, who was called Qinghan, cupped his hands at Jian Wushuang and sighed, “Jian Wushuang, don’t hate me. What I said just now was out of helplessness.”","Jian Wushuang smiled at him and nodded, indicating that he understood.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu slowly raised his head and swept his gaze across the faces of the people from the divine Hall.","Even his state of mind, which had not changed for 10000 years, was slightly disturbed at this moment.","“Jian Wushuang.”","He said indifferently.","“Here!”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands together. He knew that the time that would determine his life and death had come.","“Are you really willing to sacrifice yourself to protect the Divine Life Palace?”","Supreme Master Gai Fu raised his eyes and looked at Jian Wushuang.","“Yes!”","...","Jian Wushuang replied with a firm nod.","Upon seeing this, everyone understood that Supreme Master Gai Fu had already made up his mind to sacrifice Jian Wushuang.","For some reason, when everyone heaved a sigh of relief, they felt an inexplicable suffocation in their hearts.","Jian Wushuang, who had been personally executed by the elders of his own sect, must have felt terrible, right?","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu nodded his head. Just as he was about to speak, Supreme Blood Wave gritted his teeth, as if he had made a decision. He took the lead and said,","“Supreme Ruler Gai Fu! I brought Jian Wushuang here personally and I promised him that I would protect him for the rest of his life! I’m sorry, but I can’t watch him die!”","After taking a deep breath, the Blood Wave Supreme continued, “Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu, this Lord’s talent has already reached its limit. I’m afraid that this is the most I can do in my entire life. There’s basically no possibility of a breakthrough!”","“However, Jian Wushuang is the most talented expert since the birth of the Divine Life Palace. As long as he is here and given time to grow, I believe that he will definitely be able to push the Divine Life Palace to an unprecedented glory!”","“Therefore, I am willing to die for Jian Wushuang!”","As soon as he said this, all the Supreme-beings present were moved.","They had not expected that the Blood Wave Master would value Jian Wushuang so much!","...","Only Supreme Giant Axe knew that the Blood Wave Supreme had no descendants in his life and had never accepted any disciples. He had long regarded Jian Wushuang as his nephew.","“The Ruler Blood Wave!”","Jian Wushuang was touched and his nose couldn’t help but turn sour.","What did Jian Wushuang do to make a top Supreme-being willing to die for him?","At this moment, Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu suddenly spoke, “When did I say that I wanted Jian Wushuang to die?”","Hearing this, everyone couldn’t help but look at each other in confusion.","This...what did he mean?"]},{"number":4333,"title":"Chapter 4333 Meeting Again","paragraphs":["4333 Meeting Again","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu looked at everyone’s puzzled eyes and slowly said, “Ever since the palace Master of the Divine Life Palace was established, our disciples can die in battle, but when has there ever been a need to execute our own disciples in order to protect the Divine Palace?","“If we execute Jian Wushuang today, should we encounter such a thing again in the future, are we going to execute other disciples to please other forces and protect the Divine Palace?”","As soon as he said this, everyone was stunned.","“Lord Gai Fu, you’re right. If it wasn’t for the fact that we had no other choice, who would want to see Jian Wushuang die?”","!!","Ruler Clear Reed raised her head and looked at Ruler Gai Fu.","At the same time, he sighed in his heart. Since none of them wanted to be the bad guy, then he would be the bad guy!","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu glanced at him and said, “When did I say that there’s no way?”","After saying that, Supreme Master Gai Fu turned to look at Jian Wushuang and said in a deep voice, “Jian Wushuang, listen up. From today on, you are no longer a disciple of the Divine Life Palace!”","“I strip you of your status as a disciple of the Divine Life Palace. You are to leave the Divine Life Palace by today! Don’t stay!”","“You, do you understand?”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s last sentence was spoken with a bit of power, and it was like the sound of a yellow bell ringing, deafening the deaf!","Everyone was shocked by his words!","“Supreme Ruler Gai Fu, I...”","Jian Wushuang was stunned and was about to speak.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s face darkened as he berated, “Don’t you understand what I’m saying? From now on, you are no longer a disciple of the Divine Life Palace. Leave now!”","Looking at Supreme Master Gai Fu’s cold expression, Jian Wushuang’s heart trembled and a warm feeling welled up in his heart.","He wasn’t a fool. He knew what Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu meant.","However, would the dragon clan really let the Divine Life Palace go so easily if he left?","“Get out!”","Supreme Master Gai Fu flicked his sleeve and a gentle but powerful force blasted out, sending Jian Wushuang flying out of the Supreme shrine.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang fell hard on the ground outside the Supreme shrine. He struggled to stand up and looked at the Supreme shrine. He clenched his fists so tightly that his nails dug into his flesh.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, turned around, and headed toward the sixth mountain range.","...","Within the Ruler temple.","After Jian Wushuang left, the hall became silent.","No one said anything, except for the Ruler Blood Wave, who was smiling in his heart.","It’s good to leave, good to leave...","“Supreme Master Gai Fu, Jian Wushuang has left...then what should we do?”","Supreme Clear Reed took a deep breath and said in a deep voice.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s originally stern expression had already eased up. He glanced at Supreme martial artist clear Reed indifferently and said calmly,","Qinghan, it seems like you’ve lost your courage after so many years of rest. That’s why you’re so scared when you hear the word ‘dragon clan’.","“Supreme Ruler Gai Fu, I...”","Upon hearing this, Supreme Clear Reed’s expression changed slightly. Just as he was about to speak, he saw Supreme Gai Fu wave his hand.","“Alright, you don’t have to say anymore.”","“The dragon clan is strong, but so what? Now that Jian Wushuang is no longer a disciple of the Divine Life Palace and he has been expelled, if the dragon clan wants to find trouble with him, they can go to the universe to find him. What does it have to do with the Divine Life Palace?”","“Besides...”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s gaze swept across everyone’s faces, and the corners of his mouth curled up slightly.","A sharp intent surged up on that old, mottled face.","“When the palace Master disappeared back then, did you really think that the palace Master didn’t have a few tricks up his sleeve?”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone present was shocked.","Everyone stopped talking.","...","In the manor where Jian Wushuang was in the sixth mountain range.","Jian Wushuang stepped into the room with heavy steps.","“Husband, are you alright?”","Leng Rushuang seemed to have heard the news as well. Seeing Jian Wushuang walk in, she stood up and asked anxiously.","“I’m fine,” she said.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, took a deep breath and said, “Shuang ‘er, pack up your things. We’re leaving this place.”","“Alright,” he said.","Leng Rushuang did not ask why he was in a hurry to leave. She had always been like this. As long as Jian Wushuang had made a decision, she would not ask or say much.","After a while, Jian Wushuang put Leng Rushuang into The Investiture of the Gods and was ready to leave.","Jian Wushuang turned around and took a look at the gate of the Divine Life Palace.","In the Divine Life Palace, many disciples looked at him with complicated expressions. Their emotions were difficult to understand.","...","“I will definitely come back, definitely!”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and a flash of determination appeared in them!","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave, a flowing light suddenly shot toward him.","As the light fell, the figure of the Ruler Blood Wave was revealed.","He was here to send them off.","“Ruler Blood Wave, in the Great Hall today...”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at him.","Without waiting for Jian Wushuang to finish, the Blood Wave Master waved his hand and said with a smile, “There’s no need for all this between us.”","After a pause, the Blood Wave Supreme continued, “Jian Wushuang, I’m afraid the road ahead will be dangerous. You must be extremely careful. It’s best to change your appearance and keep a low profile.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “I understand.”","The Ruler Blood Wave grunted in acknowledgment and took out a Scarlet Jade token with a flip of his right hand. “Jian Wushuang, this Jade token contains the power of my three attacks. Keep it carefully. If...if you really encounter a life-and-death crisis, the power of three strikes in this Jade token should be able to save your life.”","...","Jian Wushuang was not a pretentious person. He accepted the Jade token and nodded at the Blood Wave Supreme.","There was no need to say any words of gratitude. They were all in his heart.","The Ruler Blood Wave smiled and continued, “You must take care of yourself. By the way, Supreme Master Gai Fu asked me to pass you a message. No matter what, you, Jian Wushuang, will always be a disciple of the Divine Life Palace!”","After a pause, the Blood Wave Supreme laughed. the Ninth Kalpa King also asked me to tell you not to die. He’s waiting for you at the Great Clan Gathering. He also wants to try what it’s like to slay a Dragon.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was touched and filled with pride.","“Don’t worry, Ruler Blood Wave. I won’t die!”","“Good! We’ll meet again in the future.”","The Blood Wave Supreme patted Jian Wushuang’s shoulder and bade him farewell.","“I’ll be leaving then. You take care, Supreme Blood Wave.”","Jian Wushuang strode away. He took Leng Rushuang with him and turned into a stream of flowing light, shooting toward the vast starry sky far away.","Today, he would leave without asking about the time limit or the way back.","He would once again face the sea of stars alone.","In the distance, the Divine Life Palace had already turned into a small black dot, which was thousands of miles away.","Jian Wushuang turned his head and looked deeply at the Divine Life Palace and the Blood Wave Supreme. Then, he spoke in a voice that only he could hear.","“We meet again.”"]},{"number":4334,"title":"Chapter 4334 Five Elements Star Domain","paragraphs":["4334 Five Elements Star Domain","In the vast starry sky, a universe boat was leaving the central region at high speed.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in the universe. Through the black light mirror, he watched the bustling universe boat turn into a deserted one.","Jian Wushuang no longer used universe boat. He had obtained universe boat from an interspatial ring after killing someone on the Ancient Path of Stars. It looked simple and didn’t move very fast.","“Shuang ‘er, the five elements Star Domain is up ahead. Let’s take a break there.”","!!","Jian Wushuang said in a deep voice.","Leng Rushuang, who was sitting opposite him, nodded and replied, “Alright,” he said.","Among the thousands of star areas in the universe, the five elements star area was just an ordinary star area. The strongest person in this star area was only the ultimate Ruler.","During his escape, Jian Wushuang had chosen the least eye-catching star areas, like the five elements star area.","A few hours later, a light blue Star sea appeared in front of Jian Wushuang. It was the five elements Star Domain.","“We’re here.”","Jian Wushuang stopped universe boat and with a wave of his hand, his appearance changed.","A full beard grew on his originally handsome and cold face. His eyes became deeper and his face became a little squarish. Although his facial features did not change much, no one would be able to recognize this rough-looking bearded man as Jian Wushuang.","This was not the end.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and his originally thin figure also became tall and big.","At first glance, there was no trace of Jian Wushuang. He was clearly a universe Ronin who had traveled the universe for many years and had been through many hardships.","“Husband, with your current appearance, even I can’t recognize you.”","Leng Rushuang glanced at Jian Wushuang and covered her mouth as she giggled.","Jian Wushuang rolled his eyes at Leng Rushuang and said, “This journey will be extremely dangerous. Naturally, I have to cover up.”","Leng Rushuang chuckled and waved her right hand. Her appearance changed as well.","Her originally beautiful face had a few more fine lines. The purple tasseled dress she was wearing had also turned into a red dress. Her chin was sharp and her nose was straight. At first glance, she looked less cold and elegant, but more like a valiant woman.","The two of them looked like a couple wandering the universe.","Jian Wushuang nodded in satisfaction. He waved his right hand and put universe boat away. He stretched his neck and walked towards the five elements star system with Leng Rushuang.","The largest city in the five elements Star Domain was named Five Elements City. It was named after the Five Elements Divine Sect, the most powerful force in the five elements Star Domain. Under it were four great clans, who were in charge of the Five Elements City.","Jian Wushuang put the Wuqi Divine Sword back into his Qian Kun ring. After the Tarot Divine Sword was sealed by Supreme Gai Fu, the sealing effect was stronger than the God-sealing vine. It did not reveal any aura at all. For safety reasons, Jian Wushuang covered the body of the Tarot Divine Sword with a layer of rust. At this moment, no one could tell that this rusty iron sword with an ordinary aura was the Tarot Divine Sword that had caused a bloody storm in the universe recently.","Jian Wushuang wore a wide black robe and hid the Tarot Divine Sword under it. He walked into the Five Elements City with Leng Rushuang.","The guards of the Five Elements City were two cultivators who had just entered the first stage of the Ruler realm. When they saw Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang walking over, they crossed their long halberds and asked expressionlessly, “Both of you, all newcomers to the Five Elements City need to register their identity information. May I know your names and your cultivation levels?”","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang looked at each other and then replied, “Sword doesn’t abandon, second stage great Ruler.”","“Ling Ruqing, first-stage chief Ruler.”","After the two of them finished speaking, they suppressed their cultivation to the second and first stage Rulers and released their auras.","The two soldiers nodded. After sensing Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang’s auras, they registered their names and let them pass without any trouble.","Now that Jian Wushuang was wandering the universe again, he naturally couldn’t use his original name. He even stopped using blood Sword and swordsman, which he had used before, for safety reasons.","As his wife, Leng Rushuang also used an alias to avoid being found out.","The Five Elements City was quite lively. After all, it was not too far away from the bustling area of the universe. The streets in the city were packed with people. Jian Wushuang released his divine power silently. In an instant, his divine power, which was tens of thousands of times stronger than an ordinary ultimate Ruler’s, turned into divine consciousness and spread out in all directions, covering the entire five elements Star Domain.","He could sense that the strongest experts in the five elements Star Domain were only a few peak ultimate Rulers. Most of them were first to fifth stage Rulers, just like the cultivation base he had revealed.","Jian Wushuang withdrew his divine power and lowered his head. He pulled the hood of his black robe to cover half of his face, leaving only his chin exposed. Then, he walked into a restaurant.","After leaving the Divine Life Palace, Jian Wushuang didn’t know where to go. He only knew that he wanted to see the myriad of sceneries in the world, to see the joy, anger, sorrow, joy, love, and hatred of the people.","The great Dao was simple.","Perhaps, when he truly understood this universe, he would comprehend the great Dao and break through to the Supreme level!","After entering the restaurant, they saw that it was filled with people from various star fields. They sat together and talked about the recent major events in the universe.","Jian Wushuang sat next to the window with Leng Rushuang. He asked for a pot of spiritual wine and sipped it.","“Did you guys hear? The dragon clan’s warship is almost at the Divine Life Palace!”","“What? It’s only been a few days, how can the Dragon race be so fast?”","“Hmph, how can the dragon clan be judged by ordinary people? I wonder how the Divine Life Palace will treat this.”","“My guess is that the Divine Life Palace still refuses to hand over Jian Wushuang. I’m afraid they’re in trouble!”","“In my opinion, Jian Wushuang is a jinx. The Divine Life Palace has stood for tens of thousands of chaos cycles and has not fallen. In the end, because of Jian Wushuang, it has made enemies on all sides and offended the dragon clan. This has caused such a disaster!”","“Well said! What number one genius in the universe? If the Supremes of the Divine Life Palace didn’t protect Jian Wushuang, he would have been dead!”","“Hahaha, that’s a good idea! Jian Wushuang is only relying on the Tarot Divine Sword to show off his strength. His actual fighting power is probably not as high as mine. If I had the Tarot Divine Sword, I would definitely be a million times stronger than Jian Wushuang!”","The sound of discussion rose one after another. Everyone in the restaurant was discussing the appearance of the dragon clan and Jian Wushuang.","Almost everyone was gloating when they talked about Jian Wushuang.","The human heart was like this. They could only see others being worse than themselves, and could not bear to see others being better than themselves.","He didn’t like to offer help in times of need and only liked to hit people when they were down."]},{"number":4335,"title":"Chapter 4335 I’ll Only Give You One Chance","paragraphs":["4335 I’ll Only Give You One Chance","Leng Rushuang could not bear to hear her husband being insulted like this. A cold look flashed in her eyes. Just as she was about to say something, Jian Wushuang reached out and patted the back of her hand.","“It’s fine,” Jian Wushuang put down his wine cup and shook his head.","“Husband, but they said that about you...” Leng Rushuang frowned.","Before she could finish, Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “There are thousands of rumors in the world, why should we care about them? Just do your best.”","!!","“Alright, let’s rest for a while and then leave.”","Leng Rushuang thought for a while and then smiled. She replied, “I’ll do everything according to my husband.”","A moment later, just as Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang were about to leave, an evil-looking young man dressed like a rich family’s young master walked into the restaurant. He was wearing a brocade robe and holding a folding fan.","He first looked at the full restaurant and frowned slightly. Then he turned his eyes and saw Leng Rushuang and Jian Wushuang sitting by the window. His eyes suddenly lit up and a smile appeared on his face. He slowly walked toward the two.","“The two of you, the seats here are all full. You don’t mind if we squeeze in for a seat together, right?”","The devilish-looking young man opened his fan and waved it as he smiled.","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang frowned and said, “You can sit here, we’ll leave now.”","Then, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang were about to leave.","The two of them had left the Divine Life Palace to avoid the pursuit of the dragon clan. They did not want to cause any trouble.","“Hold on.”","At this moment, the devilish young man grabbed Leng Rushuang’s wrist and said with a smile, “The two of you look unfamiliar. You must have just arrived in the five elements Galaxy, right? I don’t think the two of you know much about the five elements Star Domain, so let’s sit down and have a chat.”","After he finished speaking, he seemed to have forgotten something. He smacked his head and said, “That’s right. I almost forgot to introduce myself. My master is the chief elder of the Five Elements Divine Sect, the Twin River Ruler. He is also my father.”","As he said this, he opened the folding fan in his hand and fanned it in front of his chest. He was really elegant and graceful, like a Jade tree in the wind.","However, he did not notice that Leng Rushuang’s expression had turned extremely cold when he grabbed his wrist. She said coldly, “Let go!”","As soon as he finished speaking, it was as if a cold wind had blown past. The temperature of the entire restaurant dropped by dozens of degrees. The devilish young man’s body stiffened and he subconsciously let go of his hand.","Leng Rushuang stepped back to Jian Wushuang’s side. At this moment, the smile on Jian Wushuang’s face had completely disappeared, and a murderous intent flashed in his eyes.","He had planned to keep a low profile this time, but it didn’t mean that he wouldn’t be moved even if his beloved wife was bullied by others!","As for the devilish young man, he gradually recovered after a moment of daze.","As if he realized that he had been frightened by the woman’s words and lost face, he suddenly slammed the table and sneered, “You two, don’t refuse a toast only to drink a forfeit!”","PA.","He clapped his hands, and in a split second, seven or eight fifth stage Rulers filed in. They first glared at Jian Wushuang and the other man with an unfriendly look, then cupped their hands at the devilish young man and said, “Young master.”","Hearing this, the devilish young man closed his folding fan and squinted his eyes, “Surround them!”","“Yes!”","Hualala.","In an instant, the group of fifth-stage Rulers spread out and surrounded Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang, blocking their escape.","Seeing this, the surrounding customers’ pupils shrank. They looked at Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang with sympathy and shook their heads, “Alas, these two have offended the biggest rich second generation in the five elements Galaxy. I’m afraid they are in trouble today.”","“In the five elements Star Domain, the Five Elements Divine Sect is the most powerful sect. This man is the only son of the Five Elements Divine Sect’s Grand Elder. He has always been pampered and has done a lot of ridiculous things in the Five Elements City. These two people have provoked him. They are in big trouble!”","“That’s right. It would be fine if the cultivation of these two were strong. But they’re just a first stage and second stage Ruler. I’m afraid they can’t escape from the demonic palm of this second generation.”","Everyone shook their heads and sighed.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. He looked at the devilish young man and said calmly, “I’ll only give you one chance. Now, move aside.”","When the devilish young man heard this, he was not afraid at all. Instead, a look of interest appeared on his face as he replied, “Only one chance? I’ll only give you one chance. If you get out of the five elements Star Domain and leave your Dao companion here, I’ll let bygones be bygones. Otherwise...”","Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang had already pointed at the space between his eyebrows.","“You have no chance.”","The surrounding fifth stage Rulers did not care at all. In their eyes, Jian Wushuang was merely a second stage Ruler while the devilish young man had the cultivation of a fourth stage Ruler. Jian Wushuang was merely a second stage Ruler. They were simply asking to be humiliated.","However, the devilish-looking young man’s playful smile froze!","At this moment, he seemed to have seen the destruction of the world, and his eyes were filled with horror as if he had seen a ghost!","An indescribable horror was coming at him!","He had never felt such terror from his father, the Twin River Rulers. Not even the Five Elements Divine Sect’s Lord could compare!","He wanted to speak, but it was as if an invisible hand had grabbed his throat. His face was red, but he could not say a word.","The next moment!","Jian Wushuang’s fingertip stopped between his eyebrows at a distance of three inches!","However, an even more terrifying scene appeared. Without any sound, the devilish young man turned into the most hollow of nothingness from head to toe!","In less than half a breath’s time, the evil-looking young man’s body and soul had been destroyed!","In an instant, everyone in the restaurant had their mouths wide open. They were dumbfounded and fell into a deathly silence.","The few fifth stage Rulers stared at Jian Wushuang in shock and were speechless.","After a long time, a fifth stage Ruler pointed at Jian Wushuang with a trembling hand and said in disbelief, “You...you killed the only son of great Elder Shuanghe?!”","“You’re dead!”","Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang, who were the center of everyone’s attention, remained calm as if they had just done something insignificant.","A message was quickly sent to the Five Elements Divine Sect in the center of the Five Elements City.","...","...","At the same time.","In the depths of the universe, outside the Divine Life Palace.","A ship...two ships...three ships...","A total of Nine Dragon Tribe warships sailed slowly toward the Divine Life Palace.","In the end, the nine ferocious-looking warships of the dragon clan, which emitted a terrifying pressure, quietly hovered in front of the entrance of the Divine Life Palace!","A huge and majestic pressure pressed down on the starry sky. It was like a raging wave that slapped in all directions, crushing the void in the surrounding ten thousand miles and setting off countless spatial storms.","The dragon clan was here!"]},{"number":4336,"title":"Chapter 4336 The Battle","paragraphs":["4336 The Battle","When the Dragon tribe’s Army arrived outside the Divine Life Palace, the entire universe was in an uproar. They did not want to miss this earth-shattering battle and rushed to the Divine Life Palace to watch it.","Everyone looked at the Nine Bone Dragon battleships from a distance and felt a chill in their hearts. They were all intimidated by the natural pressure of the dragon clan.","Especially on the bone dragon warship, the black muzzle formed by the mouth of the Dragon head was even more terrifying.","“So this is the dragon clan!”","!!","“The dragon clan is really generous! Each of these nine spaceships has the power of a Supreme-being’s attack. In terms of grade, they’ve already reached the limit of a universe law true treasure. Moreover, because they’re spaceships, their value far exceeds that of other universe law true treasures. It’s impossible to estimate!”","“What generation of dragon clan members do you think will come this time?”","“It’s hard to say, but my guess is that we’ll have to send out the fourth generation of the dragon clan to face the Divine Life Palace, right?”","In the Divine Life Palace, countless cultivators who had come from all directions were discussing this.","They knew that if the Divine Life Palace was not handled well today, it would be destroyed!","The Nine Dragon Clan’s battleships floated quietly outside the Divine Life Palace. They were not in a hurry to make a move, as if they were giving the Divine Life Palace one last chance.","...","The Divine Life Palace, within the Ruler temple.","All the Supreme martial artists in the hall stood solemnly.","“Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu, the Dragon race is here.”","Supreme Blood Wave said softly, standing at the side of Supreme Gai Fu.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu sat at the head of the table with his eyes slightly closed. The fingers of his right hand were gently rubbing the armrest of his chair.","Hearing this, he slowly opened his eyes. His old and turbid eyes were gray and dull, and no emotion could be seen.","“Let’s go and welcome the dragon clan.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he stood up and walked out of the Divine Life Palace.","The other four lead Supreme martial artists, as well as the Ninth Kalpa King and the other Supreme martial artists, followed behind without saying a word.","No one had any confidence in what had happened today.","In fact, they were already prepared to die in battle!","Weng.","With a soft sound, Supreme Master Gai Fu and a dozen other figures appeared in the void outside the Divine Life Palace.","Immediately, the crowd was in an uproar.","“They’re here, they’re here! The people from the Divine Life Palace are here!”","“The show is about to start!”","“Look, Jian Wushuang isn’t here!”","Discussions were heard, but Supreme Master Gai Fu did not care. He did not even care about the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple and the law enforcer of the dragon clan, Long Jiu, who were standing on the deck. Instead, he looked straight at the dragon clan warship in the middle and said indifferently, “We’re sorry that we didn’t come out to welcome you, honored guest.”","The Dragon tribe’s warship in the middle Fell into silence. Then, a low and hoarse voice that sounded like iron and stone came from the middle cosmic warship.","“Gai Fu, where is Jian Wushuang?”","This voice clearly didn’t use any power, but it resounded in everyone’s heart.","Upon hearing this voice, the pupils of the four lead Supreme martial artists behind Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu constricted.","Anyone who had experienced the great catastrophe could not be more familiar with this voice!","He did not expect that the dragon clan would actually send him out this time!","At the thought of this, the hearts of all the Supreme-beings present sank.","Supreme Master Gai Fu replied indifferently, “Long Ye, it’s not that the Divine Life Palace is unwilling to hand over Jian Wushuang. It’s just that Jian Wushuang escaped from the Divine Life Palace when we weren’t paying attention. Now, the Divine Life Palace is also looking for him.”","“He escaped?”","Before the voice could speak, the law-enforcement officer of the dragon clan, Long Jiu, squinted his eyes and sneered, “The Divine Life Palace has so many Supremes. Can’t you take care of Jian Wushuang? He escaped? It’s fine if you use this kind of nonsense to deceive children, but you’re using it to deceive our dragon clan?”","“Gai Fu, let me tell you. If the Divine Life Palace can’t hand over Jian Wushuang today, then be prepared to let the entire Divine Life Palace be buried with Jian Wushuang!”","After he finished speaking, he stood with his hands behind his back and his chest puffed out. He was extremely domineering and proud.","Although he only had the cultivation of an ordinary Supreme martial artist, he was not afraid at all when facing Gai Fu!","“Little guy, are you threatening this old man?”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s turbid eyes flashed with a sharp light as he spoke indifferently.","When the law-enforcement officer Long Jiu heard this, the sneer on his face became even more obvious. He actually asked fearlessly, “So what if I’m threatening you?”","Bang!","Without waiting for him to finish speaking, Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu sighed softly and stretched out his hand to point at Long Jiu.","“If your ancestors came to me and said that, I would let it go. But you, a mere fifth-generation Dragon, dare to threaten me?”","In an instant, countless Dharma forms appeared and a giant finger tore through the void. This giant finger was hundreds of thousands of feet tall and instantly covered the entire starry sky. The planet that was millions of miles in size was as small as a speck of dust in front of this finger!","There were no words that could be used to describe the terrifying power of this finger. It was a majestic power that exceeded everyone’s imagination!","How dare you?!!","When the law-enforcement officer, Long Jiu, saw this, he suddenly felt as if he had fallen into an ice cellar and was extremely shocked!","Under this finger, he felt that he was no longer a high and mighty dragon who looked down on the universe. Instead, he felt like an ant that could be crushed at any time, looking up at the sky!","He had not expected that Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu would dare to attack him even after the Dragon tribe’s Army had arrived!","...","At this moment, the hoarse and old voice that came from the middle spaceship continued to speak.","“That’s enough.”","The next moment!","A seven-clawed Dragon arm covered in Black Dragon scales emerged from the dragon clan warship and grabbed at Supreme Being Gai Fu’s sky-reaching finger.","The seven-clawed Dragon arm was full of scars from blades, axes, and swords. They were so deep that the bones could be seen. It was hard to imagine what kind of battle the owner of the seven-clawed Dragon arm had gone through!","This grab was also extremely terrifying. It shattered the surrounding void and created countless black holes and vortexes wherever it passed. Vortexes formed on this grab, and each vortex was actually a cosmic storm!","In an instant, the finger and the claw stole away all the dazzling light in the world. Whether it was the Nine Dragon Tribe warships or Supreme Blood Wave and the others behind Supreme Fu, they all seemed to have dimmed.","In everyone’s eyes, everything had disappeared, leaving only this finger and this claw!","“Gai Fu, during the battle of the catastrophe, you and I were allies. However, rules are rules. Jian Wushuang killed a member of the dragon clan. He has to pay for it with his life.”","“A life for a life. The actions of my dragon clan can not be considered excessive.”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu raised his eyelids slightly upon hearing this and replied expressionlessly, “I’ve said that Jian Wushuang is no longer a disciple of the Divine Life Palace. If you want to find him, you can do it yourself.”","...","Bang!","In the next moment, the seven-clawed Dragon arm and Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s giant finger collided fiercely!","In an instant, the universe began to shake violently!","A world-shaking battle had begun."]},{"number":4337,"title":"Chapter 4337 Five-Element Chaotic Qi","paragraphs":["4337 Five-Element Chaotic Qi","Five Elements City, five elements Starfield.","After killing the devilish young man, Jian Wushuang didn’t pay much attention to him. He left the restaurant with Leng Rushuang and planned to leave.","The few fifth stage Rulers originally wanted to stop him, but after Jian Wushuang glanced at them, their hair stood on end and beads of sweat appeared on their foreheads. They could only let Jian Wushuang leave in embarrassment, leaving behind countless discussions.","“Who is this person? As a second stage great Ruler, he was able to insta-kill a fourth stage great Ruler like Wind Sending Ruler with a single finger?”","!!","I don’t know, but when I passed by the city gates earlier, I think I heard this person introduce himself. His name is something like sword never abandoned.","“Sword never abandoned? I’ve never heard of him before. He’s probably from another star field.”","“No matter what, this person is in big trouble! The great elder of the Five Elements Divine Sect has always doted on him. Once he finds out that he was killed by this man, he will definitely fight him to the death!”","“That’s right. First elder is a peak Ultimate Ruler who has been in the Ultimate Ruler Realm for many years. No matter how strong Jian Buqi is, he’s only a second-stage great Ruler. He’s definitely not first elder’s match!”","In the restaurant, many customers looked at Jian Wushuang’s back and shook their heads as they discussed.","On the Imperial Road, just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave the five elements Star Domain, he suddenly stopped as if he had sensed something.","“Has it started?”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked in the direction of the Divine Life Palace. His expression was complicated.","If he could, he would have loved to stay in the Divine Life Palace and fight alongside the Ruler Blood Wave and the others.","However, he knew that he couldn’t do that. Otherwise, he would be wasting the good intentions of Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu and the others.","“Husband, don’t think too much. They’ll be fine.”","Leng Rushuang seemed to have noticed Jian Wushuang’s unusual behavior. She reached out and gently held Jian Wushuang’s fingers, comforting him.","Jian Wushuang sighed in his heart and nodded to show that he understood.","“Let’s go,” he said.","...","At the same time, in the Five Elements Divine Sect, which was located in the center of the Five Elements City.","An old man with white hair and a white beard was sitting cross-legged and silently refining his divine power.","This person was the father of the evil-looking young man who had been killed by Jian Wushuang. He was also the great elder of the Five Elements Divine Sect and the Twin Rivers Ruler!","At this moment, he suddenly received a message in his mind.","“Eh? Isn’t Tie Shan always protecting Feng ‘er? how could he have sent me a message?”","The Twin Rivers Ruler opened his eyes and read the message.","A few moments later, the Twin River Rulers “faces were filled with rage!","“Feng ‘er!”","Bang!","In the next instant, the Twin River Rulers disappeared. They turned into a streak of light and shot toward the restaurant!","In just a few seconds, he appeared in the restaurant where Jian Wushuang had been.","In an instant, the entire restaurant seemed to have turned into a mountain of corpses and a sea of blood. It was filled with a strong killing intent.","The Twin Rivers Ruler’s expression was ashen to the extreme. He first looked around the restaurant, and then looked at the fifth stage Rulers protecting the devilish youth. He asked coldly, “What about the two people who killed Feng ‘er?”","Bang!","The stage five Ultimate Rulers were so scared that they knelt on the ground and stammered, “Great elder, that...that man left half an incense stick of time ago. It looks like he’s leaving the five elements galaxy!”","“You want to escape?”","The Twin Rivers Ruler’s expression instantly turned sinister. He said, “You killed my son! Even if you run to the ends of the earth, I’ll Still Kill you!”","After saying this, the Twin River Rulers decided to get up and give chase.","Just as his right foot stepped out of the restaurant’s door, he seemed to have thought of something. He turned his head and looked coldly at the few stage five Ultimate Rulers!","“My son is dead, and you still want to live?”","“Be buried with my son!”","Bang!","In an instant, the Twin River Rulers slapped down with their right hands, and countless divine powers gushed out. As they begged for mercy in fear, they directly turned this stage five Ruler into meat paste!","After doing all this, the Twin Rivers Ruler snorted coldly and turned into a stream of light again, flying in the direction where Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang had left.","...","At the gate of the Five Elements City, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang were about to leave without a word.","Whoosh!","At this moment, a stream of light suddenly descended and appeared in front of the two.","The light dissipated, revealing the figure of the Twin River Rulers.","“Greetings, great elder!”","“Greetings, great elder!!”","The divine general guarding the city knelt down on one knee and greeted respectfully.","The Twin Rivers Ruler’s expression was cold. He didn’t even look at the divine general guarding the city. His bloodshot eyes were fixed on Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang.","“Let me ask you, half an incense’s time ago, did the two of you kill a fourth stage great Ruler in the restaurant?”","Jian Wushuang frowned and cupped his hands, “Yes, it’s me. May I ask what you need?”","...","“What is it?”","The Twin Rivers Ruler laughed in anger, then said coldly, “You killed my son, and now you’re asking me what’s the matter?”","Jian Wushuang immediately understood. The elder in front of him was probably the great elder of the Five Elements Divine Sect.","“He was the one who provoked me first, and I’ve already given him a chance. He didn’t cherish it, so he can’t blame me.” Jian Wushuang replied calmly.","“Reasonable? Hahahaha, in this world, whoever is stronger is the law!”","Ruler of Twin Rivers felt a surge of anger rush from his feet to his head. He glared at Jian Wushuang and said word by word, “Kid, listen up. I’m going to crush your divine body inch by inch, extract your divine soul. and burn it with divine fire day and night. Then..I’ll strip the cultivation of the bitches around you and send them to the brothels in the mortal world to be whorehouses every day...”","Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with killing intent. He said in a low voice, “You’re looking for death!”","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s right hand struck out and pressed on the elder’s head!","Waves of sharp sword Qi exploded instantly, killing the old man thousands of times!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","...","In an instant, it was as if someone was beating a drum within the Twin River God’s body, and his divine body was constantly emitting loud bangs.","In an instant, the bodies of the Twin River Rulers began to tremble as they were crushed by the sword-intent thousands of times!","Several breaths later, the God Body of the Twin River god exploded into countless pieces of meat.","Du!","The moment the Twin River Rulers fell, the entire Five Elements City sounded the alarm, and a series of toot sounds were heard.","In the next moment, countless figures rose from the Five Elements Divine Sect and rushed toward Jian Wushuang.","Hu!","This was not the end. A stream of five-element Qi that seemed to come from the chaos gushed out from every corner of the five-element city. Like a lid, it covered the entire five-element city and blocked all the exits!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression turned extremely gloomy.","Suddenly.","An incomplete tripod cauldron in Jian Wushuang’s interspatial ring moved."]},{"number":4338,"title":"Chapter 4338 Five-Element Divine Lord","paragraphs":["4338 Five-Element Divine Lord","“What?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and immediately felt the strange phenomenon coming from the broken ancient bronze cauldron in his Interspatial Ring.","The broken tripod was the bronze tripod that Jian Wushuang had obtained after killing Qiu Long on the Ancient Path of Stars. It had a broken leg and was engraved with countless complicated and mysterious runes.","Speaking of which, after Jian Wushuang had obtained the bronze cauldron, he had spent a lot of time studying it. In the end, no matter how much divine power he had poured into it, the bronze cauldron had no reaction at all. The divine power he had poured in was like a clay ox entering the sea, unable to cause any waves.","!!","As time passed, Jian Wushuang no longer cared about it.","Unexpectedly, the ancient bronze cauldron, which had not moved for a long time, had a reaction in the Five Elements City!","“What’s going on?”","Jian Wushuang frowned and released his divine power to feel the Five Elements City carefully to see if there was anything different.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed.","“Yi wood Qi!”","He could feel that in the void of the five-element city, there were traces of faint yi wood Qi!","This second wood Qi was extremely thin. If he hadn’t killed the Twin River Rulers and activated the great array protecting the city, he wouldn’t have been able to sense it.","The Yi wood Qi was the connate Qi of the five elements before the universe was born.","At that time, the universe was filled with all kinds of five-element chaotic Qi. It was with these five-element chaotic Qi that the last layer of chaos gradually evolved into mountains, rivers, stars, and black holes, forming the current appearance of the universe.","The Qi of the five elements was further divided into innate chaotic Qi and acquired Qi.","What Jian Wushuang had felt just now was a very thin trace of innate wood Qi.","Before Jian Wushuang could think further, the countless figures that had soared up from the Five Elements Divine Sect had already landed and surrounded Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang.","On the sleeves of their white robes, there was an embroidered pattern of five elements. They were the disciples of the Five Elements Divine Sect.","They felt the divine power fluctuations of the Twin Rivers Rulers around them that had disappeared. Their eyes revealed a hint of shock and anger as they stared at Jian Wushuang.","However, they did not act rashly.","Not long after, he saw a dignified middle-aged man with a pair of thick eyebrows walking toward Jian Wushuang.","The middle-aged man’s expression was unsightly as he walked over. The disciples of the Five Elements Divine Sect stepped back automatically to make way for him.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked at the middle-aged man. The man’s cultivation was close to the level of an unparalleled Ruler. He was the most powerful expert in the five elements Star Domain according to his divine sense. Jian Wushuang knew without a doubt that this man was the sect master of the Five Elements Divine Sect, the Five Elements Divine Lord.","Looking away, Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm and he didn’t care. Not to mention the Five Elements Divine Lord, even if all the people in the five elements Star Domain were gathered together, they wouldn’t be enough to kill him with one stroke.","Although he was still at the Ultimate Ruler Realm, he was no longer someone a Ruler could compare to. His current opponents were only at the Divine Ruler Realm.","At the Ruler realm, he, Jian Wushuang, was invincible among all races!","As the middle-aged man approached, he sized up Jian Wushuang from head to toe. An imperceptible fear flashed in the depths of his eyes. Then, he took a deep breath and cupped his hands, “I’m the sect master of the Five Elements Divine Sect. You can call me the Five Elements Divine Lord. May I know how I should address you?”","Jian Wushuang nodded. He had already planned to massacre the entire five elements Star Domain. However, this person’s attitude was good. Jian Wushuang suppressed his killing desire.","“I am Jian Buqi, and this is my Dao companion, Ling Ruqing.”","“Lord Buqi, if I may ask, what was the reason for you to kill our great elder?”","The Five Elements Divine Lord said.","Jian Wushuang replied indifferently, “He offended me first. I killed him. What’s wrong with that?”","The Five Elements Divine Lord squinted his eyes when he heard that and said in a deep voice, “He didn’t abandon the Ruler, and he killed my sect’s Grand Elder just for the sake of offending him with his words. Isn’t it a bit inappropriate to just walk away like that?”","Jian Wushuang tilted his head and looked at him with a faint smile, “So, you’re here to seek justice for him?”","The Five Elements Divine Lord’s pupils shrank when he heard that. He stared at Jian Wushuang closely and thoughts flashed through his mind.","He wasn’t a stupid person. Since Jian Buqi could kill the head elder with a single palm strike, it was enough to prove that Jian Buqi’s strength was definitely not below his!","After weighing the pros and cons, the Five Elements Divine Lord said, “How about this, undying Ruler? Let’s bet three moves. As long as you can withstand three of my moves, the Five Elements Divine Sect will respectfully send you off. We’ll then forget about the matter of the great elder and never mention it again. If you can’t take it...”","The Five Elements Divine Lord’s gaze turned cold. “Then I’m sorry. I’m afraid you and your cultivation partner will have to stay in the Five Elements Divine Sect’s prison forever.”","“Oh?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang looked interested and said, “Sure, but I want to raise the stakes.”","“Additional stakes? What do you mean by that?”","The Five Elements Divine Lord was puzzled.","Jian Wushuang stretched out his finger and pointed at the Five Elements Divine Sect, which stood in the center of the Five Elements City. He said, “If I lose, you can take my life. However, if you lose, I need to take something from your Five Elements Divine Sect.”","“This...”","The Five Elements Divine Lord hesitated for a moment before he nodded heavily. “Sure.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Good.”","He could feel that the wisp of chaotic innate yi wood Qi He had just sensed in the Five Elements City came from the Five Elements Divine Sect!","Although he didn’t know why the damaged ancient bronze cauldron would suddenly move after encountering the chaotic innate yi wood Qi, he was very sure that the way to open the ancient bronze cauldron might be related to the chaotic innate yi wood Qi!","“Let’s start.”","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and said indifferently.","As soon as he finished speaking, the disciples of the Five Elements Divine Sect who were surrounding him stepped back and made a large empty space.","“Go, sect master!”","“Let this person pay for the great elder’s life!”","...","“One move! The sect master can defeat this person in one move!”","The disciples of the Five Elements Divine Sect cheered.","“Be careful, my husband.”","Leng Rushuang said with a little concern.","“I’m fine.”","Jian Wushuang smiled at her. Then, he turned to look at the Five Elements Divine Lord and said, “Come.”","“Good! Sword doesn’t abandon, then you take it!”","The Five Elements Divine Lord took a deep breath and raised his right hand.","In an instant, countless divine powers surged and condensed into a five-colored ball of light with a terrifying aura in his hand!","The Five Elements Divine Sect cultivated the five elements Qi as the foundation of their great Dao. Within the five-colored ball of light, the five elements of metal, wood, water, fire, and earth were constantly changing. Among them, the green wood Qi was especially rich!","..."]},{"number":4339,"title":"Chapter 4339 The Excited Ancient Bronze Cauldron","paragraphs":["4339 The Excited Ancient Bronze Cauldron","The next moment!","The Five Elements Divine Lord shouted and pushed his right hand forward. In an instant, the five-colored light ball smashed toward Jian Wushuang with a monstrous power!","In this five-colored ball of light, the power of the five elements of metal, wood, water, fire, and earth were intertwined with each other, growing and transforming continuously. It was extremely powerful.","“Is that so?”","!!","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and revealed an interested expression. The power in the light ball was not bad. It had gathered the power of the five elements. Even he could not help but look at it.","“The idea of this technique isn’t bad, but it’s a pity that your understanding of the five elements is still too low.”","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang made a grabbing motion. Sword Qi twisted around his five fingers like a small snake, slithering between them.","Then, the sword Qi in Jian Wushuang’s right hand exploded and crushed the five-colored light ball.","In the face of absolute strength, all fancy tricks would not be able to withstand a single blow!","“This...”","In an instant, the disciples of the Five Elements Divine Sect, who had been cheering on the side, were stunned and their mouths were wide open.","The Five Elements Divine Lord’s pupils contracted and fear filled his face.","Although he had only wanted to use this attack to test Jian Wushuang, he had no intention of defeating him.","But...Jian Wushuang had dealt with it too easily.","“Two more moves.”","Jian Wushuang smiled.","The Five Elements Divine Lord took a deep breath and his expression turned grave. He shouted, “Good! Never abandon sword, the second move is my ultimate technique, watch carefully!”","“Secret skill, eternal!”","Boom!","The moment he finished speaking, the Five Elements Divine Lord quickly formed hand seals and a huge Dharma image appeared behind him!","In the image of the Dharma idol, a towering tree was rooted in the soil of the breathing earth. A rain of sweet dew fell out of nowhere. Under the nourishment of the rain, the towering tree with branches made of gold and iron immediately grew strong and grew taller. In just a few seconds, it bloomed and bore fruit, hanging many fire fruits!","Metal, wood, water, fire, and earth were the five elements!","The towering tree used the Yi wood Qi as its Foundation and the metal, earth, water, and fire Qi as its branches to support the five elements Dharma laksana!","“What?”","Looking at the Dharma power, even Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but exclaim in surprise.","In the five elements Dharma laksana, he could see a trace of the One Thought Divine Kingdom. Although the five elements Dharma laksana was far inferior to the real One Thought Divine Kingdom, and had not even formed a framework, it was undeniable that this was a sign of the formation of the One Thought Divine Kingdom!","One Thought Divine Kingdom was an ultimate killing move that some Supreme martial artists had yet to comprehend!","If the Five Elements Divine Lord had broken through to the supremacy stage, or if his understanding of the five-element Dao had improved by leaps and bounds, he might have been able to turn the five-element Dharma laksana into a One Thought Divine Kingdom!","“Not bad.”","Jian Wushuang opened his mouth and praised.","“Go!”","The Five Elements Divine Lord’s expression was cold as he pushed forward. In an instant, the huge tree was like a dancing silver snake. Rays of five-colored divine light gushed out and rushed toward Jian Wushuang!","Like a storm of Pear Blossom needles, thousands of five-colored divine lights left countless white marks in the air!","“Haha, the sect leader is using his trump card!”","“This person definitely can’t take this attack!”","“That’s right. The five elements in the sect leader’s five elements Dharma laksana are interlinked. They are endless and continuous. Unless one’s strength is far beyond the sect leader’s, all the power of the attack will be worn out!”","The disciples of the Five Elements Divine Sect, who had been dealt a heavy blow, immediately perked up and looked at the Five Elements Divine Lord with admiration.","“If I hadn’t become an Ultimate Ruler,. might not have been able to do anything about the five-colored divine light for the time being. But...”","Jian Wushuang laughed in his heart. Then, he raised the fingers of his right hand and turned them into sword fingers. He then slashed at the thousands of five-colored divine lights.","“I’m invincible in the Ruler realm!”","Bang!","There was a loud explosion. Jian Wushuang’s finger didn’t use any sword Qi. Instead, he used his majestic divine power and turned it into a white waterfall. It crushed the thousands of five-colored divine lights!","It was not over yet. Jian Wushuang pushed his finger forward and in an instant, the majestic divine power was like the rising tide of the sea. Wave after wave, it hit the five elements Dharma laksana that was floating behind the Five Elements Divine Lord!","Du du du!","Three consecutive muffled sounds were heard. The Dharma laksana behind the Five Elements Divine Lord only lasted for a breath’s time before it collapsed and split into pieces!","The giant tree that was swaying in the wind was broken into countless pieces!","How is this possible?!","The Five Elements Divine Lord shuddered and exclaimed in disbelief.","Just as the disciple of the Five Elements Divine Sect had said, his unique skill was linked with the five elements. Unless one’s strength was far superior to his, it was impossible to break this unique skill so easily!","However, the person in front of him had not only crushed his five-colored holy light with a casual point of his finger, but had also turned the tables and destroyed his Dharma form!","Even an unparalleled Ruler wouldn’t be able to pull off such a tyrannical move so easily, right?","The entire place turned into a dead silence.","Everyone looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze and their eyes almost fell out.","Jian Wushuang looked at ease and smiled, “Divine Lord, let’s begin the third move.”","...","However, when the Five Elements Divine Lord heard that, he did not move. Instead, he heaved a long sigh and said, “There’s no need to compete. This sect master admits defeat. This sect master’s skills are inferior to others. I admit my defeat wholeheartedly.”","“Speak, Jian Buqi. What do you want from my Five Elements Divine Sect?”","Jian Wushuang pondered for a while and felt that the ancient bronze cauldron in his interspatial ring was throbbing more and more. He said, “To be honest, I don’t know what I want either. However, I’m sure that the thing I want is in your Five Elements Divine Sect.”","The Five Elements Divine Lord was stunned when he heard that. However, he was rather carefree and he smiled bitterly, “Very well, then you can follow me to the sect and choose your own.”","“Thank you very much, Divine Lord.” Jian Wushuang smiled and cupped his hands.","“Let’s go,” he said.","The Five Elements Divine Lord brought Jian Wushuang to the Five Elements Divine Sect.","The Five Elements Divine Sect’s disciples at the side quickly made way for him. They looked at Jian Wushuang with curiosity and respect.","How could this Jian Buqi, who seemed to be around his age and cultivation level, be so powerful?","Jian Wushuang followed behind the Five Elements Divine Lord. The closer he got to the Five Elements Divine Sect, the more he could feel that the ancient bronze cauldron in his Interspatial Ring was getting more and more excited. It was like a child who wanted to get candy. It was extremely excited.","It was as if there was something extremely tempting waiting for the ancient bronze cauldron.","...","If Jian Wushuang had not injected a large amount of divine power into the cauldron to suppress it, it would have rushed out of the interspatial ring and flew toward a certain place in the Five Elements Divine Sect!","it seems like this ancient bronze cauldron is closely related to the innate chaotic yi wood Qi.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless, but his mind was racing.","After a while.","The Five Elements Divine Sect had arrived."]},{"number":4340,"title":"Chapter 4340 Found!","paragraphs":["4340 Found!","The Five Elements City was accessible in all directions, and the trees formed a forest.","In the middle of the city, there was a huge Mountain Gate. At the foot of the mountain Gate, two words, ‘five elements’, were engraved!","This was where the orthodoxy of the Five Elements Divine Sect was located.","“Sword doesn’t abandon, go in.”","!!","The Five Elements Divine Lord said helplessly.","Jian Wushuang nodded, then he held Leng Rushuang’s hand and walked into the Five Elements Divine Sect.","Inside the Five Elements Divine Sect, it was a quiet and luxuriant environment. Countless trees with spiritual intelligence swayed in the wind, making a rustling sound. Jian Wushuang looked around leisurely as he walked. He was not in a hurry.","“Sword doesn’t abandon, that’s the treasure Pavilion.”","The Five Elements Divine Lord made an introduction.","“Alright, take me there.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and answered in a deep voice.","He could sense that the item he wanted, or rather, the item that the ancient bronze cauldron in his interspatial ring needed, was in the Five Elements Divine Sect’s treasure vault!","From a distance, the treasure Pavilion seemed to have been built for a very long time. The stone bricks made of spiritual Jade had turned yellow. The Five Elements Divine Lord led Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang to the entrance of the treasure Pavilion. There was a light green light shield that covered the treasure Pavilion. As the Five Elements Divine Lord stretched out his hand and pressed on the light shield, the light green light shield rippled and dissolved into a passage that was wide enough for the two of them to pass through.","“Please come in.”","The Five Elements Divine Lord extended his hand and made a gesture of invitation.","Walking into the treasure Pavilion, a foul air mixed with dust assailed his nose. It should be because no one had come in for a long time.","There were two floors in the treasure Pavilion. The Five Elements Divine Lord introduced, “Jian Buqi, you can choose one here.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and looked around the Treasure Pavilion. Although the Five Elements Divine Sect was an unknown small sect in the universe, it had a lot of treasures. Jian Wushuang saw no less than three upper-grade law Cardinal treasures.","“Jian Buqi, what do you think of this Jade Ruyi? Although it’s only a mid-grade nomological Supreme treasure, it can change into any weapon...","And this flying shuttle can increase your flying speed by 10%. If you leave the five elements Star Domain in the future and travel in the universe, this flying shuttle will definitely be useful to you...","The Five Elements Divine Lord introduced them to Jian Wushuang one by one. When he mentioned some of the treasures that were indeed powerful, even he could not help but look pained.","However, Jian Wushuang seemed to have turned a deaf ear to them. With an indifferent expression, his fingers continued to stroke across the Supreme treasures.","No...no...still no.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes. His finger swept across all the treasures on the first floor, but the ancient bronze cauldron in his interspatial ring did not show any different reaction.","Wasn’t he on the first level?","“Divine Lord, I want to go to the second level to take a look.”","Jian Wushuang gathered his thoughts and said to him.","“The second level?”","The Five Elements Divine Lord was stunned. The treasures on the second level had been left behind by the founding ancestral master of the Five Elements Divine Sect. Even he would not touch them unless he had no other choice.","“Yes.” Jian Wushuang nodded.","The Five Elements Divine Lord could not help but smile bitterly when he heard that. He hesitated for a while before sighing, “Sigh, forget it. I’ll bring you to the second level.","As soon as he finished speaking, the Five Elements Divine Lord led Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang to a tightly sealed iron door. He carefully took out a token and inserted it into a gap.","Creak creak!","Instantly, the treasure Pavilion trembled and let out a sound similar to gears grinding and mechanisms changing.","Immediately, the iron door that was tightly attached to each other quickly disintegrated, revealing a long spiral stone ladder.","As the Five Elements Divine Lord led Jian Wushuang up, he said, “Sword never abandoned, the treasures on the second floor were all left behind by the ancestor of my Five Elements Divine Sect. The items inside are a little messy, and I can’t even recognize many of them. I can’t tell if they’re good or bad, so you’ll have to rely on yourself.”","“Alright, thank you.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and walked in with his hands behind his back.","There was only a dim oil lamp hanging on the second floor, which cast an old color on the entire second floor. Jian Wushuang looked at it carefully. As the Five Elements Divine Lord had said, there were many personal items of the founding ancestor of the Five Elements Divine Lord, such as clothes and shoes. Most of the items had become rotten and worn out after being corroded by the long years.","The Five Elements Divine Lord didn’t say anything else and allowed Jian Wushuang to choose.","“Is this it? Or this?”","Jian Wushuang’s right hand kept moving across the items. There were Supreme-grade law Cardinal treasures and mysterious small items that he could not identify, but they were not his targets.","The second floor was not big, so Jian Wushuang finished searching very quickly. He was disappointed.","He didn’t find the thing that made the cauldron throb.","The ancient bronze cauldron also became quiet.","“Husband, you didn’t find it?”","Leng Rushuang stood next to Jian Wushuang. She had accompanied him to travel the world and experienced many things, so she naturally knew him best.","She could guess that Jian Wushuang was looking for something.","“No, I didn’t.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and was about to bid farewell to the Five Elements Divine Lord.","There were many treasures in the treasure Pavilion. If it was someone else, they might be ecstatic. However, Jian Wushuang had obtained the inheritance of the Tarot ruins and looted the Ancient Path of Stars. He had no lack of treasures, so he didn’t want these things.","However, at this moment, Jian Wushuang suddenly raised his eyebrows as he saw a half-inch long dead wood emerging from the bottom of the box.","“What is this?”","Jian Wushuang pointed at the half of the dead wood. The words of farewell turned into a question.","...","“This one?”","The Five Elements Divine Lord was stunned. He thought for a moment and said, “Before our ancestor died, he said that an old friend of his had given this item to him for safekeeping. This sect master doesn’t know what it is, but from the looks of it, it should be an ordinary item.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and casually reached out his hand to grab the half of the dead wood.","Bang!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled and the ancient bronze cauldron in his interspatial ring shook violently. Like a hungry child, it urged Jian Wushuang to take the item.","“This is it!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered, but his face was calm as he lifted the piece of wood.","“Divine Lord, I want this item.”","The Five Elements Divine Lord was stunned. He had not expected that Jian Wushuang would choose such a black wooden lump instead of some expensive divine medicine or divine weapon.","He couldn’t help but raise his eyebrows and asked, “Are you sure? Never abandon sword, this piece of dead wood is just an ordinary item, and there’s nothing special about it. Why don’t you choose another one?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said in a deep voice, “No need,”","...","The Five Elements Divine Lord could only nod his head and remain silent."]},{"number":4341,"title":"Chapter 4341 Innate Yi Wood Qi!","paragraphs":["4341 Innate Yi Wood Qi!","Jian Wushuang did not stay in the Five Elements Divine Sect for long after he got the piece of dead wood. After exchanging a few pleasantries with the Five Elements Divine Lord, he left the five elements Divine Domain with Leng Rushuang.","In the vast starry sky, universe boat was speeding forward.","In the universe boat, Leng Rushuang had returned to the heaven suppressing monument to cultivate. She wanted to break through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm as soon as possible and help Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in universe boat alone. He held the black wood he had brought out of the Five Elements Divine Sect in his hand and his eyes flashed with deep thought.","After his testing and exploration, he found that this piece of wood was indeed just an ordinary item and did not possess any magical power.","However, when he poured a large amount of divine power into it and scanned inch by inch, he immediately found some abnormalities.","There was a strand of chaotic innate yi wood Qi as thick as a finger in this piece of wood!","It was this chaotic innate yi wood Qi that triggered the throbbing of the ancient bronze cauldron!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. He was not in a hurry to take out the ancient bronze cauldron. Instead, he spread out a large amount of divine power and formed a protective shield with him as the center. Then, he turned his right hand and let the Wuqi Divine Sword move around to avoid any emergency.","Jian Wushuang felt relieved after doing all that. He had no hope of breaking through to the Supreme Master level and he had only touched the surface of the Dao realm. If he wanted to improve his strength in a short time, he could only increase the power of his super power or rely on divine weapons.","For some reason, Jian Wushuang had a vague prediction that the opportunity for him to become stronger might lie in the ancient bronze cauldron.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang gathered his thoughts and flipped his right hand again. Suddenly, the bronze cauldron appeared in his hand.","The moment the ancient bronze cauldron appeared, a strange phenomenon occurred!","At this moment, the ancient bronze cauldron seemed to have a mind of its own. Like a jubilant child, it began to shake violently. The black wood seemed to have sensed something and quickly collapsed!","Instantly, wood chips flew everywhere and a green light as thick as a thumb shot into the ancient bronze cauldron!","“Innate yi wood Qi!”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank and he stared at the cauldron.","All of a sudden, the ancient bronze cauldron, which had been simple and unadorned and had no reaction no matter how hard Jian Wushuang tried, suddenly shone brightly!","A green light flashed across the surface of the cauldron. The mysterious runes carved on the cauldron seemed to come to life. They twisted and split, forming the shape of a small sapling.","Buzz!","The sound of a bell that seemed to have traveled through the primordial era and came from the ancient chaos suddenly reverberated and spread in all directions.","The voice was so ancient that even Jian Wushuang felt as insignificant as a speck of dust.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang had already used his divine power to create a sealed and isolated space within a radius of ten feet so that the sound would not spread out.","Whoosh!","Then, the ancient bronze cauldron bounced up and turned into a beam of green light, trying to escape!","“You swallowed the thing I gave you and still want to escape?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and a cold light flashed in his eyes. His five fingers grabbed at the ancient bronze cauldron.","Clang!","Suddenly, the divine sword of weeping Wu, which was wandering around, slashed down at the head of the ancient bronze cauldron.","A dull sound was heard. The Wuqi Divine Sword, which contained the ultimate power of a universe law treasure, was knocked away by the ancient bronze cauldron with a wail.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang was so angry that he laughed. He clapped his right hand heavily and his figure disappeared in an instant.","With another flash, Jian Wushuang appeared in front of the cauldron. He stretched out his five well-defined fingers and grabbed the cauldron.","Buzz, buzz, buzz!","Jian Wushuang’s body trembled violently as he clutched the cauldron. He felt as if millions of ancient Bulls were charging at him and the huge force almost flipped him over.","It should be known that this ancient bronze cauldron was still an ownerless item and was still incomplete. However, after absorbing a wisp of yi wood Qi, it had sent the Wuqi Divine Sword flying and almost flipped him over.","How terrifying was this?","“Secret skill of dragon blood!”","Jian Wushuang had no time to be shocked. He shouted and his divine power burned, turning into ten times his strength.","The two of them continued to wrestle with each other. After a few breaths, Jian Wushuang finally managed to stabilize the cauldron.","Jian Wushuang let out a deep breath and sat down cross-legged with the ancient bronze cauldron in his hand. His divine power began to explore the ancient bronze cauldron.","Jian Wushuang immediately found something different.","There was a boundless chaotic space inside the cauldron. The chaotic space was indescribably large and was filled with chaotic, dark and yellow energy.","After a while, Jian Wushuang withdrew his divine power and he could not help but frown.","The bronze cauldron had indeed changed, but Jian Wushuang still didn’t know how to use it.","After a while, Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “It seems like I’ll have to absorb more innate chaotic yi wood Qi if I want to fully utilize the power of this cauldron.","“I just don’t know if this ancient bronze cauldron is only interested in the Yi wood Qi, or if it’s only interested in the innate chaotic Qi of the five elements.”","Jian Wushuang stopped talking and smiled.","“However, although I still don’t know how to use this ancient bronze cauldron, I can tell that the heavy weight of this ancient cauldron is enough to crush any Ruler below the Supreme level. Even if I’m facing a Supreme, I can still injure a Supreme by throwing this ancient bronze cauldron with my divine power.”","“The most important thing now is to find a way to refine this ancient bronze cauldron and make it recognize an owner. Otherwise, it’d be a joke if you run away before the cauldron hits anyone.”","At the thought of this, Jian Wushuang smiled. Suddenly, a huge amount of divine power gushed out and wrapped around the ancient bronze cauldron. He started to refine it inch by inch.","...","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave the five elements Star Domain.","In the Divine Life Palace, a world-shaking battle had already broken out!","...","This battle had attracted the attention of the entire universe!","Roar!","A seven-clawed giant dragon that was tens of thousands of Zhang Long with the sun, moon, and stars like pellets rose up into the sky and roared!","The terrifying sound waves shook the Nine Heavens and ten lands. Hearing the Dragon’s Roar, the surrounding spectators all lowered their heads in fear!","This seven-clawed Dragon was covered in black scales, and his eyes were a faint golden color. The two white beards at the side of his mouth swayed slightly, and an endless pressure was exuded from his body. Even a Supreme martial artist would be shocked and heartbroken if they were to see him!","He was the third generation of the Dragon Tribe, the current leader of the evil Dragon Tribe, Long Ye!"]},{"number":4342,"title":"Chapter 4342 Rushing to the Divine Life Palace","paragraphs":["4342 Rushing to the Divine Life Palace","At this moment, outside the Divine Life Palace.","The Nine Dragon Clan’s battleships covered the starry sky, giving off a cold light. On each of the nine battleships stood members of the dragon clan, all of them of the fifth generation of the dragon clan!","Since the chaos era, the Dragon Tribe had only developed to the sixth generation of the Dragon Tribe. Except for the sixth generation of the Dragon Tribe, the fifth generation and above were Supreme Divine Dragons!","A total of Nine Dragon Tribe combat vessels, with nine Supremes standing on the deck.","They had dragon heads and human bodies, and they stood with their hands behind their backs. Two Dragon beards floated around their mouths, and their eyes were pale gold in color. They were majestic and sacred, and could not be violated.","In addition to the third generation dragon clan’s long Ye, who was wandering in the Nebula and whose might had intimidated the Nine Heavens and ten lands, the dragon clan had sent ten Supreme martial artists to attack the Divine Life Palace!","This was not the end. In the darkness of the universe, many Supremes of cosmos divine Palace were quietly lying in wait. As long as the Hall Master of cosmos divine Palace gave the order, they would charge out and give the Divine Life Palace a heavy blow!","“Gai Fu, are you really going to push the Divine Life Palace to the end of the world for Jian Wushuang?”","Long Jue’s dark golden eyes swept over Gai Fu as he spoke in a deep voice.","He and Gai Fu could be considered old friends. The two of them had fought side by side in the war of catastrophe that had swept across the entire universe.","Therefore, he understood Gai Fu’s injuries the best. If the current Gai Fu were to force himself to attack, he would probably explode and die in the time it takes for an incense stick to burn.","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s expression was indifferent. He didn’t say anything, but two black truncheons appeared in his hands.","“As cultivators, why should we hesitate to fight?”","Boom!","In an instant, an earth-shattering, terrifying pressure that engulfed all life erupted with Supreme Being Gai Fu as the center!","This terrifying pressure was like a physical substance, forming a shock wave that swept across the heavens and the earth. It was filled with an aura of supremacy, and under this pressure, even the third generation of the Dragon race’s evil Dragon bloodline was suppressed!","Supreme Master Gai Fu was the true pillar of the Divine Life Palace. He was also publicly acknowledged as the strongest expert since ancient times, apart from the palace Master of the Divine Life Palace!","This was the first time Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu had completely displayed his strength!","“I, Gai Fu, the Divine Life Palace, have never feared this world.”","Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu’s turbid eyes had completely disappeared. They were like bright jade that had been stripped of its dust, revealing its brilliance.","Bang!","Behind Supreme Master Gai Fu, Blood Wave, Giant Axe, and the other lead seats, as well as many other Supreme Masters, also surged with divine power. They suppressed the four directions and were ready for the final battle!","“Fine. Gai Fu, then don’t blame me for being merciless.”","A cold glint appeared in the dragon’s eyes. He opened his mouth and let out a proud roar as he immediately grabbed towards Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu!","The other nine fifth-generation Dragons also transformed into their Dragon forms. With auras of might in their mouths, they charged toward the Supremes of the Divine Life Palace!","The battle had been in a stalemate since the beginning.","Kill!!!","Supreme techniques were unleashed one after another, releasing all kinds of brilliance. The White Tiger Supreme held a Dragon in his mouth and flung it away ruthlessly. The Supreme Giant Axe transformed into a Chaos God, and the Giant Axe in his hand split the heavens and earth apart. He slashed at the Dragon Horn of a Golden Dragon, bringing up a long string of sparks.","The Blood Wave Ruler was even more terrifying. With a tug of his hands, a sea of blood was created, drowning the few Dragons.","However, the most eye-catching performance was still the Ninth Kalpa King, who had just advanced to the supremacy stage not long ago!","“Little bug.”","His white hair fluttered in the wind, and his expression was as cold as ice. With a wave of his hand, he exerted a force of a million tons. He grabbed the law-enforcement officer of the dragon clan, Long Jiu, and began to bombard him. He was extremely overbearing!","He had just advanced to the Supreme-being realm, but the battle prowess he displayed was not much weaker than that of a top-tier Supreme-being!","At this moment, the entire universe seemed to be smashed. Countless voids were shattered and a storm was set off!","“Let’s make our move.”","The Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple narrowed his eyes and gently waved his right hand forward.","In an instant, a dozen Black Eagles appeared in the air, their faces cold.","They had been waiting for a long time.","Shua shua shua!","In the next moment, the Black Eagle flickered and turned into a stream of light, which immediately rushed toward the great Supremes of the Divine Life Palace!","An ordinary Supreme-being from the Divine Life Palace was unable to react in time. A Supreme-being from the Cosmos Temple stabbed his heart with a God-killing spear. Before he could even scream, he was swallowed by the Dragon Tribe!","After the Supreme-being from Cosmos Temple entered the arena, the battle situation immediately began to tilt in one side.","The Hall Master of the great Cosmos Temple sneered as he raised his head and looked into the endless void. Over there, the third generation of the Dragon race’s bloodline, the Dragon Sin, was currently fighting with Supreme Being Gai Fu!","As a third-generation bloodline of the Dragon race and someone who had participated in the battle of the catastrophe, the sin of the Dragon was actually being suppressed by Supreme Master Gai Fu. When the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple saw this, he immediately stomped his right foot and transformed into a Black Crow, charging toward Supreme Master Gai Fu!","Today, the Divine Life Palace would be destroyed!","As long as Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu was dealt with, the rest of the people would not be able to do anything!","...","At the same time.","In the headquarters of the Nine Emperor Pavilion, which was not far from the Divine Life Palace.","The universe passage leading to the Divine Life Palace slowly opened, revealing three figures.","Standing in the middle was a purple-haired, purple-eyed, expressionless young man.","On his left and right, the cold-faced Supreme Slayer’s heart and the red-robed old man stood with their hands behind their backs.","“Let’s go. The Divine Life Palace has been waiting for a long time.”","In the next moment, the cosmic passage slowly closed, and the Black Eagles of the three people disappeared from the cosmic passage.","...","The three of them would represent the Nine Emperor Pavilion to help the Divine Life Palace!","This was just the beginning.","Far away in the universe, there was a Sword Mountain that was floating in the starry sky.","On this day, several divine swords soared into the sky and flew toward the Divine Life Palace.","The one in the lead was a cold-looking woman in red caltrop armor with a diamond-shaped mark between her brows.","She was the Martial Sword Immortal, the unrivaled Ruler of the world, the number one female sword God!","Behind her, the seven elders stepped on their flying swords and followed closely, leaving long white marks in the air and making a Sonic Boom.","On this day, the sword Qi swept across 80000 miles, and the sword light froze 19 continents!","In the universe, countless people raised their heads and looked up. They were all convinced by the peerless sword immortal’s demeanor.","The Martial Sword Immortal’s expression was cold. He was not going to the Divine Life Palace to be an enemy, but to support!","Jian Wushuang, since you’ve received all of Tarot’s inheritance, you’re considered half his disciple.","...","“Then, shouldn’t you call this the ‘master’s wife’?”","...","Just as the entire universe was boiling, Jian Wushuang drove universe boat and left the five elements star area. He left the prosperous area of the universe and entered the desolate area of the universe.","In universe boat, Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged with a map of the universe floating in front of him.","The universe map was filled with stars and countless bright lights. Each light represented a star field."]},{"number":4343,"title":"Chapter 4343 The Fiery Sun Star Area","paragraphs":["4343 The Fiery Sun Star Area","“The Fiery Sun Star area should be in front of us.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. According to the universe map, the Fiery Sun Star area was full of volcanic craters and flowing magma. The air was high all year round. Except for some cultivators who needed to refine fire, few people would stay here.","If it were any other time, Jian Wushuang would not have stayed.","“According to the records, the volcanic crater in the Fiery Sun Star area was formed naturally. If that’s the case, then there should be an innate chaotic fourth fire Qi inside.”","“I’ll try and see if this bronze cauldron only needs the Yi wood Qi or all the innate Qi of the five elements.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and drove universe boat toward Fiery Sun Star area.","He did not deliberately speed up the stopping of universe boat. Instead, he was at ease along the way. He stopped from time to time to look at the scenery of the universe, the dense starry sky, the Flowing Milky Way, the Secrets of the sun, moon, and stars, the hurrying of the world, and to comprehend the true meaning of the great Dao.","Along the way, Jian Wushuang vaguely understood that the great Dao might be everything in the universe and the rules of operation. It was illusory but real.","However, every time Jian Wushuang thought about it on a deeper level, he felt that his comprehension was like a dream or an illusion. He could not grasp anything.","Jian Wushuang kept thinking along the way as he headed for Fiery Sun Star area.","Not long after that, they arrived at the Fiery Sun Star area.","Standing in the universe, Jian Wushuang looked at Fiery Sun Star area. It was a huge fireball. Before he got close, he could feel a burning aura. Jian Wushuang stopped the universe boat and put it away. He didn’t wake Leng Rushuang, who was cultivating in the heaven suppressing monument. Instead, he walked into Fiery Sun Star area.","Fiery Sun Star area was an uninhabited star. As soon as Jian Wushuang stepped into the plane of Fiery Sun Star area, he felt an even hotter wave of heat coming at his nose. There were sparks everywhere in the air and the ground was dried up. Green smoke rose from the cracks.","As far as the eye could see, there were erupting volcanoes everywhere. From time to time, one could see volcanoes erupting, spewing out countless streams of lava mixed with rolling black smoke. They then slowly flowed, emitting a terrifyingly high temperature.","The entire Fiery Sun Star area was extremely hot. Even Jian Wushuang felt a little uncomfortable.","Jian Wushuang finally got used to it after some adjustments. He spread his divine power and covered the Fiery Sun Star area.","Under the vast coverage of Jian Wushuang’s divine power, he immediately knew the entire Fiery Sun Star area like the back of his hand. The other places in the star area were just like what Jian Wushuang had seen. There were dry and barren volcanoes everywhere. A few cultivators were hiding in the dark and cultivating in seclusion to refine the fire power.","The cultivators ‘cultivations weren’t high, so Jian Wushuang didn’t disturb them. His divine power just swept past them and went elsewhere.","In addition, Jian Wushuang also found a huge natural karst cave in the center of the Fiery Sun Star area!","This cave was incomparably huge, taking up almost half of Fiery Sun Star area. Inside, a large amount of lava was rolling like boiling water. It kept boiling, and fist-sized bubbles gushed out.","Many branches spread out from the Fiery Sun Star system like a spider web, leading to countless volcanoes. It could be said that the current landscape of the entire Fiery Sun Star system was formed by this magma cave.","“If there’s innate fourth fire Qi in the Fiery Sun Star area, it should be in this cave.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and then took a step forward. Suddenly, he shot toward the karst cave in the center of Fiery Sun Star area.","A moment later, a cave with a wild monster’s mouth wide open appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","As he stood in front of the cave, waves of heat waves that had formed a substance rushed toward him. Jian Wushuang’s divine body couldn’t help but crack slightly.","Then, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and divine power gushed out of his body. He then plunged into the lava in the karst cave.","Bang!","Lava splashed up like waves and soon, Jian Wushuang’s figure was gradually swallowed by the lava.","In the karst cave, the terrifyingly high temperature was enough to melt everything. The boiling lava attacked Jian Wushuang and washed over his divine body.","An ordinary Ultimate Ruler would have been melted into a pool of blood by the lava. However, under Jian Wushuang’s boundless divine power, the lava could not hurt him at all.","Jian Wushuang continued to sink and his divine power continued to explore, looking for the innate fourth fire Qi.","At the same time, he felt the ancient bronze cauldron in his interspatial ring become restless again!","Not long after Jian Wushuang was immersed in the lava, he did not know that a group of uninvited guests had gradually arrived outside the Fiery Sun Star area.","“Hurry up! In the scorching sun karst cave, the time for the fire primordial spirit fruit to bear fruit every one million years is almost up!”","“This time, we can’t let anyone else beat us to it!”","Seven Ruler realm experts with different appearances stood outside the Fiery Sun Star system and spoke with burning eyes.","There were both men and women among the seven or eight Rulers, and their auras were very different. It was obvious that they had come from all over the world and were not from the same sect.","One of them was a seductive woman in red with a hot body, revealing her shoulders and beautiful legs. She smiled and said, ” the fire Yuan fruit bears fruit once every one million years, and there are seven fruits at a time. The competition is usually very fierce. This time, we have brother Tuoba, so we can definitely get all seven fire Yuan fruits.","A tall, burly man in a black robe beside the charming woman laughed heartily when he heard this. Seventh Sister, don’t worry. This time, I’m here. Getting the fire Yuan fruit will be a piece of cake.","After that, he paused for a moment before he continued, “Let’s go. It seems like we are the first ones who have come to Fiery Sun Star area. We should go to the fiery sun karst cave and get a good spot.”","“I’ll follow big brother Tuoba’s arrangements.”","“That’s right. Three days later, the fire origin Dao fruit will surface from the lava of the fiery sun karst cave. At that time, the seven of us will attack together and take the fire origin Dao fruit!”","The others chimed in.","A moment later, the seven of them flashed and stepped into the Fiery Sun Star area.","They didn’t stop in Fiery Sun Star area. They went straight to the center of the huge cave, found a place to sit down cross-legged, and waited for the fire Yuan fruit to appear.","And this was only the beginning.","In the next three days, more and more Ruler-level cultivators came from afar and stepped into the blazing sun Star Domain. They guarded the scorching sun cave and the fire Yuan fruit.","Suddenly, the originally desolate and uninhabited flaming sun Star area became lively.","There were even experts who were close to the invincible Ruler level.","The atmosphere at the side of the scorching sun karst cave gradually became extremely heavy. The Rulers sized each other up, their eyes filled with deep enmity and fear.","What no one noticed was that beneath their feet, in the terrifying lava of the flaming sun karst cave, a black-haired figure had already sunk to the bottom.","“What is this?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked at the ball of fire formed by countless flames and lava in front of him.","..."]},{"number":4344,"title":"Chapter 4344 Obtaining Xiantian Fourth Fire Qi Again","paragraphs":["4344 Obtaining Xiantian Fourth Fire Qi Again","Under the huge lava cave, a fist-sized fireball floated quietly, like a king of Flames, separating all the lava.","A wave of scorching heat separated from the fireball and formed into terrifying lava.","Seeing this, the divine light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly grew by three inches!","He could feel that the lava in the cave was formed by the fire power of the fist-sized fireball!","In other words, this fist-sized fireball was the reason why the entire Fiery Sun Star area had become so barren!","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang spread out his divine power and grabbed the fireball carefully.","Weng!","However, before Jian Wushuang’s boundless divine power touched the ball of fire, his divine power was completely burned away by the fire.","The connate Qi of five elements was born from the chaos. It was extremely overbearing and could not be controlled by anyone.","The reason why Jian Wushuang was able to grab the second wood Qi was that the second wood Qi was naturally mild and not the extremely dangerous five elements Qi. However, the fourth fire Qi was the five elements Qi, which was only second to the first metal Qi and was extremely dangerous!","“To have such power, it must be the innate fourth fire Qi.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and thought for a while. Then, he took out the ancient bronze cauldron with his right hand.","Jian Wushuang didn’t need to do anything. As soon as the cauldron appeared, the fireball and the cauldron were like two magnets that attracted each other. The cauldron turned and the fireball flew in like a lost child who had found its home.","In an instant, the ancient bronze cauldron changed again!","On the body of the ancient bronze cauldron, the originally dim and obscure mysterious runes lit up. Red flames streaked across the body of the cauldron. In an instant, the lifeless bronze cauldron seemed to come to life. It spun wildly in the air and kept ringing the ancient Bell.","Buzz, buzz, buzz!","Buzz, buzz, buzz!","The sound of a great bell spread in all directions like the drums of the ancient heavenly court!","In an instant, the entire lava cave began to shake violently.","Outside the cave, the Rulers who were waiting for the birth of the fire Yuan fruit glared at each other and were ready to fight felt the tremors from beneath their feet. Their expressions changed.","“W-what’s going on?”","“What happened?”","“What’s the situation?”","They looked at each other, and their pupils shrank. They had never heard of such a big event when the fire Yuan fruit was born!","Fortunately, the vibration did not last long before it calmed down.","Under the scorching sun cave.","Jian Wushuang released his divine power and it automatically formed a boundary to seal off the aura of the ancient bronze cauldron. Otherwise, if the cauldron were to act according to its temperament, the entire Fiery Sun Star area would not be able to withstand it.","The power of the ancient bronze cauldron was not to be taken lightly.","Besides the sapling that had absorbed the Yi wood Qi, another flame mark appeared on the cauldron.","He had already obtained two of the connate five elemental Qi.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and immersed his divine power into the chaotic space of the ancient bronze cauldron. In the chaotic space, other than the dormant yi wood Qi, there were countless red divine fires!","“After I completely control this cauldron, I should be able to use the power of the five elements inside.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. He immediately turned his right hand and put the ancient bronze cauldron into his Interspatial Ring.","After doing all this, just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave, he suddenly let out a soft gasp.","“What is this?”","In a crack in the rock wall under the lava, a vine with seven fireball fruits hanging on it broke out of the ground with difficulty. Perhaps it was because Jian Wushuang had taken away the innate fourth fire Qi, but the seventh fruit withered instantly before it was formed.","The vine had also stopped growing. It had stopped moving upward.","“Fire Yuan fruit?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows. The fire Yuan fruit contained a large amount of divine power, which was very beneficial for cultivators who practiced fire-related super powers and secret skills. In the universe, it was considered a good Dao fruit.","This thing was not of much use to Jian Wushuang. After taking a glance at it, he shook his head and no longer paid attention to it. He then shot it out of the scorching sun karst cave.","...","Outside the scorching sun cave.","The various Ruler experts from all over the world were waiting quietly.","“The fire Yuan fruit should have appeared by now. Why isn’t it out yet?”","“Yeah, usually the fire Yuan fruit would be out by this time. What happened this time?”","The Rulers all frowned.","One of the chief Rulers said tentatively,","“Do you think that the vibration from the bottom of the cave a few days ago was caused by someone who had gone to the bottom of the cave before us and took the fire Yuan fruit?”","As soon as he said that, someone sneered, “That’s impossible! The temperature in this cave has already reached tens of billions of degrees. Even an unparalleled Ruler wouldn’t be able to last more than a few hours before being burned to ashes by the high-temperature lava!”","Just as this person finished speaking, a sudden change occurred.","Gululu! Gululu!","In the cave, the magma began to boil as if a monster was about to come out of it.","The next moment!","The lava in the entire cave formed a huge whirlpool!","...","“Could it be that the fire Yuan fruit is about to be born?”","“The birth of the fire Yuan fruit this time has caused so many strange phenomena. Could it be that the number of fire Yuan fruits this time will be far more than before?”","All of a sudden, the people who came to fight for the fire Yuan fruit were excited and spoke excitedly.","Countless divine power gushed out as they stared at the center of the vortex. They were ready to attack and snatch the fire Yuan fruit as soon as they saw it!","Just as they mustered up all their strength and were about to make a move, a scene that made them dumbfounded happened.","A black-robed, black-haired, tall, and bearded loathsome visitor was being lifted up by the lava. He was like a god of fire, his expression indifferent as he walked out of the depths of the lava.","Behind him, the sky was filled with flames.","It was Jian Wushuang, who had changed his appearance!","“Eh? Why is it a human?”","“Who is he?”","“Where’s the fire Yuan fruit?”","...","“A mere second-stage Omega Ruler?”","Then, the Rulers came back to their senses with a quiver. They sized up Jian Wushuang and said in surprise.","A white-haired, white-robed, almost-unparalleled old man frowned and said in a deep voice,","“Kid, let me ask you, where is the fire Yuan fruit? Did you take it?”","After he finished speaking, the other chief Rulers immediately chided him, “Right! Kid, hand over the fire Yuan fruit!”","“Hmph, you must have taken the fire Yuan fruit! Quickly hand it over!”","“Hand over the fire Yuan fruit! I’ll spare your life!”","“Everyone, this man must have used some secret technique to sneak into the lava and take the fire Yuan fruit!”","The rebukes and pressure came at him. Jian Wushuang frowned and a cold light flashed in his eyes."]},{"number":4345,"title":"Chapter 4345 Massacre","paragraphs":["4345 Massacre","“I didn’t take the fire Yuan fruit. It’s under the lava. You can take it if you want.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, suppressed his anger, and said calmly.","“You didn’t take it? If you say you didn’t take it, then you didn’t take it. What proof do you have?”","An Ultimate Ruler snorted coldly and stared at Jian Wushuang in disdain.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and coldness appeared in his eyes again. He asked, “Then how do you want me to prove it?”","The final Ruler, upon hearing this, immediately sneered. He said disdainfully, it’s simple. Take out your interspatial ring and let us check it. If there is no fire Yuan fruit, we will believe you.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered with coldness. He turned to the others and asked indifferently, “Do you all have the same intention?”","The Rulers were not afraid of Jian Wushuang’s gaze. Instead, they sneered and replied, “That’s right. Hand over your interspatial ring and let us check it!”","“Yes, if you don’t have the fire Yuan fruit, we’ll let you go. We won’t make things difficult for you!","“Hmph, kid, I’m warning you, don’t try to play any tricks. There are so many of us here. If you don’t hand over your interspatial ring, today will be the day you die!”","The sneers and threats came one after another. Jian Wushuang replied expressionlessly, “I’ll explain it for the last time. If I say I didn’t take it, I didn’t take it. If you don’t believe me, you can go down to the bottom of the lava and check it out.”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang turned around and was about to leave.","“You want to leave without handing over the fire Yuan fruit? It won’t be that easy!”","“This kid must have a secret technique to pass through the flames and lava. Let’s capture him and force him to reveal this secret technique!”","“Stop right there!”","A yellow-robed evil-looking young man with the cultivation of an Ultimate Ruler frowned. He immediately jumped up and stretched out his right hand to grab Jian Wushuang’s shoulder!","The grab was filled with divine power. If Jian Wushuang was an ordinary second stage Ruler, he would have lost his fighting power even if he did not die.","“He killed me just because he suspected that I took the fire Yuan fruit...fine, you asked for it.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and sighed in his heart.","In an instant, an earth-shattering sword Qi shot up from Jian Wushuang and spread in all directions.","Under this sharp sword energy, the entire Fiery Sun Star area was like a disaster was about to befall.","The next moment!","Jian Wushuang used his right hand as a sword and turned around to slash at the Ultimate Ruler, who was trying to grab him!","Whoosh!","A heaven-opening sword ray instantly slashed out, tearing the void apart for thousands of feet!","“This is?”","The expression of the Ultimate Ruler who had been trying to grab Jian Wushuang changed drastically, and his eyes were filled with horror as if he had seen a ghost!","However, it was too late for him to change his move at the last minute!","He watched helplessly as the poignant sword gleam grew bigger and bigger in his eyes before it finally cut into his body!","His divine body collapsed! His body and soul were destroyed!","One-hit kill!","The entire place instantly fell into a dead silence.","Everyone was staring at Jian Wushuang with fear in their eyes.","After a long time, a tall and burly Ultimate Ruler stepped out and said in a deep voice, “Everyone, don’t be afraid! The fire Yuan fruit must be in this man’s hands. Let’s kill him together and get the fire Yuan fruit!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the others looked at each other, then gritted their teeth and nodded heavily.","“That’s right, let’s attack together!”","“No matter how strong he is, he’s only a second stage Ruler. He’s no match for all of us!”","“Kill!”","In an instant, dozens of Ruler realm experts, including the almost invincible Ultimate Ruler, charged at Jian Wushuang at the same time!","Countless super powers were launched at Jian Wushuang!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression turned extremely cold.","“You’re all looking for death.”","Jian Wushuang said coldly.","Whoosh!","The Wuqi Divine Sword instantly appeared in Jian Wushuang’s hand. His black hair flew in the air as he slashed down, shattering the countless divine skills that were smashing at him. Then, he swept out and killed the dozens of Ruler realm experts!","A one-sided massacre had begun!","Sword light crisscrossed, and sword shadows weaved together as they slashed down in the void.","Countless drops of divine blood fell and the entire Fiery Sun Star area became a sea of blood. Jian Wushuang, who had gone on a killing spree, was like a bloodthirsty Asura. With a casual slash of his sword, he took away a life mercilessly.","For the current Jian Wushuang, killing an ordinary Ruler of the same realm as him was as easy as crushing an ant.","“Don’t, don’t kill me!”","“Quickly escape!!”","“I don’t want the fire Yuan fruit anymore. Let...Let me go!”","Countless people were shocked to find that the soft persimmon that they thought could be crushed at their will was like a god of death at this moment. He was slaughtering their lives like they were pigs and dogs!","For a moment, wailing and begging for mercy sounded one after another. Jian Wushuang’s expression was cold and he did not hold back his Wuqi Divine Sword.","...","In the time it took for an incense stick to burn, Jian Wushuang had killed dozens of Rulers.","In the end, there was only a tall and charming woman left. She was curled up in a ball, trembling and looking at Jian Wushuang in fear.","Just now, she had seen with her own eyes how her invincible brother Tuoba had been split into two by this black-haired man.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless as he approached her step by step. He had already made a decision when he left the Divine Life Palace. It was fine if he did not take action during this escape journey. However, once he took action, he would do it in a thunderous manner and eliminate the roots!","He would not allow anything to happen that would expose his identity!","“Don’t, don’t come over, let me go.”","The beautiful woman looked at Jian Wushuang, who was approaching her step by step, and her face suddenly turned pale as she screamed.","“Die!”","Jian Wushuang lowered his eyes. At that moment, he had put away the Wuqi Divine Sword and the blood-red sword light was gathering on his fingers.","Looking at the increasingly terrifying sword light in Jian Wushuang’s hand, the beautiful woman’s thoughts ran wildly!","Just as the beautiful woman was in a life and death crisis, she suddenly thought of something and shouted, “Your Excellency! Are you looking for the innate fourth fire Qi? I know where else there is a large amount of Xiantian fourth fire Qi!”","...","After she finished speaking, she stared at Jian Wushuang closely, not King of Day to miss any subtle expression on Jian Wushuang’s face. Her heart was beating fast.","In her eyes, there was hope.","“What?”","Finally, Jian Wushuang stopped and looked down at the beautiful woman who was sitting on the ground with her chest heaving up and down. He asked calmly, “How did you know I was looking for the innate fourth fire Qi?”","The gorgeous woman looked at Jian Wushuang, who had stopped, and heaved a sigh of relief. She knew that she had made the right bet."]},{"number":4346,"title":"Chapter 4346 Spirit Bristle Holy Land","paragraphs":["4346 Spirit Bristle Holy Land","The beautiful woman didn’t dare to keep him in suspense. She looked at Jian Wushuang and quickly explained, “Your Excellency, I’m just making a wild guess. Since you don’t like the fire Yuan fruit, and you want to go to the bottom of this karst cave, then there must be something more attractive to you at the bottom of the magma cave. And my cultivation method is very sensitive to fire power. Combined with the situation in the Fiery Sun Star area, I guessed that Your Excellency is looking for the innate fourth fire Qi.”","After saying that, the beautiful woman didn’t even dare to breathe. She looked at Jian Wushuang nervously.","After a while, she heard Jian Wushuang’s voice.","“You’ve got an exquisite heart.”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, confirming the woman’s guess. After a pause, he asked, “You said before that you know where there is a large amount of Xiantian fourth fire Qi, is that true?”","Hearing this, the beautiful woman was ecstatic. She knew that since Jian Wushuang didn’t attack her immediately but asked her, it meant that she was finally safe!","After taking a deep breath, the beautiful woman said respectfully, “Your Excellency, I come from the Spirit Bristle Holy Land. In our sacred land, there is a huge fire pool, which is dedicated to a large amount of innate fourth fire Qi.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and said with a faint smile, “Oh? You mean you want me to go to your Spirit Bristle Holy Land to get the innate fourth fire Qi? When the time comes, I will follow you to the Spirit Bristle Holy Land. I’m afraid it will be easy to enter, but difficult to come out, right?”","“This...” When the beautiful woman heard this, she immediately knew that her words were a little naive. After thinking for a while, she gritted her teeth and said, “Sir, I know that there is a secret passage in the sacred land that leads to the innate fourth fire pond. If you believe me, I can guarantee that I will not reveal your information. After entering the Spirit Bristle Holy Land, I will take you to the innate fourth fire pond without you knowing!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t reply. Instead, he turned to look at the sky in the distance, deep in thought.","He had heard of the Spirit Bristle Holy Land.","According to the historical records of the Divine Life Palace, the Spirit Bristle Holy Land was one of the top forces in the entire universe 10000 chaos cycles ago. It had a glorious past with ten Supremes. However, after the death of the Spirit Bristle Holy Land’s ancestor, the Spirit Bristle Holy Land, it had never been able to rise again. In the recent 10000 chaos cycles, it had declined even more and more. It was even forced to move its entire sect to the depths of the universe and come to the desolate area of the universe.","The Spirit Bristle Holy Land was an immortal Holy Land. It was an ancient orthodoxy, but it had long since fallen to the third-rate power of the universe. It was said that there were no Supremes in the Spirit Bristle Holy Land. Even if there were Supremes, they were only the lowest-level Supremes who were struggling at death’s door.","After a while, Jian Wushuang looked back at the beautiful woman and said, “How should I address you?”","“Feng Xin, Sir, you can just call me Feng Xin!”","The beautiful woman quickly replied.","Jian Wushuang nodded and said casually, “Let’s go, Feng Xin. Take me to your Spirit Bristle Holy Land.”","“Yes!” The beautiful woman couldn’t help but smile and quickly nodded.","Jian Wushuang glanced at her and said, “Don’t be happy too early. After you go to the Spirit Bristle Holy Land, I hope you are not lying to me. Because the price of lying to me is something you can’t afford.”","When the beautiful woman heard this, she couldn’t help but feel a chill in her heart. She quickly lowered her head and cupped her hands, “I don’t dare!”","Jian Wushuang let out a ‘hmm’ and let Feng Xin Ruler lead the way as they headed toward Spirit Bristle Holy Land.","According to what Feng Xin had said, the Spirit Bristle Holy Land wasn’t too far from here. It would only take a month or so to get there by driving universe boat.","Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry. He let Feng Xin lead the way in universe boat while he sat down cross-legged and refined the ancient bronze cauldron.","The difficulty of refining the ancient bronze cauldron was unprecedented. Ever since he left the five elements Star Domain, he had been refining it every day, but he had only managed to refine one percent of it. Now, he could only barely keep the cauldron from escaping.","More than a month passed in the blink of an eye.","Soon, a Red Planet appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","This planet was where the Spirit Bristle Holy Land was located.","“Sir Buqi, we have arrived at the Spirit Bristle Holy Land.”","Ruler Feng Xin said softly.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a bright light flashed in his eyes.","In the past few days, Feng Xin had been very obedient, like a tamed kitten. She stayed quietly by Jian Wushuang’s side, not King of Day to disturb him.","“Let’s go,” he said.","Exhaling, Jian Wushuang stood up and left the universe boat.","Jian Wushuang did not feel any fear when he came to the Spirit Bristle Holy Land. He did not care whether Feng Xin would call the people of the sacred land to swarm after her arrival.","“Let’s not talk about whether there were still Supremes in the Spirit Bristle Holy Land. Even if there were Supremes, so what? The current Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to say that he was stronger than a Supreme. However, if he was determined to leave, ordinary Supremes definitely wouldn’t be able to stop him!”","After putting universe boat away, Jian Wushuang and long-hearted Ruler walked side by side toward Spirit Bristle Holy Land.","As soon as he arrived at the entrance of Spirit Bristle Holy Land, he saw two third stage Rulers guarding the entrance. They first greeted Feng Xin respectfully, then looked at Jian Wushuang and asked in confusion, “Elder Feng Xin, who is this?”","Hegemon Sacred heart’s expression was calm as she replied, “This is an old friend of mine. He was invited by me to be my guest, so you don’t have to care about him. You may leave.”","It was clear that Feng Xin had some status in the Spirit Bristle Holy Land. After she finished speaking, the two third stage Rulers immediately stopped asking questions and obediently let them pass.","As he walked into the spirit puppet sanctuary, the nine towering mountains came into view. Jian Wushuang sized up the spirit puppet sanctuary and joked, “You’re also an elder of the Spirit Bristle Holy Land?”","“Not abandoned, Sir. Ruler Feng Xin bitterly smiled. As long as the Spirit Bristle Holy Land’s top-tier ultimate Rulers are present, they can become elders. They aren’t even worth mentioning in front of you.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and did not speak anymore.","Along the way, the two met many Spirit Bristle Holy Land disciples. It could be seen that Feng Xin Ruler had a rather prestigious status in the Spirit Bristle Holy Land. When these Spirit Bristle Holy Land disciples saw Feng Xin Ruler, they stopped and greeted her respectfully.","In front of Jian Wushuang, Ruler Feng Xin was as docile as a kitten. However, in front of these Spirit Bristle Holy Land disciples, her expression changed immediately. Her pretty face was not happy, but it was intimidating.","“Sir Buqi, the Xiantian fourth fire pool is right behind the nine peaks, guarded by the elders of the nine peaks. In three days, it will be my turn, so you can go to my room and rest first. Do you think it’s okay?”","“Let’s go!” When there were no more Spirit Bristle Holy Land disciples nearby, Feng Xin lowered her head and bowed."]},{"number":4347,"title":"Chapter 4347 Elder of Shu Mountain","paragraphs":["4347 Elder of Shu Mountain","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he replied after a moment of silence, “Sure.”","Then, she led Jian Wushuang to the seventh peak on the left.","Before the two of them reached the seventh peak, they saw a burly man with a tower-like figure pacing back and forth at the foot of the mountain. He would stop from time to time to look outside. When he saw Feng Xin Ruler walking with Jian Wushuang, a simple and honest smile appeared on his face and he ran over with large strides.","“Yi, Feng Xin, you went to the Fiery Sun Star area to fight for the fire Yuan fruit, are you alright?”","A look of loathing appeared in Ruler Feng Xin’s eyes when she saw the towering man. She coldly replied, “Elder Shu Mountain, if something happened to me, would you still be able to see me?”","The iron-tower-like man who was called Elder Shu Mountain was stunned when he heard this. He scratched the back of his head in embarrassment and said, “Feng Xin, you’re right.”","Ruler Feng Xin’s expression was cold. After making a sound of acknowledgment, she said, “Move aside, I want to return to the peak first.”","Elder Shu Mountain nodded. Just as he dodged to the side and was about to ask Feng Xin to move aside, his expression suddenly changed.","“Hold on!”","“What’s going on?” Ruler Feng Xin’s footsteps faltered, and her brows furrowed. “Shu Mountain, what do you want now?”","The honest smile on the elder’s face slowly disappeared. He looked at Jian Wushuang with an unfriendly gaze and said in a deep voice, “Feng Xin, who is this guy?”","There was no trace of the simple and honest look on his face.","Ruler Feng Xin’s expression changed slightly when she heard this question. She felt a headache coming on as she thought, I knew that nothing good would come out of meeting this silly boy.","After taking a deep breath, she said with a calm expression, “This is an old friend who was specially invited by me to meet with me. Is there a problem?”","“Old friend? A gathering?”","Elder Ba Shan squinted his eyes and a glint of light flashed across his green bean-like eyes. He sized up Jian Wushuang and asked coldly, “Kid, let me ask you, what is your relationship with Elder Feng Xin? Also, the seventh peak is filled with women. Why are you going there?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Ruler Feng Xin looked at Jian Wushuang and gave him a meaningful look, hoping that he would agree with her.","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently and said calmly, “What does it have to do with you?”","“What does it have to do with me?”","The elder from Shu Mountain laughed in anger, he said, “Brat, elder Feng Xin is the Dao companion that the Holy Lord was prepared to give me. Do you think this has anything to do with me?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was about to speak again when she raised her eyebrows and said with a frosty face, “Enough! Shu Mountain, let alone the fact that we haven’t become Dao companions, even if we did, you’re not allowed to interfere in my personal affairs!”","Then, she grabbed Jian Wushuang’s sleeve.","“Sir Buqi, let’s go!”","Ruler Feng Xin no longer paid any attention to Elder Shu Mountain. She held Jian Wushuang’s hand and hurried toward the seventh peak.","Behind the two, the face of the elder from Shu Mountain, who had been knocked away by Feng Xin, instantly turned ashen.","He glared at Jian Wushuang and Ruler Feng Xin’s back and clenched his fists so hard that they made cracking sounds.","“Cheap woman, just you wait, this Lord will make you submit to me sooner or later!”","A sinister look appeared on Elder Shu Mountain’s face. He watched Jian Wushuang and Feng Xin’s backs for a moment before he snorted and left.","When Elder Shu Mountain had walked far away, Feng Xin Ruler, who was halfway up the mountain, finally heaved a long sigh of relief. She hurriedly let go of Jian Wushuang’s sleeve and said in fear and trepidation, “Your Excellency Buqi, I had no choice but to offend you just now. Please punish me.”","The scene of Jian Wushuang killing everyone in the Fiery Sun Star area was still vivid in his mind.","She was afraid that Jian Wushuang would start a massacre in the Spirit Jade Holy Land if he was unhappy. If that was the case, no one in the vast spirit Jade Star area would be able to stop Jian Wushuang.","“It’s fine,” Jian Wushuang smiled and asked casually, “Ruler Feng Xin, that elder from the mountains just now was your Dao-companion?”","Ruler Feng Xin couldn’t help but sigh. Helplessly, she said, “I can’t say I’m a Dao companion, it’s just that Sir Holy master acted on his own accord and betrothed me to him.”","A complicated look appeared on her face as she spoke.","Jian Wushuang nodded and didn’t ask any more questions. For him, he only needed to enter the innate fourth fire pool three days later and take the innate fourth fire. As for the love and hatred between the two, he didn’t want to know, nor was he interested.","The seventh peak was millions of feet high. The two of them chatted as they walked up. They didn’t walk fast and only reached the peak after the time for one incense stick to burn.","The seventh peak was just as the elder from Shu Mountain had said. As long as they could see the disciples, they were all valiant and heroic-looking female disciples. When they saw that the usually cold elder Feng Xin had actually brought a man into the seventh peak, their expressions were instantly filled with shock.","“Who’s that man?”","“Could it be elder Feng Xin’s old flame?”","“No wonder elder Feng Xin has been so reluctant to accept Elder Shu Mountain. In terms of looks, this man is indeed much better than the boorish Elder Shu Mountain. It’s just that his cultivation level seems to be a little lower.”","“A second-stage Ruler? Elder Feng Xin is a supreme Ultimate Ruler. This man isn’t worthy of her.”","One mosquito-like discussion after another rang out, causing Feng Xin’s face to instantly flush red.","“So noisy! Don’t you need to cultivate? You’re here gossiping?”","Ruler Feng Xin’s face turned grim as she spoke in a harsh voice.","Immediately, the female disciples of the Spirit Bristle Holy Land were shocked and quickly scattered.","After doing all that, Ruler Feng Xin stole a glance at Jian Wushuang. When she saw that Jian Wushuang’s expression was normal and there were no fluctuations in his emotions, she could not help but sigh in relief.","However, for some reason, she felt a little disappointed.","After making a few turns, she led Jian Wushuang to a secluded hut with red walls and green tiles. The door was filled with purple bamboos. She said, “Sir Buqi, this is my room. You can rest here. I’ll give an order later to not let anyone come near and disturb you. Three days later, when I’m on duty in the innate fourth fire pool, I’ll lead you into the innate fourth fire pool.”","“Yes.”","Jian Wushuang nodded without any change in his expression.","“Then, Sir Buqi, please have a good rest here. I have to report to the sect master about what happened in the Fiery Sun Star area.”","As soon as she finished speaking, she was afraid that Jian Wushuang would overthink, so she quickly added, “Sir Buqi, don’t worry, I won’t tell anyone about you.”","“Go on.”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand to show that he was fine, and then gently pushed open the wooden door of the quiet house.","..."]},{"number":4348,"title":"Chapter 4348 The Curtains of the Great Battle Draw Down","paragraphs":["4348 The Curtains of the Great Battle Draw Down","As he pushed open the wooden door of the quiet house, a faint orchid fragrance assailed his nose. Jian Wushuang’s expression was normal. He found a place to sit down cross-legged and began to refine the ancient bronze cauldron.","He sank into the ancient bronze cauldron. In the chaotic world inside, the fourth fire Qi and the second wood Qi were spreading like two polar forces. They were sticking to each other and spreading.","Three days passed in the blink of an eye.","For Jian Wushuang, these three days were ordinary, but for the entire universe, they were earth-shattering!","With the Divine Life Palace and the Dragon Tribe as the leaders, the unprecedented war between many forces had finally come to an end!","No one had ever thought that the battle that had started with Jian Wushuang and the Tarot Divine Sword would drag down so many top forces!","In the beginning, it was only a war between the Divine Life Palace and the Dragon Tribe. Later, with the entrance of Cosmos Temple, the situation was one-sided, and the Divine Life Palace had no chance to breathe.","Just as the entire universe was sighing for the Divine Life Palace...","Heart Slayer, Red-ear, and purple-haired Supreme from the Nine Emperor Pavilion had arrived!","Suddenly, the situation changed again. The Divine Life Palace and the Nine Emperor Pavilion joined forces to fight against the dragon clan and Cosmos Temple.","If that was the case, it would be fine.","No one would have thought that the four great powers that had previously declared war on the Divine Life Palace-the Blood Sky Hall, the great void godly Palace, the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, and the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom-would charge out again and deal the Divine Palace a fatal blow!","In this battle, the Divine Life Palace had suffered countless losses, and The White Tiger Supreme, one of the five lead Supremes, had fallen.","On that day, the great Dao wailed, and heaven and earth wept together.","Under the attack of the four top forces, the Divine Life Palace once again suffered a disastrous decline. Supreme Giant Axe, who had been shining brilliantly on the battlefield, was seriously injured by the sneak attack of five top Supreme Masters and was forced to leave.","The Divine Life Palace had lost two generals in a row, and their fighting spirit was extremely low.","Just as the Divine Life Palace was in danger, the situation on the battlefield changed again!","The seven divine swords came from the distant starry sky. The sword Qi swept across the starry sky for 30000 feet, and the sword light froze millions of states in the universe!","The Starry Sky Sword Sect was here!","The current sect leader of the Starry Sky Sword Sect, the Martial Sword Immortal, was one of the unrivaled Supremes. After the Tarot Swordmaster, she was the first female sword God in the world!","After the Martial Sword Immortal entered the arena, the situation reversed once again. He slaughtered three major Dragon tribes in a row and forced the Hall Master of Cosmos Temple to retreat continuously.","On that day, the sword Qi shot up to the sky, and the majestic and sharp golden sword light cut in all directions of the untainted land, turning the entire universe into sword shadows.","The number of Supreme martial artists that had died in her hands was no less than five.","The dragon clan, Cosmos Temple, and the four great forces were all terrified.","Even so, the gap between the two Supreme martial artists was still too big.","Just as the Divine Life Palace was continuously shrinking its defensive perimeter and the sect-protecting formation was about to be broken, Supreme Martial Artist Gai Fu, who was so old that he looked like a human, finally took out the Divine Life Palace’s final trump card!","It was the Supreme glory that the Lord of the Divine Life Palace had bestowed upon them when they had participated in the battle of the catastrophe!","For that glory, the ancestors of the Divine Life Palace had suffered countless casualties, and Supreme Master Gai Fu had been injured to this day. Even the palace Master of the Divine Life Palace had disappeared in the Galaxy of the universe, without any news.","This Supreme glory that bloomed in blood was enough to take the next disaster for the Divine Life Palace.","That Lord had made his move.","With that Lord’s attack, this battle had come to an end.","The scale of this war was huge, and many top forces participated. The situation was reversed so quickly that it was rare and soul-stirring. Countless races in the universe who watched the war sighed and were destined to be recorded in history.","However, the most regretful thing was that Jian Wushuang, who should have been the protagonist of the battle, did not show his face at all.","After some people’s inquiries, they found out that Jian Wushuang, who had caused the shocking ore war, had been driven out of the Divine Life Palace long ago and had now wandered to an unknown place.","As a result, the battle with the Divine Life Palace ended, and a reward for Jian Wushuang began!","On that day, the Dragon race that had retreated to the dead star area in the extreme north made another announcement to the universe.","Whoever killed Jian Wushuang would be rewarded with the status of an outer disciple of the dragon clan and would enjoy the eternal protection of the dragon clan!","After the dragon clan, the four major forces and Cosmos Temple also responded.","The one who kills Jian Wushuang will be rewarded with billions of universe origin stones!","Whoever kills Jian Wushuang will be rewarded with the resources of five star areas!","Whoever kills Jian Wushuang will be rewarded with five upper-grade Supreme treasures, ten top-grade divine medicines, and a Supreme martial artist’s full-force attack!","All of a sudden, the name ‘Jian Wushuang’ became a hot name in the universe again!","Many second-rate powers and independent Supreme cultivators took action to search for Jian Wushuang in the universe!","Jian Wushuang’s name no longer represented a person, but a treasure and a great fortune!","The bounty on Jian Wushuang had become the most valuable bounty in the universe since the beginning of time!","...","At the same time.","In the desolate area of the universe, in the seventh peak of the declining Spirit Bristle Holy Land.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes.","Three days had passed, and today was the day Jian Wushuang and Ruler Feng Xin had agreed to go to the innate fourth fire pool.","Du, du, du.","There was a knock on the door, and then a respectful and gentle voice was heard.","“I won’t abandon you, Sir.”","Ruler Feng Xin called out softly from outside the door.","...","“They’re here.”","Jian Wushuang nodded, stood up, and put away the ancient bronze cauldron.","When he walked out of the room, he found that Ruler Feng Xin had been waiting for him for quite some time.","“Lord unforsaken, shall we set off?”","Ruler Feng Xin asked.","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang nodded, then followed Feng Xin to the innate fourth fire pool.","The innate fourth fire pool was located on the back of the planet occupied by the Spirit Bristle Holy Land, which was quite far away from the seventh peak.","“Sir Buqi, the innate fourth fire pool is an important weapon of our Spirit Bristle Holy Land. The security is very strict. However, I know a secret passage that can allow you to enter quietly.”","Ruler Feng Xin said with a smile. Then, he led Jian Wushuang to the secret passage.","After a few days of interaction, although she and Jian Wushuang did not talk much, she had more or less understood Jian Wushuang’s character. She found that although Jian Wushuang was quick to kill, as long as they got along well, Jian Wushuang was not a narrow-minded person who was fickle in emotions.","...","Therefore, she was not as reserved as before when facing Jian Wushuang.","The two of them chatted as they traveled, and the atmosphere was quite harmonious.","“Sir Buqi, have you been paying attention to the big event in the universe recently?” Ruler Feng Xin asked with a smile.","“Something big? What’s the big deal?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and asked.","“Don’t you know? It’s the Great War between the Divine Life Palace and the dragon clan.”","“What?” Ruler Feng Xin asked in surprise."]},{"number":4349,"title":"Chapter 4349 I Am Ashamed","paragraphs":["4349 I Am Ashamed","The Great War between the Divine Life Palace and the dragon clan had swept across the entire universe. Almost everyone in the universe knew about this war.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat. He had been on his way without stopping after leaving the Divine Life Palace, so he really didn’t know much about the battle in the Divine Life Palace.","However, this did not mean that Jian Wushuang had forgotten about the war that had started because of him. In the entire universe, no one was more eager to know the outcome of the war than he was, and no one was more eager to participate in the war than he was!","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang suppressed the anxiety in his heart and made himself look normal. Then, he asked calmly, “What happened to that great battle?”","“Of course,” Ruler Feng Xin replied with a smile, “Sir Buqi, that war is over. Speaking of which, the Divine Life Palace really is quite tenacious. Despite the combined efforts of so many top-class factions, they still managed to hold their own for so long.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s heart skipped a beat. Judging from his tone, could it be that the Divine Life Palace could not hold on any longer?","Immediately, Jian Wushuang suppressed his trembling thoughts and forced a smile on his face. “Tell me in detail.”","Ruler Feng Xin thought for a moment, then nodded. “Alright, but I don’t know much either. It’s just some of the most widely circulated news in the universe.”","She slowly began to talk about the battle in the Divine Life Palace.","She was talking to herself. When she mentioned the heavy casualties of the Divine Life Palace, she didn’t notice that Jian Wushuang’s face had long become sorrowful.","Speaking of which, The White Tiger Supreme of the Divine Life Palace was really powerful. He fought three top-tier Supremes alone and even killed one of them before he died, perishing together with them...","Jian Wushuang clenched his fists so tightly that his nails dug into his flesh that they turned red without him noticing.","He hadn’t spent much time with The White Tiger Supreme Master, but in his impression, The White Tiger Supreme Master was extremely fond of fighting. At the same time, he was a straightforward and generous Supreme Master. He had once saved his life with the help of the Supreme Giant Axe and the others.","Unexpectedly, even the White Tiger Supreme had fallen in this battle.","After that, Supreme Giant Axe was ambushed by the five top Supreme martial artists and was seriously injured. If not for the Blood Wave Supreme’s timely assistance, he would have followed in the footsteps of White Tiger Supreme...","Jian Wushuang felt a sense of sorrow as Ruler Feng Xin continued to speak.","Although Supreme Giant Axe was a man of few words, Jian Wushuang could feel his love and care for him.","In Jian Wushuang’s opinion, Supreme Giant Axe was only second to Blood Wave Supreme in the Divine Life Palace.","After taking three deep breaths, Jian Wushuang finally managed to suppress the throbbing thoughts in his heart.","She was only an ordinary Ruler in the desolate regions of the universe, so she didn’t know much. She only knew that the war had suddenly ended at the end, and Supreme Being Gai Fu had fallen into a deep sleep.","supreme white Tiger has fallen. Supreme Giant Axe is dying from his injuries. Supreme Gai Fu is in. Deep sleep. Even more disciples of the Divine Life Palace have died...","Jian Wushuang felt as if there was a huge stone pressing on his heart. It was exceptionally heavy.","The entire Divine Life Palace was almost destroyed because of him.","“The dragon clan! Cosmos Temple! The Great Sun Divine Kingdom! The Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom!","“I, Jian Wushuang, am ashamed of the Divine Life Palace.”","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang made a decision.","“The dragon clan! Cosmos Temple! The Great Sun Divine Kingdom! The Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom! The Great Void Temple! The Blood Sky Palace! I, Jian Wushuang, will remember this!”","“Today, I, Jian Wushuang, make a great promise. In this life, if I don’t destroy The Six Forces, I’m not a human!”","The sorrow faded and waves of killing intent were suppressed by Jian Wushuang, surging in his chest.","“No, Sir Buqi, what’s wrong?”","“What’s going on?” Feng Xin, who had been talking to Jian Wushuang, was shocked when she saw Jian Wushuang’s cold expression.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and his expression returned to normal. He said lightly, “I’m fine.”","Ruler Feng Xin didn’t dare to ask any more questions. She nodded and continued to lead Jian Wushuang toward the innate fourth fire pool.","Not long after, a large lake appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","“Sir Buqi,” Ruler Feng Xin said, “the passage to the connate fourth fire pond is in that Lake.”","Jian Wushuang nodded. Without much consideration, he took a step forward and suddenly shot toward the lake. After a muffled sound, ripples spread on the surface of the lake and Jian Wushuang disappeared.","Ruler Feng Xin didn’t stay on the lake for too long. She also left, heading off in another direction.","What she didn’t notice was that after the time it took for an incense stick to burn, a tall and burly Man in Black took a step out and revealed his figure from the void.","“Cheap woman, do you think you’re the only one who knows about the passage to the innate fourth fire pool? Hmph, you actually colluded with outsiders to steal the innate fourth fire Qi from the sect. I’ll report this matter to the Holy master and see how you deal with it!”","“And that brat, you dare to come to my Spirit Bristle Holy Land to steal the innate fourth fire Qi, you’re dead!”","This tall and burly man had a pair of beady eyes, and his face was filled with ruthlessness. He was none other than Elder Shu Mountain, who had followed them all the way here!","A fierce light flashed in his eyes. After thinking for a moment, he decided to turn around and leave to report this matter to the Spirit Bristle Holy Land’s Holy Lord.","Gulp.","Suddenly, a circle of ripples appeared on the calm lake.","BOOM!","Immediately after, the entire surface of the lake exploded. A huge hand formed from a towering divine power broke out of the lake and grabbed at Elder Shu Mountain!","“This!”","Elder Shu Mountain’s expression changed drastically. He raised his hand and unleashed a sacred art, blasting it toward the huge hand.","Bang!","However, when Elder Shu Mountain’s Divine Art landed on the huge hand, it was like an egg smashing into a rock, instantly shattering. Immediately after, the huge hand pressed down and grabbed Elder Shu Mountain ruthlessly. It pulled him back and dragged him into the lake.","Gulp.","The surface of the lake returned to its calm state, as if nothing had happened.","...","At the bottom of the lake.","...","Elder Shu Mountain looked at Jian Wushuang in fear and said with trembling lips, “You, Who are you? What do you want to do?”","“Be smarter in your next life, and don’t be so curious.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him and with a squeeze of his hand, he crushed the elder into powder, killing him in both body and soul.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang’s expression was indifferent, as if he had just done something insignificant.","Jian Wushuang looked down at the other side of the lake. There was a Whirlpool that looked like a wormhole. From the whirlpool, hot air was spurting out.","“This should be the passage to the innate fourth fire pool.”","Jian Wushuang took a heavy step forward and shot toward the whirlpool like a cannonball, leaving a long trail of white waves at the bottom of the lake."]},{"number":4350,"title":"Chapter 4350 Devouring","paragraphs":["4350 Devouring","Gulp!","The whirlpool was a long and narrow passage. After Jian Wushuang plunged into the whirlpool, he continued to shoot forward. Gradually, he felt the surrounding lake water getting hotter and hotter. There was even a trace of fire in front of him!","After an unknown amount of time.","Pfft!","!!","As if he had passed through the hyperthermal layer, Jian Wushuang instantly broke out of the water and was shocked by the scene in front of him.","After passing through the narrow passage, the field of vision in front of him suddenly widened. A huge furnace and fire pool appeared in front of him.","This smelting furnace’s fire pool was at least 30000 meters in size and was hidden deep underground. Countless blood-red flames that were as viscous as water were constantly emerging and burning the void.","“This...this is all Xiantian fourth fire Qi!”","Jian Wushuang was overjoyed. He had only absorbed a finger-sized second wood Qi to awaken the ancient bronze cauldron. Then, he absorbed a fist-sized fourth fire Qi to further improve the cauldron.","But now, if this ocean-like innate fourth fire was completely absorbed by the ancient bronze cauldron, how much would it grow?","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and the ancient bronze cauldron in his interspatial ring shook violently like never before!","“Scatter!”","Jian Wushuang opened his right hand and made a grabbing motion at the smelting furnace and fire pool. In an instant, countless divine power gushed out from his hand and formed a huge sealed space in the innate fourth fire pool.","After that, Jian Wushuang stopped suppressing the cauldron and let it fly out of his Interspatial Ring.","“Whoosh!”","In an instant, the ancient bronze cauldron floated in the air and spun rapidly, letting out a few long howls.","In the next moment, the ancient bronze cauldron seemed to have turned into a monarch of fire. Like a whale sucking in water, countless connate fourth fire Qi rushed out of the pool and quickly poured into the ancient bronze cauldron!","One, two, three...","In the blink of an eye, countless Xiantian fourth fire Qi interwove with each other and came from all directions, with the ancient bronze cauldron as the center. He poured it into the ancient bronze cauldron!","They were densely packed, covering the sky and the sun, and were mighty!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang blinked his eyes. The ancient bronze cauldron wouldn’t absorb all the innate fourth fire Qi here, would it?","One had to know that this innate fourth fire Qi was the foundation of the Spirit Bristle Holy Land’s cultivation.","“Forget it, I don’t care anymore.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and sat down with his legs crossed. He slowly closed his eyes and divine power gushed out of his arms to refine the ancient bronze cauldron.","Three years had passed.","...","Outside the innate fourth fire pool.","Ruler Feng Xin quietly sat there in the Lotus position, her brows slightly furrowed.","She sometimes lowered her head to look at the sealed innate fourth fire pond, and sometimes raised her head to look into the distance. There was a touch of anxiety on her face that could not be resolved.","“It’s been three years. Why hasn’t Sir Buqi come out yet?”","Ruler Feng Xin looked a little worried. It had been three years since Jian Wushuang had entered the innate fourth fire pool. During that time, she had not seen any trace of Jian Wushuang, but she could feel that the fourth fire Qi in the innate fourth fire pool was decreasing at a visible rate.","She couldn’t help but feel nervous. If Jian Wushuang had only absorbed a little bit of innate fourth fire Qi, it wouldn’t have mattered. She could have brought Jian Wushuang here and then left quietly without anyone noticing.","However, if Jian Wushuang absorbed too much, the result would be very different!","This innate fourth fire pool was the innate fourth fire Qi that the Spirit Bristle Holy Land had accumulated over tens of thousands of chaos cycles. Even as an elder of the Spirit Bristle Holy Land, she had to report to the sacred land’s master if she wanted to use even a little bit of innate fourth fire Qi.","However, in the three years that she had been guarding the innate fourth fire pond, the innate fourth fire Qi that the innate fourth fire pond had consumed was the amount that the entire Spirit Bristle Holy Land had consumed for several chaos cycles!","With such a huge consumption, once the matter was exposed, even if she was crushed to death, she would not be able to bear the responsibility!","Just as she was feeling uneasy, she suddenly heard a series of hurried footsteps behind her.","“Who is it?”","Ruler cherished heart instantly felt his heart clench.","“Elder Feng Xin, it’s me. Sir Holy master sent me here to obtain some innate fourth fire Qi.”","A boy with a gourd in his hand walked in.","When Ruler Feng Xin saw this, she couldn’t help but relax. Fortunately, he was only a servant of the sacred Lord.","“En, give me the gourd. You can just wait for me here.”","Ruler Feng Xin said, pretending to be calm.","“Alright, then I’ll have to trouble you, Elder Feng Xin.”","The small child grinned.","“It’s no trouble at all.”","Ruler Feng Xin chuckled, then took the gourd and thrust it into a fist-sized hole. Instantly, an endless stream of fourth-flame Qi began to pour in, filling the gourd.","Seeing that everything was fine, the boy casually said, “Elder Feng Xin, the Holy master wants to ask me something. Has anything happened to the innate fourth fire pool recently?”","Ruler Feng Xin’s heart trembled when she heard this. She didn’t turn her head and forced a smile. “I’m personally guarding this place, so what could possibly happen?”","The child nodded, not noticing the change in her tone. He casually said, “Elder Feng Xin, do you know where Elder Shu Mountain went? Recently, the Holy master has been looking for him, so he’s been searching the entire Holy Land but hasn’t seen him.”","“Oh? The Shu Mountain is gone?”","Ruler Feng Xin raised an eyebrow.","“That’s right. Speaking of which, Elder Shu Mountain has disappeared for quite some time now. Ever since you returned from your mission, everyone has only seen him once, and not once.”","...","“...Perhaps he went to find a place to cultivate in seclusion?”","Ruler Feng Xin’s heart trembled. For some reason, she had a faint feeling that the news about Elder Shu Mountain had to do with Jian Wushuang.","“It should be.”","The boy didn’t suspect anything. A few moments later, Feng Xin handed the gourd to the boy, who immediately thanked her and waved his hand.”Elder Feng Xin, I won’t stay here any longer, Sir Holy master is still waiting for the fourth fire Qi.”","“Take care, then I won’t see you out.”","A few moments later, the boy left, allowing Feng Xin to let out a long sigh of relief.","Then, she looked down at the sealed gate of the innate fourth fire pit again, more and more worry in her eyes.","There were still seven years left before the shift would start again. At that time, the decrease in the fourth fire Qi in the innate fourth fire pool would definitely be discovered.","...","In the blink of an eye, another seven years had passed.","Inside the innate fourth fire pool.","...","The Xiantian fourth fire Qi that was originally a vast ocean had already shrunk by a large degree. In ten years, the Xiantian fourth fire Qi in this Xiantian fourth fire pool had decreased by at least seventy percent!","The ancient bronze cauldron floated in the air like a giant Taotie, devouring large amounts of innate fourth fire Qi tirelessly!"]},{"number":4351,"title":"Chapter 4351 Exit Seclusion!","paragraphs":["4351 Exit Seclusion!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The bronze cauldron floated in the air, spinning.","In an instant, streams of innate fourth fire Qi as thick as a finger shot out of the pool like small snakes, then automatically poured into the ancient bronze cauldron and were completely devoured and refined.","For a whole ten years, the ancient bronze cauldron had been absorbing the innate fourth fire Qi. The innate fourth fire pool, which was originally bottomless, was now close to the bottom!","!!","After devouring a large amount of Xiantian fourth fire Qi, the ancient bronze cauldron’s appearance had changed again!","The originally simple and unadorned cauldron was now covered in flame patterns. These flame patterns flowed and spread, turning the pitch-black Cauldron into a demonic red.","Bursts of explosive power emanated from the ancient bronze cauldron. Just one look at the power would make one shiver.","If it wasn’t for the divine power that Jian Wushuang had set up to seal the power, the entire spirit puppet sanctuary would have submitted to the power.","In the void not far from the cauldron, Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged with his eyes closed. His black hair drooped down like an ancient statue.","In the past ten years, his refining speed of the cauldron had never been faster. He had refined 30% of the cauldron!","He could even try to control the innate fourth fire Qi in the bronze cauldron, as well as the tiny wisp of innate second wood Qi!","What kind of concept was this?","Since the ancient times, no one had ever heard of anyone who could control the innate five elements Qi!","What was the Xiantian realm?","It was the highest level of energy in the universe, formed by chaos and the heavenly Dao!","This kind of innate five elements Qi could be used to assist cultivation, to comprehend, and to create one’s own acquired power of five elements.","For example, the previous Five Elements Divine Lord and the current Spirit Bristle Holy Land used it this way.","However, it was impossible to control the innate five elements Qi directly.","Or even if there was, Jian Wushuang had never heard of it.","“It’ll probably take a few more days for the innate fourth fire energy in this innate fourth fire pool to be completely absorbed.”","“And this ancient bronze cauldron will reach a state of saturation in the innate fourth fire Qi of the five elements.”","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a red light flashed in his eyes.","At the same time, he made a decision in his heart. After he left the innate fourth fire pond, he would leave behind a large number of universe origin stones and law Supreme treasures as compensation to the Spirit Bristle Holy Land.","Jian Wushuang had never been a person who liked to take advantage of others. Since the innate fourth fire Qi in the innate fourth fire pool had been completely absorbed by the ancient bronze cauldron, he would find a way to make up for it from other places.","He had been fighting all over the years. First, he had obtained the Tarot treasure trove in the Tarot ruins. Then, he had plundered the Ancient Path of Stars for tens of thousands of years. The heavenly materials and earthly treasures and universe origin stones he had accumulated were probably not even comparable to those of some top-tier supreme beings.","Therefore, he was also confident that the treasures he left for the Spirit Bristle Holy Land would not be less valuable than this pool of innate fourth fire Qi.","...","Outside the innate fourth fire pool.","“What’s going on?” Ruler vegetarheart began to pace back and forth anxiously.","Today was the day of duty for the Xiantian fourth fire pond in the Spirit Bristle Holy Land. The elder who had come for the duty had been waiting outside for a long time.","“What should we do now?”","Ruler Feng Xin turned to glance at the mirror, which displayed the total amount of connate fourth fire Qi, and her face instantly filled with despair.","On the surface of the profound light mirror, the Xiantian fourth fire Qi was less than 10% left. There was only a shallow layer left!","If the elder on duty saw her, she would know that she was finished.","“Feng Xin! What the hell are you doing? How long do I have to wait outside?”","Outside the innate fourth fire pond, Elder Yan Fu, who was in charge of taking over the duty, said impatiently.","“Elder Yan Fu, it’ll take a while. Please wait for a while.","“Yes!” Ruler Feng Xin forced a smile onto her face as she loudly replied.","Her voice was trembling.","Hearing this, Elder Yan Fu snorted and said, “Feng Xin, I don’t care what you’re up to. I’ll give you the time it takes for an incense stick to burn. After that, I’ll come in regardless of whether you agree or not.”","After he said this, the innate fourth fire pool was silent and no one replied.","Di di di da ~~","Time passed by slowly, and the time for one incense stick to burn was up.","Elder Yan Fu, who was standing guard outside the innate fourth fire pond, couldn’t wait any longer. His face suddenly turned gloomy.","“Feng Xin, I’d like to see what you’re up to!”","Bang!","In the next moment, he struck out his right palm and hit the bronze door outside the innate fourth fire pool.","The innate fourth fire pond located in the Spirit Bristle Holy Land was like a circle that kept extending out, one ring after another. Each ring was guarded by the Spirit Bristle Holy Land’s disciples, the Yan clan, and the core was the innate fourth fire pond located in the deepest part!","And outside was the elder guard area where Ruler Feng Xin was.","BOOM!","As Elder Yan Fu slammed his right palm onto the bronze gate, an earth-shaking explosion occurred!","The intensity of the vibration was like an earthquake in the entire Spirit Bristle Holy Land. The earth cracked and the void shattered. It was like the end of the world!","The wind howled, the world changed colors, and the world seemed to fall into chaos again!","No words could describe the power of this vibration!","...","“This is?”","Elder Yan Fu’s expression changed drastically. He knew that the earth-shaking force wasn’t caused by his palm.","Before he could think further, the next moment!","Pfft!","A huge shock wave exploded from the fourth fire pool and spread out in all directions. It instantly shattered the ancient bronze door and hit Elder Yan Fu hard, sending him flying for nearly ten thousand feet!","What is it?!!","Elder Yan Fu fell to the ground and cried out in shock.","In his horrified eyes, he saw a fiery-red ancient bronze cauldron rush out from the core of the innate fourth fire pool and shoot into the distance.","Then, his vision blurred and he saw a young man in a black robe with long hair and a beard. He did not look rough, but he was following closely behind the ancient bronze cauldron.","“You’ve grown a little bit of ability and now you want to escape?”","Jian Wushuang was so angry that he laughed. A cold light flashed in his eyes and he reached out his right hand to grab the escaping bronze cauldron.","...","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang performed the secret skill of dragon blood. Boundless divine power that was tens of thousands of times stronger gushed out madly and suppressed the ancient bronze cauldron.","Boom, boom, boom!","The cauldron shook violently, trying to break free from Jian Wushuang’s grasp.","However, Jian Wushuang’s five well-defined fingers seemed to be made of molten iron. No matter how the cauldron struggled, it did not move and suppressed it.","Sharp sword Qi burst out from his fingers and struck the bronze cauldron!","Gradually, the cauldron’s struggle weakened.","Jian Wushuang felt the huge power in the cauldron gradually disappear, and the coldness in his eyes became even more intense. Fortunately, he had refined 30% of the cauldron. Otherwise, he was afraid that he would not be able to suppress the cauldron that had absorbed the pond full of innate fourth fire Qi with his own strength!"]},{"number":4352,"title":"Chapter 4352 Spirit Bristle Divine Lord","paragraphs":["4352 Spirit Bristle Divine Lord","“Now you’re being honest?”","Jian Wushuang snorted and put the cauldron back into his interspatial ring.","Raising his head, Jian Wushuang was slightly stunned. The spirit puppet sanctuary under his feet had been reduced to ruins by the shock wave of the ancient bronze cauldron. Countless disciples of the spirit puppet sanctuary were looking up at him in shock.","“W-Who are you?”","!!","Elder Yan Fu sat in the middle of a broken wall and stared at Jian Wushuang in fear.","Jian Wushuang let out an ‘uh’ and felt a little guilty.","Da da da da da.","A series of hurried footsteps came from behind Jian Wushuang.","He immediately saw Sacred Heart, who had also been battered by the shockwave, run over.","“I won’t abandon you, Sir.”","Ruler Feng Xin’s chest heaved slightly as she panted.","Elder Yan Fu’s eyes narrowed. He looked at Jian Wushuang and then at Feng Xin. In the end, he seemed to understand something and his expression changed.","“Alright! Feng Xin, you actually colluded with outsiders to enter the innate fourth fire pool! You’re in big trouble!”","As soon as he finished speaking, he saw a stream of fire with a tail of flames shooting toward him from the seven peaks of the spiritual spirals sect!","Under the stream of fire, a sonic boom was set off!","In just a few seconds, the flaming light appeared in front of everyone.","The flames dissipated, revealing a dignified middle-aged man with a head full of red hair and two balls of fire in his eyes.","“Sir Holy master!”","“Greetings, Saint Lord!!”","“Yes!” The Spirit Bristle Holy Land disciples, Feng Xin Ruler, and Elder Yan Fu immediately knelt down on one knee.","This dignified middle-aged man was the Spirit Bristle Holy Land’s current Holy Lord!","At that moment, Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s face was ashen. She first looked at Jian Wushuang coldly before looking at Ruler Feng Xin. “First, take me to the innate fourth fire pool.”","Ruler Feng Xin trembled at these words. No one understood the situation in the innate fourth fire pit better than she did.","The Xiantian fourth fire that had been accumulated over tens of thousands of chaos cycles in the pool was now completely gone.","She didn’t dare to imagine what state Spirit Bristle Divine Lord would be in if she saw this scene.","“Yes!”","Taking a deep breath, Sacred Heart braced himself and said.","Then, Ruler long Xin led Spirit Bristle Divine Lord toward the innate fourth fire pool.","The innate fourth fire pond was hidden underground. Two doors made of ten-thousand-year-old ice cold Xuan iron firmly sealed the innate fourth fire pond.","At this moment, the two doors made of ice cold Xuan metal had been completely blown apart by the ancient bronze cauldron, revealing a huge hole.","Numerous burning auras came out from the hole.","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s face was dark as she walked toward the hole. She only lowered her head to take a look.","In an instant, Spirit Bristle Divine Lord felt as if she had fallen into an ice cellar, and her expression was completely stunned.","“Xiantian...where’s Ding Huo?”","The next moment.","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s body trembled. Under his gaze, he saw that the innate fourth fire pond, which had originally stored a lot of innate fourth fire energy, was now empty. Not a single drop of innate fourth fire energy was left.","“Where’s the Xiantian fourth fire?!!!”","“Arghh!” A heart-wrenching howl came from Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s mouth.","Then, Spirit Bristle Divine Lord suddenly turned her head and looked at Ruler Feng Xin and Jian Wushuang with hatred. She was so angry that her body trembled.","“You...you all deserve to die!!!","“BOOM!”","The aura of an unrivaled Ruler exploded with Spirit Bristle Divine Lord as the center!","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord was instantly enraged to the extreme!","“You...!” Ruler Feng Xin’s hair immediately stood on end, and a thin layer of cold sweat appeared on her forehead.","She was about to speak when Jian Wushuang took a step forward and stood in front of her.","“Your mission is complete. Leave the rest to me.”","Jian Wushuang smiled at her and turned to look at Spirit Bristle Divine Lord. He said in a deep voice, “Spirit Bristle Divine Lord, things have come to this. Listen to me...”","“I said, your grandma!”","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s face turned green. She immediately took a step forward and grabbed Jian Wushuang!","At this moment, he was already in a rage. How could he listen to the second half of the sentence?","Clang!","A golden divine spear suddenly appeared in Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s hand. He took a step forward, and endless flames appeared around his legs as he stepped through the air!","Every step he took left a flame mark in the air.","“Go to hell!”","...","In the next moment, Holy Lord spirit Luan thrust forward and the Golden divine spear was aimed at Jian Wushuang’s head!","Countless flames spurted out from the tip of the divine spear!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang frowned slightly and jumped back to avoid the stab. At the same time, he said in a deep voice, “Spirit Bristle Divine Lord, calm down first.”","“I can’t calm down!!!”","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s eyes were bloodshot as she panted. If there weren’t so many disciples present, she would have cried.","The innate fourth fire pool was the foundation of the Spirit Bristle Holy Land for tens of thousands of chaos cycles. Now, it had all been used by Jian Wushuang.","Who could stand this?","After Spirit Bristle Divine Lord finished roaring, she charged forward again. The blazing golden spear in her hand was like a storm hitting a banana leaf or like big and small beads falling on a Jade plate. She instantly brandished thousands of Spears and stabbed Jian Wushuang.","Shua shua shua!","Countless spear shadows overlapped and interweaved together. Every spear thrust was like a roaring fire Dragon, terrifying to the extreme.","Jian Wushuang tilted his head slightly. He dodged the spear shadows easily.","...","Until now, Jian Wushuang thought that it would be best to resolve this matter peacefully. After all, he was the one who took away the foundation of the Spirit Bristle Holy Land first.","However, Jian Wushuang’s continuous retreat didn’t make Spirit Bristle Divine Lord have any intention of stopping. Instead, the fight became more intense. In the end, every spear attack of Spirit Bristle Divine Lord was headed straight for Jian Wushuang’s Mingmen.","“You’re not done?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and his face turned cold.","“Alright. Since you won’t listen to me, I’ll beat you into submission first, then I’ll tell you.”","Innate divine power, original universe!","Pfff!","In an instant, a boundary power descended on the entire scene!","Under the power of the boundary, Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s aura weakened rapidly while Jian Wushuang’s aura rose rapidly!","Gradually, Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s speed slowed down.","The next moment, he thrust his spear forward and the raging flame golden spear in his hand was caught by Jian Wushuang.","“What?”","“You...” Spirit Bristle Divine Lord was stunned for a moment before she let out an angry roar. Divine power surged in her body as she pulled her hands back.","He did not move.","He pulled again.","He still didn’t move.","“What’s this?”","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s body stiffened and she slowly raised her head to look at Jian Wushuang.","He saw Jian Wushuang holding the blazing divine spear in his right hand and looking down at him expressionlessly."]},{"number":4353,"title":"Chapter 4353 Smashing People With a Cauldron","paragraphs":["4353 Smashing People With a Cauldron","Jian Wushuang’s divine power was tens of thousands of times greater than that of Spirit Bristle Divine Lord. With the help of the original universe, the gap between him and Spirit Bristle Divine Lord had reached an incredible level!","“Are you done?”","Jian Wushuang spat out these words indifferently.","“I...”","!!","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s face turned red, and she stuttered, unable to say a word.","“Since you’ve fought enough, can we have a good talk?”","With a calm expression, Jian Wushuang released his grip on the Golden spear.","In that instant, Spirit Bristle Divine Lord, who didn’t have time to stop her power, almost fell from the sky.","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord, who was holding the blazing flame golden spear tightly, smiled angrily again.","“Hmph, you stole my Holy Land’s heritage, and now you have the nerve to tell me to talk nicely?”","“If you want this sect master to speak properly, then receive this move of mine first!”","Secret skill, true Sevenfold flame!","“Die!” Spirit Bristle Divine Lord shouted as she rubbed her hands together.","In an instant, the Golden spear disappeared and turned into a pool of golden flames.","As soon as the golden flame appeared, it turned the entire sky and land into a sea of fire as if it was burning the sky!","Jian Wushuang, who was in the sea of fire, was like a small boat in the raging sea, as if he would be swallowed by the sea of fire at any time.","“Go to hell!”","“You’re courting death!” Spirit Bristle Divine Lord grinned and pulled with her hands again. The golden flames instantly turned into a lifelike golden fire dragon. Each scale was shining, and it stepped on flames.","“Go!”","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord roared and pushed forward. In an instant, the golden fire dragon roared and pounced toward Jian Wushuang!","“You’re so stubborn.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. He had wanted to use divine general Wu Qi to cut the fire Dragon into pieces, but he seemed to have thought of something. Instead of taking out Wuqi Divine Sword, he turned his right hand and an ancient bronze cauldron appeared in his hand.","The ancient bronze cauldron was suppressed by Jian Wushuang’s divine power. It had recovered from its original power and was like a black iron lump, not eye-catching at all.","“It’s a good time to test your power.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and threw the ancient bronze cauldron at the fire Dragon.","However, Jian Wushuang was afraid that the cauldron would smash Spirit Bristle Divine Lord into ashes, so he controlled his power and only used less than ten percent of the cauldron’s power.","Bang!","The ancient bronze cauldron drew a parabola in the air and smashed into the mouth of the fire Dragon formed by the true fire of Sevenfold!","Chi chi chi chi!","There was no resistance at all. Like a sledgehammer smashing tofu, the powerful Fire Dragon was directly shattered inch by inch, turning into countless fire stars that scattered!","This wasn’t the end. After the ancient bronze cauldron smashed the fire Dragon, it spun and once again smashed toward Spirit Bristle Divine Lord!","“What the hell is this?”","“What?!” Spirit Bristle Divine Lord was stunned. A black lump of metal rushed out of the countless sparks and kept enlarging in his eyes!","Clang!","In the end, the ancient bronze cauldron drew an extremely beautiful arc in the air and smashed straight into his head.","“What did I get hit by?”","This was the last thought that flashed through the mind of Spirit Bristle Divine Lord.","Immediately, his vision turned black and he passed out.","Whoosh.","The unconscious Spirit Bristle Divine Lord fell to the ground, raising a cloud of dust.","“Holy Lord!!”","“You actually dared to kill the Holy Master?!!”","“How dare you!” Countless Spirit Bristle Holy Land disciples and nine peak elders roared.","However, although they looked hesitant and eager, none of them dared to step forward and face Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang ignored them and looked at the cauldron. He raised his eyebrows and his eyes lit up.","This was the first time he had used the bronze cauldron against an enemy. He had tried his best to control the power of the cauldron and only used 10% of its original power.","He didn’t expect that even so, Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s divine body was on the verge of collapse, and her divine soul was directly blocked under the heavy blow.","This was an invincible Ruler!","If he were to use the innate Qi in the ancient bronze cauldron, how powerful would he be?","“It seems like the power of this cauldron is far beyond my imagination.”","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he had a lot of thoughts.","After a while, Jian Wushuang stretched out his right hand and made a grabbing motion. Boundless divine power gushed out and he grabbed the ancient bronze cauldron back. He then put it into his Interspatial Ring.","“Don’t worry, your Holy Master is fine.”","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and glanced at the people from Spirit Bristle Holy Land.","...","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s gaze, they shuddered.","They had finally seen clearly that the dark object that had knocked their sect master out was an ancient bronze cauldron!","Knocked unconscious by a cauldron?","This was too fierce!","...","A month passed.","During this month, Jian Wushuang did not leave Spirit Bristle Holy Land. Instead, he quietly waited for spirit puppet Holy Lord to wake up.","To Jian Wushuang, Spirit Bristle Holy Land was just an ordinary force that could be destroyed with a flip of his hand. However, he, Jian Wushuang, never liked to owe others anything. He had said before that he would give resources to compensate Spirit Bristle Holy Land, so he would naturally do as he said.","At the top of the seventh peak of the Spirit Bristle Holy Land, there was a cliff that overlooked the entire Spirit Bristle Holy Land.","Jian Wushuang sat on the edge of the cliff with his legs crossed, comprehending the great Dao in silence.","Ruler Feng Xin stood behind Jian Wushuang respectfully like a servant.","...","Ever since Jian Wushuang had defeated Spirit Bristle Divine Lord with one move using the ancient bronze cauldron a month ago, she had been completely convinced by Jian Wushuang.","“Sir Buqi, Sir Holy master has already woken up early this morning,”","Ruler Feng Xin said respectfully.","Jian Wushuang’s back was facing Feng Xin. He nodded and stood up.","“Alright. Let’s go, follow me to see him.”","“Yes!”","After a while, Jian Wushuang saw Spirit Bristle Divine Lord in the sect master’s Hall of Spirit Bristle Divine Land.","Although Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s godly body was still covered in cracks and was still weak, her complexion had recovered a lot.","However, his entire person was like a frosted eggplant. He looked dispirited and sighed in a low voice, as if he had aged decades.","He looked at Jian Wushuang, who was walking into the hall step by step. The anger on his face had disappeared and was replaced by a touch of helplessness.","“Sir, you’ve already taken the innate fourth fire and I’m not your match, what else do you want? My temple is small and can’t take any more trouble.”","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord said helplessly.","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Sir Holy master, don’t worry, I’m only here to make amends.”","“Compensation?”","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord, who was originally depressed like a frosted eggplant, suddenly became energetic. She straightened her back and her eyes shone."]},{"number":4354,"title":"Chapter 4354 Collecting the Five Elements","paragraphs":["4354 Collecting the Five Elements","“Your Excellency, how do you plan to compensate me?”","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s eyes lit up as she clicked her tongue.","Jian Wushuang was speechless. If only Spirit Bristle Divine Lord had such an attitude earlier.","After a pause, Jian Wushuang pondered for a while and said, “100 million universe origin stones, 50 top-tier divine herbs, 50 top-tier divine materials, and 10 top-tier law true treasures...”","!!","Jian Wushuang spoke slowly. Every time he mentioned a compensation, Spirit Bristle Divine Lord’s eyelids could not help but twitch. By the time he finished speaking, Spirit Bristle Divine Lord was already seeing stars.","“This, this...”","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord swallowed her saliva, and her arms trembled with excitement.","100 million universe origin stones were enough to buy dozens of star fields like the Spirit Bristle Holy Land in this desolate area of the universe!","Fifty top-tier divine herbs could nurture many Ultimate Rulers. There were also fifty top-tier divine materials and ten top-tier law true treasures!","The heavens had pity on him. In this huge Spirit Bristle Holy Land, only he, the Spirit Bristle Divine Lord, had a top-tier law true treasure.","The Spirit Bristle Holy Land had been in decline for far too long. Anything of value in the Holy Land had long been plundered clean by other forces.","This is enough to increase the strength of my Spirit Bristle Holy Land by several times!","“What?” Spirit Bristle Divine Lord exclaimed.","Jian Wushuang smiled and said, “Spirit Bristle Divine Lord, even if the resources I’m offering aren’t as good as the innate fourth fire Qi in the pond, it’s almost the same. What do you think?”","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord muttered to herself. Even if she didn’t agree, what could she do?","“Good! Then it’s a deal!”","Spirit Bristle Divine Lord gritted her teeth.","Jian Wushuang nodded in satisfaction.","“Good.”","Jian Wushuang immediately handed over an interspatial ring to let Spirit Bristle Divine Lord settle the bill.","Half a day later, Jian Wushuang bade farewell and left under the gazes of everyone from the Spirit Bristle Holy Land.","...","Outside the Spirit Bristle Holy Land.","“Sir Buqi, aren’t you going to stay any longer?”","Ruler Feng Xin said with some reluctance.","She did not know why, but during the time she followed Jian Wushuang, she had slowly formed a dependence on him, as well as an inexplicable, inexplicable feeling that even she herself was not clear about.","“I’m not staying.”","Jian Wushuang smiled at her.","Then, Jian Wushuang cupped his hands at her and said, “Don’t send me off. We’ll part ways here.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang took a step with his right foot and suddenly turned into a flowing light, shooting into the distant starry sky like a small boat sailing into the sea of stars.","Ruler Feng Xin looked at Jian Wushuang’s back as he gradually disappeared into the horizon. A hint of melancholy appeared on her face. If she left today, she was afraid that they would never see each other again.","...","In the vast sea of stars, Jian Wushuang was refining the ancient bronze cauldron while driving the universe boat toward the depths of the desolate universe.","In the blink of an eye, ten thousand years had passed.","In the past ten thousand years, Jian Wushuang kept changing his name and appearance. He traveled in the wild areas of the universe and collected the innate five elements Qi.","After 10,000 years of collecting, he had already collected four of the innate five elements Qi, which were the Yi wood Qi, the D fire Qi, the Geng metal Qi, and the hai water Qi. As long as he collected the third Earth Qi, he would be able to complete the collection of the innate five elements!","The ancient bronze cauldron would also be truly opened!","However, the difficulty of finding the innate earth element Qi was much higher than the other four innate Qi!","Jian Wushuang had searched for three thousand years, but he had not found any information about the innate Earth Qi.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang slowed down and started to comprehend the great Dao.","In these 10000 years, he wandered around the secular world. Sometimes he was like a scholar traveling far away with books, sometimes like an old scholar, sometimes like a swordsman on horseback, watching hundreds of sects fighting for power, watching layers of forests being stained, watching the rise and fall of the tide, watching other people’s lives.","He saw the high-spirited youth, the steady middle-aged man, and the understanding of the world in old age.","Jian Wushuang gradually realized that everything in life was decided by the heavens, just like reincarnation.","However, the more Jian Wushuang looked at it, the more lost he became.","What was Dao?","It was like seeing a mountain as a mountain, but seeing a mountain as a mountain was not a mountain. Jian Wushuang had now entered a bottleneck state.","However, Jian Wushuang knew that although he was lost, he was the closest to comprehending the great Dao!","Once he truly glimpses the heavenly Dao, he would be like a reincarnated Nirvana, truly soaring up and comprehending the true meaning of the great Dao!","From there, he would be able to get a glimpse of the opportunity to become a Supreme Divine Realm expert!","...","In an unknown Starfield, in a world called the thousand forest world.","Jian Wushuang had turned into an old scholar with white hair and beard. He held a walking stick and walked on the official road outside the city with a slightly hunched body.","Leng Rushuang walked next to him. She turned into an old woman with white hair and a wrinkled face.","In the past ten thousand years, Leng Rushuang had finally broken through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm.","...","The two of them staggered forward like ordinary old men. No one would have thought that either one of them had the vast power to crush a planet with a casual pinch!","“Old hag, there’s a tea stall in front. Let’s go and rest.”","Jian Wushuang tilted his head slightly and looked at Leng Rushuang, who was standing beside him, and said with a smile.","“Alright, old swordsman.”","Leng Rushuang smiled back at him. She could not help but sigh.","The two of them were both at the Ultimate Ruler Realm and were immortal. It was probably impossible for them to grow old together.","Now that they saw each other’s appearance, it was not bad.","The two of them did not walk quickly, just like the most ordinary old people. They held their crutches and trembled as they walked toward the tea stall in front.","The martial power of this star realm was not high. In other words, in this entire star area, the strongest person was only at the Principles Master realm. With Jian Wushuang’s current strength, he could probably blow this star area up with a single breath.","Walking into the tea stall, he saw that the owner of the tea stall was a charming middle-aged woman. At his knees was a child about ten years old. He was waving a wooden sword and babbling some ‘Jianghu slang’ that he had learned from God knows where.","“What would you two like to drink?”","...","The lady boss of the tea shop looked kind. When she saw Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang walk in, she did not dislike them because of their age. Instead, she respectfully pulled out the wooden chairs and helped them sit down.","“Just some simple tea will do.”","Jian Wushuang said with a smile.","“Alright, please wait a moment.”","The lady boss used the cloth on her shoulder to wipe the fine sweat on her forehead. Then, she turned around and went into the house to prepare.","However, the boy with red lips and white teeth under the lady boss’s knee stopped his sword dance. He was tired of it and his eyes rolled around. Then, he trotted toward Jian Wushuang.","“Grandpa, grandma, where are you guys from?”"]},{"number":4355,"title":"Chapter 4355 Comprehending the Great Dao!","paragraphs":["4355 Comprehending the Great Dao!","Jian Wushuang looked at the strong-looking boy and found him quite interesting. After exchanging a look with Leng Rushuang, he jokingly replied, “Grandpa, grandma, you came from beyond the heavens.”","“Beyond the heavens?”","The boy was stunned. He blinked his bright eyes and asked, “Where is beyond the heavens?”","“Oh. beyond the heavens...” Jian Wushuang thought for a while and replied with a smile, “It’s a place that’s very, very far from here. When night comes, you can look up at the sky and see the furthest star from you. That’s where I came from.”","!!","The boy pouted and shook his head. “Grandfather, you’re talking nonsense. Mother told me that the stars in the sky are places that people can only go to after they die. My father is living on the star now.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was dumbfounded. But when he heard the second half of the sentence, he could not help but sigh softly. He reached out his hand and rubbed the little boy’s head.","“You’re so smart, you even saw through grandpa’s lie.”","When the little boy heard this, he immediately raised his head and snorted with pride, “Of course. Mother said that I’m the smartest child in the world.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled and didn’t say anything.","As for the little boy, he was at the age where he was naturally playful, so how could he sit down? He picked up the wooden sword and danced for a while. After a while, he was tired of dancing and ran over again. He asked while panting, “Grandpa, you must have seen a lot of people since you came from far away. Do you think there are sword Immortals in this world?”","“Sword immortal?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned. He thought for a moment, then nodded and replied with a smile, “Of course there is. Grandfather was once a sword immortal.”","“Ah? Grandpa, you’re a sword immortal?” The little boy’s eyes suddenly widened. He sized up Jian Wushuang and asked with suspicion, “Grandpa, you’re lying. Sword Immortals all fly in the sky.”","Jian Wushuang laughed. “Grandpa, didn’t you say that I used to be a sword immortal? But now I’m old and can’t fly anymore.”","Hearing this, Leng Rushuang burst into laughter. She had never thought that Jian Wushuang could be so innocent.","However, she didn’t say anything. As Jian Wushuang’s wife, she was the only one who knew how much pressure Jian Wushuang, who had a bounty on his head and the Divine Life Palace had suffered a great calamity because of her, was under.","If this could allow Jian Wushuang to relax for a short while, why not?","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the little boy’s big eyes were filled with disbelief, but he didn’t know how to refute it. After thinking for a while, he straightened his neck and asked, “Then...then Grandpa, tell me how you became a sword immortal in the past and I’ll believe you!”","“Alright.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and then looked up at the sky. His old and turbid eyes flashed with a touch of nostalgia.","“Then I’ll have to start from a long, long time ago...”","As the sun set in the West, time gradually passed. Jian Wushuang picked out some interesting things to tell the little boy. Suddenly, the little boy’s eyes widened, and his expression was wonderful. His heart was full of ups and downs, and he was full of longing.","After a while, Jian Wushuang slowly stopped talking. He shook his head and smiled, “Alright, let’s stop here for today.”","The little boy only came back to his senses after a long time, as if he had just woken up from a dream.","When he looked at Jian Wushuang again, his eyes were full of admiration.","“Grandpa, let me tell you a secret. I’m practicing the sword so that I can become a sword immortal like you in the future!”","He tightly held the wooden sword in his hand, his eyes full of young hesitation.","“As long as I persevere, I will.”","Jian Wushuang replied with a smile.","The little boy was overjoyed when he heard Jian Wushuang’s affirmation. He asked Jian Wushuang several times and only laughed foolishly when he got Jian Wushuang’s affirmation.","After a while, he rolled his eyes as if he had thought of something. He then asked curiously, “Grandpa, why did you practice the sword then?”","“Me?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang smiled. Just as he was about to answer, he suddenly froze.","He...why did he practice the sword in the first place?","Jian Wushuang didn’t say anything. He just looked up at the sky in a daze and a myriad of thoughts surged in his heart!","Everyone had their own reasons to become stronger, or rather, it was called obsession!","With this obsession, he would be able to forge his own Dao without regret even if he died ten thousand times!","Then, what was his obsession?","Jian Wushuang could answer this question. In the beginning, his obsession was to protect himself, to not be bullied, to find his father, Jian Nantian, and to survive in this world!","Thus, as the other party became stronger and stronger, he muddleheaded and passed through one obstacle after another, making himself stronger and stronger!","Now, he had become the most powerful existence in the entire universe, except for the Supremes!","But...","He, Jian Wushuang, had never taken the initiative to become stronger. What should he do?","No!","Looking closely at all of his actions, it was actually just a counterattack to the pressure from all sides!","Even now, he wanted to comprehend the Dao, collect the innate five elements Qi, and break through to the Supreme Divine Realm. All of this was just to make himself stronger so that he could face the dragon clan and all the forces that wanted to suppress him!","Then, if one day, he, Jian Wushuang, became invincible in the universe and no one in the world could suppress him, would he stop cultivating? Was it going to stagnate?","Jian Wushuang’s eyes gradually revealed a hint of confusion.","The divine power in his body started to become chaotic.","“My husband!”","Seeing this, Leng Rushuang’s expression changed slightly. She quickly waved her right hand and formed a Ward, which wrapped her and Jian Wushuang.","She knew that Jian Wushuang must have understood something and was now at the most critical stage!","All she could do was to not let anyone disturb him.","Inside the wizardry barrier, Jian Wushuang fell into an unprecedented state of confusion. It was as if he had fallen into the deep sea and was constantly sinking...sink...","...","He was completely lost.","What was his Dao?","...","Time flew by and three days passed.","In the wizardry barrier, Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang seemed to have disappeared from the world. They were sitting in front of the tea stall, but no one could see or touch them.","This naturally caused another wave of surprise. The little boy was extremely excited and repeatedly exclaimed, “Mother, I’ve met an immortal!!”","The lady boss was also stunned. Then, she quickly knelt on the ground and kowtowed three times, calling for the arrival of the immortals.","Jian Wushuang, who was in the ward, was in an extremely critical situation.","Since ancient times, countless experts had failed to comprehend the great Dao, and then their Dao hearts had completely collapsed, turning them into walking corpses or human-shaped machines.","Just as Jian Wushuang’s Dao heart was about to collapse and he was about to follow in the footsteps of those people.","Suddenly, a human face appeared in Jian Wushuang’s consciousness.","...","That was...Xuan Yi!"]},{"number":4356,"title":"Chapter 4356 The Completion of the Great Dao","paragraphs":["4356 The Completion of the Great Dao","Jian Wushuang was in a strange state.","His consciousness was blurry, as if he was in the deep sea 90000 miles below. He could not use any of his destructive divine power and could only sink...sink...","It was as if there was a huge stone pressing on their chests, making it hard for them to breathe.","What was Dao?","!!","This Dao wasn’t a heavenly Dao, but a Dao that he had opened up himself.","There were 3000 great Daos, and everyone’s ‘Dao’ was different. Some people had the absolute confidence of ‘I’m invincible’, while some people had the unyielding determination of ‘crawling forward despite all the difficulties in the world’.","Jian Wushuang closed his eyes and his mind was in chaos.","Just as he was lost in the great Dao, a human face suddenly appeared in his chaotic consciousness!","This face was Xuan Yi’s!","In an instant, it was as if a candle had been lit in the middle of a long night, and the dark world was filled with light!","“Master!”","Jian Wushuang suddenly woke up!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s mind was filled with countless thoughts.","From the time he met Xuan Yi to the time when Xuan Yi protected him.","The scenes of the past kept playing in his mind!","This face was not an imprint that Xuan Yi had left in his mind. Instead, it was a bond that he had buried in the deepest part of his heart!","It felt like an instant, but it also felt like ten thousand years had passed in the blink of an eye. Jian Wushuang’s thoughts became clearer and clearer. After Xuan Yi, he saw more and more faces.","Among these people, there was Jian Nantian, who had once protected him. There was also Supreme Blood Wave, who was willing to die for him. There was also Supreme Gai Fu, who was cold on the outside but warm on the inside, who was willing to go to war with the entire universe for him...","There were too many people who had paid a huge price to protect Jian Wushuang.","One face after another appeared in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang understood!","As if the clouds had parted to reveal the bright moon, Jian Wushuang, who had been lost in the ‘Dao’, had completely woken up!","Boom!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s eyes opened and countless divine lights flashed in his eyes.","“My Dao is to protect!”","“I’m not only protecting myself, but I’m also protecting everyone who has protected me!”","“I want to protect my master, Leng Rushuang, and the Divine Life Palace!”","“A dragon has a reverse scale that will kill you upon contact. They are my reverse scales!”","“Only by becoming stronger can I protect the people I want to protect! Only then can I protect myself!”","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were clear and filled with unquestionable determination!","Then, Jian Wushuang’s body changed!","First of all, his divine power became purer and purer, like a piece of unpolished jade that had its impurities removed and became clear!","The greatest difference between a Ruler and a Ruler was the quality of their divine power. The Ruler’s unique Divine Ruler power was the greatest reliance a Ruler relied on to soar above the heavens, sit alone in the clouds, and look down on all living beings!","As for Jian Wushuang, although his divine power did not break through to become Ruler divine power, it was already far different from the divine power of a Ruler!","Then, his aura also changed!","His extremely strong and unyielding aura first began to surge, and then it began to transform in an unknown direction!","The aura made Jian Wushuang look more transparent, purer, and clearer!","It made his every move full of the charm of the great Dao.","If anyone had noticed Jian Wushuang, they would have realized that he was no longer an individual, but the incarnation of the great Dao!","He stared at Jian Wushuang as if he was staring at the truth of the great Dao!","Time passed slowly. Jian Wushuang was immersed in the comprehension of ‘Dao’ and his comprehension of ‘Dao’ progressed at a tremendous pace!","At the same time, he began to advance toward the Supreme-being realm!","In the blink of an eye, sixty years had passed.","...","To cultivators, sixty years was just a snap of their fingers.","However, to mortals, sixty years was more than half of their lives. It was enough to turn a child into a white-haired old man.","Desolate region of the universe, an unknown star field, within the star World.","Early in the morning.","A simple tea stall on the official road outside the city had not yet opened.","A skinny woodcutter with his white hair tied behind his head with a piece of wood walked over from the ridge beside the official road. He placed the hoe covered in yellow mud behind the door, then fetched a basin of cold well water to wash his face. He picked up the slightly yellowed white cloth next to the stove and placed it on his shoulder. He began to set up a tea stall outside the house.","Not long after, the tea stall was set up, and it did not take much time.","Because the tea stall was too simple, they moved a few wooden tables and chairs from the house and placed them outside the house. Then, they raised a stick and tied an apricot flag with the word ‘tea’ on the tip of the stick, and the tea stall was closed.","Old man woodcutter had repeated this kind of thing for decades and was already familiar with it.","Then, he turned around and entered the house. He began to prepare some tea and miscellaneous food in case a tea guest came to his door later.","...","What he didn’t know was that not long after he turned around and entered the house, he had already entered the house.","The air in the tea stall outside the house twisted, and a young man and a young woman appeared out of thin air!","The young man on the left had a handsome and cold appearance. His black hair was let down, but his deep eyes were exceptionally clear, like the blue sky and the sea, as pure as unpolished jade.","This person was Jian Wushuang, who had comprehended the great Dao!","For a whole sixty years, Jian Wushuang was immersed in comprehending the great Dao.","If he was like an unsheathed divine sword in the past, revealing his sharp edge and causing people to not dare to look at him directly, then the current him was like a distant mountain or a distant River. It was as if he had merged into the great Dao of heaven and earth, causing people to have a good impression of him.","In these sixty years, no matter if it was his Shen power aura or his strength, they had all undergone earth-shaking changes!","Although Jian Wushuang had yet to break through to the Supreme realm, he was much stronger than before and was only a step away from the Supreme Divine Realm.","The beautiful woman beside him was Leng Rushuang.","Jian Wushuang had comprehended the great Dao for sixty years, and Leng Rushuang had been by his side, watching over him for sixty years. Now that Jian Wushuang had finally come out of seclusion, Leng Rushuang removed the ward.","“Husband, you seem to be a little different.”","...","Leng Rushuang looked at Jian Wushuang from head to toe and said in surprise.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and then smiled, “What’s different?”","Leng Rushuang thought for a moment, shook her head and said, “I can’t say for the time being. In any case, it just feels like there’s no smoke or fire in the world. At first glance, it feels very close, but in fact, it feels very far away.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was in deep thought. This was the influence of ‘Dao’. As he comprehended more about ‘Dao’, this temperament would become stronger.","“Yi, when did the two of you arrive?”","Just then, the woodcutter walked out with a plate of pastries and miscellaneous food. He was slightly stunned when he saw Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang."]},{"number":4357,"title":"Chapter 4357 The Immortal Caresses My Head","paragraphs":["4357 The Immortal Caresses My Head","“What?”","Hearing that, Jian Wushuang looked at elder woodcutter and was slightly surprised.","The old man was none other than the young boy with red lips and white teeth who had enjoyed his life and asked Jian Wushuang to tell him stories. He wanted to fight with swords in the pugilistic world and become a sword immortal.","He did not expect that after he came out of seclusion, things had changed. The once naughty child had now become a white-haired old man.","The owner of the teahouse, Nian, who still had his charm, had probably turned into a pile of soil.","Jian Wushuang looked at this person again. He no longer had the innocence of a child and was full of lethargy.","Jian Wushuang could not help but feel that the world had changed.","“You, don’t you recognize me?”","Jian Wushuang smiled at him and said.","“Ah...”","The old man was slightly stunned. He first looked at Jian Wushuang up and down. He saw that Jian Wushuang was dressed in fine clothes, his face was Fair and Handsome, and his whole person was full of gentleness and elegance. At first glance, he knew that Jian Wushuang was from a great family.","“Young master, have we met before?” the old man asked, confused.","Before Jian Wushuang could speak, he shook his head and said, “Young master’s bearing is extraordinary. This old man has never seen anyone like young master in his life. If this old man had seen one, he would definitely not forget.”","“Forgive this old man’s poor eyesight, but I really can’t recognize it.”","Jian Wushuang smiled and made a decision.","Speaking of which, he was able to comprehend the great Dao thanks to this old man’s casual question when he was still a child, which opened the key to his enlightenment.","Hence, Jian Wushuang decided to give him an opportunity.","If this person still had a trace of childlike innocence and did not forget the dream of his youth, then Jian Wushuang would enter the path of cultivation through his cultivation method.","If this person has long forgotten his dream, then I will protect him until he lives a hundred years without worry and spend his old age in peace.","“Silly child, let me ask you, do you still have your wooden sword? Do you still want to use your sword and become the famous carefree sword immortal?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him and asked indifferently.","In an instant, the woodcutter trembled and he looked at Jian Wushuang with horror as if he was looking at a ghost.","“You...you’re the old immortal from back then?”","Old woodcutter cried out in disbelief. He immediately knelt on the ground and kowtowed repeatedly.","His life had been dull and uneventful. For him, the biggest episode in his life was probably Jian Wushuang, who had told him the story of the sword immortal when he was young.","Even though time had passed and he was no longer young, he still could not forget the ‘adventure’ he had when he was young.","Even now, in his wooden house, there was a carving of Jian Wushuang and Leng Rushuang, who had turned into old men. Every day, they were worshiped as gods.","“Get up.”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm. He raised his right hand and a gentle divine power immediately gushed out and helped Saint woodcutter up.","“There’s no need to kneel, you just need to answer my question.”","When old woodcutter heard that, he instantly shuddered and replied excitedly, “Old immortal, the immortal’s words back then, this old man...I can’t forget it even for a day. I even left the wooden sword at home!”","After saying that, he quickly turned around and pulled out his wooden sword from the woodshed. At this moment, the wooden sword seemed to have aged with him. It was covered with dust, moldy white hair everywhere, and there were wormholes left by insects.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","“Fine, then I’ll give you a good fortune today.”","“You, come here.”","Hearing this, the woodcutter didn’t dare to delay. He knelt down in front of Jian Wushuang with a pious expression.","Jian Wushuang stretched out his right hand and slowly pressed it on the old woodcutter’s head.","Then, a gentle divine power gushed out from Jian Wushuang’s hand and entered old man woodcutter’s body. It cleansed his body and transformed him into an immortal.","Pfft pfft pfft.","Slivers of sticky and stinky black liquid gushed out of old man woodcutter’s body.","These were all hidden injuries that had been left behind in old man woodcutter’s body for many years, as well as aging cells and so on.","The immortal touched my head, tied my hair, and received longevity!","For the current Jian Wushuang, it was extremely easy to reverse the life and death of a mortal.","Old man woodcutter’s entire body trembled. He could feel that his aged body that was usually filled with lead was recovering his youth at an extremely fast speed and reaching his peak state!","“A miracle! This is a miracle!”","Old man woodcutter shouted in his heart. He looked at Jian Wushuang with even more respect.","After a while, Jian Wushuang withdrew his right hand.","Looking at old man woodcutter again, his entire person had already undergone a monstrous change. Although he was still old and his face was still full of wrinkles, the essence, Qi, and spirit that exuded from his entire body were even more exuberant than when ordinary people were young.","Then, Jian Wushuang flipped his right hand again and a cultivation method appeared in his hand.","Jian Wushuang said calmly, “An old steed in hiding, with ambitions of a thousand miles, a martyr in his twilight years, with a strong heart. Today, I’ll give you some good fortune. You only need to comprehend it day and night and search up and down to open the door of longevity. You can be the sword immortal you wanted to be when you were young. This can also be considered as the karmic fate between the two of us.”","“Thank you for the gift, immortal!”","Instantly, tears welled up in old man woodcutter’s eyes. He kept kowtowing to Jian Wushuang and made muffled sounds.","When he raised his head, his eyes were empty. The immortal couple was already in front of him. Only a scroll of cultivation technique was left in front of him.","“They’ve already left?”","...","Old man woodcutter was slightly absent-minded, and then he carefully put away the cultivation technique.","He closed the tea stall and closed the wooden door.","From then on, this unknown galaxy in the desolate region of the universe lost old woodcutter but gained a white-haired sword immortal!","...","At the same time, in the starry sky of the universe, outside of that unknown star field, a universe boat was passing away into the vast sea of stars.","In the blink of an eye, the universe boat disappeared from this star field.","“Husband, where are we going now?”","Leng Rushuang asked in universe boat.","Jian Wushuang pondered for a while and then replied, “If I remember correctly, the Great Clan Gathering is about to begin.”","After a pause, Jian Wushuang continued, “I’ve heard that the soil of breath has appeared on Planet Tianhuang. Let’s go there and see if there’s any connate Earth Qi. It’d be best if we can collect the complete connate five elements Qi before the universe banquet.”","“Because I don’t think I’ll have time after the Great Clan Gathering.”","...","Leng Rushuang raised her eyebrows and asked, “Why?”","Jian Wushuang did not reply. Instead, he turned to look at the depths of the universe, where the top forces stood. The corners of his mouth gradually curled up into a cold sneer with a strong killing intent."]},{"number":4358,"title":"Chapter 4358 Planet Tianhuang","paragraphs":["4358 Planet Tianhuang","In the desolate universe, Jian Wushuang drove universe boat and headed towards the center of the savage barren land.","In the 10000 years he had been wandering in the universe, he had collected four of the innate five elements Qi. He only needed the third Earth Qi to complete the collection.","Fortunately, before he went to that unknown star field, he managed to find out some information about the third Earth Qi from a group of Pirates who had robbed him.","It was said that the soil of breath was born on Planet Tianhuang, and it was where the essence of the earth was.","A piece of breathing earth was only the size of a palm, but it could grow freely and never be reduced. Often, where the breathing earth appeared, it meant that the third Earth Qi was stronger there.","As for whether or not it had the chaotic innate third Earth Qi, it was unknown.","“If I can find the innate Earth Qi, I will be able to completely mobilize the five elements chaotic force in the cauldron. By then, my strength will increase by a huge margin.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he thought about it and rushed toward Planet Tianhuang.","When he was in the Divine Life Palace, his strength was only one level lower than that of a beginner Supreme. During these years of wandering in the universe, Jian Wushuang had not slacked in condensing his super power. He had become more and more mature every day and night. Now, he had completely pushed the sword move ‘daybreak’ to the initial realm.","If this was only a small increase in his strength, then the great Dao of protection that he had opened up in the unknown star area a few days ago had completely transformed his divine power and allowed him to take a big step forward!","He might not have undergone a ‘qualitative’ transformation, but it was definitely at a height that he could not have reached in the past!","Therefore, Jian Wushuang, who had not met an enemy for a long time, did not know how strong he was.","....","Infinite region was the largest and most famous region in the universe.","This place was bustling all year round with all kinds of people. It was like a crossing, and countless cultivators who wanted to go to the depths of the universe would head to the universe passage here.","Therefore, this had created a prosperous and dazzling scene on Planet Tianhuang.","There was no single force that could dominate Planet Tianhuang. It was made up of countless sects and families. These sects and families fought against each other constantly, but they were united against outsiders. Any top force that wanted to conquer Planet Tianhuang would be attacked by them together.","Even the Nine Emperor Pavilion, which had opened all over the universe, had tried to extend their hands many times, but they had been strictly rejected by these clans and sects. In the end, the Nine Emperor Pavilion had no choice but to retreat.","There was no other reason than the fact that they were the three great Rulers who lived on Planet Tianhuang, a small planet in the universe!","Although the three great Supremes were all ordinary Supremes, and it was said that the strongest one was only an advanced Supreme, even a top Supreme would find it difficult to deal with them when they joined forces.","Therefore, Planet Tianhuang had become the most uncultured place in the universe!","At this moment, on a small island in the South Sea of Planet Tianhuang, countless powerful cultivators were gathered for a grand event.","“This piece of breathing earth was discovered by our Feng clan, so it should belong to us!”","“Humph, the most valuable treasures in the world belong to the strongest. The Feng family is only a second-rate family on Planet Tianhuang, and you want the soil of breath?”","“Well said. The three great families haven’t said anything. Is your Feng family qualified to speak?”","On the biggest Island of the Spratly Islands, the Spratly Islands, were filled with powerful cultivators from Planet Tianhuang. There were also powerful cultivators from other nearby planets.","What they were discussing was the soil of breath that had recently appeared!","The Feng family head who had discovered the breathing earth was an expert who was almost unrivaled. When he heard the commotion around him, his face immediately flushed red.","“Hmph, fine. We’ll decide the ownership of the soil of breath after the three great clans arrive!”","The Feng family’s patriarch flicked his sleeve angrily and sat down with an ugly expression.","This soil of breath had clearly been discovered by the Feng family, but now they had no choice but to take it out for everyone to split. It was truly aggrieving.","The others laughed and nodded. They were all discussing in low voices, waiting for the arrival of the three great families.","Even though everyone on Planet Tianhuang was doing things their own way, the three great families still had the most say!","On Planet Tianhuang, the three great families were the gods who held the power of life and death. They had supreme authority!","At this moment, before the three great clans had arrived, a thin young man in a black robe and a white antelope mask had already stepped onto the beach of Spratly sand island.","“No wonder it’s the most prosperous star field in the desolate area of the universe. There are no less than a hundred peak ultimate Rulers and more than two hands of unparalleled Rulers.”","The young man with the White Antelope mask looked around and smiled.","He was naturally Jian Wushuang, who was steering universe boat and speeding over.","Because there were Rulers on Planet Tianhuang, Jian Wushuang’s ordinary appearance-changing skills were no longer effective. The Rulers could see through him with one glance, so he wore the white antelope mask.","The antelope mask was not used for anything else, but it could perfectly cover Jian Wushuang’s aura. Even a Supreme would not be able to recognize Jian Wushuang, so it was perfect for him.","As for Leng Rushuang, she was naturally kept in the heaven suppressing monument. With so many ultimate Rulers and Supreme Divine Realm experts on Planet Tianhuang, Jian Wushuang did not dare to be careless.","After a while, Jian Wushuang gathered his thoughts and walked towards the center of the island.","In the center of the island, there was a tall platform. On the platform, there was an apricot-yellow flag. On the flag, there was a large ‘wind’ character. Under the apricot-yellow flag, a middle-aged man in luxurious clothes sat with a gloomy expression.","Jian Wushuang listened to the discussions around him and squinted his eyes.","Looking at the situation, the Feng clan must have discovered the breathing earth. The Feng clan had wanted to hide it secretly, but someone had leaked the news. Now, everyone knew about it and had gathered here.","The Feng family head had no choice but to discuss selling the breathing earth today.","“It seems that I was just in time. If I had been a little later, I’m afraid that the soil of breath would have disappeared.”","Jian Wushuang smiled. If there was any innate Earth Qi here, it must be in the breathing earth.","Just as Jian Wushuang was hesitating whether to enter the Feng family directly. When he went to intercept the breathing earth, he suddenly heard a burst of surprised voices.","“Don’t abandon you?”","“What?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and looked back. He immediately revealed a faint smile.","Behind him, two young men and women wearing the same white robes and swords at their waists waved at him excitedly.","“What are you guys doing here?”","...","Jian Wushuang walked over slowly and said with a smile."]},{"number":4359,"title":"Chapter 4359 The Three Great Clans","paragraphs":["4359 The Three Great Clans","“It’s a long story. I didn’t think I’d ever see you again after we parted in the Feng Yi star field, but I didn’t expect to see you again.”","The young man and woman looked at each other and laughed.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang slightly raised his head and nodded, “We are indeed fated.”","They were a cultivation couple from the heaven sword sect in the Wildlands. Jian Wushuang had met them five thousand years ago when he was collecting the sea water Qi. At that time, a war had broken out in the star area where the sea water Qi was located. The two of them were Rulers of the fifth level, so they were naturally in danger and were being hunted down.","The person who was chasing them happened to be the one who possessed the hai water Qi. Jian Wushuang killed the person casually and took the hai water Qi. It could be said that he had saved the two of them by accident.","From then on, the two of them were grateful to Jian Wushuang and they had a long journey together.","Jian Wushuang didn’t reject them because they were innocent. After a few exchanges, the three of them became familiar with each other.","Later on, the two of them returned to the sky sword sect, while Jian Wushuang continued to collect other innate five elements Qi. They parted ways.","To think that the three of them would meet on Planet Tianhuang 5000 years later.","“Sir Buqi, we’ve come with the elders of our sect to gain some knowledge.”","The young man who was known as the Stardust Ruler laughed.","“Sir Buqi, did you come for the soil of breath?”","“What’s going on?” The young woman called the star ripple Dominator blinked her eyes in a playful manner.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and replied, “I guess so. Where are the elders of your sect?”","The Stardust Ruler pointed at the central platform, where a black-robed old man was sitting next to the Feng clan’s patriarch. “The elders of my family are old friends with the head of the Feng family, and they’re chatting up there.”","Jian Wushuang nodded, indicating that he understood.","The Stardust Ruler muttered to himself for a moment before saying, “Your Excellency Buqi, there are many hidden talents on Planet Tianhuang. If you want the soil of breath, you should be careful. I heard that the three families on Planet Tianhuang are all interested in the soil of breath, especially the number one genius of the Green family. Qingmu is determined to get his hands on the soil of breath.”","“Qingmu?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","The Stardust Ruler made a sound of acknowledgment, and his expression gradually became serious. “That’s right, that Qingmu is the number one genius of the Green family. No, it should be said that he is the number one genius in the desolate area of the universe under the stars!”","He was extremely talented and had become one of the strongest Rulers after cultivating for only tens of millions of years. He was also blessed with great fortune. When he cultivated at a young age, he had a fortuitous encounter and three Dao fruits landed by his side. Later, when he traveled through the universe, he was recognized by the Demon Phoenix Clan and obtained the demon phoenix bloodline. Later, when he reached the Ruler realm, he triggered a heavenly vision and obtained the recognition of the ultimate treasure of the universe, the divine demon halberd!","Now, he had been receiving guidance from the Qing clan’s ancestor, the Qing clan’s Supreme martial artist, all year round. His strength had already reached a terrifying stage!","His name was known by everyone in the desolate regions of the universe. Although he had yet to become a Ruler, everyone was certain that he would become one within ten chaos cycles!","“In fact, there are already many people in the desolate area of the universe who call him Young Master Qingmu!”","“Young Master Qingmu?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and his eyes were filled with interest.","From what the Stardust Ruler had said, this genius named ‘Young Master Qingmu’ was indeed formidable. Whether it was his own talent or his fortune, he was considered one of the top geniuses in this cosmos.","To become an ultimate Ruler in tens of millions of years was definitely the best in the universe, except for Jian Wushuang.","In the depths of the universe, he could compete with the Saints of the immortal sacred lands and the divine sons of the divine nations.","“According to the rumors, Young Master Qingmu’s current strength is enough to stand shoulder to shoulder with the big shots on the Ancient Path of Stars, where all the geniuses gather and everyone fights for supremacy!” The Stardust Ruler continued in a deep voice.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows and then smiled, saying, “Then why didn’t Young Master Qingmu participate in the Ancient Path of Stars?”","As if he had heard Jian Wushuang’s nonchalant tone, before the Stardust Ruler could speak, the star rhythm Ruler pouted and said, “Sir Buqi, don’t underestimate Young Master Qingmu. He didn’t participate in the Ancient Path of Stars, but when it opened, he was in seclusion. By the time he came out, half of the Ancient Path of Stars had already been completed, and the Overlord, Jian Wushuang, had already left.”","“Hehe, Young Master Qingmu has great ambitions. His goal is to challenge Jian Wushuang, who stirred up a storm in the universe 10000 years ago, killed a Supreme Master with a sword, and was crowned as the number one genius!”","When she spoke of Ruler Qingmu, the star rhythm Ruler was different from the Stardust Ruler, who had a grave expression on her face. Her face was full of excitement and admiration, and she couldn’t wait to tell Jian Wushuang in detail about Young Master Qingmu’s legendary deeds.","It could be seen that she loved Young Master Qingmu.","Seeing this, the Stardust Ruler couldn’t help but glare at the star field Ruler. Then, he looked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Sir Buqi, please don’t lower yourself to Yun ‘er’s level.”","“It’s fine.”","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and felt a little speechless.","So, he had unknowingly become the target of many geniuses in the universe?","The three of them were still chatting when suddenly, there was a commotion in the crowd. Someone shouted, “The three great clans are here!”","In an instant, everyone raised their heads and looked at the sky.","In the sky above, a golden carriage was approaching!","This golden carriage glowed with a golden light. The horse pulling the carriage had a pair of wings on its back and a single horn on its forehead. It was the Golden-horned sun swallowing beast of the universe!","In front of the carriage, there was a large golden flag with a huge ‘lie’ character written on it!","This was the ‘lie’ family of the three great families!","After the golden carriage passed by, a huge ship with a flag with the word ‘North’ on it came across the sky!","This giant ship was incomparably majestic, like a mountain collapsing, and it let out a deafening roar.","In front of the ship, two half-naked giants were using chains to drag the lofty ship forward.","The Bei family of the three great families!","Someone on the southern sand island exclaimed.","However, more people remained silent as they focused their gazes on a tall figure who was walking over alone.","He came alone against the light, so no one could see his face clearly. He didn’t use any power, but he suppressed everyone!","In front of this person, whether it was the golden carriage that was stepping on the sky or the towering giant boat that was pressing down on the void, they all lost their color.","It was as if he was born to be the heaven’s chosen one who could command the wind and clouds. As soon as he appeared, there was no need for any words, and he was already the center of attention!","...","This person was the number one genius in the desolate area of the universe, Young Master Qingmu!"]},{"number":4360,"title":"Chapter 4360 Young Master Qing Mu","paragraphs":["4360 Young Master Qing Mu","Young Master Qingmu!","He was publicly acknowledged as the strongest genius in the desolate area of the universe. Whether it was in terms of talent or luck, he was at the top of the universe. He had great fortune and had yet to become a supreme deity, but the treatment he received was no different from that of a Supreme Being!","He stepped on the sky, stepping on the sun and the moon as if they were lifted up by the sky. He was the favorite of heaven and earth.","“Young Master Qingmu!”","!!","In an instant, everyone on the southern sand island started shouting.","Their expressions were fanatical, and their eyes were filled with worship, as if they were devout believers.","The Starstreak Ruler was also in this group. At this moment, she didn’t seem like a high and mighty Ruler, but more like a secular little girl who had seen an elegant young master. Her expression was extremely excited, and she shook the Stardust Ruler’s arm frantically, calling out repeatedly.","“Stardust, quickly look, quickly look, this is Young Master Qingmu!”","The Stardust Ruler’s expression was helpless. He glanced at Young Master Qingmu, a hint of sadness flashing through his eyes.","The two of them were both Omega Rulers, but the gap between them was simply too great.","“He’s Young Master Qingmu?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked up.","The Young Master Qingmu’s face was handsome and full of vigor. He lowered his head and looked down with an indifferent expression. No emotion could be seen, as if he was a God sitting alone in the clouds, overlooking the common people.","Whoosh!","Then, the Feng family head, who was sitting on the high platform, took a step forward and shot out to welcome them from afar.","“Young Master Qingmu, how could a mere breathing earth alarm you?”","The head of the Feng family bowed and smiled apologetically.","“If you want this soil of breath, you just need to send someone to inform me and I will immediately take the initiative to deliver it to you. How could I let you personally come over?”","Young Master Qingmu glanced at him indifferently and said, “Since you’ve set the rules for everyone to obtain the soil of breath with their own abilities, I’ll just follow the rules.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the head of the Feng family immediately flattered, “As expected of Young Master Qingmu, such a righteous person!”","On the island, the others nodded in response.","“Young Master Qingmu is too righteous!”","“Young Master Qingmu is too righteous!”","In an instant, the words of praise for Young Master Qingmu were like a terrifying sound wave that filled the sky and rushed straight into the clouds.","Jian Wushuang was mixed in the crowd and did not stand out at all. He touched his nose and could not help but find it funny.","He didn’t know how strong this Young Master Qingmu was, but in terms of style and reputation, even an invincible Ruler wouldn’t be able to match him.","A moment later, the Young Master Qingmu sat down on the main seat with a proud expression.","The young geniuses of the other two families looked at the young venerable Qingmu, who was surrounded by a myriad of stars, with complicated expressions.","“Young Master Qingmu.”","After hesitating for a moment, the people of the two clans saluted Young Master Qingmu.","One had to learn to judge the situation. The Green family was a Supreme clan that wasn’t weaker than the two of them, and Young Master Qingmu was very likely to become the second Supreme of the Green family. At that time, the Green family’s status would probably far surpass these two great clans and become the unrivaled monarch of the desolate area of the universe!","“Yes.”","Young Master Qingmu indifferently nodded.","To him, be it the young talents of the two great clans or the other heroes present, or even the desolate area of the universe and the entire vast universe, as long as they had not become Supremes, they were all beneath his notice.","He believed that there was only one person who was qualified to be his opponent, and that person was the number one genius in the world, Jian Wushuang, who had killed a Supreme Master.","He was confident that Jian Wushuang was the only person in the entire universe who could fight with him.","He was even very confident that he could defeat Jian Wushuang within 100 moves!","This was his pride!","“Feng Congyun, let’s start.”","He looked at the head of the Feng family and said.","“Yes!”","The head of the Feng family quickly nodded and cleared his throat. He stood up and looked at the crowd below the stage.","“The soil of breath is the most precious treasure of the universe. It can create a star field of thousands of miles and live forever.”","This kind of treasure should belong to the strong. Therefore, our Feng family is willing to offer the soil of breath to the strongest person here. If one wanted to prove their strength, the rules for obtaining the soil of breath were very simple. One only needed to defeat all the opponents present and make everyone submit to one. Then, one would be the owner of the soil of breath!","“Do you all understand what I’m saying?”","Everyone nodded in agreement.","It was a natural principle that treasures belonged to the strong.","Immediately after, their gazes turned to Young Master Qingmu, and their eyes flickered.","If the person who had come this time wasn’t Young Master Qingmu, they would still have had the heart to fight for it. But since Young Master Qingmu had come, no one had the confidence to defeat him.","“I’m afraid this soil of breath will belong to Young Master Qingmu.”","“That’s right, with Young Master Qingmu here, who would dare to snatch something from him?”","“The breathing earth will definitely belong to Young Master Qingmu!”","Everyone was discussing.","As expected, it was just as they had said. After his voice fell, Ruler Qingmu stood up and swept his indifferent gaze across the crowd. “This Lord wants this piece of breathing earth. Is there anyone who wants to fight with this Lord?”","...","His voice was not loud, but it was full of power, and no one responded.","Seeing this, the pride in Young Master Qingmu’s eyes became more and more obvious. At the same time, a trace of desolation welled up in his heart.","The world was so big, was there no one who could be his opponent?","After a long time, an old man walked out of the crowd and said with a kind face, “Young Master Qingmu, when this old man was far away in the Jiang Yu star field, I’ve always heard that you have heaven-defying strength, and I’ve come to see you today.”","After the old man walked out, someone in the crowd immediately exclaimed, “Ruler Yuan Feng of the river Court Starfield!”","“Ruler Prime Peak is an invincible Ruler who has been famous for a very long time! He’s one of the top Warriors in the desolate area of the universe!”","“Although Young Master Qingmu is powerful, he’s only cultivated for ten million years. Ruler Prime Peak, on the other hand, spent ten chaos cycles in the invincible Ruler realm. In terms of Foundation, Young Master Qingmu is definitely far inferior to Ruler Prime Peak.”","“This battle is going to be exciting!”","Young Master Qingmu raised his eyebrows and sized up the Ruler of Yuan peak. He then said indifferently, “Three moves. As long as you can take me on, I’ll consider it my loss.”","Prime Peak Ruler’s face didn’t change, and he continued to smile, but he snorted in his heart.","“Venerated youth, this old man admits that you are very powerful, but to defeat me in three moves, aren’t you being a little too arrogant?”","...","Young Master Qingmu didn’t even bat an eye. With a flip of his right hand, a domineering Platinum halberd appeared in his hand.","“Cut the crap and make your move.”","Boom!","In the next moment, Young Master Qingmu slashed down with his halberd at the Prime Peak Ruler!","In an instant, boundless divine power gushed out and condensed on the Platinum halberd. One could even hear the faint and crisp cry of a Phoenix!","In the middle of the halberd, there seemed to be a Phoenix that was born from the flames. It soared into the sky and cried out to the world!"]},{"number":4361,"title":"Chapter 4361 Jian Wushuang Takes Action","paragraphs":["4361 Jian Wushuang Takes Action","Universe-limit true treasure, divine demon halberd!","“It’s rumored that when Young Master Qingmu reached the Ruler realm, he triggered a heavenly phenomenon. A divine halberd shot out from the depths of the universe and fell into Young Master Qingmu’s hands, automatically recognizing him as its master! It seems like it’s this divine demon halberd!”","“In addition, Young Master Qingmu also has the demon Phoenix bloodline! Demon phoenixes are a large branch of the Phoenix Clan. They are violent and battle-hungry, also known as the nine-headed Phoenix!”","In an instant, everyone’s gazes focused as they began to discuss and narrate the power of Young Master Qingmu’s Divine Art!","!!","The star rhythm Ruler was even more excited. She continued to introduce to Jian Wushuang and the Stardust Ruler, “Quickly look, Young Master Qingmu is about to make a move! This is the first time in ten thousand years that Shi Feng has made a move!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression was indifferent as he sized up Young Master Qingmu.","It had to be said that Young Master Qingmu was indeed quite good. Even before he made a move, the aura he exuded was no weaker than that of Emperor Golden Crow, who Jian Wushuang had defeated on the Ancient Path of Stars.","On the high platform.","“Good!”","A grave look appeared in the eyes of the Prime Peak Ruler, and he didn’t dare to be careless.","With a wave of his right hand, a glass abacus appeared in his hand.","“You can lose.”","Young Master Qingmu’s expression was indifferent as he casually raised the divine demon halberd and pressed it down on Ruler Prime Peak!","This halberd was as heavy as 10000 Jun. It was as if three mountains and five mountains had descended, and its mighty power reached the heavens!","Endless divine power surged in all directions!","“You...!” Prime Peak Ruler grimaced. The halberd hadn’t even pressed down, but he already felt like there was a blade on his back, and all his hair stood on end.","“Go!”","He braced himself and shouted in a low voice, his five fingers quickly fiddling on the abacus.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Instantly, beads spun and shot out from the abacus like meteors to meet the halberd!","Bang!","A huge explosion was heard and the entire Spratly sand island shook.","Dust rose into the air, forming white smoke. When the smoke dispersed, the Prime Peak Ruler was half-kneeling on the ground, his face the color of a pig’s liver as he panted heavily.","As for Young Master Qingmu, who was holding the divine demon halberd, he was like a high and mighty God. He lowered his head and looked down at Yuan Prime Peak Ruler, indifferently saying, “You’ve lost.”","Prime Peak Ruler struggled to his feet. He cupped his hands and said bitterly, “Young Master Qingmu’s power is second to none in the entire universe. This old man is completely convinced of his defeat.”","After he finished speaking, he stepped back into the crowd.","“As expected of Young Master Qingmu. He’s also an invincible Ruler, but Ruler Prime Peak wasn’t even able to take a single blow from him!”","“Young Master Qingmu is too strong. I think even Jian Wushuang, who has been praised as the number one genius in the universe, is far inferior to him!","“That’s right. The reason why Jian Wushuang is so famous is mainly because of the Divine Life Palace. In terms of strength, he’s definitely no match for Young Master Qingmu!”","“I’m afraid no one below the Supreme level can be Young Master Qingmu’s opponent!”","“Young Master Qingmu is invincible!”","Everyone in the crowd exclaimed in admiration.","“This is...!” The Stardust Ruler was even more excited, her beautiful eyes shining with admiration.","The Stardust Ruler, who was standing next to the Starstreak Ruler, couldn’t help but smile even more bitterly.","Looking at the situation, it was likely that as long as this Young Master Qingmu beckoned with his finger, his Dao companion would leave him and turn to Young Master Qingmu’s arms.","“Sir Buqi, didn’t I tell you? Young Master Qingmu is very powerful!”","The Stardust Ruler turned to Jian Wushuang and bragged.","“Mm, it’s not bad.”","Jian Wushuang nodded.","“Only ‘not bad’?”","The Stardust Ruler pouted but didn’t say anything. After all, Jian Wushuang had saved her life.","However, she was inexplicably angry and wished that Young Master Qingmu could teach Jian Wushuang a lesson so that Jian Wushuang would no longer dare to underestimate him.","On the Spratly sand island, Young Master Qingmu’s eyes surveyed the surroundings with a cold and proud expression.","“Is there anyone else who wants to make a move?”","He asked indifferently.","No one responded. Only after a long time did an unparalleled Ruler-like man walk out.","However, this burly man was only a little stronger tha Prime Peak Ruler and was defeated by Young Master Qingmu in two moves.","Time slowly passed. During this time, a few unparalleled Rulers walked out of the crowd, including the geniuses of the other two clans and su elders, who wanted to ask for advice from Young Master Qingmu.","As expected, these famous and invincible Rulers in the desolate area of the universe couldn’t even last three moves before being defeated by Young Master Qingmu and becoming his stepping stones. This showed how powerful and invincible Young Master Qingmu was.","After two hours, no one dared to challenge Young Master Qingmu.","“No one else? Then this soil of breath belongs to me.”","A look of disdain flashed across Young Master Qingmu’s indifferent expression. He immediately turned around and walked toward the high platform to receive the breathing earth.","“A bunch of useless chickens and dogs.”","Young Master Qingmu shook his head in his heart.","...","Seeing this, the head of the Feng family quickly took out a palm-sized piece of soil from his interspatial ring.","“Young Master Qingmu, who would be a match for you at the Ruler realm?”","He smiled apologetically and pushed the breathing earth forward, saying, “Venerated youth, this is the soil of breath!”","Young Master Qingmu nodded, a hint of satisfaction flashing through his eyes. He reached out and took the soil of breath.","In the crowd, when everyone saw this scene, a hint of envy flashed in their eyes.","Young Master Qingmu was already powerful to begin with, and now that he had this piece of breathing earth, he was like a tiger that had grown wings, his strength rising to another level.","At this moment, no one noticed that after the breathing earth was taken out, a young man in a black robe and a White Antelope mask among the crowd had a flash of fear in his eyes.","“There is indeed the innate Third Earth Qi in the breathing earth!”","Jian Wushuang felt the strange movement from the ancient bronze cauldron in his Interspatial Ring, and an irrepressible joy flashed in his eyes.","He had been searching for thousands of years and finally found the third Earth Qi, the only missing Qi among the innate five elements Qi!","As long as he could obtain the third Earth Qi, he would be able to truly open the ancient bronze cauldron!","...","The next moment, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and stepped out of the crowd. He said indifferently, “Hold on.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the crowd turned to look at Jian Wushuang.","“What?”","This included Young Master Qingmu, who was on the high platform. His right hand, which was reaching for the breathing earth, stopped. He also turned his head and slowly looked at Jian Wushuang.","“You want to challenge this Lord?”","He sized up Jian Wushuang, frowned, and said in a cold tone.","This person had his face covered and didn’t make a move before, but he spoke up just as he was about to get the breathing earth. A hint of displeasure flashed through Young Master Qingmu’s heart.","Jian Wushuang’s expression did not change and he asked calmly, “Can’t I?”","Young Master Qingmu’s eyes narrowed, and a cold smile gradually appeared on his face.","“Fine, then I’ll do as you wish.”","Bang !","As soon as he finished speaking, the universe-limit true treasure, the godly demon halberd, that he had put away in his interspatial ring, reappeared in his hand!"]},{"number":4362,"title":"Chapter 4362 Defeating the Enemy With a Flick of the Finger","paragraphs":["4362 Defeating the Enemy With a Flick of the Finger","At this moment, everyone asked in confusion, “Who is this person? Challenging Young Master Qingmu, is he looking for death?”","“The ones who challenged the young master before were all famous unparalleled Rulers of the universe’s desolate star fields. This person isn’t famous, so how can he be qualified to challenge the young master?”","“How can any random person challenge Young Master Qingmu?”","Everyone present shook their heads.","!!","Even the Stardust Ruler’s face was filled with anxiety as he hurriedly shouted, “Sir Buqi, what are you doing?”","Back then, although Jian Wushuang had saved them and killed those who had pursued them, that person had only been a peak Ultimate Ruler. How could he compare to Ruler Qingmu?","Just as he was about to pull Jian Wushuang back, Star Lord stopped him and shook his head, “Stardust, since Sir Buqi isn’t convinced by Young Master Qingmu, then just let him be. Why should we meddle in his business?”","As she said this, the Stardust Ruler’s eyes flickered with derision.","The Stardust Ruler turned to look at her, and his expression instantly froze.","‘This...’ Was this still the kind, playful, and innocent wife he knew?","“Stardust, what nonsense are you talking about? What did he mean by being a busybody? Don’t forget, Sir Buqi is our Savior!”","Taking a deep breath, the Stardust Ruler looked at the Starstreak Ruler as if he was looking at a stranger.","“Stardust, I think you’ve been bewitched by that Young Master Qingmu!”","“You!”","The Starstreak Ruler wasn’t convinced. He opened his mouth, wanting to say something, but when he saw the Stardust Ruler’s expression gradually turn cold, he couldn’t help but avoid his gaze and snorted, “So many people challenged Young Master Qingmu, but he didn’t do anything to them. Sir Buqi will be fine, so don’t worry.”","A hint of hesitation flashed across the Stardust Ruler’s face when he heard this. When he saw Young Master Qingmu walking down the platform with the divine demon halberd in hand, he knew that he was no longer able to stop this battle. He could only sigh and say, “Let’s hope so.”","...","On the high platform.","Young Master Qingmu looked down at Jian Wushuang from above and said expressionlessly, “I don’t care who you are or where you’re from. Listen up, the rules are the same as before. If you can take three of my moves, I’ll consider you the winner.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently and said, “Then hurry up, I’m in a hurry.”","“In a hurry?”","When Young Master Qingmu heard this, he was so angry that he laughed. What did this person take him, the number one genius in the desolate area of the universe, for?","“This Lord thinks you’re rushing to die!”","Young Master Qingmu snorted coldly. He held the halberd with both hands and ruthlessly chopped down at Jian Wushuang!","This halberd strike was made by Young Master Qingmu in anger, and it was even more ferocious than before. It directly shattered the void, and the phantom of the demonic phoenix danced wildly!","However...","“Prepare for the second move.”","Jian Wushuang lifted his eyelids slightly and used his divine power to flick a finger!","In an instant, the divine power that had transformed into the power of a great Dao circulated in a terrifying manner. It covered Jian Wushuang’s fingertips and flicked toward the God demon halberd that was coming at him!","Clang!","As if he could crush the mountains and seas with a finger, the ferocious divine demon halberd let out a mournful wail and was sent flying after being flicked by Jian Wushuang.","Young Master Qingmu’s body trembled and he retreated three steps. He circulated all the divine power in his body and finally managed to suppress the huge force coming from the divine demon halberd!","In an instant, Young Master Qingmu’s expression was uncertain. He stared at Jian Wushuang for a moment before he coldly said, “No wonder you dare to be so arrogant, so you’re relying on your own ability.”","After a pause, he sneered and continued, “However, I only used 30% of my strength in that strike.”","“30%?”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. How would Young Master Qingmu feel if he knew that he had not even used one percent of his power?","Although he was still in the Ruler realm, whether it was the divine power that could be transformed into the power of a great Dao or the divine power and Supreme treasures, he was far from what a Ruler could compare to.","No matter which unparalleled Ruler they were, they were just ants that Jian Wushuang could casually crush.","Even the Ninth Kalpa King, who was widely acknowledged as the number one in the Ruler realm, or Qiu Long, who had fallen from the Ruler realm, couldn’t last more than three moves in front of Jian Wushuang, let alone Young Master Qingmu.","The divine power of a Ruler and the divine power of his great Dao were not on the same level.","“The second move!”","“Die!” Young Master Qingmu coldly shouted. He no longer suppressed his strength, and his unparalleled Ruler cultivation erupted!","In an instant, a strong wind rose and roared, forming a vortex storm!","Standing in the center of the maelstrom, Young Master Qingmu was like a god that had descended from the heavens, so brilliant that it was impossible to look at him!","Secret skill, heavenly punishment!!","Boom!","In an instant, the Platinum-colored divine demon halberd in his hand suddenly changed. Fine vein-like patterns covered the halberd, and Young Master Qingmu ruthlessly stabbed it into the sky. He directly guided the power of heaven and earth, causing countless divine lightning to descend!","In the end, the divine lightning landed on the divine demon halberd and formed a terrifying lightning bolt similar to the ancient thunder dragon!","The surrounding people were all shocked.","“So this, this is the true strength of Young Master Qingmu!”","“Young Master Qingmu’s true strength is so terrifying!”","“It seems that Young Master Qingmu is really angry!”","“This masked man’s life is over!”","Seeing this, the Stardust Ruler’s expression turned anxious. He shouted repeatedly for Jian Wushuang to dodge.","...","As for the star Lord, after a flash of worry for Jian Wushuang, his expression turned into a deeper admiration for Young Master Qingmu.","“It would be great if my husband was such an expert.”","She was secretly envious.","“Go to hell!”","Young Master Qingmu sneered.","Boom~!","In an instant, the terrifying sacred thunder struck at Jian Wushuang with a destructive power!","“Prepare for the third move.”","However, Jian Wushuang’s expression was still calm. He merely flicked his sleeve in the face of the terrifying divine Thunder that shocked everyone.","This sleeve was extremely light and did not seem to have any power. It only made people feel as if this sleeve had thrown out mountains, water, all the things in the world, the Dao, and nature.","Weng.","...","The terrifying divine Thunder hit Jian Wushuang’s sleeve, and it rippled like a stone dropping into the water.","The next moment!","This divine lightning was actually sent flying. With a turn, it flew at a high speed and crashed toward Young Master Qingmu with even more terrifying power!","How is this possible?!!!","Young Master Qingmu’s expression instantly changed, and he wanted to wave his halberd to block.","However, this divine lightning directly smashed into Young Master Qingmu’s chest!","Bang!","A terrifying power exploded, and a huge, turbid mushroom cloud rose above the island.","“Cough, cough, cough.”","In the huge mushroom cloud, Young Master Qingmu’s uncomfortable cough sounded. Immediately after, everyone saw the originally handsome and divine Young Master Qingmu fall from the sky and crash onto the ground.","However, at this moment, he was like a god who had fallen into the mortal world. His black hair was all blown up, and his clothes were blown to pieces, revealing his charred chest. He was in an extremely sorry state.","In an instant, everyone froze and turned into stone."]},{"number":4363,"title":"Chapter 4363 The Supreme Martial Artist Takes Action","paragraphs":["4363 The Supreme Martial Artist Takes Action","“Damn it!”","In the next moment, Ruler Qingmu rose from the ground and stared at Jian Wushuang with a livid expression.","Since he was young, he had been a proud son of the heavens, favored by the heavens and earth. His cultivation path had been smooth and smooth.","He was born with a Dao fruit, and he had obtained the demon Phoenix bloodline on a casual trip. Even if he broke through a realm, he could make a limit true treasure recognize him as its master.","!!","No matter where he, Young Master Qingmu, went, he was always greeted with praise and admiration.","Due to all kinds of encounters, he had become extremely conceited. He was so conceited that he thought that no one below the Supreme-being level in the entire universe was his match. Even Jian Wushuang, who was rumored to have killed a Supreme-being and was crowned as the number one genius in the world, was only slightly worthy of his attention.","However, today, he was easily defeated by a masked man who had appeared out of nowhere!","The pride and conceit that he had cultivated for tens of millions of years were trampled under his feet and ruthlessly trampled on!","This was an embarrassment that he had never experienced before!","Waves of monstrous anger surged in his chest, wanting to burn him to ashes!","The next moment.","“Dammit, dammit, dammit! You should die!”","The blood vessels on Young Master Qingmu’s forehead twisted as he roared,","“Devil Phoenix transformation!”","Boom~!","In an instant, his blood began to boil, and mysterious symbols began to appear on his body.","Suo~~!","Immediately after, a pair of wings formed from flames spread out from his back. They were ten miles wide!","At his neck, eight heads grew out in a twisted manner!","The demon phoenix was a branch of the Phoenix Clan. It had nine heads and was extremely powerful!","The awakening of his bloodline was still ongoing, and even more terrifying changes were happening to his body.","Suddenly.","“Are you performing acrobatics?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him indifferently, stretched out his right hand in his direction, and slowly spread his five fingers.","If this Young Master Qingmu was really from the demon Phoenix royal family, Jian Wushuang would still be interested in taking a look. However, he was just a half-human, half-puppet monster. He naturally didn’t want to waste his time.","He had even killed a real dragon before, let alone this defective one.","“Come over.”","Jian Wushuang’s five fingers grabbed at the void.","In an instant, Young Master Qingmu, who was immersed in the transformation and his divine body was undergoing various gorgeous changes, felt as if an invisible hand had grabbed his throat. The divine power circulating in his body was forcibly cut off and he flew toward Jian Wushuang.","“This...w-what is this?”","The young master struggled to speak.","He felt that the divine power that was grabbing onto him seemed to be in harmony with the world. His awakened power of the demonic phoenix could not shift the power of the great Dao at all.","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang grabbed his neck and lifted him up as if he was a little chick.","“Y-you let me go!”","The Young Master Qingmu, Jian Wushuang, raised his right hand in the air, flapped the wings on his back, and flapped his hands and feet. He was shocked and angry to the extreme.","He still had a trump card that he had yet to use. He had yet to truly awaken the demonic phoenix state, and now he was caught by Jian Wushuang. He was extremely unwilling.","“Venerated youth, three moves have passed, you’ve lost.”","Jian Wushuang let go of his hand and shook his head.","After that, Jian Wushuang ignored him and walked toward the swelling earth on the high platform.","To the current Jian Wushuang, only a Supreme could really make him spirited. As for the Rulers, he had no interest in killing them.","This Young Master Qingmu boasted of his strength, but in his opinion, he was just a frog at the bottom of the well who had never even been to the depths of the universe.","Unknowingly, the entire place was deathly silent.","Everyone looked at Jian Wushuang in a daze. Their eyes were so shocked that they almost fell out and their mouths were so wide open that an egg could be stuffed in.","Young Master Qingmu was defeated?","Unrivaled in the wildlands, with the title of Junior Venerable, the one bestowed with the title of heaven’s son, Junior Venerable Qingmu, was defeated just like that!","They looked at Jian Wushuang in shock. From the beginning to the end, Jian Wushuang had only used one finger, one sleeve, and one grab. Everyone could see that Jian Wushuang had dealt with it easily and had a lot of strength left.","The Stardust Ruler’s expression was one of shock and disbelief as he muttered, “Impossible, absolutely impossible. Young Master Qingmu is an invincible existence. He can’t be defeated.”","...","“Give me the soil of breath.”","Jian Wushuang said to the head of the Feng family as he stepped onto the high platform.","The head of the Feng family’s heart trembled when he heard this, and a troubled look flashed across his face.","Everyone knew that the breathing earth was already in Young Master Qingmu’s possession. The so-called rules and competition were just a formality to him.","However, the Feng family’s master didn’t expect that Jian Wushuang, an uninvited guest, would come out of nowhere and easily defeat Young Master Qingmu!","If he were to hand over the soil of breath, he would undoubtedly offend the Qing clan.","...","The Green family didn’t just have one Young Master Qingmu. That was a true Ruler power with a Ruler in charge!","“I’ll say this one last time, give me the soil of breath.”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold and a murderous intent flashed in his eyes.","In an instant, the head of the Feng family felt a great sense of horror as if he was on the verge of death. His body trembled violently, and he no longer dared to hesitate. He trembled as he handed over the soil of breath.","Jian Wushuang took the breathing earth and a smile appeared on his face.","He had finally gathered all the innate five elements Qi!","“It’s time to really open the ancient bronze cauldron.”","Jian Wushuang thought about it. He was also looking forward to what the ancient bronze cauldron would look like after it had completed the five elements.","However, he did not notice.","In the distance, Young Master Qingmu’s expression had already become extremely gloomy!","He clenched his fists tightly, and a wave of humiliation turned into a surging killing intent that surged in his chest!","...","“There’s no way this person is a Ruler! No Ruler in the universe can defeat me!”","“Right! This person must be a Supreme martial artist. Only a Supreme martial artist’s strength would be far above mine!”","Young Master Qingmu’s killing intent madly flickered. The proud him would never admit that there was another Ruler in this world who could defeat him!","He, Young Master Qingmu, was the protagonist of this universe, the beloved Son of Heaven and earth. How could he lose?","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to leave Planet Tianhuang...","He couldn’t hold it in any longer. He crushed the silk bag at his waist and shouted with a twisted expression, “So what if you’re a Supreme martial artist? Not even a Supreme martial artist can insult me!”","“Patriarch, please make your move!”","“BOOM!”","As soon as he finished speaking, a white-haired elder in the center of Planet Tianhuang opened his eyes and struck out with his palm from thousands of miles away!","The speed of the palm was extremely fast. In the blink of an eye, it covered thousands of miles and continued to grow. Finally, it covered the sky and pressed down on Jian Wushuang!","In an instant, the Spratly Islands split into pieces. The surrounding ocean waves rose up, and countless seawater rolled up, connecting heaven and earth and forming a turbulent water column!","The people on the island scattered like birds and beasts, terrified to the extreme.","Jian Wushuang, who had already flown up to the sky, narrowed his eyes.","“A Ruler?”","In the next moment, the power of the great Dao in Jian Wushuang’s body exploded and turned into countless sword Qi that interweaved and formed a palm. It collided with the Supreme master’s palm that was coming at him with great momentum and could overturn the world!"]},{"number":4364,"title":"Chapter 4364 The Three Great Supremes! (Part One)","paragraphs":["4364 The Three Great Supremes! (Part One)","Bang!","The two palms were like two worlds colliding with each other. They kept rubbing against each other, giving off deafening sounds!","Boom boom boom!","Countless terrifying forces seeped out and exploded in the air, creating a hole of a thousand feet!","!!","The Spratly Islands were split into pieces, and a huge amount of seawater surged up, forming a huge wave that was like a giant beast opening its mouth to bite down!","In just an instant, the Spratly Islands were submerged, as if it was the end of chaos!","All of this seemed to have happened for a long time, but it all happened in the span of a breath. After the two giant palms collided, they both disappeared.","Jian Wushuang’s black clothes and black hair fluttered in the wind. He took a step back and suppressed the terrifying supreme divine power that came from his hand.","“A Ruler?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned cold as he looked at the direction where the giant palm came from.","There, a white-haired old man was slowly walking over.","Every step he took seemed ordinary, but it was as if he was stepping on a spatial node. He crossed thousands of miles.","After three consecutive steps, he stood in front of Jian Wushuang.","This man was one of the Overlords of Planet Tianhuang, the Green family’s patriarch, Supreme Green River!","Ruler Green River had become a Ruler two hundred chaos cycles ago, and a hundred chaos cycles ago, he had broken through to become a middle-grade Ruler. Although he wasn’t an advanced Ruler, he was still extremely powerful!","“Sir, you have the body of a Supreme martial artist. Isn’t it inappropriate for you to bully a junior?”","Supreme Green River’s hair and beard were all white. He sized up Jian Wushuang and said with a fake smile.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. Now that he was facing a Supreme again, he was fearless even without the Tarot Divine Sword.","His only worry was that his identity would be exposed.","However, from the looks of it, it seemed that Supreme Green River had already regarded him as a Supreme.","After thinking for a while, Jian Wushuang understood the cause and effect of this. Under the effect of the antelope mask, his aura was covered, and even a Supreme could not see his level. His divine power of the great path was completely different from the divine power of a Ruler, so it was normal that his cultivation level could not be seen.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang no longer had any fear.","“The fact that I didn’t kill him is already giving face to you, Supreme Green River.”","Jian Wushuang said in a hoarse voice.","He knew that since Supreme Green River mistook him for a Supreme, he might as well pretend to the end.","“So you’re saying that this old man should thank you?”","Supreme Green River narrowed his eyes.","“You can understand it that way.” Jian Wushuang nodded his head indifferently.","When Supreme Green River heard this, he couldn’t help but burst out laughing as if he had heard something funny.","“Sir, you bullied my people and stole their treasures, and you still want me to thank you? This is the biggest joke in the world!”","At the same time, Young Master Qingmu rushed over. First, he respectfully saluted young master Green River. Then, he turned his eyes to Jian Wushuang and said resentfully, “Patriarch, this is the person who snatched my soil of breath, injured me, and humiliated me in front of everyone!”","“Patriarch, you must make the decision for me and punish this person severely. You can’t let him leave!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression gradually turned cold. He looked at Supreme Green River and said, “Green River, are you going to Stop Me Now?”","Supreme Green River patted Young Master Qingmu’s head affectionately and asked him to step aside. He then put on a fake smile and said,","“Sir, you and I are both Supreme martial artists. You can leave if you want to. However, before you leave, you have to return my grandson’s ‘breathing earth’.”","“His soil of breath?” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but laugh out of anger. He said coldly, “Let’s not talk about the fact that the soil of breath isn’t his. Even if it was, what can you do even if I take it?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang’s divine power surged and he looked at Supreme Green River with an unyielding gaze. He was extremely overbearing.","“You don’t know what’s good for you!”","Supreme Green River’s face instantly stiffened. He then sneered, “Then we’ll have to see if you have the strength to do so!”","Boom~!","He grabbed at the void with his right hand and took out a black Seven Star demonic saber. He then slashed at Jian Wushuang!","This saber move seemed casual, but after it slashed down, countless energy roared and all kinds of nomological laws were derived, filling the world!","In an instant, the entire sky was filled with this blade!","On the surface of the Spratly Islands, many Rulers stood on the water and looked at the blade that filled the sky and dominated the world. They were all shocked.","“This is the power of a Ruler!”","“With Supreme Green River taking action, I’m afraid that the masked man won’t be able to escape this calamity!”","“Not necessarily. Didn’t you hear what Supreme Green River said just now? this masked man is also a Supreme martial artist!”","Everyone was discussing.","In the crowd, only the Stardust Ruler had a strange expression on his face.","He remembered that when Jian Wushuang had saved them five thousand years ago, he had only revealed his cultivation to be at the Ultimate Ruler Realm.","Could it be...did Buqi break through in the past 5000 years?","The Stardust Ruler had a puzzled look on his face.","The Stardust Ruler, who was standing next to him, was stunned for a moment. Then, she said sourly, “No wonder he was able to defeat Young Master Qingmu. So it turns out that he’s a Supreme martial artist. Hmph, what kind of skill is it to bully the weak?”","“Shut up!”","...","The Stardust Ruler’s expression changed when he heard this. He snapped,","“How can we speculate and comment on the actions of a Supreme martial artist?”","“Furthermore, Sir Buqi is our savior! Stardust, if I hear you slander Sir Buqi again, don’t blame me for cutting off all ties with you and cutting off our relationship as Dao companions!”","After saying that, he turned to look at Jian Wushuang again with a worried expression, regardless of the star Lord’s expression.","...","Above the Nine Heavens.","Jian Wushuang looked at the black blade light that was like a flowing Galaxy and sneered, “The power of a Ruler is only so-so.”","Clang!","With a flip of his right hand, the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","“Sundering stars!”","In an instant, a large amount of energy gathered in Jian Wushuang’s hand and formed a sword rainbow that was nearly 15000 meters long!","...","This time, the star slashing sword rainbow activated by the power of a great Dao was no longer silver. Instead, it was extremely bright and turned into a dense blue!","With his improvement, the power of the astral Slash sword technique naturally could not be mentioned in the same breath. It was much stronger than before!","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang growled and the 50000-foot sword rainbow suddenly slashed down, colliding with the black silk!","With a loud explosion, Jian Wushuang leaped forward and closed in!","“Hmph, arrogant!”","Supreme Green River’s eyes flickered as he stepped forward and slashed down!","“Divine Ruler Art, seal the heavens slash!”","Kachaa!","The saber Qi filled the sky and intertwined with each other, forming a net that blocked Jian Wushuang’s path!","“Split open the sky!”","“Split open the sky!”","Split open the sky!!!","Jian Wushuang slashed out three times in a row, each sword full of the charm of the great Dao. The heaven-opening sword light, which was enhanced by the power of the great Dao, became sharper and sharper, tearing the saber net apart!","“Kill!”","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and exchanged thousands of moves with Supreme Green River!"]},{"number":4365,"title":"Chapter 4365 The Three Great Supremes! (Part Two)","paragraphs":["4365 The Three Great Supremes! (Part Two)","“Clang! Clang! Clang!”","The clash of the sword and saber created a series of sparks and terrifying energy kept exploding, causing the entire Planet Tianhuang to rumble!","Jian Wushuang did not hold back the divine power of a great Dao that was tens of thousands of times greater than his own. It poured out from his hand like a mountain and a River. It formed a storm of sword Qi that bombarded the area!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","!!","“Good, good, good, let’s continue!”","Jian Wushuang could feel the majestic power coming from the seven Star demonic saber in Supreme Green River’s hand, and the battle intent in his eyes surged to the extreme!","He laughed out loud, and the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand became more and more fierce!","It had been a long time since Jian Wushuang had fought with Qiu Long on the Ancient Path of Stars. He had never experienced such a satisfying battle.","In the past battles, those who were weaker than him could be crushed with a flick of the finger or those at the Supreme Divine Realm could only be killed by the power of the Tarot Divine Sword.","“Hmph, you’re too arrogant!”","Supreme Green River’s face turned gloomier as he felt the sharp force coming from the blade.","This power was not the supreme divine power, nor was it the power of a Ruler. Instead, it was the power of the great Dao that had evolved after it had been refined to the extreme.","The power of a great Dao was a strange power that some Supreme martial artists had yet to comprehend.","“There aren’t many people in this universe who have entered the Dao with the sword and reached the Ruler level, and even fewer who have comprehended the power of a great Dao. Which one of them is this person?”","Supreme Green River’s eyes flickered as he exchanged blows with Jian Wushuang. The mountains and seas were overturned and the divine land sank. At the same time, he was thinking quickly.","The name ‘Jian Wushuang’ flashed across his mind, but he quickly erased it. It was true that Jian Wushuang used a sword, but he was only a Ruler. Although he had killed a Supreme before, it was all thanks to the power of the Tarot Divine Sword. He definitely wouldn’t be so powerful.","“Supreme Divine Art, seven layer wave!”","Supreme Green River looked at Jian Wushuang, who was charging at him, and shouted again. The seven Star demonic saber in his hand suddenly changed!","The seven Star Pearls embedded in the blade of the seven-star demonic saber gradually lit up. With every Star Pearl that lit up, the power of the seven-star demonic saber increased by a little!","“Slash!”","Supreme Green River said coldly as he raised his saber and slashed down at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang raised his sword to block it, and the web between his thumb and forefinger couldn’t help but feel numb. The power of this blade was actually twice as strong as the full-force attack of Supreme Green River!","However, this wasn’t the end. Supreme Green River stepped on the void and the seven Star demonic saber in his hand slashed again!","The second slash!","The third slash!","The fourth slash!","When Supreme Green River struck out with his fifth saber move, its power had increased by five times!","Jian Wushuang couldn’t take it anymore and was sent flying by Green River Supreme’s saber. He crashed into the deep sea, causing huge waves and a terrifying tsunami!","“Forefather! Kill him!”","When Young Master Qingmu saw this, a hint of joy appeared on his face as he shouted.","He looked at the place where Jian Wushuang had fallen and a cruel expression appeared on his face.","“So what if you’re a Supreme martial artist?","“I, Young Master Qingmu, am the one who gathers the fate energy of heaven and earth and is the protagonist of this era who has the protection of a Ruler!”","Deep in the sea, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered.","It wasn’t that he couldn’t take the divine Art seven layered waves. He could easily break them by using his divine body, Eternal Night, or daybreak swordsmanship. However, there was a risk of being exposed.","“Fine, it’s time to test your power.”","Jian Wushuang’s rapidly descending body came to a halt. He flipped his right hand and the ancient bronze cauldron appeared in his hand.","On the body of this ancient bronze cauldron, there were branches of a towering tree, flames that formed patterns, and sharp Golden Seals around it. There was also a torrential flood that flowed freely.","Over the past 10000 years, he had been refining the ancient bronze cauldron and had finally completed it.","Now, not only could he perfectly control the cauldron, but he could also extract the innate five elements Qi from the cauldron to attack!","Bang!","Jian Wushuang took a step forward and a huge pit was created in the deep sea. Then, he shot up and broke through the sea surface.","“Go!”","Jian Wushuang pushed with his right hand and the ancient bronze cauldron immediately began to spin. It let out a chaotic sound that was like the beginning of the universe and crashed toward Supreme Green River!","As for Green River Supreme, his seventh blade had already come crashing down!","This blade caused the world to lose its color and the sun and moon to dim. If it was in the universe, it was enough to split several stars into nothingness!","Bang!","Then, the cauldron and the saber clashed!","At this moment, the world turned into a dead silence. All the sound waves were drowned out by the explosion of the collision between the two!","Then, something shocking happened. Infinite region, which was billions of miles wide and the largest in the desolate area of the universe, had countless cracks in the void at the same time. A shock wave spread in all directions, crushing the land millions of miles around into nothing. Countless innocent people were killed by the shock wave!","Boom, boom, boom!","A storm was brewing, and the world fell into a brief darkness!","When Supreme martial artists fought, they could easily destroy the heavens and earth!","Whoosh!","...","Then, the ancient bronze cauldron rushed out from the center of the explosion. It didn’t even wait for Supreme Green River’s seventh blade to strike down and ruthlessly collided with his chest!","“Pfff!”","In an instant, Green River Supreme’s divine body cracked, and his face turned sallow. He retreated a hundred steps before he could dissipate the huge force coming from the ancient bronze cauldron.","The bronze cauldron spun and returned to Jian Wushuang’s hand.","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and said in a hoarse voice, “Green River, you still want to stop me now?”","Supreme Green River’s expression was uncertain. He stared at the ancient bronze cauldron in Jian Wushuang’s hand and a hint of fear flashed through his eyes.","“This cauldron...”","Vaguely, he seemed to have seen this ancient bronze cauldron in some records, but it was too long ago for him to remember it clearly. Moreover, the ancient cauldron was missing a leg, and it looked different from the universe treasure he remembered, so he couldn’t be sure.","The next moment, he took a deep breath and coldly replied, “Your abilities are exceptional, but if you think you can leave with this, you’re a little too naive.”","After saying that, he suddenly turned his head and looked at the void, saying, “Ruler Lie Chen, Ruler Darknorth, our three great clans are bound to suffer the same fate if our lips die. We’ve always advanced and retreated together when facing our enemies. How long more do you want to keep watching?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the void where Supreme Green River was looking at suddenly distorted.","...","Then, with a soft sigh, two Supreme martial artists stepped out of the void.","The one on the left was exuding a cold aura. Every step he took turned his feet into ice, and there was frost on his brows. It was the Bei family’s patriarch, Supreme Darknorth!","The one on the right was wearing a Daoist robe covered in dirt. He looked thin like an old beggar on the street.","The blind old man.","This person was the ancestor of the Lie family, Supreme Lie Chen!","At the same time, he was also the one with the highest cultivation among the three great Supremes. He had been an advanced Supreme for many years!"]},{"number":4366,"title":"Chapter 4366 The Ancient Bronze Cauldron Shows Its Ferocity","paragraphs":["4366 The Ancient Bronze Cauldron Shows Its Ferocity","After the two Supreme martial artists walked out, they were like dingfengzi who had set the storm. The turbulent mountains and rivers had all calmed down.","“Patriarch of the Bei family, Ruler Darknorth! The Lie family’s patriarch, Supreme Lie Chen!”","In an instant, everyone was shocked.","“The three great Rulers are here! What kind of appearance is this?”","“I remember that the last time the three great Rulers of Planet Tianhuang were here was three chaos cycles ago. That was when the Nine Emperor Pavilion wanted to set up a branch on Planet Tianhuang!”","“I didn’t expect this masked man to attract the three great Supremes!","“Now, no matter who this masked man is, I’m afraid he’s dead!”","Immediately, everyone quickly discussed.","The Stardust Ruler’s heart instantly clenched. Just as he was about to speak, he saw an elder of the Heavenly Sword Sect appear in front of him and place a hand on his shoulder. With a solemn expression, he said, “Stardust, this old man can see that you have some history with this masked man. It’s fine that you spoke up for him before, but now, if you don’t want to bring great disaster to our Heavenly Sword Sect, you should immediately sever all ties with him!”","The Stardust Ruler’s expression changed slightly upon hearing this. He gritted his teeth and explained, “Martial uncle, Sir Buqi once saved my life! Please intervene and stop this battle!”","“Me?” The senior from the sky sword sect glanced at him and snorted coldly. “You really do think highly of your uncle-master, but I’m nothing more than an invincible Ruler. What right do I have to stop the Rulers from waging war against each other?”","“Besides, not to mention that he only saved your life, even if he saved the entire heaven’s sword sect, now that he’s in great trouble, it’s already the greatest repayment for him that we don’t hit him when he’s down.”","The Stardust Ruler wanted to say something more, but the nearby Starstreak Ruler pulled him aside and said, “Stardust, just listen to your martial uncle. Don’t cause trouble for yourself.”","The Stardust Ruler hesitated for a moment, then lowered his head and let out a long sigh.","...","Above the Nine Heavens, the three Supreme martial artists stood side by side.","Standing on the left, the frosty-faced Supreme Darknorth sighed and said, “Your Excellency, you and I are both universe Supremes, and it was not easy for you to get to this point. It’s just a piece of breathing earth, why should we fight to the death?”","After a brief pause, Supreme Darknorth continued, “Your Excellency, I promise you that as long as you put down the soil of breath, you can leave at any time. We will not stop you. How about it?”","After he finished speaking, the three great masters stared at Jian Wushuang, waiting for his answer.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void and his expression was gloomy.","Jian Wushuang wouldn’t be afraid if it was just Green River Supreme alone. However, it would be a little troublesome if three great Supremes were to attack at the same time.","In particular, the blind elder, Supreme Lie Chen, gave him a sense of threat that was even more terrifying than the two great Supremes combined. Even if Jian Wushuang had made a breakthrough, he would not be a match for the three great Supremes combined no matter how powerful he was!","If it were in the past, Jian Wushuang might have really given up on the soil of breath and left. After all, this was not the only place in the world that had the innate Earth Qi. At worst, he would just find another place.","However, the Great Clan Gathering was about to begin. When all the clans gathered, Jian Wushuang would have nowhere to run. He could only confront the top forces again!","Therefore, as long as he could improve his strength crazily during this period of time, he would not only have the power to protect himself but also to counterattack after the Great Clan Gathering ended!","This piece of breathing earth must not be given up!","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang raised his head and looked at the three Supreme Masters indifferently. He said indifferently, “What if I don’t give up this piece of breathing earth?”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone was shocked.","No one had expected that Jian Wushuang would still do things his own way under the pressure of the three great masters!","“Your Excellency, have you thought it through?”","Supreme Darknorth sighed again, as if he felt sorry for Jian Wushuang’s decision.","“Darknorth, why are you talking so much to him? Just kill them!”","Supreme Green River let out an angry laugh. The seven star devil saber appeared in his hand once again, and a black light streaked across the air.","“Alright,”","Supreme Darknorth shook his head and didn’t say anything else. Then, a layer of frost covered his arm!","The next moment!","Kill!!!","Supreme Green River waved his right hand, and the seven star demonic saber in his hand turned into a stream of light again. As he slashed down, the entire Planet Tianhuang was occupied by the saber, as if the heavenly river had reversed and chaos had just begun!","Under this blade, heaven and earth seemed to have been refined into a line, and everyone’s eyes lost all light!","As for Supreme Darknorth, he clenched his fist, and in an instant, the entire South Sea began to boil. Hundreds of millions of tons of seawater rolled up, went against the current, and slapped toward Jian Wushuang!","The entire sea hung high in the sky. What a shocking scene!","“Seal!”","Supreme Darknorth sighed softly. In an instant, the endless sea water that was hanging upside down in the sky and slapping toward Jian Wushuang was frozen, turning into a million miles of snow!","The entire Planet Tianhuang was turned into a world of ice and snow!","The power of a Supreme martial artist could easily change the heavens and earth!","As for the strongest expert, Supreme Lie Chen, he had been in a state of deep thought after taking a glance at Jian Wushuang. He frowned slightly and did not make a move. Instead, he seemed to be thinking about something.","“Good!”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and divine light shot out three inches from his eyes!","In the face of the world-destroying saber radiance and the ice-sealing power, he stomped his right foot heavily and soared into the sky!","The ancient bronze cauldron appeared in his hand!","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and looked down at the ancient bronze cauldron in his hand. He muttered to himself, “Let’s release our true brilliance.”","Xiantian fourth fire, burn!!!","“BOOM!”","In an instant, the ancient bronze cauldron began to shake violently, and the flame runes on the cauldron suddenly lit up!","...","An indescribable, terrifying, and scorching aura was being emitted from the ancient cauldron!","The next moment!","“Hu!”","A purple-red flame shot out of the ancient bronze cauldron!","In just an instant, this monstrous flame spread out and covered a million miles of land. It directly burned the pitch-black blade light and the ice!","Flames, flames that covered the sky and earth!","The sun and the moon shone on the flames!","The entire Planet Tianhuang was turned into a fiery dome!","This was a fire that could burn the heavens, burning cities and incinerating the heavens!","It was as if the two were not on the same level at all. Whether it was the world-destroying Saber Light that sank the divine land or the hundreds of millions of feet of ice that gathered the water of the sea and turned it into a World of ice and snow, they all collapsed and disintegrated upon contact with the flame!","At that moment, everyone was stunned. They all looked up at Jian Wushuang, dumbfounded.","...","Standing in the middle of the fire, Jian Wushuang, who was holding the ancient bronze cauldron, looked like the Lord of fire and the god of fire!","After breaking the two supreme arts, the flame continued to rush toward the three Supreme Masters in an extremely overbearing and turbulent manner!","In an instant, the bodies of Supreme Green River and Supreme Darknorth trembled violently, and a hint of shock and anger flashed through their eyes."]},{"number":4367,"title":"Chapter 4367 Exposed","paragraphs":["4367 Exposed","“He can actually use the innate fourth fire Qi. This is rare.”","Only the skinny blind old man in a shabby Taoist robe was surprised for a moment before he returned to normal.","He took a step forward, and a large amount of supreme divine power gushed out from his hands, forming a light shield that protected the three of them.","The Xiantian fourth fire that was rushing over pounced on the light shield, and it kept making ‘chi chi’ sounds. For a moment, it was unable to do anything to the golden light shield.","Just as the innate fourth fire burned off a layer of the light barrier, more and more supreme divine power gushed out to stop the innate fourth fire Qi from corroding it.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and a hint of unwillingness flashed in his eyes.","He had wanted to use the connate fourth fire Qi to burn these two great Supremes to death in one go, but it seemed that the attack of the advanced Supreme, Lie Chen, was still not enough.","However, Jian Wushuang was not discouraged. The ancient bronze cauldron already had the power to kill a Supreme even before it was truly awakened. Once it collected the complete innate five elements Qi, the five elements would transform into chaos. At that time, it was obvious that the ancient bronze cauldron would really have a qualitative leap!","“I can’t kill them. But...”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned slightly and looked at the terrified Young Master Qingmu. He sneered, “Go!”","In an instant, a fire snake emerged from the endless Xiantian fourth fire Qi and rushed toward Young Master Qingmu!","He, Jian Wushuang, had never bullied anyone in his life, but it did not mean that he was a soft persimmon that could be easily pinched and bullied!","This Young Master Qingmu had threatened to kill him time and time again, and Jian Wushuang had long been determined to kill him!","Hu!","The fire was getting more and more intense!","When Young Master Qingmu saw the purple-red fire snake rushing toward him, his legs trembled in fear and his face was filled with terror.","“You...you’re an exalted Ruler! What sort of skill is it to kill a Ruler like me? If you have the guts, why don’t you lower your cultivation level to a Ruler and fight me?”","Young Master Qingmu first glanced at his family’s old ancestor, Supreme Green River, who couldn’t even take care of himself, and then summoned up his courage and shouted.","“Frog in the well.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and didn’t bother to talk to him.","When Supreme Green River saw this scene, he immediately roared at Jian Wushuang, “If you kill Qingmu, the Green family will not rest until you die!!!”","Before he could finish.","The Xiantian fourth fire Qi immediately wrapped around Young Master Qingmu!","“Ah! I, Qingmu, am going to become a Supreme martial artist. I am the main character of this era. How can I die here? No!”","Instantly, Young Master Qingmu’s miserable shrieks came from the innate fourth fire!","However, in just an instant, the miserable howls stopped abruptly. Young Master Qingmu’s body and spirit were destroyed and turned into ashes.","In an instant, the entire place fell into a dead silence.","In the desolate area of the universe, the venerated Young Master Qingmu, who had the title of heaven’s chosen, had fallen.","When Supreme Green River saw this, he felt as though his heart was bleeding. His expression was contorted to the extreme.","No one knew that the so-called Dao fruit that accompanied Young Master Qingmu and the great fortune that he possessed was actually Supreme Green River’s doing behind the scenes.","He was the one who had given up the Dao fruit and obtained the demon Phoenix bloodline at a great cost from the demon Phoenix Clan. Even the divine demon halberd was something he had shamelessly promised countless benefits to get from his Supreme-being old friend.","Everything he had done was to create an invincible heart for Young Master Qingmu, so that he could be firm on the path of cultivation and break through to the Supreme level!","However, with this fire, the painstaking efforts that he had spent a great price and time to create were all destroyed in one day!","Ruler Green River instantly went mad!","“Ah! No matter who you are, in this life, I, Green River, will slaughter your entire family and let you enjoy the greatest pain and torture in the world!”","Supreme Green River roared.","“You?”","Jian Wushuang sneered and said, “I’m leaving today, none of you can stop me.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and immediately shot out of Planet Tianhuang.","Jian Wushuang withdrew the endless flame back into the ancient bronze cauldron like a divine sword returning to its sheath.","After the innate fourth fire returned to the ancient bronze cauldron, the entire South Sea disappeared. The hundreds of millions of tons of frozen seawater evaporated, turning the entire ocean into a bottomless pit.","The sky was filled with water vapor after the seawater evaporated, making it difficult to see clearly.","“You want to run?”","Supreme Lie Chen furrowed his brows as he coldly replied, “I’d like to see who you are, you cowardly rat!”","“Heavenly eye, open!”","Supreme Lie Chen wiped his eyes with his right hand, and his eyes, which had only been white, suddenly lit up with an endless red light!","Under this gaze, Jian Wushuang, who had already fled far away, seemed to be seen through. Whether it was his cultivation realm or his true appearance, everything was seen through.","In the next moment, Supreme Lie Chen’s body trembled, and his calm expression instantly changed. He couldn’t help but exclaim, “He’s a Ruler!!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the entire Hall was shocked. It was as if a bomb had been dropped, and everyone was in an uproar!","“What? Ruler-level?”","“A Ruler fighting a Ruler?!!”","“Are you sure? The masked man who defeated Young Master Qingmu with a snap of his fingers, suppressed Green River and Supreme Darknorth, and fought against three great Rulers for so long is only at the Ruler realm?”","“There’s such a powerful Ruler within the cosmos?”","...","At this moment, everyone went crazy. Their eyes were so shocked that they almost fell out. They were extremely terrified.","However, this was not the end.","Supreme Lie Chen continued, “If I’m not wrong, he’s Jian Wushuang!!!”","Boom~!","As soon as his words fell, it was equivalent to dropping a heavy bomb in everyone’s hearts, setting off a stormy wave!","Supreme Darknorth and Supreme Green River, who had already paled, trembled once more and said in disbelief, “What? He is Jian Wushuang?”","The next moment, the three of them looked at each other, and their faces were filled with ecstasy!","“Hahahaha, the Jian Wushuang that the entire universe is looking for has been found by us!”","The eyes of the three men were filled with greed.","Jian Wushuang was a famous name in the universe. Only by killing Jian Wushuang would one be able to obtain the identity of an outer disciple of the dragon clan and enjoy the eternal protection of the dragon clan!","Other than that, there were also bounties from the other four top powers, such as billions of universe origin stones, resources from the five star fields, and so on!","...","Other than that, there was also the Tarot Divine Sword that all the other races coveted!","It was an unrivaled treasure that was truly famous in the universe!","Including the ancient bronze cauldron that Jian Wushuang had just used, it was obviously extraordinary, far beyond the existence of a universe treasure!","There were simply too many benefits!","Thinking of this, the three great masters went crazy!","“Catch up and kill Jian Wushuang!”","Bang!","The three of them took a step forward and all of them burst out with their supreme divine power, shooting toward Jian Wushuang!"]},{"number":4368,"title":"Chapter 4368 Chase After","paragraphs":["4368 Chase After","“Damn it!”","Jian Wushuang turned his head to look at the three great masters, and his expression suddenly became so gloomy that it could drip water.","He had never expected that Supreme Lie Chen would have a pair of heart’s eye heavenly pupils that could see through the illusions of the world.","Now, it was probably impossible for him to hide his identity again.","“Fine, since you like to chase after me, I’ll give you a big gift!”","Jian Wushuang stretched out his hand to touch the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword that was hidden behind his black robe. The corners of his mouth curled into a cold smile.","Whoosh!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang took a step forward and shot toward the Galaxy!","“Hahaha, Jian Wushuang, you came to me and now you want to escape?”","The three great masters looked at each other and laughed.","At that moment, even Green River Supreme, who had just experienced the pain of losing his grandson, had long forgotten the pain. In his eyes, there was only greed for the reward and the treasures that Jian Wushuang had on him!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The three of them followed closely behind and soon disappeared into Planet Tianhuang.","On the Spratly sand island.","Everyone watched the four of them leave with their mouths wide open, unable to come back to their senses for a long time.","It was not until a long time later that they heard the sound of people swallowing their saliva in unison.","“Did you guys hear what Supreme Lie Chen just said? The masked man is Jian Wushuang!”","“I heard that Jian Wushuang became powerful because of the Tarot Divine Sword. He didn’t even use the Tarot Divine Sword just now, but he was able to fight against three great Supremes. It seems that the universe has seriously underestimated Jian Wushuang’s power!”","“I said before that Young Master Qingmu could easily defeat Jian Wushuang. Now it seems that I was too short-sighted and ignorant.”","A Ruler who had previously said that Young Master Qingmu could suppress Jian Wushuang said with a bitter smile.","Jian Wushuang is the real number one heaven’s favorite in the world. He’s overpowered everyone in his generation!","“Young Master Qingmu, you’re far from that!”","More people looked at Jian Wushuang’s disappearing back with awe and envy.","They were all Ultimate Rulers, but Jian Wushuang’s strength was far from theirs.","It was only at this moment that they finally believed that there really were existences in the universe who weren’t even at the Ruler realm but were able to contend with Supremes!","On the other side of the Spratly Islands.","The star rhythm Ruler was in a daze. When Jian Wushuang defeated Young Master Qingmu, she thought that Jian Wushuang was just bullying a junior because of his cultivation. Now that she knew that Jian Wushuang was also in the Ultimate Ruler Realm, the invincible illusion and worship she had for Young Master Qingmu instantly shattered.","“It turns out that he...he is Jian Wushuang.”","The Starstreak Ruler muttered to herself.","Stardust, comparing that Young Master Qingmu to Jian Wushuang is like comparing a grain of rice to the bright moon. You have eyes but no pupils.","The Stardust Ruler sighed and looked at the place where Jian Wushuang had disappeared. His eyes were filled with longing.","“This is how a man should be.”","...","Outside Planet Tianhuang.","Jian Wushuang turned into a ray of light and sped forward.","The three great Supremes, Lie Chen, Green River, and Darknorth, also turned into shooting stars and followed closely behind.","“Lie Chen, if we force Jian Wushuang into a corner, he’ll definitely use the Tarot Divine Sword. We’ll have to rely on you to stop him then.”","Supreme Green River’s eyes flickered.","Supreme Lie Chen nodded his head and sneered, “As we all know, Jian Wushuang can only use the Tarot sword once. I’ll use the death substitution talisman to block it.”","With that, he flipped his right hand, and a person with the same appearance as him appeared.","There was a yellow talisman on the insignificant person’s forehead. It was enough to block a fatal blow for him!","It was because of the presence of the scapegoat that the three of them dared to pursue Jian Wushuang without any worries.","Supreme Green River smiled when he saw this. He then looked at Jian Wushuang and shouted, “Jian Wushuang, you little thief, surrender now. Hand over the Tarot Divine Sword and the ancient bronze cauldron, and I’ll spare your life!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang looked at Supreme Green River as if he was looking at a fool. Then, without saying a word, he continued flying forward.","He remembered that there was a backtrack place not far away from Planet Tianhuang. The spacetime there was chaotic and the void was cracked all year round. It was the perfect place for him to use his trump cards!","“Jian Wushuang, this little thief, is leading us to the place of backtrack.”","Lie Chen and the other two were universe Supremes, so they were not stupid. After thinking for a while, they guessed Jian Wushuang’s intention.","“Hmph, the little thief’s escape route is just what I wanted. If we kill Jian Wushuang there, the remaining divine power fluctuations will immediately cause chaos in the void storm. No one will know that we killed Jian Wushuang and took the Tarot Divine Sword.”","As a result, the people on both sides each had their own ulterior motives, and they continuously approached the place of backtrack with a tacit understanding.","After the time it took for three incense sticks to burn, a Whirlpool made up of countless broken stars and meteorites appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang suddenly stopped and turned to look at the three great masters.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang quickly thought of countermeasures in his mind,","Among the three great Rulers, the advanced-level Supreme Lie Chen was the strongest, followed by the middle-level Supreme Green River, and the weakest was Supreme Darknorth.","If Jian Wushuang wanted to escape, he would have to find a way to kill one of the Supreme martial artists. Otherwise, if the three Supreme martial artists worked together to cast a spell, even if he had the Tarot Divine Sword, he would only be defeated.","...","if we use the Tarot Divine Sword to kill Supreme Blazing Owl first, it’ll be too risky. It’s very likely that we won’t be able to kill him. Instead, we’ll be attacked by the other two great Supremes.","Jian Wushuang was deep in thought. Ever since he had used the Tarot Divine Sword, he had killed the Black Eagle Ruler and the others, but they were all beginner-stage Supremes. As for whether he could kill senior Supremes like Supreme Lie Chen, who were at a higher stage, he was really uncertain.","“In that case, why don’t we first use other divine abilities to hold off Supreme Blazing Owl and Supreme Darknorth, then kill them in a compromise...”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed and a cold killing intent surged in his eyes. He locked his gaze on the face of Supreme Green River, who was charging toward him!","First, kill Supreme Green River!","At this moment, the three Supreme martial artists who were following closely behind arrived together!","“Hahaha, Jian Wushuang, you little thief, you really know how to bury yourself!”","Supreme Green River stood in the middle and sized up Jian Wushuang from head to toe. A hint of ruthlessness flashed through his eyes.","As for Supreme Darknorth and Supreme Lie Chen, they took a step forward and blocked Jian Wushuang’s path of retreat. Then, they casually waved their hands and created a space of their own!","“Jian Wushuang, you little thief. I’ve said that I will kill you today!”","“Go to hell!”","...","Supreme Green River let out a maniacal laugh and took the lead to attack. The seven Star demonic saber reappeared in his hand, and a monstrous demonic might swept out in all directions, shattering the starry sky!","“If the heavens want them to die, they must first make them wild. Green River, the one who should die today is not me, but you!”","After Jian Wushuang finished his words, his eyes were filled with killing intent!","“Innate divine ability, life intimidation!”"]},{"number":4369,"title":"Chapter 4369 Fighting Three Supreme Martial Artists Alone","paragraphs":["4369 Fighting Three Supreme Martial Artists Alone","Boom!","In an instant, a suppressive force from the depths of the soul of a higher life form descended and enveloped the Three Rulers!","“Go, bronze cauldron!”","Jian Wushuang turned his right hand and the ancient bronze cauldron appeared. With a spin, it released a large amount of innate fourth fire again!","The Xiantian fourth-grade fire Qi was like a burning Prairie in an instant, forming an earth-shattering incinerating aura that surged toward Supreme Lie Chen!","Jian Wushuang, your small cauldron is extraordinary. The innate fourth fire in it is enough to pose a threat to ordinary Supreme martial artists, but it’s far from enough to deal with me.","Supreme Lie Chen shook his head and casually waved several light shields to block the blazing flames!","Jian Wushuang ignored him. He turned his right hand again and the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","“Eternal Night, appear!”","In an instant, the Wuqi Divine Sword disappeared inch by inch, starting from the tip of the sword.","Chi chi chi.","Wisps of pitch-black mist gushed out from the bottom of Jian Wushuang’s feet and shot toward Supreme Darknorth. They formed a huge black ball that wrapped around him!","Within the sphere, a slithering power began to appear. It was as if a pair of invisible hands had begun to strip away everything that belonged to Supreme Darknorth!","In the end, Jian Wushuang looked away and took a deep breath. Then, he pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword from his back inch by inch!","Pfft pfft pfft.","With the appearance of the Tarot Divine Sword, a brilliant sword pressure that could destroy the heavens and earth, shake the Nine Heavens and ten lands, and suppress all the races in the universe appeared between the heavens and the earth!","Sharp, overbearing, evil, and destructive!","No words could describe how terrifying this sword pressure was. Even Supreme Green River, who was a universe Supreme, couldn’t help but feel his eyelids Twitch and a chill run down his spine when faced with this brilliant sword pressure.","“Is the killer move me?”","Supreme Green River narrowed his eyes and let out a cold laugh.","“Jian Wushuang, you can only use the Tarot Divine Sword for one attack. Let’s see what you can do after this attack!”","“So what if it’s his own power? It’s enough to kill you!”","Jian Wushuang said coldly. In an instant, endless power of great Daos poured into the Tarot Divine Sword and broke the three seals that had covered Supreme Master Fu!","In an instant, the Tarot Divine Sword truly shone with golden light. The Scarlet vertical eye on the hilt of the sword suddenly opened!","“Daybreak!”","Jian Wushuang shouted in a low voice.","Crack!","A ray of golden light appeared and connected the sky and the stars into a line!","Jian Wushuang’s entire body disappeared as he merged with the Tarot Divine Sword. With an extremely fast speed, he swept toward Supreme Green River!","At this moment, all the stars in the sky lost their color, and the entire place of backtrack stopped spinning. The void shattered like glass, and countless cracks appeared. Immortal radiance sprinkled down and illuminated the world!","Previously, Jian Wushuang had used his Ruler’s divine power and Wuqi Divine Sword to activate the Tarot sword principle. However, this ‘Daybreak’ sword principle was activated by the Tarot sword and the power of great Dao. Its power had increased by several levels!","As Jian Wushuang flew across the starry sky, it was as if the endless night had been torn apart by a bolt of divine lightning. The entire sky was suddenly torn into cracks!","Supreme Green River’s pupils immediately contracted as he thought to himself, ‘How can this Jian Wushuang be so terrifying? He’s on par with me without using the Tarot Divine Sword, but even I feel threatened when he uses it! After using the Tarot Divine Sword, he would probably be able to kill any Supreme existence in any universe that was below the level of an advanced Supreme! If this kid becomes a Supreme martial artist, wouldn’t it be... ‘Wouldn’t that mean that even top-tier Supreme martial artists wouldn’t be able to do anything to him?’","Supreme Green River couldn’t help but be startled by his own conjecture, and he felt his scalp go numb.","How could such a heaven-defying monster be allowed to exist in this world?","“Green River, die!”","Jian Wushuang’s bone-chilling voice came from the golden thread that was flying at a high speed.","Supreme Green River suddenly raised his head and looked at Jian Wushuang. Then, he suddenly burst out laughing and said, “Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang, you are indeed the most talented expert in history. With the Tarot Divine Sword in your hand, you even have the power to kill me.”","After a pause, he shook his head and said, “It’s a pity that I’ve already predicted that you’ll be the first to kill me.”","With a wave of his sleeve, a straw doll with a yellow talisman on it suddenly appeared in his hand!","This scarecrow was none other than the death substitution talisman that Supreme Lie Chen had used to block a life-and-death crisis!","“Go!”","With a push of his right hand, Supreme Green River sent the straw doll flying toward Jian Wushuang!","However, a shocking situation occurred.","Bang!","The scarecrow was ruthlessly torn into countless pieces the moment it touched the dawnbreak sword light. However, the dawnbreak sword light didn’t show any signs of being worn down as it once again charged toward Supreme Green River!","In an instant, the wild and arrogant laughter on Supreme Green River’s face froze.","“W-what’s going on?”","The next moment!","He suddenly turned his head and glared at Ruler Lie Chen, who was trapped in the sea of flames but was still dealing with it with ease. He was shocked and furious to the extreme.","“Lie Chen! You tricked me?”","Before he could finish.","Pfft!","The Daybreak sword ray had already pierced through his chest!","...","The sharp and domineering Tarot sword Qi directly crushed his undying Ruler divine body!","Behind Supreme Green River, the golden light gradually dissipated, revealing Jian Wushuang’s Black-robed, black-haired figure.","Jian Wushuang held the Tarot Divine Sword and panted slightly.","“Ah!”","Supreme Green River lowered his head and looked at the hole in his chest. Then, he let out an angry roar and started to disintegrate inch by inch from his feet. In the end, his entire body was like a fortress built on the beach. He instantly collapsed and shattered, disappearing from the world.","A Supreme martial artist of a generation had fallen.","On the other side, Supreme Lie Chen, who was deep in the sea of flames, had a fake smile on his face.","“Idiot, that death substitution talisman is this old man’s second Life. How can I really let you use it? Besides, a treasure like the Tarot Divine Sword is naturally better for me to enjoy alone.”","The old and dirty starry sky Daoist robe on his body suddenly brightened up like a pearl that had been dusted off and released the brilliance that originally belonged to him.","Supreme Lie Chen’s expression was sinister as he walked out of the sea of flames. The raging flames actually couldn’t hurt him in the slightest.","In just a few seconds, he walked out of the endless sea of fire as if he was taking a stroll in his garden.","...","He looked at Jian Wushuang, twisted his neck, and said with a smile, “Jian Wushuang, now that you’ve finished using the Tarot Divine Sword, what else do you have to stop me?”","Jian Wushuang squinted at Supreme Lie Chen without saying a word.","Although this man seemed to be a man of few words, he was in truth an extremely vicious person. He had lived with Ruler Green River for dozens of chaos cycles, and yet he had been able to kill him so easily. He truly was formidable.","If Supreme Green River had not trusted this man so much and not used any other means, Jian Wushuang might not have been able to kill him so easily.","“Ruler Lie Chen, what a good plan.”","Jian Wushuang said indifferently. No one could tell if he was mocking or praising him."]},{"number":4370,"title":"Chapter 4370 Splitting the Path of Life and Death With a Single Sword","paragraphs":["4370 Splitting the Path of Life and Death With a Single Sword","In the land of backtrack.","Supreme Darknorth was still trapped in the Eternal Night Kingdom. In the vast starry sky, only Jian Wushuang and Supreme Lie Chen were left.","Supreme Lie Chen chuckled, not minding it in the slightest. “Jian Wushuang, a wise man submits to circumstances. In the face of absolute power, whether it’s your so-called overwhelming talent or the Tarot Divine Sword in your hand, they’re just like a dream. They’ll shatter at the touch.”","He stroked the beard on his chin and smiled with confidence, as if he knew everything and had the pearl of wisdom in his hand.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was calm. He knew that his greatest enemy had always been Supreme Lie Chen.","Whether it was the fallen Supreme Green River or the Supreme Darknorth who was still trapped in the Eternal Night Kingdom, Jian Wushuang wasn’t 100% sure that he could kill them. However, if he wanted to leave, they definitely wouldn’t be able to stop him with their skills.","Only Ruler Lie Chen was left!","The gap between him and Supreme Lie Chen was simply too great. An Ultimate Ruler and a high-ranked Supreme were a full realm apart!","Moreover, the difference between these few realms was so great that it was like the difference between cloud and mud!","Supreme Lie Chen didn’t mind Jian Wushuang’s silence and continued, “Jian Wushuang, I’m wasting my breath on you because I don’t have the intention to kill you. I’m giving you another chance. You have to be clear about this.”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes.","Supreme Lie Chen glanced at Jian Wushuang and said, “Jian Wushuang, I have to say that your luck and talent are the best in this era. It can even be said that you have been at the top since the birth of the universe. Perhaps only the number one genius of the universe a hundred thousand chaos cycles ago, the East boundary, can be compared to you.”","After a short pause, Supreme Lie Chen suddenly changed the topic and grinned. “Jian Wushuang, if I’m not wrong, the ancient bronze cauldron you used before was the Wuxu chaotic cauldron you used in the East realm 100000 chaos cycles ago, right?”","A hint of irrepressible envy flashed across Supreme Lie Chen’s face as he said this.","“Wuxu chaotic cauldron?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was shocked. This was the first time he had heard someone mention the origin of the ancient bronze cauldron.","He had long found it strange that the power displayed by the ancient bronze cauldron was not any weaker than the Tarot Divine Sword. Logically speaking, it should definitely be one of the most famous treasures in the universe.","“Jian Wushuang, you don’t have to play dumb. Although I’m blind, I’m not blind. There are only two or three items that can control the primordial chaos five elements Qi. The only one that has such power is the Wuxu chaotic cauldron!","“However, it seems that you haven’t completely awakened the Wuxu chaotic cauldron yet. Otherwise, you should be able to directly transfer the chaotic force.”","Supreme Lie Chen shook his head.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. Supreme Lie Chen was most likely right. The ancient bronze cauldron he had obtained from Qiu Long was the Wuxu chaotic cauldron that the East realm possessed 100000 years ago.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang also understood why Supreme Lie Chen had delayed killing him.","It was likely that Supreme Lie Chen had seen that he had the Wuxu chaotic cauldron and subconsciously thought that he had also obtained the inheritance of the East realm. He wanted to find out more about the burial place of the East realm from him and obtain more benefits!","Supreme Lie Chen’s greed had far exceeded his expectations.","“Alright, I’m done. Jian Wushuang, I’m running out of patience. Hand over the Tarot sword, the Wuxu chaotic cauldron, the Tarot Sword Manual, and the other opportunities. As long as you’re obedient, this old man can take you in as a servant. Although you’ll become this old man’s eternal slave, you’ll still be able to live.”","Supreme Lie Chen said as he stretched his neck.","“What if I don’t tell you?” Jian Wushuang looked at him and answered.","“Hehe.” Supreme Lie Chen smiled faintly, a hint of mockery appearing in his eyes. Jian Wushuang, you overestimate your power and underestimate me. The gap between an advanced Supreme and an Ultimate Ruler is far beyond your imagination. No matter how strong your super power, divine power, or Supreme treasure is, you are just an ant in my eyes.","After saying this, Supreme Lie Chen paused for a moment before continuing, “Jian Wushuang, it’s a pity that you don’t know that you have nowhere to go. Fine, I’ll show you my ability first!”","Supreme Lie Chen shook his head and casually flicked his finger at Jian Wushuang.","Bang!","As he flicked his finger, tens of thousands of rules evolved and turned into all kinds of rules of the great Dao. They mixed together and formed an extremely strong power!","In an instant, the void shattered and countless wormholes exploded. It was majestic and did not seem to exist in the mortal world!","In just half a breath, the finger that could destroy the starry sky was about to land on Jian Wushuang!","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang put the Tarot Divine Sword back into the sword case on his back and a touch of determination flashed in his eyes!","Whoosh!","The next moment, the Wuqi Divine Sword condensed in his hand.","Since there was no path ahead, he would use the three-foot Long Qingfeng sword in his hand to cut a path of life and death!","The power of the great Dao in his body surged and slashed toward the finger!","“Sundering stars!”","A 50,000-foot blue sword energy that could pierce through the sky suddenly surged!","The sword light was so brilliant that it seemed to break the entire universe. At that moment, there was only the sword light left in the universe. In the sword light, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were full of fighting intent. His black hair flew in the air. Holding the blazing blue sword light, he looked like a peerless sword God!","The Star Sundering skill was a real killing move created by Jian Wushuang. After he comprehended the power of great Daos, it had also sublimated to the extreme and reached another level!","This sword strike was full of Daoist techniques, full of charm, and the meaning of the cycle of heavenly law.","This sword was a protection!","What was protection?","In Jian Wushuang’s understanding, as long as he killed all the enemies in the world, suppressed the Nine Heavens and ten lands, and no one dared to hurt him or the people he wanted to protect, he would be protecting them!","what a powerful sword. It has already stepped into the realm of ‘Dao’.","Supreme Lie Chen shook his head in admiration, but there wasn’t the slightest hint of fear in his eyes.","“It’s a pity that I’ve also comprehended the Dao.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Supreme Lie Chen’s finger, which was pressing down, suddenly shone with light.","The brilliant sword struck his finger, but it only managed to penetrate a thousand feet before it shattered like glass on a rock.","The shattered sword light turned into countless rays and swept in all directions, shattering countless meteorites in this backtrack land. Then, it shot into the distance of the universe and disappeared.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank.","...","Bang!","Before he could think further, the finger had already hit Jian Wushuang and sent him flying, breaking the void.","“An ant trying to shake a tree, laughable.”","Supreme Lie Chen’s expression didn’t change as he shook his head."]},{"number":4371,"title":"Chapter 4371 Great Enemy","paragraphs":["4371 Great Enemy","“Husband!”","In the universe, Leng Rushuang’s heart-wrenching scream rang out.","Then, he saw Leng Rushuang rush out of the heaven suppressing monument.","Kachakachaa.","Jian Wushuang’s body crashed into an asteroid and pierced through it. Then, he flew back for tens of thousands of feet before he gradually stopped.","Several cracks appeared on his God Body, and his face turned pale.","“Shuang ‘er, why did you come out?”","Jian Wushuang looked at Leng Rushuang and said, suppressing the boiling force in his chest.","“Husband, are you alright?”","Leng Rushuang strode over and said with a pained expression.","“I’m fine. Go back to the heaven suppressing monument.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head at her, then fixed his gaze on Supreme Lie Chen.","It had to be said that Supreme Lie Chen was the strongest enemy he had ever encountered!","“Oh?”","Supreme Lie Chen turned to look at Leng Rushuang, then at Jian Wushuang. He said with a faint smile, “Jian Wushuang, this person is your cultivation partner, right? You’re quite lucky. Not only are your talents and opportunities top-notch, but even your Dao companion’s talent is also not bad. It seems that she once had an opportunity.”","Jian Wushuang didn’t answer. Instead, he took a deep breath and held the Wuqi Divine Sword tightly with both hands. His eyes flickered continuously as if he was thinking in secret.","Immediately!","“Again!”","Jian Wushuang shouted and used the Daybreak swordsmanship again!","Clang!","A strand of golden light appeared. At first, it was only as thick as a strand of hair. However, it quickly wrapped around Jian Wushuang and transformed into a soaring golden thorn. It broke through all the darkness in the world and once again headed toward Supreme Lie Chen!","The stroke was extremely powerful and it was also Jian Wushuang’s most powerful killing move. It was extremely fast and it seemed to break through layers of raging waves. Along the way, many small planets were turned into dust and even the space was shattered at the same time. It was extremely terrifying!","Peng peng peng!","A series of earth-shaking sonic booms resounded in the area where the golden light flashed.","“This is the Tarot sword principle, right?”","Supreme Lie Chen couldn’t help but be slightly moved. He remembered that Jian Wushuang had used the Tarot Divine Sword to kill Supreme Green River just now.","“It’s a pity. If you had used the Tarot sword, I would still be afraid of you and be unable to take you down. But now that you can’t use the Tarot sword, you’re just a joke if you rely on your own strength.”","Finished speaking.","Ruler Lie Chen’s eyes flickered, and a pitch-black light suddenly shot out from his eyes.","“Heavenly eye, open!”","He shouted. In an instant, under his gaze, Jian Wushuang’s movements in the golden light of dawn became extremely slow. He looked like a snail that was struggling to move toward him.","His eyes could not only see through all illusions in the world, but they could also slow down his movements and find his weaknesses!","The next moment.","“Supreme Divine Art, Nine Heavenly finger.”","Supreme Lie Chen sneered and flicked his fingers nine times in the void. It was as if he was playing a lute. In an instant, nine divine lights formed by supreme divine power streaked across like meteors and bombarded Jian Wushuang’s weak point.","Peng peng peng!","The golden light that Jian Wushuang had turned into trembled and the golden light was destroyed with each hit.","In the end, after flicking his eight fingers, Jian Wushuang’s daybreak sword light was completely destroyed, leaving only Jian Wushuang’s figure that was charging forward with his sword.","“My husband!”","Instantly, Leng Rushuang, who was watching the battle from afar, felt her heart tighten!","In the end, Jian Wushuang managed to get within a hundred feet of Supreme Lie Chen’s divine body. The ninth finger, which was as big as a mountain, finally fell and flicked on the Wuqi Divine Sword!","A tremendous force that could move mountains and seas and grab a Star River came over. Jian Wushuang’s right hand couldn’t hold on and the Wuqi Divine Sword was sent flying. The right hand that was holding the sword was also blown to pieces!","The Daybreak swordsmanship was actually destroyed by Supreme Lie Chen’s finger before it could even get close to him!","“Jian Wushuang, do you now understand the difference between you and me?”","Supreme Lie Chen’s face was as cold as ice as he stared at Jian Wushuang with his black eyes and sneered without a trace of emotion.","“Is that so?”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang, whose face was sallow, suddenly laughed in a deep voice.","In the next moment, he reached out with his left hand, and the Tarot Divine Sword that he had been carrying on his back was unsheathed once again. It was now in his left hand!","The dawnbreak was just a cover. The real killing move was the Tarot Divine Sword!","In the past, he could indeed only use the Tarot Divine Sword once. If he wanted to use it a second time, he would have to recover for a long time. However, how could the current him be the same as before?","“Go to hell!”","A crazed look flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes as he slashed the Tarot Divine Sword in his left hand toward Supreme Lie Chen.","At that moment, the power of great DAOs in Jian Wushuang’s body began to circulate madly. Then, it was all poured into the Tarot Divine Sword and devoured by it!","This sword strike held nothing back and used all his strength!","...","This sword was enough to kill a God!","Bang!","Instantly, the eye on the hilt of the Tarot Divine Sword opened, and it was covered in blood!","An extremely majestic aura spread out from the Tarot Divine Sword, and white Thunderbolts exploded in the air. Countless sword Qi and endless Yuan Qi energy intertwined, as if chaos was boiling.","Boom!","Immediately, there was an explosion as if the gate of heaven had opened and endless celestial light fell. At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s figure seemed to be blurred and replaced by a figure in a green robe. He rode a sword for thousands of miles and drank from the heaven and earth. With a sword in one hand and a wine pot in the other, he opened his hazy eyes and smiled at the heaven and earth.","“This, this is the Tarot Swordmaster!”","Supreme Lie Chen’s face was instantly filled with shock, and he could no longer maintain his composure. At this moment, the person reflected in his eyes did not seem to be Jian Wushuang, but the primordial Sword Master Tarot from 300 chaos cycles ago, who had suppressed the entire era and dominated the universe alone!","“Slash!”","As Jian Wushuang’s deep and cold voice rang out, the sword finally struck down.","Rip!","...","In an instant, the entire universe’s starry sky was split into tens of thousands of feet, as if a sword had split the sea.","“I thought you could only use it once? How...how is this possible?”","Supreme Lie Chen’s pupils shrank. According to the news from the universe, Jian Wushuang only had the power of one strike from the Tarot Divine Sword.","How could he still use the Tarot Divine Sword?","How was that possible?","Supreme Lie Chen didn’t have time to think about it. The Tarot Divine Sword had already slashed down at an extreme speed, leaving him no time to change his move or dodge. He could only take it head-on!","Jian Wushuang!","Supreme Lie Chen finally understood that Jian Wushuang hadn’t used the dawnbreak swordsmanship to kill him. Instead, he had used it to close the distance between them and catch him off guard. The real killing move was the Tarot Divine Sword!","At this critical moment of life and death, Supreme Lie Chen quickly flipped his right hand, and a puppet doll with a mixture of joy and sorrow appeared in his hand."]},{"number":4372,"title":"Chapter 4372 An All-Out Attack","paragraphs":["4372 An All-Out Attack","“Go!”","His face sank as his right hand quickly formed an incantation gesture. Then, he tapped the space between the puppet doll’s eyebrows. In an instant, the puppet doll seemed to come to life as it twisted its body and stood up in the void. Supreme Lie Chen then disappeared.","Bang!","The target of the Tarot Divine Sword suddenly changed. It locked onto the puppet doll and ruthlessly slashed down!","!!","In an instant, the puppet doll shattered into pieces, and the destructive power of the Tarot Divine Sword also disappeared.","The celestial light gradually dissipated. Jian Wushuang, who had overused a large amount of divine power, lost his balance and almost fell from the sky. He took several divine medicines to recover his divine power and his exhausted divine body was nourished. Only then did he feel better.","“A death substitution magic treasure?”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. If Supreme Lie Chen didn’t die from this attack, it would be difficult to kill him.","Ka-chak.","Not far away, the void suddenly distorted, and Supreme Lie Chen’s body began to gradually condense.","His expression was gloomy as he stared at Jian Wushuang with a cold glint in his eyes.","If he hadn’t used the death substitution puppet in time, he would have died under the sword just now, following in the footsteps of Green River Supreme.","“Hmph, Jian Wushuang, I originally wanted to spare your life. Since you are so insensible, don’t blame me for being merciless and crushing you directly. I don’t believe that with my means, you can persist in not telling me about the opportunities you have.”","Supreme Lie Chen squinted his eyes and took a step forward, causing the void beneath his feet to ripple. When he reappeared, he was already on Jian Wushuang’s head.","Bang!","He raised his foot and stomped down on Jian Wushuang!","In an instant, countless voids were annihilated. His foot turned into thousands of mountains that suppressed the surroundings.","“Again!”","Jian Wushuang’s face was pale, but his eyes were cold. The power of great Daos evolved around him and turned into various rules. Then, he struck again with the Wuqi Divine Sword.","The secret skill of dragon blood, divine power ignition!","Peng peng peng!","Jian Wushuang, who was already dispirited, suddenly had his aura surge and soar!","A sharp sword rainbow that cut through the sun and the moon and tore the sky appeared suddenly. However, after the sharp sword rainbow struck down, it was only 100 feet into the foot before it was shattered. Jian Wushuang was directly stomped down 10000 feet into the starry sky and his divine body collapsed.","“My husband!”","At that moment, Leng Rushuang felt as if she had fallen into an ice cellar. Her eyes turned red and wet with tears.","She did not know how long it had been since she had seen Jian Wushuang in such a desperate situation.","Leng Rushuang gritted her teeth when she saw Supreme Lie Chen’s cold expression and his desire to pursue Jian Wushuang again. Divine power erupted from her body, and the nine-section divine whip appeared in her hand. She whipped it at Supreme Lie Chen.","“A Mantis trying to stop a chariot, overestimating your own strength.”","Supreme Lie Chen looked at Leng Rushuang coldly and waved his hand. A vast force blasted out from his hand and smashed Leng Rushuang into the depths of a star.","“Don’t worry. After I kill your husband, Jian Wushuang, I will send you to be his companion.”","Supreme Lie Chen snorted coldly and looked at Jian Wushuang again.","Jian Wushuang’s divine body, which had collapsed, instantly regenerated and his pale face turned sallow.","He held the Wuqi Divine Sword in his right hand and stood up shakily. He looked at Supreme Lie Chen and suddenly laughed.","“Jian Wushuang, what are you laughing at?”","Supreme Lie Chen frowned as a cold glint of wind flickered in his dark eyes.","In his eyes, Jian Wushuang was like a catfish jumping on the chopping board. His life or death was in his hands.","“Lie Chen, do you really think that I’m out of options?”","Jian Wushuang stopped smiling and shook his head. His eyes became calm again.","“Hehe.” Supreme Lie Chen’s eyes were filled with faint mockery as he said, Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang, let’s not talk about your strength and talent. I have to admire your tenacious vitality. Therefore, no matter what the decision is today, you won’t be able to walk out of the backtrack land.","“Is that so?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows, then lowered his head and took out a jade token hanging on his waist. He couldn’t help but sigh in his heart.","“Blood Wave Supreme, I owe you one more time.”","Bang!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang crushed the Jade token on his waist!","Kachaa.","A crack appeared on the Jade token at his waist.","A majestic aura that seemed to come from the primordial chaos slowly rose from the jade token.","“This is?”","In an instant, Supreme Lie Chen’s body trembled violently, and a hint of shock appeared in his eyes.","This aura was far above his!","His power, which was enough to crush Jian Wushuang, was like the difference between a child and an adult in front of this aura!","The gap between them was even greater than that between him and Jian Wushuang!","BOOM! BOOM!","This aura became more and more intense. At this moment, time seemed to have stopped in the entire backtrack land. Everything had stopped moving.","Supreme Lie Chen’s eyes widened as he watched this aura continue to condense, finally transforming into a handsome, expressionless black-robed middle-aged man.","...","This black-clothed middle-aged man was hundreds of millions of feet tall, and his eyes were like mountains. Under his feet, the nearly 10000-foot starry sky had turned into a pool of blood, dyed with a demonic red.","An indescribable power surged and slapped in all directions, causing all races to submit and shaking the Nine Heavens and ten lands!","“He’s the strongest Supreme-being among the top Supreme-beings! Blood Wave!”","In an instant, Supreme Lie Chen’s body trembled violently as he cried out in shock!","The Blood Wave Supreme was one of the five lead Supremes of the Divine Life Palace. He was second only to the unparalleled Supreme!","The Blood Wave Supreme had a world-shaking cultivation. He was an epic figure who had survived the catastrophe and had fought countless battles in his life. He had once suppressed the Great Void Temple and fought with the newly-promoted Emperor God, Supreme Bing Ye, for three days and three nights. He had also fought with the invincible great Cosmos Temple’s Hall Master. Finally, he had shown his brilliance in the war with the Dragon Tribe. The number of Supremes who had died in his hands could be counted with two hands!","It could be said that as long as the invincible Ruler didn’t appear, the Ruler Blood Wave would be able to do as he pleased in the universe. He was a true great figure in the depths of the universe!","He was far from someone Supreme lie Hong, who had to live in the desolate area of the universe, could compare to.","The next moment!","The Ruler Blood Wave’s illusory figure slowly opened its eyes and coldly glared at Supreme Lie Chen.","“Who gave you the right to bully the people of the Divine Life Palace?”","...","Bang!","An endless pool of blood condensed and transformed into a gigantic hand that blotted out the sun as it slapped toward Supreme Lie Chen!","How terrifying was a full-force attack from a top-tier Supreme martial artist? This was especially so for an ultimate existence like Blood Wave, who was a top-tier Supreme Being!","At this moment, the great Dao of heaven and earth trembled and roared. Countless voids shattered and collapsed at the same time, and the entire backtrack place exploded!"]},{"number":4373,"title":"Chapter 4373 The Blood Curse","paragraphs":["4373 The Blood Curse","Run!!!","Supreme Lie Chen’s heart instantly went into a frenzy, and he turned around to flee!","However...","The entire universe seemed to have frozen over. Under the full-force attack of the Ruler Blood Wave, a massive suction force was drawn from the palm of his hand, sending Ruler Lie Chen flying toward the palm!","!!","The palm finally pressed down.","Endless celestial light and Starlight surged, and the palm patterns were so thin that they were almost visible. Under this palm, all sounds were silent.","Bang!","Supreme Lie Chen poured out all of his divine power to resist the palm.","At this moment, his heart was filled with regret and even more so, he felt extremely aggrieved.","If he had known that Jian Wushuang had such a great killing move, he would not have dared to chase after Jian Wushuang even if he had ten times the courage.","Ka-chak.","However, it was useless to say anything at this time. This palm was the Blood Wave Supreme’s full-powered attack. If Supreme Lie Chen had been a top-tier Supreme, he might have been able to resist it. However, he was only an advanced Supreme, so how could he resist the Blood Wave Supreme’s full-powered attack?","His feet were the first to be obliterated inch by inch by the tremendous power of the palm. Soon after, his arms began to explode.","“Jian Wushuang, even if I die, I won’t let you have an easy time!”","Supreme Lie Chen suddenly turned to look at Jian Wushuang with a resentful expression. He shouted with all his strength, “Supreme Divine Art, Blood Curse!”","Bang!","All of a sudden, Supreme Lie Chen’s eyes exploded, and two streams of blood flowed out of his eyes. They twisted and condensed, and finally hung above Jian Wushuang’s head, forming a huge Scarlet word, ‘kill’!","With the word ‘kill’ in front of him, all of Jian Wushuang’s concealment techniques would be exposed. He would even be like a piece of rotten meat that would attract all the experts above the Supreme realm in the surrounding ten thousand miles of starry sky!","“Damn it!”","Jian Wushuang’s face suddenly turned gloomy and his eyes were filled with killing intent.","“Hahahaha! Jian Wushuang, I’d like to see how many times the Ruler Blood Wave’s full-power attack can protect you!”","Boom~!","“Hahahaha...” Supreme Lie Chen’s divine body was obliterated by Supreme Blood Wave’s palm, and he laughed maniacally.","Supreme Lie Chen had died!","After killing Supreme Lie Chen, the power of that palm also gradually dissipated. In the end, it disappeared and returned to nothingness.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void, his black hair flying in the wind, and his expression was uncertain.","He didn’t feel the slightest bit of joy at the death of Supreme Lie Chen.","The huge ‘kill’ word hanging above his head was like a bright light in the dark night, extremely conspicuous, and he had nowhere to hide.","He tried to use the power of the great Dao to erase the word ‘kill’, and also tried to see if the Antelope mask could cover it, but it was useless. All his methods were useless.","“This is going to be troublesome.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered continuously. He understood that the word ‘kill’ would cause a stir among the Supremes in the entire universe and they would come to kill him.","Just as Jian Wushuang was deep in thought, a burst of crazy laughter suddenly came from nearby.","Hhahaha, Jian Wushuang, I’m finally out!”","In the distance, the Eternal Night Kingdom continued to shatter and finally exploded. Although Supreme Darknorth was in a sorry state, his face was full of joy as he rushed out of the Eternal Night Kingdom with a loud laugh!","“Supreme Green River, Supreme Lie Chen, how are you?”","“Come, let’s join forces and take down Jian Wushuang. We’ll split the treasure!”","“Eh...”","“Supreme Green River? Supreme Lie Chen?”","In the next moment, the smile on Supreme Darknorth’s face froze. It was as if someone had grabbed his throat, and his face turned red.","The surrounding void was in chaos, and countless cracks appeared in the void. The entire backtrack was destroyed.","Where were the shadows of Supreme verdant River and Supreme blazing Phoenix under the starry sky?","Only Jian Wushuang, who was dressed in black and had black hair, slowly turned his head and looked at him coldly.","Supreme Darknorth was momentarily stunned, but he still mustered his courage and asked, “Little thief Jian Wushuang, let me ask you. Where are Supreme Green River and Supreme Lie Chen?”","Jian Wushuang looked at him with a strange expression. He didn’t expect that Supreme Darknorth, who was the weakest among the three great Supremes that had come to kill him, would live the longest.","Immediately, he faintly replied, “You guess.”","For some reason, a premonition welled up in his heart upon hearing this, and he hurriedly spread out his divine power to sense his surroundings.","In the next moment, Supreme Darknorth’s expression changed drastically, and he sucked in a breath of cold air. His lips trembled as he said, “They...they’re dead?”","Without waiting for Jian Wushuang to answer, he took a step forward and divine power surged in his body.","Just as Jian Wushuang thought that Supreme Darknorth was going to take revenge for the deaths of Supreme Green River and Supreme Lie Chen, he clenched the Wuqi Divine Sword in his hand tightly.","“Fiend! He’s a fiend!”","“Run!” Supreme Darknorth roared as he turned around and fled. In the blink of an eye, he had disappeared from Jian Wushuang’s sight.","“Huh?”","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but be stunned. Then, a look of astonishment flashed across his face.","Shaking his head, Jian Wushuang didn’t plan to chase after him. This Supreme Darknorth was only an elementary Supreme, so he couldn’t pose any threat to him. At most, he could spread the news about him. Now that he had the word ‘kill’ above his head, it didn’t make much difference to him whether the news spread or not.","...","“What I need to do now is to quickly find a place to recover my divine power and truly open the ancient bronze cauldron! Only then will I have the power to protect myself in the upcoming battle!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and he quickly made a decision.","Then, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and put Leng Rushuang into the heaven suppressing monument. He then quickly left in a direction.","...","What Jian Wushuang didn’t know was that not long after he left, two divine lights appeared in the backtrack land like meteors.","The divine light dissipated, revealing the figures of two Supreme martial artists.","“This aura is the Tarot Divine Sword! Jian Wushuang was here before!”","One of the Supreme martial artists, who was wearing a bamboo hat and carrying a knife at his waist, said in a deep voice.","“That’s right. It’s the aura of the Tarot Divine Sword. It also contains the divine power fluctuations of Supreme Lie Chen and Supreme Green River. It seems like the two of them were killed by Jian Wushuang!”","A hunchbacked old woman with pimples all over her face and an extremely ugly appearance said in a hoarse voice.","“Go! Jian Wushuang shouldn’t have gone far, let’s chase!”","...","The eyes of the Supreme-being in the bamboo hat flickered as he looked around at the void. Finally, his eyes fixed in the direction where Jian Wushuang had left, and the corners of his mouth curled up into a cold smile.","“Look, there’s a blood tunnel here. Jian Wushuang must have been hit by Lie Chen’s Blood Curse!”","The two of them looked at each other. Then, they turned into two divine lights and chased after Jian Wushuang at an extremely fast speed!","Very quickly, the backtrack fell into silence.","Not long after, several Supreme Masters arrived one after another. After thinking for a while, they all smiled greedily and chased after Jian Wushuang!"]},{"number":4374,"title":"Chapter 4374 Awakening!","paragraphs":["4374 Awakening!","On a planet far away from the backtrack.","A light flew down and shattered, revealing Jian Wushuang’s figure.","Jian Wushuang’s face turned pale. He could vaguely sense that the Supremes in the desolate area of the universe were all rushing toward him.","“I have to open the bronze cauldron first!”","!!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered and his body quickly broke through the ground and sank into the depths of the earth.","Then, endless Sword Qi gushed out of his body. The sword Qi was dense and spread out with him as the center, burying into the ground.","After doing all this, Jian Wushuang sat down with his legs crossed. He first swallowed a few divine herbs to recover his divine power. Then, with a flip of his right hand, the ancient bronze cauldron and the soil of breath appeared in his hands.","“Refine!”","Jian Wushuang shouted. In an instant, wisps of black and yellow Qi rose from the palm-sized swelling earth and were absorbed by the ancient bronze cauldron.","“BOOM!”","In an instant, the ancient bronze cauldron let out a never-before-heard explosion!","In the space of the ancient bronze cauldron, the innate five elements Qi were constantly blending together and transforming into a terrifying power that could not be described with words.","Jian Wushuang slowly closed his eyes and split his mind into two. He continuously shot out sword Qi that filled the void while he continued to refine the ancient bronze cauldron and observed the changes that occurred in the cauldron.","A transformation was slowly beginning.","...","At the same time, outside the planet.","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Streaks of powerful divine rays of light with different auras streaked across the starry sky like meteors and landed outside the area of stars.","The light dissipated, revealing the figures of the Supreme martial artists.","The first one to arrive was the Supreme with a bamboo hat and a blade at his waist. He was a middle-grade Supreme with a powerful aura and was known as ‘Wild Blade Supreme’ in the desolate area of the universe. His strength was even slightly above Green River Supreme.","Beside him was an ugly hunchbacked old woman with red pimples all over her face.","This old woman was not very pretty, but she was also a middle-grade Supreme martial artist, also known as ‘Grandma Poison Flower’. Her poison techniques were superb, and she had even comprehended the power of the great Dao. She had once killed an advanced Supreme martial artist to death!","Jian Wushuang is here!","Supreme Master Wild Blade squinted his eyes and looked down at the star under his feet.","In the center of the star, where Jian Wushuang had sunk into the Earth’s core, there was a huge Scarlet word, ‘kill’, that was particularly eye-catching.","“Hehe, it seems that Jian Wushuang’s treasures are going to be ours.”","A sinister smile appeared on Granny Poison Flower’s face, and her voice was filled with uncontrollable excitement.","The two of them looked at each other, and their eyes were filled with greed as they flew toward the star.","“Jian Wushuang, come out. I know you’re here!”","Granny Poison Flower laughed out loud. With a pull of her hands, one of the meatballs on her Hunchback suddenly exploded. Green liquid burst out, and it was extremely stinky.","Then, the green liquid gathered in her hands and formed a poisonous flower. She smashed it at the place where Jian Wushuang had sunk!","“BOOM!”","In an instant, the entire planet trembled, and a 10000-mile-wide crater was created on the ground.","“Eh? You’ve hidden pretty well.”","Granny Poison Flower laughed nonchalantly and stepped into the ground at the same time as Supreme Wild Blade.","The moment the two of them stepped on the ground, the entire land suddenly trembled slightly.","As Supreme martial artists, the two of them naturally had extraordinary perception. Seeing this, they couldn’t help but raise their brows and let out a soft gasp.","Before the two of them could do anything, the entire ground suddenly cracked open like a spider web!","A sharp sword Qi Rainbow Rose from these cracks.","“What’s this!”","In an instant, the two of them were shocked and their pupils shrank.","Sword Qi, sword Qi that covered the entire mountain and the earth!","Millions of streaks of sword Qi streaked across the void, shattering the clouds and dyeing the entire world!","The next moment!","The sword Qi suddenly turned around and a sharp and cold intent burst forth, shooting toward Supreme Wild Blade and Granny Poison Flower!","“Hmph, small tricks.”","Seeing this, Supreme Wild Blade sneered and pulled out the snow-white long blade hanging on his waist with his right hand. His supreme divine power gushed out.","“Jian Wushuang, Jian Wushuang, I’d like to see how long this sword Qi can hold us back.”","Granny Poison Flower laughed evilly as a red box appeared in her hand.","Opening the box, there were nearly ten poisonous needles of different lengths.","Granny Poison Flower flicked her ten fingers, and the poisonous needle immediately floated into the air. As she flicked her ten fingers, it was as if there were invisible threads controlling the poisonous needle, shattering the surrounding sword Qi.","Just as the two of them were trapped by the sword Qi, several divine lights swept over from outside the star and turned into the figures of Supremes.","“Oh? I didn’t think that Supreme Wild Blade and Granny Poison Flower would be one step ahead of us.”","An evil-looking man raised his eyebrows and laughed.","...","Beside him, a thin young man with an octopus head said, “Hehe. Shushu, let these two help us to destroy this sword power, then we’ll make our move.”","This octopus-headed young man was the current clan leader of the demon octopus clan in the desolate area of the universe. He had become an advanced Supreme-being not long ago!","“Alright!”","The devilish-looking young man had a pair of narrow Fox-like eyes. He nodded upon hearing this.","“Boom, boom, boom!!”","On this star, countless sword Qi rained down on Supreme Wild Blade and Granny Poison Flower, only to be shattered by the two!","To the two of them, although the sword Qi could cause some trouble, it did not pose any threat to them.","After a while.","The millions of sword Qi in the hall were quickly destroyed at a speed visible to the naked eye. Meanwhile, Supreme Wild Blade and Granny Poison Flower were getting closer and closer to Jian Wushuang.","....","Deep in the Earth’s core.","...","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged and the ancient bronze cauldron in front of him was undergoing the most critical change!","In the space of the ancient bronze cauldron, the fourth fire Qi, the hai water Qi, the first gold Qi, the second wood Qi, and the third Earth Qi were like five different forces that were constantly merging and repelling each other.","The Qi of the five elements spread and formed each other, reinforcing and countering each other.","They came from the same source, but each had their own extreme power, so they couldn’t merge.","For example, the energy of water and fire, the energy of metal and wood, and so on. They were the most hostile forces in this world.","“How did this happen?”","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows and kept thinking.","Taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang could feel that more and more Supreme-beings were coming, and his eyes were filled with determination!","“Today, the Qi of the five elements can be melted, but if it can’t be melted, you have to melt it!!”"]},{"number":4375,"title":"Chapter 4375 Massacre!","paragraphs":["4375 Massacre!","Bang!","Jian Wushuang no longer held back any divine power. He released all of it and poured it into the ancient bronze cauldron, urging the five-element Qi to merge!","That feeling was as if he was trying to stuff soil into gold and iron, barbaric to the extreme!","Boom, boom! Boom!","In an instant, the ancient bronze cauldron began to shake violently, letting out an embarrassing cracking sound.","However, Jian Wushuang’s face was filled with joy.","He could feel that the Qi of the five elements was finally showing signs of fusion under his strong urging!","However, at the last moment of the fusion, a barrier suddenly appeared and blocked the five-element Qi!","“What is this?”","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. He felt a small person appear out of thin air with his divine power.","This little person’s black hair hung down, his face was cold, and his eyes had double pupils. His entire body was filled with a cold killing intent, causing one to feel a chill all over their body with just a glance.","However, this little person’s expression was numb and stiff, as if it didn’t have a consciousness of its own.","“Eh? An imprint?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. If he had guessed correctly, this small person should be the mark left in the cauldron by the previous owner.","In that case, based on what Supreme Lie Chen had said, the previous owner of the ancient bronze cauldron, which should have been called the Wuxu chaotic cauldron, was ...","“A hundred thousand chaos cycles ago, the publicly acknowledged number one genius of the universe, the East realm!”","The divine light in Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly grew. In other words, the mark of the little man was left by the East realm!","“I’m afraid that the ancient bronze cauldron has tried to escape several times before. Now that the connate five elements Qi can’t be combined, I’m afraid it’s all because of the mark left by the eastern world Overlord.”","The corners of Jian Wushuang’s mouth gradually curved into a cold smile.","Immediately, countless divine power gushed out and wiped away the mark!","To the current Jian Wushuang, even if the East realm had come personally, he would not be afraid, let alone a mere mark left by the East realm!","Bang!","With a muffled sound, the little person was instantly wiped out by Jian Wushuang!","There were no more obstacles in the way of the connate five elemental Qi, and they fused together!","...","On the surface of the planet.","“Hahahaha, Jian Wushuang, the sword Qi you left behind has been destroyed. Let’s see how you can stop me now.”","Supreme Wild Blade casually waved his blade and destroyed the last beam of sword Qi. He then opened his mouth and laughed.","Then, he took a step to the place where Jian Wushuang had sunk into the Earth’s core. He stretched out his hand to break the ground and tried to grab Jian Wushuang!","Granny Poison Flower’s expression was cold. She hung her ten poisonous needles in the air quietly. She was ready to give Jian Wushuang a fatal blow the moment he was caught.","The devilish young man with long narrow eyes and the Black-headed nine-clawed octopus clan’s leader also gushed out their divine force and waited for the opportunity to make a move!","At this critical moment.","“Boom boom boom!”","All of a sudden, an earth-shattering explosion rang out!","The entire world seemed to have fallen into doomsday as it trembled madly!","The earth began to crack, the mountains began to collapse, the sky began to shatter, and everything on the planet began to shatter.","“What’s going on?”","Suddenly, the faces of Supreme Wild Blade and the others changed.","The next moment!","The entire star exploded!","A boundless ancient aura that seemed to transcend the chaos of the universe rose up!","The entire starry sky of the universe resonated with the sound of the great Dao, as if heaven and earth were celebrating the birth of a Supreme treasure!","Waves of air currents spread out like shock waves. The expression on Granny Poison Flower’s face, which was full of meat lumps, changed rapidly.","“Retreat!”","Supreme Wild Blade and Granny Poison Flower looked at each other, then quickly retreated.","They only stopped after they had retreated a few hundred thousand feet. They looked at the blast with shock and doubt.","In the time it took for an incense stick to burn, the air waves gradually dissipated, revealing a black-haired man who was sitting cross-legged with a huge scarlet ‘kill’ character above his head.","He closed his eyes slightly. In front of him, an ancient bronze cauldron was spinning slowly. The chaotic aura was coming from this bronze cauldron.","“This is...the Wuxu chaos cauldron?”","The others had not noticed anything, but the devilish young man’s eyes widened and he exclaimed in shock!","The next moment!","“Not good! The Wuxu chaotic cauldron is in Jian Wushuang’s hands. We are definitely not his match. Run!”","The devilish young man said quickly.","All these years, he had been searching for the long-lost Wuxu chaotic cauldron. Although he didn’t know why the Wuxu chaotic cauldron had fallen into Jian Wushuang’s hands, he knew how terrifying it was!","...","The Demon Octopus Clan Master standing next to him frowned when he heard this. He felt that this devilish youth was making a mountain out of a molehill and casually said, “Shu Yuan, I’ve heard of the Wuxu chaotic cauldron before. It’s indeed a great killing weapon. However, Jian Wushuang is only an Ultimate Ruler. We don’t have to be so afraid of him, right?”","“You don’t understand,”","The devilish teenager shook his head and took a deep breath, “Demon Octopus Clan Master, if you want to stay, then stay here by yourself. I’ll take my leave first!”","After saying that, the devilish young man turned around and tried to escape!","At this moment, a calm voice was heard.","“Since you’re all here, then all of you should stay.”","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a cold light flashed in his eyes.","He then looked down at the bronze cauldron in front of him.","The ancient bronze cauldron had already undergone earth-shaking changes. Although it was still incomplete, a shocking image had appeared on the body of the cauldron.","The sun, the moon, and the stars were hanging high above the ancient cauldron, while flowers, birds, insects, and beasts were running around. The sky was still, and it looked like a lively world-creating map.","The fusion of the five elements formed chaos!","...","“Absorb.”","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang pulled out a streak of yellow primordial chaotic power from the Wuxu chaotic cauldron.","In an instant, a great horror of life and death appeared in everyone’s heart!","“Hiss-!”","“What is this?”","Primal Chaos energy!!!","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air and their hearts trembled. The devilish young man’s face turned pale and his lips were trembling.","100,000 chaos cycles ago, the eastern world supremacy had been a mere mortal, but with the help of the Wuxu chaotic cauldron, he had slaughtered Rulers as easily as he had slaughtered dogs!","But now, the Wuxu chaotic cauldron was in Jian Wushuang’s hands. How terrifying would it be?","In addition to the Wuxu chaotic cauldron, Jian Wushuang had another great killing weapon, the Tarot Divine Sword, compared to the East boundary!","Moreover, Jian Wushuang was a super perfect-level special life form, had great super powers like daybreak and Eternal Night, and had comprehended the power of a great Dao...","Jian Wushuang’s terror would far exceed that of the East realm!","“Run! I have to escape!”","The four Supreme martial artists ‘hair stood on end, and they shot in different directions almost at the same time.","“Today, none of you will be able to escape.”","Jian Wushuang’s voice was as cold as a glacier.","A moment later, Primal Chaos energy viciously slammed down!","Even further away, there were other Supreme martial artists who were rushing over with sinister smiles on their faces.","...","Three days later, an earth-shattering piece of news spread from the desolate area of the universe and quickly swept through the entire universe!","Jian Wushuang, who had disappeared for 10000 years, had reappeared in the wild area of the universe and killed nine Supreme-level experts by himself!","In an instant, the universe was shocked, and all the races were terrified!"]},{"number":4376,"title":"Chapter 4376 The Universe Is in Shock","paragraphs":["4376 The Universe Is in Shock","When the news that Jian Wushuang had killed nine Supreme Divine Realm experts in three days spread, it instantly swept across the entire universe with the momentum of a Prairie Fire!","At first, some people didn’t believe it. However, when a Supreme-being from the desolate area of the universe escaped in a sorry state and told them that there were no more Supreme-God-level experts in the desolate area of the universe, they were shocked.","The entire universe was in an uproar!","As a Ruler, he had killed a Divine Realm expert!","What kind of concept was this?","In an instant, the entire universe was in turmoil. Many people who were envious of the bounty and planned to find Jian Wushuang retreated quickly.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s title as the number one heaven’s favorite was no longer an exaggeration. Some people even claimed that Jian Wushuang was a legend!","...","In Cosmos Temple.","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple, Hei Yu, sat on the main seat, while the other Supremes stood on both sides. The atmosphere was particularly heavy.","“Hall Master, what should we do next?”","A Supreme martial artist asked in a low voice with a complicated expression.","The Hei Yu Ruler did not say anything, and not a single emotion could be seen on his face. However, if one were to pay close attention, one would notice that the right hand of the Hei Yu Ruler, hidden under his black robes, was trembling.","“I didn’t think that this kid would become so successful.”","He clenched his fists tightly and his eyes were filled with unwillingness.","He had planned everything and even invited the dragon clan to take action so that he would not be able to witness such a scene. He wanted to kill Jian Wushuang in the cradle.","They had not expected that Jian Wushuang would still be able to escape even after the six forces had joined forces. In just ten thousand years, Jian Wushuang had grown to the point where he could kill a Supreme!","After recollecting his thoughts, a look of dejection appeared on Hei Yu Ruler’ face.","“Hall Master, in my opinion, we might have a chance to kill Jian Wushuang.","“Otherwise, once he misses this opportunity, Jian Wushuang will be able to get ten seats on the praying mats and break through to the Supreme level when the universe banquet of all races begins.","“I’m afraid that by then, there will be no place for our Cosmos Temple in the entire universe!”","The Supreme martial artist who had spoken earlier said in a deep voice, his eyes flickering.","“Oh?”","Hearing this, the brows of the Hei Yu Ruler twitched. With a bitter smile, he replied, “Qing Gou, the four lead Supremes of the Divine Life Palace and the newly-promoted Ninth Kalpa King have been keeping an eye on me. As soon as I leave Cosmos Temple, they will come to stop me. Tell me, where do you think I’ll get the chance to kill Jian Wushuang?”","The Supreme martial artist named Qing Gou smiled and said, “Hall Master, you don’t have to worry. It’s just Jian Wushuang, not worth mentioning. Why do you need to take action? I alone am enough to suppress him!”","At this point, Supreme Green Dog’s face was filled with confidence.","This self-confidence did not come from vanity. It was because he was the second most powerful person in Cosmos Temple, second only to the Hall Master!","His strength as a top Supreme martial artist had already reached the peak!","“You?”","Hearing this, Hei Yu Ruler fell silent for a moment.","Seeing the Hei Yu Ruler’s hesitation, the Green Dog Ruler spoke up, Hall Master, there’s no need to think too much. I’ve analyzed Jian Wushuang’s power. He’s about a middle Supreme. With the help of the Tarot Divine Sword and the Wuxu chaotic cauldron, he can barely kill an advanced Supreme. It all depends on the strength of the advanced Supreme.","Hearing this, the Hei Yu Ruler heaved a sigh of relief. Understanding the importance of this matter, he nodded his head and said,”That’s good. Qing Gou, you must bring back Jian Wushuang’s head this time!”","“Yes!”","Supreme Green Dog cupped his hands, bowed, and retreated.","...","Within the Great Void Temple.","“Wuxu chaotic cauldron! The heavens are so unfair that such a universe treasure has fallen into Jian Wushuang’s hands!”","Supreme Master Bing Ye’s expression was extremely unsightly, and the gloominess in his eyes almost materialized!","Jian Wushuang’s opportunity made him envious. Not only did he obtain the Tarot Divine Sword, but he also obtained a treasure that was no weaker than the Tarot Divine Sword, the Wuxu chaotic cauldron!","“Sir Divine Emperor, what do we do now?”","The Palace Master of the Second Palace also spoke with a dark expression.","Supreme Bing Ye took a deep breath and calmed himself down. He then said with a decisive tone, “Jian Wushuang must die! Otherwise, once he successfully breaks through to the Supreme-being level and truly grasps the Tarot Divine Sword, I’m afraid no one in the entire universe will be able to stop him!”","The Palace Master of the Second Palace nodded in agreement and said, ” Hall Master, let me kill Jian Wushuang.","Supreme Bing Ye’s eyes flickered as he heard this. He then waved his hand and said,","“No! This is the last chance to kill Jian Wushuang before the feast of all races in the universe. It’s of great importance, so we must kill him in one blow without any risk!”","Supreme Bing Ye paused for a moment before his eyes suddenly turned cold. therefore, I will kill Jian Wushuang personally this time!","“What?”","The second Hall Master couldn’t help but be shocked when he heard this. Supreme Bing Ye was a half-step unparalleled Supreme and the master of a force. If he were to kill Jian Wushuang personally, he was afraid that it would set off a storm of public opinion in the entire universe.","However, the second Hall Master didn’t try to persuade him. He knew that Supreme Bing Ye was already afraid of Jian Wushuang. As long as Jian Wushuang didn’t die, he would be uneasy.","“Yes, sir!”","He cupped his hands and said.","...","Nine Emperor Pavilion, headquarters.","At the Round Table that represented the Supreme Council.","...","The three great masters, purple-haired, Red-eared, and Heart Slayer, were sitting at the Round Table. The faint afterglow shone through the glass and onto the Round Table, forming mottled light blocks.","“Tsk, tsk. A perfect-level special lifeform with extremely high talent for cultivation and enlightenment. In addition to the Tarot Divine Sword, you’ve also obtained the Wuxu chaotic cauldron. Even I can’t help but be envious of such opportunities.”","Supreme Heart Slayer shook his head and laughed.","“There are only a few extreme weapons in the universe. I didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to have two. What a great fortune.”","The Red-eared Supreme martial artist clicked his tongue in wonder.","Although the purple-haired youth didn’t say anything, a bitter smile appeared on his eternally cold face.","Supreme Heart Slayer glanced at him and said, “Purple-haired, now you know why I advised you not to be enemies with Jian Wushuang and the Divine Life Palace, right? Jian Wushuang is the same as the East realm from 100000 chaos cycles ago and Tarot from 300 chaos cycles ago. He’s the one chosen by heaven who can dominate and suppress an era. In fact, he’s even stronger than the East realm and Tarot.”","The purple-haired youth nodded and couldn’t help but sigh. He replied, “It’s been countless chaos cycles since someone has slain a Ruler in succession with a Ruler’s body. I’m afraid that the major forces that attacked the Divine Life Palace must be having a headache now.”","After a pause, the purple-haired youth looked at Supreme Heart Slayer and continued, “Heart Slayer, what should we do next? Do you need to help Jian Wushuang again?”","Heart Slayer was in no hurry to answer. Instead, he squinted his eyes and looked through the glass into the distance. “No need. Jian Wushuang’s wings have already formed. He will have to rely on himself next. Once he experiences this tribulation, he will definitely become a God and be tempered into steel.”","The purple-haired youth pondered for a moment, then nodded and said, “Then we’ll do as you say, Heart Slayer.”","...","Heart Slayer laughed and did not reply. Instead, he looked into the distance with a touch of anticipation.","“Jian Wushuang, I’d like to see how far you can go in the end.”"]},{"number":4377,"title":"Chapter 4377 The Various Races Take Action","paragraphs":["4377 The Various Races Take Action","As the news of Jian Wushuang’s reappearance spread, everyone in the universe was shocked at first. Then, they began to look forward to the reaction of the six top forces, who had great enmity with Jian Wushuang.","As expected, other than the dragon clan, which had yet to express their stance, the other six powers had all sent their top experts to the desolate area of the universe to kill Jian Wushuang!","What was worth mentioning was that the leaders of the Great Void Temple and the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom had personally taken action. The newly-promoted Supreme God Bing Ye and the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom’s Scarlet Sun Demon Master had also taken action!","Both of them were half-step unparalleled existences!","Everyone in the universe could not help but sigh. They did not know whether to envy Jian Wushuang or pity him.","He envied Jian Wushuang, who was only at the realm of an Ultimate Ruler, but he was able to stir up a storm in the entire universe. He had even attracted the real big shots in the universe and was destined to be famous throughout the ages. At the same time, he pitied Jian Wushuang for his many disasters. He had killed nine Supremes with great difficulty and survived, but now he had to face an even more severe and terrifying situation.","It should be known that the people from the major forces had already figured out Jian Wushuang’s strength and even overestimated the outcome. They wanted to kill him with one blow without any accidents!","And right at this moment, news finally came from the Dragon race that had fallen into a state of silence!","Long Qing, the leader of the fourth generation of the dragon clan, would come out of seclusion and head to the savage lands of the universe to kill Jian Wushuang!","Who was Long Qing?","Back then, the champion of the dragon clan’s battle for the throne, Qiu Long, was defeated by Long Qing in that battle. He was stripped of his Supreme-being Divine Realm and expelled from the dragon clan!","As soon as this news came out, the universe suddenly boiled over even more.","Almost everyone was certain that Jian Wushuang would not be able to escape this time!","...","At the entrance of the Ancient Path of Stars.","A tall and burly figure with a dignified expression and a blood Qi as strong as the sun rushed out of the Ancient Path of Stars.","“Fortunately, I finally got the third invitation to the universe banquet of all races at the last moment.”","The figure lowered his head and looked at the white jade pendant in his hand, an irrepressible joy appearing on his face.","This person was the Overlord who had received the invitation to the Great Clan Gathering!","A few thousand years after Jian Wushuang left the Ancient Path of Stars, the Ancient Path of Stars once again fell into chaos. Many people left the Sword Union, but the first group of core members who followed Jian Wushuang stayed and loyally maintained the development of the Sword Union.","The great Overlord was one of them. After a round of competition, not only did he receive the last invitation to the Great Clan Gathering, but his cultivation had also improved greatly.","He had broken through to the Ultimate Ruler Realm dozens of chaos cycles earlier than Jian Wushuang and was at the peak of the unparalleled Ruler realm. Now that he had improved greatly, he was only a step away from the Divine Ruler Realm.","Just as he was about to leave to tell his ancestor the good news, his ears twitched and he heard the name ‘Jian Wushuang’.","“Eh? What’s wrong with the Alliance master?”","The Overlord raised his eyebrows, then stepped into the center of the crowd and asked in a deep voice, “Let me ask you, what did you mean by Jian Wushuang’s pity?”","The group of people who were talking about Jian Wushuang were only at level five and had just become an Ultimate Ruler. When they felt the Overlord’s surging blood Qi, their hearts trembled. They did not dare to hide anything and quickly told him everything that had happened in the universe recently.","Hearing Jian Wushuang’s story, the Overlord couldn’t calm down for a long time. After a long time, he smiled bitterly and said, “I thought that my cultivation base had improved greatly and I could compete with you. I didn’t expect that in just tens of thousands of years, you’ve grown to the point where you can kill Supreme-beings.”","The tyrant couldn’t help but feel a little disheartened. The joy he had felt from the great progress in his cultivation and the qualification to participate in the Great Clan Gathering faded a lot. He only felt that he was increasingly catching up with Jian Wushuang and it was increasingly difficult to catch up.","In the end, the Overlord shook his head. His eyes flickered, and a thoughtful look appeared on his face.","“Dragon Tribe, Great Void Temple, Cosmos Temple...these six powers are all the top powers in the universe. I’m afraid it’ll be difficult for the Alliance master to move if he’s chased by them.”","“No, I have to hurry back to the family and ask the patriarch to protect the Alliance master!”","After thinking for a while, the Overlord took a step forward and quickly flew toward an unknown star area in the universe.","...","Desolate area of the universe.","At the peak of a towering mountain.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged in silence. His black robe was stained with divine blood. The mountain wind blew his disheveled hair, revealing a cold and indifferent face.","Under him, divine blood was spilled all over the ground, dying the mountain Red. One of the nine-clawed octopus heads was particularly eye-catching.","Three days ago, Jian Wushuang had chased them with the Wuxu chaotic cauldron and killed nine Supreme Masters on the Tongtian mountain.","Among them, the most powerful one was the Demon Octopus clan’s patriarch, who was an advanced Supreme.","After he killed the nine great Supremes, the huge ‘kill’ character hanging above his head became more and more enchanting and dazzling.","no wonder the eastern world could slaughter Supremes like dogs. The Wuxu chaotic cauldron is indeed powerful.","Jian Wushuang looked at the Wuxu chaotic cauldron in front of him and his eyes flashed with deep thought.","After the Wuxu chaos cauldron was awakened, the five-element Qi inside it combined and turned into the power of Chaos before the universe was born. It was extremely overbearing.","The supreme divine power that was once incomparably powerful in Jian Wushuang’s eyes was like an egg hitting a rock when it came into contact with the chaotic power. It could not withstand a single blow.","It was with this chaotic force that Jian Wushuang managed to kill the nine Supremes.","However, the power of the Wuxu chaotic cauldron seems to be not destruction, but creation.","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","At first, he thought that the Wuxu chaos cauldron was like the Tarot Divine Sword, a powerful offensive magic treasure. However, after he observed it carefully, he realized that it was not the case.","This was because he felt that although the Wuxu chaotic cauldron was powerful, the power of the chaotic force had already reached its limit. In other words, even if he broke through to the supremacy stage or even the invincible supremacy stage in the future, he would only be able to use the Wuxu chaotic cauldron as powerful as he was now.","At that time, the attack power would appear to be weak.","As for the Tarot sword, it was a treasure that was created purely for killing and attacking. At the moment, it seemed to be not as powerful as the Wuxu chaotic cauldron. Jian Wushuang could only use a few strikes with all his strength.","However, that was because Jian Wushuang had yet to break through to the Supreme realm and master the Tarot Divine Sword.","Once he truly grasped the Tarot Divine Sword, its power would be much more terrifying than the Wuxu chaotic cauldron!","“If I’m not wrong, this Wuxu chaotic cauldron is a magic treasure used for attack. It’s created! Create a world!”","...","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and immersed his divine power into the chaotic space in the Wuxu chaotic cauldron. The five-element Qi in the chaotic space combined and turned into chaos, which was breeding a universe of life.","However, it seemed that because the Wuxu chaotic cauldron was incomplete, the chaotic energy was not able to give birth to life.","“Once I find the other fragments of the Wuxu chaotic cauldron and complete it, I’ll be able to use the Wuxu chaotic cauldron. Perhaps...within this Primal Chaos Space, one can truly create life within the cosmos!”"]},{"number":4378,"title":"Chapter 4378 The Attack of a Strong Enemy","paragraphs":["4378 The Attack of a Strong Enemy","Creation!","What a grand and terrifying word.","Even Jian Wushuang’s heart couldn’t help but beat wildly when he thought of this.","After a long time.","“You’re thinking too far ahead. For me, breaking through to the refined state is the most important thing.”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. After taking a deep breath, he put away the Wuxu chaotic cauldron.","The battle on the Ancient Path of Stars should have ended by now, which meant that the feast of all races in the universe was about to begin.","Other than breaking through to the Supreme-being realm, his strength could no longer advance any further. The only thing he could do now was to wait quietly for the Great Clan Gathering to begin.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang sat on the peak of the mountain and let the strong wind blow across his face. He slowly closed his eyes.","Time passed day by day. Just as the universe banquet was about to begin, Jian Wushuang felt the jade pendant that ‘Lady Blue’ had given him and his heart throbbed.","Boom!","All of a sudden, the sound of something breaking through the air could be heard from afar.","“Jian Wushuang!”","With a cold shout, a lightning bolt shot over at an extreme speed!","In the beginning, he was still at the edge of the universe, but he was just a small black dot. The next moment, the small black dot suddenly enlarged in Jian Wushuang’s pupils and appeared in front of Jian Wushuang!","The lightning dissipated and turned into a black-robed man who covered his entire face, only revealing a pair of Scarlet eyes.","“Who are you?”","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and looked at him.","“You don’t need to know who I am.”","The black-robed man’s voice was hoarse, and his eyes were scarlet.","“You only need to know that I am here on the orders of the King of Day to take your life!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the black-robed man flipped his right hand, and a pitch-black Trident appeared in his hand.","He had no intention of talking to Jian Wushuang. His supreme divine power surged and he threw the trident at Jian Wushuang’s head!","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank slightly. He quickly rose into the sky and dodged the attack.","Bang!","The trident hit the towering mountain where Jian Wushuang was sitting with his legs crossed. In an instant, the entire mountain collapsed with a loud bang, raising a cloud of dust.","“Sundering stars!”","A cold voice was heard. Then, a sharp blue sword rainbow slashed out from the dust and sand. It broke through the void and came.","“Small tricks.”","The black-robed man didn’t care about the star slashing sword rainbow at all. He casually grabbed with his right hand and instantly shattered the sharp sword rainbow.","“Jian Wushuang, just use your Tarot Divine Sword and chaotic cauldron.”","“Let’s go!” He said lightly. Immediately, a peak Supreme martial artist cultivation suddenly surged out. It was as if a bomb had been thrown into a calm lake. The entire starry sky boiled as if it could not withstand this huge force and countless cracks appeared.","“A top Supreme-being!”","Jian Wushuang’s body trembled and his heart sank.","He had guessed that the six major forces would not let him go, but he had not expected that the six major forces would think so highly of him and send a top-tier Ruler to kill him, an Ultimate Ruler.","One had to know, what kind of figures were the top Supreme martial artists?","Top Supreme-beings were all famous figures in the universe. They were powerful enough to establish a Holy Kingdom and become an ancient Overlord!","“Then I’ll do as you wish!”","Although Jian Wushuang was afraid, there was no fear in his eyes. He took out the Wuxu chaotic cauldron with his right hand.","“Go!”","He shouted in a low voice and in an instant, the black primordial chaos power was drawn out by Jian Wushuang. Like the heavy water of the sky River, he held it in his hand and slapped it at the black-robed man.","“Is this the power of the Wuxu chaotic cauldron?”","The black-robed man’s eyes gleamed as he pushed forward with both hands, supremely divine power surging out of his hands and colliding with the primal Chaos energy!","In an instant, the two unparalleled forces collided, and a series of explosions rang out in the sky. The entire starry sky began to collapse under the impact of these two forces, turning into nothingness!","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","The sleeves of the black-robed man’s arms burst open, revealing his lean arms.","However, he did not retreat even half a step.","“Tsk tsk, that’s all you got.”","The next moment, he let out a low and sinister laugh and quickly cast a divine spell, ruthlessly tearing it in two directions.","Buzzzzzz!","A shocking scene occurred. The chaotic force that seemed to be able to sweep up the heavy water of the heavenly River was actually torn apart by the black-robed man!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s face turned extremely gloomy.","It seemed that the attack power of the Wuxu chaotic cauldron was limited to killing an advanced Supreme-being. To top Supreme-beings, it would cause some trouble, but it would not be fatal!","In the next moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. He stepped back with his right foot and quickly retreated!","...","It was obviously not wise to fight this top-tier Supreme Being head-on. It was better to avoid him for the time being and wait until the Grand Assembly of all races in the universe started!","He had a hunch that the Great Clan Gathering would begin in the next few days!","“You want to escape?”","The black-robed man sneered disdainfully. His body shuttled back and forth, once again turning into a bolt of lightning and chasing after Jian Wushuang.","The two of them quickly disappeared under the starry sky.","Not long after the two of them left, a few more streaks of light arrived.","“Did you just leave?”","Supreme Bing Ye stepped in the void and his silver eyes turned slightly. A thoughtful look flashed in his eyes. Then, he performed greater teleportation and flew toward Jian Wushuang and the black-robed man at a speed that far exceeded their own.","His body flickered like a dot of light. Every time he flickered, he would travel a million miles, directly from one star region to another.","Just like Supreme Bing Ye, Scarlet Sun Demon Master, the Blood Sky Hall Master, and Supreme Qing Gou from Cosmos Temple all performed their divine skills to chase after Jian Wushuang after they arrived at the star area that Jian Wushuang had left behind!","In the distance, a six-clawed Divine Dragon that was a hundred thousand feet long was shuttling through the clouds and the Galaxy. It was devouring the sun and moon as it swam in the sky.","...","There was no emotion in his golden eyes.","He was the one sent by the dragon clan to kill Jian Wushuang. He was the leader of the fourth generation of the dragon clan, Long Qing!","...","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","“Bang bang bang!”","The black-robed man sent by the Great Sun Divine Kingdom followed Jian Wushuang at a moderate pace. Like a cat toying with a mouse, he kept swinging his trident at Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","“Damn it!”","Jian Wushuang continued to use his chaotic force to block the black-robed man’s attacks.","Fortunately, the power of the five elements in the cauldron was endless. Otherwise, a casual attack from the black-robed man would cause him immeasurable damage!","The difference in power between an Ultimate Ruler and a Supreme Ruler was simply too great.","The chasm between the two was like a heavenly chasm.","“If it was just him, I’m confident I could defeat him or escape, but...”","Jian Wushuang felt that there were several auras that were not weaker than the black-robed man’s, and they were even more powerful. They were rapidly pulling away from him!"]},{"number":4379,"title":"Chapter 4379 The Fine Line Between Life and Death","paragraphs":["4379 The Fine Line Between Life and Death","“Jian Wushuang, give up on resisting. I’ll be honest with you. Other than me, there’s also the Hall Master of Blood Sky Hall, Scarlet Sun Demon Master of the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom, Supreme Bing Ye of the Great Void Temple, Supreme Qing Gou of the Cosmos Temple, and Long Qing of the fourth generation of the Dragon Tribe. Every single one of them isn’t any weaker than me.”","“Unless the invincible Ruler comes out to protect you, you won’t be able to escape this calamity.”","The black-robed man said. Seeing that Jian Wushuang did not respond, he shook his head and continued, “Jian Wushuang, if you are tactful and obediently fall into my hands, I can let you die a little easier. However, if you die in the hands of those people, I’m afraid it won’t be so easy to die...”","“You’re noisy.”","Before he could finish, Jian Wushuang looked at him coldly and continued to fly forward.","“You’re so stubborn.”","The black-robed man could not help but sneer when he saw the situation. Endless supreme divine power condensed into a ball in his hand. He pushed it forward and it instantly pierced through the void. Like a knife cutting mud, it broke through the chaotic power and hit Jian Wushuang’s back!","Even though most of the power of the ball had been destroyed by the chaotic power, it was still far from what Jian Wushuang, an Ultimate Ruler, could withstand. Immediately, more than half of Jian Wushuang’s divine body was blown to pieces.","Whoosh!","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang was a perfect chaotic special lifeform. In the blink of an eye, his divine body instantly reassembled. He turned his sword and used Eternal Night swordsmanship on the black-robed man.","The black mist wrapped around the black-robed man and dragged him into the Eternal Night Kingdom.","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief.","Just as he was about to continue flying forward, an extremely cold voice suddenly sounded in front of him.","“Jian Wushuang, you can’t escape.”","Buzzzzzz!","The next moment, a majestic power that far surpassed Jian Wushuang and even the black-robed man descended on the world and locked down the surrounding space!","Then, Jian Wushuang saw the figure of Supreme Bing Ye slowly forming in front of him.","Supreme Bing Ye was expressionless and his eyes did not contain any joy or sadness. He looked at Jian Wushuang as if he was looking at an ant that could be crushed easily.","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank.","In the end, he still couldn’t escape?","Before Jian Wushuang could react, several more figures descended and locked down the starry sky.","God Emperor Scarlet Sun!","The Blood Sky Palace Master!","Supreme Green Dog!","The auras that the three of them exuded were equally powerful. Even Scarlet Sun Demon Master was also a half-step unparalleled Supreme!","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but smile bitterly.","All paths of retreat had been sealed off.","He had become the enemy of the entire world and was bound to die.","“Jian Wushuang, kill yourself. Don’t force me to do anything, and don’t try to escape with your innate ability, or fantasize about someone coming to save you.”","Supreme Bing Ye sized up Jian Wushuang and said indifferently.","His expression was neither happy nor sad, as if he was a God who controlled the life and death of the common people. He sentenced Jian Wushuang to death.","“Jian Wushuang, you can only blame yourself for being too talented and having too many good opportunities. Once you break through to the Supreme level, the balance that has been maintained with great difficulty will be broken by you.”","Scarlet Sun Demon Master shook his head and said.","“Jian Wushuang, you only have yourself to blame for what you’ve done today. If you had known what was good for you and handed over the Tarot Divine Sword earlier, you wouldn’t have been in such a predicament today.”","“That’s right, don’t take things that don’t belong to you. Since you’ve taken them, you’ll have to pay the price. You should have long understood the principle of virtue not being worthy of the place.”","The other Supreme-beings said in a cold or sarcastic tone.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang was not the number one genius in the universe, nor was he a perfect special life form. In their eyes, he was just an ant that was about to die.","Jian Wushuang looked around and swept his gaze across their faces one by one. Then, he gradually calmed down.","Death?","In fact, from the moment he picked up the Tarot Divine Sword, killed Qiu Long, and refused to bow his head under the pressure of the Six Forces, he had already prepared himself mentally.","He wasn’t surprised by the current outcome.","The only thing that made him feel a little guilty and regretful was that the Divine Life Palace had suffered heavy losses for him, and the White Tiger Supreme had died for him, but he was unable to avenge them.","This...in the end, it was difficult to calm down!","Just as Jian Wushuang was deep in thought, a rumbling sound suddenly came from the distant sky.","A six-clawed Golden Dragon came from the void, swaying its body and breathing clouds. In the end, with a flash of golden light, it turned into a young man in a golden robe with two horns on his head and a dignified face.","This person was the leader of the dragon clan’s fourth generation bloodline, Long Qing!","The six powers that wanted to kill Jian Wushuang had finally arrived!","When the crowd saw Long Qing, their pupils shrank slightly, and their expressions became more cautious.","Long Qing was expressionless. He didn’t even look at the other Supreme martial artists. Instead, he looked straight at Jian Wushuang and said indifferently, “You are Jian Wushuang? The one who killed that useless Long Han?”","“Hehe.” Hearing this, Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and looked at him. Then, he sneered and asked, “You’re asking the obvious, are you spouting nonsense?”","Long Qing squinted his eyes and his face darkened. He said with killing intent, “You’re sharp-tongued. Jian Wushuang, it seems like you’re still thinking that you’re not going to die fast enough!”","Jian Wushuang laughed disdainfully. To him, the addition or absence of Long Qing would not affect his ending.","He didn’t care anymore.","The only thing he wanted to do now was to use all his strength to drag someone down with him before he died!","...","Even if he died, he would not be a salted fish to be slaughtered!","A trapped beast would still fight, not to mention Jian Wushuang!","“Alright, things will change if we delay. Let’s make our move.”","Supreme Bing Ye coldly spoke.","An ice sword covered with spikes was held in his hand. A cold air was emitted from the ice sword, freezing the air three feet in the air.","The other Supreme martial artists nodded their heads and began to prepare for their killing blow!","Jian Wushuang instantly fell into the death realm.","However, what they did not expect was...","At that moment, Jian Wushuang took the initiative to attack!","Innate divine power, original universe!","“Innate divine ability, life intimidation!”","...","Secret skill of dragon blood, divine power ignition!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s divine power rose sharply and his divine body was adjusted to its strongest peak state!","With the help of the various realms and divine powers, Jian Wushuang’s aura, which represented the limit of an Ultimate Ruler, actually improved!","The next moment!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes suddenly turned and he stared at Long Qing!","“Go to hell!”","Bang!","Jian Wushuang took out the Wuxu chaotic cauldron first. He drew out chaotic force and smashed it at Long Qing’s face!","“The Tarot Divine Sword!”","Then, Jian Wushuang pulled out the Tarot Divine Sword with his right hand again. The terrifying and surging peak great Dao divine power poured into the Tarot Divine Sword and he slashed it at Long Qing!","A blurry figure of the green-robed sword God reappeared in the world!","The Wuxu chaos cauldron and the Tarot Divine Sword were Jian Wushuang’s two strongest killing moves. As soon as the two killing moves were used, the entire starry sky suddenly made a shattering sound. The sealing secret skills that the top Supreme Masters had used couldn’t hold on and slightly exploded!","However, this was not the end!","Jian Wushuang crushed the Jade token on his waist again!","It contained two of the Ruler Blood Wave’s top powers!","All the killing moves were aimed at Long Qing at the same time!"]},{"number":4380,"title":"Chapter 4380 The Dragon Clan Is Nothing More Than This","paragraphs":["4380 The Dragon Clan Is Nothing More Than This","Boom!","At this moment, the world changed colors and the sun and moon shattered.","Long Qing looked at Jian Wushuang, who was charging at him, and immediately understood Jian Wushuang’s intention. He laughed in anger, “Jian Wushuang, do you think you’re worthy of taking me down with you?”","He opened his mouth. Dark clouds gathered in his mouth, lightning shuttled back and forth, and countless energy dense.","Then, the energy condensed and turned into a destructive light wave, which blasted toward Jian Wushuang!","Kachaa!","In an instant, the sealing enchantment set up by several Supreme martial artists was broken!","The light wave of destruction collided with Jian Wushuang’s first killing move, chaotic force!","Peng peng peng!","A loud boom rang out between the two, as if chaos had reappeared and everything was silent. A huge black shock wave seemed to condense and spread out fiercely!","Not to mention the killing move of the two, just the shock wave alone could kill any expert below the Supreme-being level. Even a beginner-stage Supreme-being would be killed by the shock wave.","“Is this the power of the Wuxu chaotic cauldron?”","Supreme Bing Ye, the Blood Sky Hall Master, Supreme Green Dog, and the others looked at this scene. They first casually drew back the surging shock waves, then squinted their eyes with a strange look.","Although this power couldn’t threaten them, it was enough to allow an Ultimate Ruler to cross several realms and pose a threat to an advanced Supreme. It was truly powerful.","“After Jian Wushuang’s death, I’ll give you the Tarot Divine Sword and other opportunities. But I’ll take the Wuxu chaotic cauldron.”","Scarlet Sun Demon Master said as he licked his lips.","Although Jian Wushuang was not dead yet, they had already regarded him as a dead man and started to divide up his magic weapons.","Bang!","The boundless power dissipated. The destructive light wave in Long Qing’s mouth, although much of its power was obliterated, dispersed the chaotic power and went to meet Jian Wushuang’s second killing move, the Tarot Divine Sword!","In this sword, the previously blurry figure in green could be seen clearly. One could even see the figure’s delicate and clear facial features. At first glance, it looked like a Supreme Tarot descending to the world, but also like an immortal from the Nine Heavens walking out of the gate of heaven with a sword and splitting the sea with a sword.","The stroke contained all kinds of power that Jian Wushuang had added to it. It was his peak attack and his most brilliant attack!","Under this sword, the entire universe’s starry sky exploded. Even the black-robed man, Supreme Green Dog, and the other top-tier Supremes felt a sharp sword energy sweep through them, and they couldn’t help but take half a step back.","“The Tarot Divine Sword!”","“This is the Tarot Divine Sword?”","Everyone raised their heads and looked at the dark golden sword in Jian Wushuang’s hand. Their hearts skipped a beat.","The Wuxu chaotic cauldron had appeared in a very distant era, so they didn’t know much about the Wuxu chaos and weren’t very interested in it. However, the Tarot sword had dominated the entire universe 300 chaos cycles ago. Many of the Rulers present had experienced that era and knew how terrifying the Tarot sword was!","They looked at the dazzling golden light of the Tarot Divine Sword, which seemed to be shining through the ages, and their breathing quickened.","“Jian Wushuang, you only have the Tarot Divine Sword. Even when Tarot Supreme was still alive, he didn’t dare to provoke our dragon clan. Who do you think you are?”","Long Qing snorted disdainfully. He controlled the destructive light waves from his mouth to meet the unparalleled sword!","“Is that so?”","Jian Wushuang was expressionless. The Tarot Divine Sword in his hand emitted a brilliant golden light. It cut through the sea of destruction light wave and broke through all obstacles!","“What?”","Long Qing’s heart jolted with shock. For countless chaos cycles, he had always stayed within the Dragon race and had never seen the universe beyond the Dragon race. The idea that had been instilled in his mind was that the Dragon race was the highest, most powerful, and most noble race in the entire universe.","Therefore, he looked down on the entire universe and didn’t put anyone in his eyes. Jian Wushuang, who was merely an Ultimate Ruler, was even regarded as a pig, dog, and catfish that he could kill at will.","But now, as he looked at this sword, he knew that he was wrong, and he was very wrong!","The destructive light wave that he had casually unleashed was completely unable to block this destructive sword!","This move didn’t bring out the Tarot Divine Sword’s full power, but with the support of Jian Wushuang’s various secret skills, the Tarot Divine Sword was truly activated at this moment!","The vertical eye on the hilt of the sword had countless blood streaks congregating in its pupil like small snakes, letting out a furious roar that came from the Nine Heavens!","Bang!","The sword landed on Long Qing’s body!","Whoosh!","Countless dark golden dragon blood poured down, as if a rain of blood had fallen from the sky!","Long Qing was sent flying thousands of feet away. His Golden Dragon robe was torn apart, and one of his dragon horns was almost cut off, leaving a deep sword mark on it!","Pfft!","Long Qing half-knelt in the void and slowly raised his head. A trace of dark golden Dragon blood flowed out of his mouth.","Jian Wushuang, you deserve to die!!!","Long Qing roared mournfully. His indifferent face couldn’t remain calm anymore. The blue veins on his forehead were throbbing. Apparently, he was in a rage!","What a disgrace!","He had never been humiliated like this before!","He, Long Qing, was the leader of the fourth generation of the Dragon bloodline. He was strong enough to fight against the top supreme beings and look down on the entire universe. He thought of himself as a noble and respected existence. Wherever he went, there was no one who didn’t submit.","But today, he was actually injured by a mere Ultimate Ruler!","This was the greatest humiliation he had ever suffered since he was born!","This kind of humiliation was worse than taking his life!","Jian Wushuang’s face was pale and his right hand was trembling. The moment he swung the sword, the Tarot Divine Sword had sucked all of his power dry. Now, all the secret skills that he had used to boost his strength had receded like a tide. He suddenly felt a sense of weakness that he had never felt before.","...","This feeling of weakness almost made him unable to stand. His entire body was on the verge of collapse, and the Tarot Divine Sword almost fell out of his hand.","However, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but laugh when he saw Long Qing’s sorry state.","He laughed wildly, scornfully, and unscrupulously!","“A mere dragon clan is nothing more than this!”","Boom!","The jade pendant on Jian Wushuang’s waist shattered, and two shadows of the Blood Wave Supreme condensed and pressed down on Long Qing again!","This was the all-out attack that the Blood Wave Supreme had left on Jian Wushuang!","At that moment, Jian Wushuang knew that he had no chance of survival, so he directly used the two full-force attacks at the same time!","The two shadows were tens of thousands of feet tall. Their legs were like mountains, their eyes were like stars, and endless blood Qi was swirling around them. They looked at Long Qing with a stiff and numb expression, then raised their hands and attacked!","“Jian Wushuang, you were able to hurt me just now because I was careless. Do you think you can still be so lucky?”","Long Qing’s eyes were filled with killing intent as he spoke coldly.","...","Long Qing opened his mouth in the face of the Blood Wave supremacy’s all-out attack, and a fist-sized golden bead slowly rose from his mouth!"]},{"number":4381,"title":"Chapter 4381 Tragic","paragraphs":["4381 Tragic","Dragon Pearl!","It was a Dragon Pearl that could only be completely cultivated when a Dragon reached the supremacy stage!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","The Dragon Pearl spun and took the initiative to collide with the full-force attack of the Ruler Blood Wave’s projection!","An endless amount of light shot out, containing a brilliant Dragon’s might that suppressed all directions!","Bang!","Then, the Dragon Pearl collided with the two full-force strikes of Supreme Blood Wave!","Long Qing’s face flushed red as he took a few steps back. Meanwhile, the Ruler Blood Wave’s projection collapsed inch by inch!","This time, Long Qing wasn’t in such a sorry state.","This was his true strength!","“Jian Wushuang, it’s my turn now!”","“Don’t worry, I won’t kill you easily. I’ll let you enjoy the most extreme pain in the world!”","Long Qing opened his mouth and sucked the Dragon Pearl back into his stomach. His dark golden pupils turned slightly and locked on Jian Wushuang’s face, revealing a cold and cruel smile.","Bang!","He took a step forward and appeared in front of Jian Wushuang. His right fist, which was covered in Golden Dragon scales, hit Jian Wushuang’s chest hard!","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s divine body, which had lost all power to resist, collapsed and broke into pieces.","After doing all that, Long Qing didn’t rush to kill Jian Wushuang and shatter his divine power. Instead, he waited for Jian Wushuang’s divine body to reform with a twisted expression.","When Supreme Bing Ye, Scarlet Sun Demon Master, and the other Supremes saw this scene, they were silent and kept their sacred arts.","To them, Jian Wushuang was already dead. They might as well do Long Qing a favor and let him torture Jian Wushuang to death.","Hualala!","Jian Wushuang’s collapsed divine body gradually regrouped.","Bang!","Long Qing threw another punch and the supreme divine power that was enough to crush a star domain landed on Jian Wushuang’s chest, causing his divine body to collapse again.","“Hahaha, Jian Wushuang, don’t you want to die? I don’t want you to die so easily. Enjoy the most extreme pain in this world!”","Long Qing laughed out loud.","Peng peng peng!","Time and time again, Jian Wushuang’s divine body was destroyed and reconstructed by Long Qing. Then, it was destroyed again.","His bones were completely shattered, and his meridians were all broken.","Waves of pain from the deepest part of his soul came continuously.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang was extremely weak. He didn’t know how much longer he could last. He only knew that he was so weak that he couldn’t even speak or lift a finger.","Bang!","Once again, Jian Wushuang’s divine body was destroyed.","If not for the fact that he was a perfect chaotic lifeform, he would have been dead.","“Jian Wushuang, kneel down and beg for mercy. I can give you a quick death.”","Long Qing stomped on Jian Wushuang’s head and laughed with disdain.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils turned slightly as he looked at Long Qing. There was no fear in his eyes, only ridicule.","“He, Jian Wushuang, had come to the green fire World and walked all the way to the depths of the universe. He had turned thousands of battles into his own. When had he ever begged for mercy from anyone?”","He would only die today, so what was there to fear?","Long Qing’s face gradually darkened as he saw the mockery in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","“I gave you face but you didn’t want it. Jian Wushuang, it seems that you are tough? Then I will crush your bones inch by inch!”","“I’d like to see how long you can last!”","Long Qing’s eyes flashed with a touch of fierceness. He raised his foot and stomped down, crushing Jian Wushuang’s bones and bones.","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s divine body collapsed again.","Ka ka ka.","Slowly, Jian Wushuang’s divine body regrouped with great difficulty.","After the reconstruction, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness became blurry and his vision became blurry. Everything in his vision seemed to have blurred.","The voice in his ear gradually faded, and the scene in his vision gradually faded.","The world seemed to have become silent, and the black and white were monotonous.","Long Qing was still laughing wildly. The other Supreme martial artists were standing around him, firmly sealing the space. Their expressions were cold and emotionless, without the slightest bit of pity.","Leng Rushuang, who was sealed in the heaven suppressing monument, was madly crashing into the enchantment he had set up. She was in so much pain that she wanted to die. Her heart was torn and her lungs were torn. Tears of blood flowed from her eyes.","Everything began to blur and fall silent.","“Am I finally going to die?”","Jian Wushuang had a sudden realization.","He could feel that even if he was a perfect chaotic lifeform, he was gradually unable to hold on under the continuous destructive attacks.","...","He knew that his divine body couldn’t withstand the next reconstruction.","At this moment, the past kept surging into his mind.","“Master, I’m afraid I won’t be able to find you...”","“Ruler Blood Wave, Ruler Giant Axe...I can’t help you take revenge...”","All the memories gradually faded.","A sense of fatigue that he had never felt before attacked his entire body.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but sigh in his heart.","In the end, it was difficult to calm down.","Bang!","However, just as Jian Wushuang closed his eyes and his consciousness gradually fell into a deep sleep, he seemed to feel an extremely domineering figure with vigorous Qi and blood, like an unrivaled blazing sun, suddenly tearing the enchantment apart and crashing into it with a destructive force like a bomb!","“Alliance master!!!”","...","A loud roar rang out.","Then, a figure covered in white hair but emitting a strong golden light said in a deep voice, “Grandson, is this the Alliance master you were talking about? The little fellow who saved your life on the Ancient Path of Stars?”","“Please save him, patriarch!”","Plop!","The Overlord knelt down and kowtowed to the white-haired figure.","“Don’t worry. We, the undying Overlord body clan, never owe anyone anything.”","The white-haired man nodded and punched out!","In an instant, the heavens and the earth cracked, and the stars shattered. An extremely overbearing force that could suppress the ancient times surged!","Bang!","As if the war drums of the ancient heavenly court had been struck, the fist of the white-haired figure shone with a golden light, as if it was pushing a blazing sun, a Golden Chariot!","Long Qing, who had stepped on Jian Wushuang’s chest, was shocked. Before he could say anything, he was sent flying thousands of miles away and turned into a black dot!","“Grandson, take you, the Alliance Master, away.”","The white-haired figure casually instructed. Then, his eyes turned into two Balls of Fire as he looked at Supreme Bing Ye, Scarlet Sun Demon Master, and the others.","“I wonder if the people of this world still remember me after ten thousand chaos cycles?”","The white-haired man’s mouth opened, revealing a cold smile.","BOOM!","Then, the white-haired figure threw a punch. His bare hands cracked the sky and he defeated a Supreme-being with a snap of his fingers!","A casual punch from him could destroy a star, and a casual kick could shatter a Galaxy!","He opened his mouth again and directly swallowed the sun.","His entire body was shimmering with golden light and surrounded by endless celestial radiance and Starlight. With every move he made, he brought about a void storm.","He was like an Immortal King who had awoken from his deep sleep in the chaos, opened his eyes, and descended into the world.","In front of him, the sun, the moon, and the stars were like pellets in his hand, and the sky was just a bathtub for him to wash his feet.","No words could describe how overbearing and terrifying he was!"]},{"number":4382,"title":"Chapter 4382 The Grand Gathering of All Races in the Universe Begins!","paragraphs":["4382 The Grand Gathering of All Races in the Universe Begins!","Bang!","The white-haired man’s fists were shining with a golden light, as if he was pushing the sun. Every punch he threw was like a long Dragon, directly creating holes in the sky. It was extremely domineering.","The faces of Supreme Bing Ye and the others sank, and their eyes flickered.","“If Jian Wushuang doesn’t die today, there will be endless trouble for us. Let’s attack together!”","Supreme Bing Ye said coldly. He stomped his right foot and a pair of long, narrow Ice Wings formed from ice crystals appeared on his back.","“Secret technique, divine might!”","He shouted in a low voice, and the ice leaf divine sword in his hand slashed down at the white-haired man as if it was stirring up a huge wave on the sea!","The other Supreme martial artists’ expressions were solemn. After looking at each other, they also used their own special skills.","“One Thought Divine Kingdom!”","Scarlet Sun Demon Master pulled with his hands and turned the surrounding void space into a boiling sea of blood and a country with a rising blood Sun.","“Secret skill, Flying Star Hand!”","“Secret technique, Azure Rainbow!”","“Secret skill, Six Saint Flash!”","All of a sudden, except for Long Qing, who had been sent flying by the white-haired figure, the top Supreme martial artists of the other five Forces attacked the white-haired figure one after another.","“Little brats, when this old man roamed the universe, you weren’t even born yet!”","When the white-haired figure saw this, not only was there no fear on his face, but he also laughed out loud.","He tore with his hands, and endless blood Qi boiled, directly tearing the One Thought Divine Kingdom into pieces. Then, he swept with his foot again, sending all the Supreme Masters who were coming at him flying.","One after another, Supreme divine arts that were powerful enough to destroy the world bombarded the white-haired figure, but they could not even leave a mark.","“Bang bang bang!”","The white-haired man was like an ancient martial God. He shook Kunlun with his hands and Heaven Gate with his legs. Every punch and kick was like a giant axe that opened the sky, turning the world into chaos.","In front of him, these top-tier Supreme-beings and even half-step unrivaled Supreme-beings, who could reach the peak of the universe, were like adults beating up children. These top-tier Supreme-beings couldn’t even fight back.","Kachaa.","He stretched out his hand and directly grabbed the Bing Ye divine sword from Supreme Bing Ye. He then said, “Little child, back then, Emperor God Tai Xu of your great void God Hall was very respectful when he saw me. He didn’t dare to speak loudly. You dare to point your sword at me?”","Clang.","The white-haired figure’s right hand twisted and tore off Supreme Bing Ye’s entire right hand. Then, he opened his mouth and bit down on the Bing Ye divine sword.","Crack.","The ice leaf divine sword, which had been upgraded to a Supreme divine weapon, was bitten by the white-haired figure.","Crack, crack, crack, crack.","In a few seconds, the entire ice leaf divine sword was swallowed by the white-haired figure.","“Burp!”","The white-haired figure patted his stomach in satisfaction and let out a long burp.","At this moment, the hair on Supreme Bing Ye’s body stood on end, and beads of sweat appeared on his forehead. He no longer had any thoughts of fighting.","“Senior, who are you?”","He asked with a pale expression.","“Who am I?” The white-haired figure laughed and replied, “Go back and ask your Emperor God Tai Xu. That little fellow will tell you who I am.”","After saying that, the white-haired figure looked around and glanced at the other Supreme martial artists.","“I’m going to take Jian Wushuang away. Who’s going to stop me?”","As soon as these words fell, the originally arrogant and domineering top Supreme martial artists all kept quiet out of fear, lowering their heads in silence.","The white-haired man shook his head disdainfully and looked at Jian Wushuang, who was sleeping in the distance, and the Overlord, who was holding him up with both hands. He laughed and said, “Grandson, let’s go.”","“Yes, forefather.”","The Overlord quickly replied.","Then, the white-haired ancestor and the Overlord left with Jian Wushuang and disappeared into the sky.","In the blink of an eye, only Supreme Bing Ye, the Blood Sky Hall Master, and the others were left standing in the void with uncertain expressions.","“What do we do now?”","Supreme Green Dog asked.","Supreme Bing Ye glanced at him and snorted. “What else can we do? Why don’t you go and take Jian Wushuang back from the old monster?”","Shaking his head, Supreme Bing Ye took a step forward and disappeared from the starry sky.","...","The universe gradually returned to peace.","The plan to kill Jian Wushuang by the six Supreme Masters failed again.","There was an uproar in the universe. Countless people exclaimed that Jian Wushuang’s luck was amazing.","However, before this event could even begin to ferment, a major event that truly boiled the universe instantly attracted everyone’s attention and topics.","The Great Clan Gathering had begun!","On that day, a strange phenomenon suddenly appeared in the sky. The power of the great path came grandly, and there was nothing between heaven and earth that could not sense it.","...","The spiritual Qi surged toward the thousands of living beings. Countless people in the world had their spirits awakened in a day, and countless people were even able to sense the great Dao under the power of the great Dao and break through to the next realm.","A deep voice resounded through the heavens and earth.","“Time’s up. I’m preaching in Ling Xiao Palace. Anyone who has been invited by me can come and listen to my teachings.”","Immediately, all the races began to worship him.","Countless people looked up at the starry sky with excitement.","“Hahahaha, the Great Clan Gathering has finally begun!”","“I’ve waited more than a hundred chaos cycles for this day to come!”","“This time, I’ll definitely be one of the ten seats to listen to the Dao!”","On this day, countless old monsters who had been in deep sleep all woke up and went to Ling Xiao Palace.","In addition, the top forces, immortal orthodoxies, ancient Holy Lands, and Holy kingdoms of the universe had all been invited to the myriad Clan Gathering. They all sent their strongest Masters to the gathering.","The world was shaken, and it was a grand event.","...","Thousands of wind and clouds surged toward towering Palace. &Nbsp;","This Grand gathering of all races in the universe would last for 60 years. It was the biggest event in the entire universe!","At this moment, all the disputes stopped. Nothing was more important than the Grand gathering of all races in the universe.","...","At the same time, in a swamp area in a remote corner of the universe.","Three Supreme martial artists wearing the same black robe and black armor were hiding in the dark.","“Devour Seven, the gathering of all races in the universe has begun.”","The three-meter tall mountain-like Supreme martial artist said.","The Supreme-being called Devour Seven replied in a hoarse voice, “Devour Nine, let’s leave first. That old man has a tight watch. Once he finds us here, it’s very likely that our plan will be exposed.","Devour Nine narrowed his eyes, nodded, and snorted, “Fine, then let’s leave first. It’s just that I haven’t found that guy yet. Otherwise, I’ll definitely burn his bones and scatter his ashes!”","Hualala!","A spinning black hole appeared under their feet.","The three of them seemed to have fallen into a swamp as they were slowly swallowed by the black hole.","“Hehehehe, just wait. We’ll be back soon.”","An unreconciled sneer came from the swamp."]},{"number":4383,"title":"Chapter 4383 I’ll Give You a Chance","paragraphs":["4383 I’ll Give You a Chance","Three years passed by in a flash.","One of the nine forbidden grounds in the extreme north of the universe.","Under a ten thousand year old ice mountain.","“Ancestor, how is Jian Wushuang? Do I have to keep sleeping like this?”","The Overlord asked as he placed Jian Wushuang on a huge ice bed.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s aura was extremely weak. His eyes were tightly closed and he had fallen into the deepest sleep.","Beside him, Leng Rushuang, who had just come out of the heaven suppressing monument, held Jian Wushuang’s hand tightly. She looked at the sleeping Jian Wushuang with heartache.","When the white-haired ancestor heard this, he shook his head and sighed, “Grandson, this little guy’s divine body has been shattered sixty-seven times. It’s already a great fortune that he’s still alive. However, his life force has been injured. I’m afraid it’s impossible for him to wake up.”","“Is that so?” The Overlord’s expression turned grave.","Leng Rushuang’s heart skipped a beat when she heard this. She knelt down in front of the white-haired man with a thud. Her clear voice became hoarse and her eyes were bloodshot.","“Senior, I know you have a way. Please save my husband!”","“Hey, what are you doing? Please get up.”","The white-haired ancestor quickly helped Leng Rushuang up and shook his head, “Little girl, Jian Wushuang once saved my grandson’s life. We, the Overlord clan, have never owed anyone anything. If I can save him, I will naturally not be stingy. However, his life force has been damaged. Ordinary methods won’t be able to save him.”","At this point, he sighed.","Leng Rushuang trembled and her lips trembled. She asked in despair, “Senior, is...is there really no way to save my husband?”","The white-haired ancestor stood with his hands behind his back. He nodded and replied, “He can only depend on his own fortune. And...as his life force origin is damaged, he will no longer be able to maintain his undying state. His life force origin will gradually disappear and I’m afraid Jian Wushuang will really die.”","At this point, the white-haired ancestor saw that Leng Rushuang’s face was pale and she almost fell to the ground. He comforted her, “However, you don’t have to worry so much. This piece of billion-year-old profound ice can slow down Jian Wushuang’s life force to the greatest extent. It will take at least several chaos cycles for Jian Wushuang to truly die.”","Hearing this, Leng Rushuang couldn’t help but turn pale. She felt cold all over.","When the Overlord saw this, he seemed to have thought of something. He looked at the white-haired ancestor and hesitated for a while. Finally, a look of determination appeared in his eyes. He gritted his teeth and said, “Patriarch, isn’t there a secret technique that can...”","“Nonsense!”","Before the great Overlord could finish, the white-haired ancestor glared at him and chided, “Grandson, come out with me!”","With that, the white-haired ancestor walked out of the ice cave.","Outside the ice cave, snow was falling. At a glance, the world was a vast expanse of white. In the distance, countless mountains were covered in white snow, as if there were snow dragons lying on the ground.","The Overlord followed behind the white-haired ancestor in silence, allowing the snow to fall on their shoulders and dye them white.","“Grandson, I know what you want to say, but the secret skill must be guided by the blood essence of Overlord body. I have already repaid your favor by saving Jian Wushuang. Do you want me to offer my life blood essence for him?”","The white-haired ancestor said in a deep voice with his back to the Overlord.","Bang!","“Old ancestor, please save her to the end. I’m willing to offer my own blood essence!”","The great Overlord knelt down on the ground and said with his head buried.","“You’re offering your life essence blood?”","The white-haired ancestor snorted and said, “Bastard! There are very few people in our Overlord body clan to begin with, and those who can truly awaken the undying Overlord body are even fewer. After my death, it wasn’t easy for me to awaken you, and now you’re actually offering your life essence blood for a mere outsider? Do you still want to break through to the Supreme martial artist level? Where do you think our Overlord body clan is?”","“Nonsense!”","When the white-haired ancestor said the last word ‘nonsense’, he was truly enraged. An ice mountain in the distance suddenly exploded!","The Overlord trembled when he heard this. However, after taking a deep breath, he mustered up his courage and said, “Forefather! The reason why I want to save Jian Wushuang is for the sake of the Overlord clan!”","“Oh? For the sake of our Overlord body clan?”","The white-haired ancestor turned around and looked down at the Overlord who was kneeling in front of him. He sneered and said, “Then tell me, how did you consider this?”","The Overlord nodded and replied in a deep voice, “Forefather, as you said, there are only a few members of the Overlord’s clan, and even fewer can truly awaken the Overlord body. It’s because of this that the Overlord’s body clan has never been able to become a top clan among the ten thousand clans in the universe. However, with Jian Wushuang’s help, our Overlord body clan might really become a top clan in the universe and prosper forever!”","“Eternal prosperity? With the strength of a little fellow who can’t even protect himself and hasn’t even broken through to the Supreme level?”","The white-haired ancestor laughed as if he had heard a funny joke.","“Not bad.”","However, the Overlord nodded solemnly and replied, “Ancestor, you don’t understand Jian Wushuang. That’s why you said that. Do you know that when I first met Jian Wushuang, he was only a fifth-level Ruler? But in just tens of thousands of years, he was able to kill a Supreme!”","“Forefather, what does this mean? I’ve always been a good judge of character. Jian Wushuang is a person who will repay kindness and revenge. We saved Jian Wushuang today. If he can come back to life, the repayment in the future will definitely be much greater than what we have today!”","Seeing that the white-haired ancestor was about to speak again, the Overlord directly kowtowed and said, “Please help your grandson this once, old ancestor, as a way to pave the way for your grandson’s future!”","“You...”","The white-haired ancestor pondered for a moment before sighing. He took a step forward and touched the Overlord’s head, “Forget it. I’ve already reached the end of my path of cultivation anyway. I’ll take the present as a gamble for the future.”","The Overlord quickly stood up with joy on his face. Just as he was about to thank the white-haired ancestor, the white-haired ancestor glared at him and said, “Not only are you siding with an outsider, but you’re also being so impetuous. How can you be like this?”","Seeing the Overlord sneer, the white-haired ancestor could not help but feel angry and amused at the same time. In the end, he shook his head and said, “I can now use my life essence blood to perform a secret skill to save Jian Wushuang, but I have to be blunt. It’s equivalent to reconstructing a body for Jian Wushuang and creating an indestructible Overlord body. The chance of success is only one percent. If he can’t hold on and his life essence completely collapses, don’t blame me.”","“This...”","Hearing this, the Overlord couldn’t make up his mind for a moment and said, “Ancestor, why don’t we let Jian Wushuang’s cultivation partner make the decision?”","The white-haired ancestor nodded and stepped into the ice cave again.","Leng Rushuang kneeled beside Jian Wushuang on the ice bed. She touched his face with her slender fingers and sobbed.","Seeing this, the white-haired ancestor’s eyes flickered and he said in a deep voice, “Little girl, I’m giving Jian Wushuang a good fortune, but there’s also the risk of death. Do you want it or not?”"]},{"number":4384,"title":"Chapter 4384 Borrowing Power From the Good Wind","paragraphs":["4384 Borrowing Power From the Good Wind","“Good fortune?”","Leng Rushuang was stunned and asked, “Senior, please explain in detail.”","The white-haired ancestor nodded and replied, “I have a way to save Jian Wushuang. I’ll use my bloodline as a guide to change his blood and awaken the undying Overlord body. Once Jian Wushuang awakens the undying Overlord body, his life origin will become eternal. He will be truly undying and indestructible. He will naturally be able to live.”","“However, I need to remind you that even if you’re from the Overlord body clan, the chance of awakening the indestructible Overlord body is only one in ten thousand. Moreover, Jian Wushuang doesn’t have the bloodline of the Overlord body yet. If he doesn’t succeed in awakening the Overlord body with my bloodline as the guide, I’m afraid he will die immediately.”","Then, the white-haired ancestor stopped talking and stared at Leng Rushuang with his bright eyes.","He thought that he had done his best and left the rest to Leng Rushuang.","Leng Rushuang was dazed for a moment. Then she took a deep breath and said gratefully, “Thank you for your advice, senior, but this matter is of great importance. I want to think about it first.”","“Naturally.”","The white-haired ancestor nodded and smiled. He then got up and left the ice cave, leaving Leng Rushuang to weigh the pros and cons herself.","After the white-haired ancestor left, the ice cave immediately became silent.","Leng Rushuang stood by Jian Wushuang’s side. She used her thumb to wipe off the thin layer of frost on Jian Wushuang’s face with gentle divine power. She looked lost.","She wanted Jian Wushuang to come back to life, but she was more afraid that the secret method would fail and Jian Wushuang would die and leave her.","Her heart was like a swing, going up and down, with mixed feelings.","“My husband, what do you think I should do...”","Leng Rushuang mumbled to herself and put her head on Jian Wushuang’s chest, listening to his weak heartbeat.","Time slowly passed. One day, two days, three days...","The white-haired ancestor had not stepped into the ice cave ever since he came in and said those words that day.","The Overlord came in a few times and wanted to say something, but he swallowed his words. In the end, he just looked at Jian Wushuang silently for a while and then left.","A year had passed.","In this forbidden land of ice and snow, there was no night or day. It was always a vast expanse of white, and it was impossible to distinguish the concept of time.","Leng Rushuang was like a statue. She had forgotten to cultivate and just stood beside Jian Wushuang.","She was struggling in her heart. If she didn’t use the secret skill, Jian Wushuang would leave her sooner or later. If she used the secret skill, although Jian Wushuang might wake up and even improve, there was a greater possibility that he would lose his life.","Then, it would be equivalent to her killing her own lover with her own hands.","How could he bear to do this?","Time passed by as she pondered. One day, when she saw Jian Wushuang’s hair slowly turning gray, she could no longer hold it in.","“Husband, if you had a choice, I think you would choose to take a gamble, right?”","At this moment, Leng Rushuang thought of many things. She remembered that Jian Wushuang had traveled 3000 miles and fought against millions of people with one sword.","He thought of the countless counterattacks that Jian Wushuang had made!","At this moment, the scale in her heart finally tilted towards the ‘secret technique’.","“Husband, if you wake up, it will be a happy ending. But if you fail to wake up and die, I, Leng Rushuang, will just die with you. What’s there to be afraid of?”","“I, Leng Rushuang, will go with you to the heavens and the netherworld. I will not regret it even if I die!”","Leng Rushuang’s eyes were filled with determination. She took a deep breath and walked out of the ice cave.","Outside the ice cave, the white-haired ancestor was sitting in front of an Ice Lake. He held a bamboo pole and was fishing quietly.","Hearing Leng Rushuang’s footsteps, the white-haired ancestor did not turn around. He said lightly, “Little girl, have you made your decision?”","Leng Rushuang nodded and said firmly, “Senior, please use your divine power to save my husband!”","“You really don’t regret it?”","“No regrets!”","“Good.”","A smile appeared on the white-haired ancestor’s face. He shook his fishing rod and stood up.","“Then...let’s start.”","The white-haired ancestor strode into the ice cave, followed by the Overlord and Leng Rushuang.","“You don’t need to come in, just wait for this old master outside.”","The Overlord and Leng Rushuang looked at each other and stopped.","The blizzard outside the ice cave was getting stronger and stronger, and it looked like it was going to pour into Liancheng.","The Overlord and Leng Rushuang started to wait quietly.","Inside the ice cave.","The white-haired ancestor stood with his hands behind his back and looked at Jian Wushuang who was lying on the Millennium black ice. He muttered to himself, “The good wind borrows strength, sending me to the clouds. Little guy, this old man has given you this good fortune, but whether you can take it and rise to the top will depend on your own ability.”","“Don’t disappoint me.”","Bang!","In an instant, the white-haired ancestor’s body blazed with golden light. His white hair all over his body disappeared, revealing a burly and majestic body.","His eyes were like fire, his qi and blood were vigorous, and his body was shining with golden light, like a golden-armored God of War who stepped out of the Nine Heavens.","The next moment.","He pointed out his index finger and pressed it between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows.","A trace of golden blood came out of his fingertip and entered Jian Wushuang’s glabella, which was quickly absorbed.","...","As the white-haired ancestor’s blood essence was absorbed, Jian Wushuang’s pale face suddenly turned red and his gray hair turned black again.","In contrast, the white-haired ancestor’s burly body slowly shriveled up. His aura, which was as bright as the sun, also gradually diminished.","Seizing the fortune of heaven and earth, reversing life and death, and reconstructing the source of life, how could it be done with just a few drops of blood essence?","The price the white-haired ancestor had to pay was far more than what he had to tell the Overlord!","Time flew by, and in the blink of an eye, several years had passed.","Kachaa.","The door of the ice cave opened, and the white-haired ancestor stepped out.","little girl, I have ten creation divine pills here. Give one to Jian Wushuang every other day. As for whether he can wake up or not, it will depend on his fate.","The white-haired ancestor could not hide the exhaustion in his eyes. He waved his hand and took out a Jade bottle.","“Many thanks, senior! My husband and I will never forget senior’s kindness!”","Leng Rushuang was overjoyed. She took the Jade bottle and kowtowed to the white-haired ancestor.","...","“There’s no need for that.”","The white-haired ancestor shook his head and took a step forward, disappearing before them.","Leng Rushuang did not say much and quickly entered the ice cave.","He saw Jian Wushuang lying on the ice bed. Although he had not woken up, his face was no longer pale, but a little ruddy.","Ten days later, Leng Rushuang took out a longan-sized elixir from the Jade bottle and carefully put it into Jian Wushuang’s mouth.","Then, she began to wait for Jian Wushuang’s transformation."]},{"number":4385,"title":"Chapter 4385 Send Me Up to the Clouds!","paragraphs":["4385 Send Me Up to the Clouds!","Darkness!","Endless darkness.","Jian Wushuang felt as if he had fallen into an eternal void where everything was still. There was no sun, moon, stars, or the alternation of day and night.","Jian Wushuang felt as if he had turned into a wisp of energy that was drifting in the void. He was muddleheaded and did not know where he came from or where he was going.","He wandered around like this for an unknown amount of time. Perhaps it was a moment, or perhaps it was ten thousand years. Suddenly, in the endless night, there was an additional trace of dark red.","A trace of blood-red.","Then, more and more of this dark red appeared...","The world was no longer a monotonous black, but a bright red!","All of a sudden!","A ray of light exploded in Jian Wushuang’s consciousness!","He began to feel. His senses, his touch, his pain, all his feelings and memories came flooding in like a tide.","“I’m Jian Wushuang!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s consciousness woke up from his deep sleep. Before he could think that he was not dead, a magnificent power, no, it should be called energy, poured into his body fiercely!","It hurt!","A heart-wrenching pain!","Jian Wushuang felt that his divine body was about to be torn apart by the violent and magnificent power!","This huge force came from his blood!","His blood was burning like a flame, trying to burn his entire body into ashes.","No, to be exact, it should be a foreign blood that was constantly tearing apart the particles, atoms, and cells in his blood and replacing them!","This blood was as vigorous as the rising sun. It carried with it endless vitality as it underwent an earth-shaking transformation in his body!","Under this change, his missing life source began to recover step by step, and it was moving in another direction.","...","At the same time.","Inside the ice cave.","The white-haired ancestor and Leng Rushuang stood around Jian Wushuang and stared at him.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were still closed and he was in a deep sleep. However, he had regained consciousness and seemed to be experiencing something extremely painful. His brows were tightly furrowed, his eyelashes kept trembling, his body was red and hot, and there were even cracks on his body from time to time.","“Senior, what’s my husband’s condition now?”","Leng Rushuang asked worriedly.","The white-haired ancestor’s eyes flickered and he replied, “Little girl, do you know the story of a butterfly breaking out of its cocoon? Jian Wushuang was now going through the most critical step of breaking out of the cocoon and becoming a butterfly. If he could survive, he would be able to sublimate to the extreme, break the shackles of life, recover, awaken the undying Overlord body, and take another step forward.","“However, if he can’t make it through, he will die and everything will turn into nothingness.”","Leng Rushuang’s heart tightened when she heard this. She could not help but ask, “Senior, what can I do?”","“You?”","The white-haired ancestor glanced at him and shook his head, “The only thing you can do now is to wait quietly and see how he will experience this transformation.”","“This transformation is both good fortune and a tribulation.”","“Whether it’s a blessing or a curse, it’s all up to him.”","Hearing that, Leng Rushuang stopped talking. She gathered her thoughts and prayed in her heart.","Time flew by, and several years passed.","It had been thirty years since Jian Wushuang had been rescued and the Great Clan Gathering had begun.","The great Overlord had already left for the Great Clan Gathering.","Ka-cha-cha.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s divine body was covered with numerous cracks. It was like a ceramic that had been sewn up and it looked like it was about to break.","His brows were tightly furrowed, and his face was filled with pain.","it seems that Jian Wushuang can’t hold on any longer.","The white-haired ancestor shook his head and said in a deep voice.","At this point, the white-haired ancestor sighed and said, “It’s extremely difficult even for the Overlord body clan to awaken the undying Overlord body, let alone Jian Wushuang. It’s only natural for him to fail.”","“Is that so?”","Leng Rushuang could not help but laugh.","All his efforts were in vain in the end.","At that moment, Leng Rushuang’s heart was like dead ashes.","She held Jian Wushuang’s hand gently and wiped her teary eyes. She forced a smile and thanked white-haired ancestor. Then, she looked at Jian Wushuang with tenderness.","“Husband, it’s fine. Even if I die, I’ll be with you.”","Seeing this, the white-haired ancestor could not help but sigh again, “What an idiot.”","Crack!","More and more cracks appeared on Jian Wushuang’s body. Just as Jian Wushuang’s body was about to explode and his life origin was about to collapse and shatter...","...","Suddenly!","From the depths of Jian Wushuang’s soul, the power of his perfect chaotic lifeform gushed out and turned into a light shield that covered Jian Wushuang!","Under this power, Jian Wushuang’s body, which was in imminent danger, began to heal at a speed that was visible to the naked eye!","Furthermore, he strode in a direction that even the White-haired ancestor did not know about!","“This is?”","The white-haired ancestor was shocked, and his eyes flickered.","He didn’t know what had happened to Jian Wushuang, but he could feel that Jian Wushuang’s life origin, which had been withered, suddenly boiled. His life aura was like a ball of fire, burning fiercely!","This boiling and burning life source aura made even him feel fear.","“A perfect chaotic lifeform?”","White-hair ancestor looked at Jian Wushuang in shock. He only realized then that Jian Wushuang was a rare perfect chaotic lifeform!","What kind of sparks would be produced when the immortal tyrant body and the perfect chaotic lifeform collided?","...","Even the White-haired ancestor could not give an answer.","“Let’s go out. Don’t disturb him!”","He took a deep breath. Although he didn’t know what the situation was, he knew that Jian Wushuang was undergoing an unprecedented transformation!","“What’s wrong?”","Leng Rushuang was stunned.","Jian Wushuang might be waking up soon...","The white-haired ancestor’s eyes were like torches as he spoke word by word.","Then, he took Leng Rushuang away from the ice cave and watched from a distance.","Hu chi...hu chi...hu chi...","A heavy panting sound came out of the ice cave like muffled thunder, as if a prehistoric giant beast had begun to awaken.","Hu chi...hu chi...","This panting sound was like a big drum being hit, it was deep and heavy to the extreme.","Then, the sound grew louder and louder!","Finally-","Bang!","A heaven-destroying, earth-shattering boom rang out as the ice cave that had been frozen for countless chaos cycles exploded!","In the midst of the explosion, countless glaciers exploded and ice peaks shattered, forming an avalanche that was a hundred thousand feet tall. It rolled out grandly, as if it was a scene of destruction!","In this apocalyptic scene, a ray of golden light suddenly shot into the sky and straight up to the green clouds!"]},{"number":4386,"title":"Chapter 4386 Chaotic Domineering Body!","paragraphs":["4386 Chaotic Domineering Body!","Rumble!","Snowflakes fell and ice shards flew everywhere.","The golden light shot up into the sky like a blazing sun, melting the snow.","In the golden light, a black-haired man slowly opened his eyes.","“Jian Wushuang!”","“Husband!”","Suddenly, the white-haired ancestor’s eyes flickered and Leng Rushuang cried tears of joy.","In their eyes, the bright golden light gradually dissipated, revealing Jian Wushuang’s naked upper body.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s appearance had changed greatly. His thick black hair grew rapidly and hung down to his heels. His originally white body was now covered with golden divine patterns and runes.","This was nothing, especially Jian Wushuang’s eyes, which had changed the most.","It was a pair of purple-gold eyes!","Jian Wushuang’s black and white eyes had disappeared and were replaced by a pair of purple-gold vertical eyes. There was a purple ‘Chuan’ mark between his eyebrows!","Chaotic domineering body!!!","In an instant, the white-haired ancestor’s body trembled, and his eyes revealed a look of disbelief.","He stared at Jian Wushuang and his breathing became heavy.","“Senior, what is chaotic domineering body?”","Leng Rushuang was also shocked and asked in confusion.","The white-haired ancestor took a deep breath and stared at Jian Wushuang. He replied in a deep voice, “Little girl, all the races in the world were born from the chaos of the universe, such as the ancestral Dragon of the Dragon race, the Phoenix ancestor of the Phoenix race, and so on. Our undying Overlord body race is naturally the same.”","“The first person to be born in the chaos of the universe in the immortal Overlord body clan was the Overlord body ancestor. He...it’s the chaotic domineering body!”","“I didn’t expect that my Overlord body blood essence could directly awaken the atavism of Jian Wushuang and activate the chaotic Overlord body of Yuan ancestor!!”","At this point, the white-haired ancestor’s expression was extremely interesting.","Their Overlord body clan had been passed down for generations, and there were only a few people who could awaken the indestructible Overlord body. They didn’t expect that a person who had nothing to do with them would actually awaken the chaotic Overlord body!","He could tell that even though Jian Wushuang had just started cultivating the chaotic domineering body, he was very likely to grow to the level of the Overlord body ancestor in time!","That was a level that even the current him could not catch up to!","“Why is it like this? Is it because Jian Wushuang is a perfect chaotic lifeform?”","Patriarch white hair fell into deep thought.","Above the Nine Heavens.","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and looked at his body that was covered with divine patterns. His eyes flickered.","He could feel that his body contained a terrifying mighty force that was about to explode. This mighty force was the Supreme physical strength that could destroy the stars and blow into the Star field with a flick of his finger!","He felt that he could blow up a Supreme martial artist with one punch!","“This power...”","Jian Wushuang let out a breath of turbid air. He turned his right hand and the Wuqi Divine Sword appeared in his hand.","Chila!","He held the Wuqi Divine Sword and slashed his chest with force. A long string of sparks actually splashed out, but his skin was not even broken.","“How did it become like this?”","He was in a daze. Didn’t he die in Long Qing’s hands?","Why didn’t he die? why did his body suddenly become so much stronger?","Whoosh!","At this moment, a white-haired figure flashed over at an extremely fast speed and stood in front of him.","Just as he was about to ask, he saw the white-haired figure sizing him up as if he had found a treasure. In the end, he laughed and said, “Hahaha, I was right. It’s the chaotic domineering body!”","“This senior, you are?”","Jian Wushuang cupped his hands in suspicion. He could feel that although the white-haired ancestor’s aura was extremely powerful, he had no ill intentions toward him. In fact, there was a natural closeness between them that came from the same bloodline.","“Husband, this is Senior Tyrant Ancestor. He was the one who saved you.”","Leng Rushuang said with a smile.","Then, Leng Rushuang told him how the white-haired ancestor had saved him from the six Supremes and how he had used a secret skill to awaken him.","Immediately, Jian Wushuang was moved. He quickly cupped his hands and bowed to white-haired ancestor respectfully, “Senior Tyrant Ancestor, today’s kindness is like a rebirth. I will never forget this great kindness. In the future, if you need my help, I, Jian Wushuang, will do anything for you!”","The white-haired ancestor stroked his beard and smiled. He waved his hand nonchalantly and said, “There’s no need to be so polite. You saved my grandson’s life, so I’m just returning the favor on his behalf.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and replied seriously, “Senior Tyrant Ancestor, I saved the Overlord in passing. It’s not the same as your kindness.”","The white-haired ancestor was not a pretentious person and replied with a smile, “Little guy, you’ve inherited my bloodline, so you’re considered half a descendant of mine. How about this, if I encounter any accidents in the future, when my Overlord body tribe is in great danger and can no longer protect the Overlord body tribe, you can help me and I’ll consider it as returning the favor today. How is it?”","“Naturally!”","Jian Wushuang nodded his head firmly.","Seeing this, a look of relief flashed across the white-haired ancestor’s eyes.","“Jian Wushuang, I won’t stay any longer. When you were asleep, this little girl stayed by your side and took care of you day and night. You two should have a good time.”","With that, the white-haired ancestor was about to leave.","...","However, before he left, he seemed to have thought of something and added, “Oh right. Jian Wushuang, the Great Clan Gathering has been going on for forty years. You’d better go there as soon as possible. That Lord will be choosing ten candidates to become his children in the Great Clan Gathering. They’ll be listening to the Dao for the last ten years, so don’t waste any more time.”","Then, without any hesitation, white-hair ancestor took a step forward and disappeared from Jian Wushuang’s sight like a fireball.","“It’s been 40 years since the Great Clan Gathering?”","Jian Wushuang’s pupils shrank slightly and he was deep in thought.","Jian Wushuang collected his thoughts and turned to look at Leng Rushuang. His eyes were filled with gentleness and love.","...","A year later.","On the snowy plains.","Jian Wushuang was walking barefooted, wearing a loose black robe and carrying the Tarot Divine Sword on his back.","Every step he took left a deep flame mark on the icy plain.","“Shuang ‘er, your husband will be leaving first. Take care of yourself.”","...","“Husband, I will wait for your safe return here.”","Leng Rushuang, who was wearing a long purple dress with tassels, stood behind Jian Wushuang and smiled.","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang nodded at her and then pressed his right hand on the White jade token on his waist without any hesitation.","It was the pass to the Night Sky Palace, the Grand gathering of all races in the universe.","Kachaa!","In an instant, the White jade token shattered, and a gentle light shot up into the sky.","Bang!","The next moment, the clear sky suddenly changed. Countless clouds were torn apart, and a white beam of light suddenly shot down from the sky, forming a circle of light.","Jian Wushuang stepped into the ring of light.","Whoosh!","The light beam was retracted and heaven and earth became clear again. Jian Wushuang’s figure disappeared."]},{"number":4387,"title":"Chapter 4387 The Gathering of Ten Thousand Races","paragraphs":["4387 The Gathering of Ten Thousand Races","Hu hu hu!","Gusts of strong wind came from the ninth heaven. Jian Wushuang was lifted up by a seven-colored auspicious cloud. He broke through the void continuously and shuttled through the cracks, heading in an unknown direction.","Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back. His purple-gold eyes flashed with thoughts.","In the past year, he had spent most of his time familiarizing himself with the chaotic body and asking white-hair ancestor about the Great Clan Gathering.","!!","First, it was the chaotic domineering body.","To Jian Wushuang, his comprehension of sword principle, universe law, and divine power were all at the peak among the Rulers of the world.","In fact, throughout the ages, there were very few people who could compare to him.","His only flaw, or rather, his shortcoming, was the strength of his physical body.","His body could only be considered ordinary among Rulers. In fact, some cultivators who specialized in cultivating their bodies or races with naturally strong bodies were far stronger than him.","But now, with the awakening of his chaotic domineering body, this shortcoming was finally made up for.","The advantage of this was that even if he stood still and let a beginner Supreme-being attack him, they would not be able to break through his defense. On the other hand, he could blow up a beginner Supreme-being with one punch.","Furthermore, the great Dao was interconnected. He tried to use the Tarot Divine Sword again, and the backlash that had instantly sucked him dry had already been reduced to its minimum.","In other words, he would truly be able to grasp the Tarot Divine Sword and would no longer be limited by the number of times he could use it!","This was what Jian Wushuang was most pleased about.","“I’m now strong enough to kill an advanced Supreme. I can even fight against a top Supreme!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered with a cold killing intent.","After passing through countless cracks in the void, a magnificent palace built on the clouds appeared in front of Jian Wushuang.","The palace was lifted up by a beautiful red glow and was made of green bricks, white jade, and glazed tiles. There were elegant cranes flying around the palace, and there was even a rainbow that stretched across the back of the palace.","Countless rich auras of the great Dao and the power of rules rushed toward him, giving him a calm and amiable feeling.","In the center of the palace, there was a plaque with the words ‘Ling Xiao’ written on it. It was simple and grand.","“Is this the towering palace?”","Jian Wushuang sighed slightly. Towering Palace was really like a blessed Land of the Gods. It was a rare place in the world.","“Who are you? Do you have an invitation?”","Outside Ling Xiao Palace, two soldiers wearing shiny silver armor and silver helmets and holding long tasseled Spears stood guard at the entrance of Ling Xiao Palace and asked in a clear voice.","“Eh? That Lord is really generous. The divine generals in charge of guarding the door are all Supreme martial artists.”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and took a step forward. He landed outside Ling Xiao Palace and took out the White jade token he had obtained on the Ancient Path of Stars. He said, “Is the invitation card this token?”","“Please wait a moment, allow us to examine it.”","The two divine generals took the token from Jian Wushuang’s hands respectfully. After examining it carefully, they returned the token to Jian Wushuang and said, “Please come in, Sir.”","“Yes, thank you.”","Jian Wushuang nodded at the two divine generals and stepped into the gate of the Night Sky Palace.","As soon as he stepped in, he saw a long white jade staircase in front of him.","Beside the white jade stairs, many Supreme-beings with different appearances were sitting in rows.","Some had tiger heads and human bodies, some had catfish gods, and some looked like old friends with three heads and six arms, with eyes all over their faces.","These were some of the top races in the universe.","It seemed that the order of their seats was arranged by their strength. The closer they sat to the former, the higher their strength.","When they saw Jian Wushuang walking over, a touch of surprise flashed in their eyes. They discussed in low voices, “Who is this person? Why did you only arrive at this time?”","“Eh? this person seems to have the cultivation level of an Ultimate Ruler?”","“The Ultimate Ruler? Aren’t there only three Ultimate Rulers from the Ancient Path of Stars who are qualified to participate in the feast of all races in the universe?”","“That’s right, the Overlord and true Luo are already here. This person is...”","“Jian Wushuang?!”","“Jian Wushuang is here!!!”","In an instant, the entire Hall was in an uproar.","Jian Wushuang’s name was definitely a thunderous one in the recent universe. He was merely an Ultimate Ruler, but the number of Supremes who had died at his hands had far exceeded the number of hands!","One had to know how terrifying this number was.","Even among the many Supreme martial artists present, there were very few people who had slaughtered so many Supreme martial artists.","A person’s reputation was like the shadow of a tree. The Supreme-beings sitting on the White jade steps were almost all beginner or intermediate Supreme-beings. Their expressions changed slightly, and they looked at Jian Wushuang with fear.","“I didn’t expect that the six top Supreme Masters, including Bing Ye, who is a half-step to invincible Supreme Master, would kill Jian Wushuang together and let him escape.”","“He still dares to come to the Great Clan Gathering? The Great Void Temple, the Dragon Tribe, and the other great powers are also participating in the myriad Tribe Gathering.”","“It seems that there will be some twists and turns in this Great Clan Gathering.”","On the White jade stairs, many Supreme martial artists were shaking their heads as they discussed.","Jian Wushuang was expressionless as he walked up the stone steps. The stagnation force coming from the stone steps was almost negligible for him who had the chaotic domineering body.","“The Dragon Tribe, the Great Void Temple...have they all come?”","Hearing the discussion, a murderous intent flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes.","“It’s time to settle old and new scores.”","...","Jian Wushuang’s lips curled into a cold smile.","Pa da pa da.","There were a total of 999 steps on the white jade stairs. When Jian Wushuang reached the middle, there were no elementary Supreme martial artists left. Almost all of them were middle Supreme martial artists.","They looked at Jian Wushuang with less respect and suspicion, but more playfulness and ridicule.","“Oh? Wasn’t that Jian Wushuang? How would a stray dog dare to participate in a meeting of the highest level in the universe?”","At this moment, a cold and sinister laugh could be heard.","“What?”","Jian Wushuang looked up and saw a white-robed Supreme Master with the word ‘great void’ embroidered on the back. He was looking at him with a cold smile.","“People from the Great Void Temple?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","“I am the south of the river, the third Hall Master of the Great Void Temple!”","...","The Supreme Master stood up and stood in front of Jian Wushuang. He said with a fake smile.","“The south of the river?”","Jian Wushuang thought for a while and felt that the name was familiar. It seemed that he had once tried to kill Ninth Kalpa King on the Supreme Ancient Path of Stars. In the end, he was chased by Ninth Kalpa King and finally, Ninth Kalpa King let him go.","“Oh.”","Jian Wushuang nodded.","After that.","“Get lost!”","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s fist glowed with golden light and sent Supreme Feng Nan flying!"]},{"number":4388,"title":"Chapter 4388 Meeting Old Friends","paragraphs":["4388 Meeting Old Friends","Buzzzzzz!","At that moment, the divine patterns on Jian Wushuang’s body lit up, and his purple-gold eyes shone brightly. The purple ‘River’ character between his eyebrows flashed with a touch of flirtatiousness. His originally ordinary appearance also had an inexplicable sense of handsome and domineering aura.","“Jian Wushuang, you...”","There was a flash of anger in the eyes of the South River Supreme. He had not expected that Jian Wushuang would dare to attack him in the universe myriad Clan Gathering!","!!","“Hmph, if you used the Wuxu chaotic cauldron or the Tarot Divine Sword, I would still be a little afraid of you. How dare you fight me with your mere physical strength?”","Then, River south Supreme sneered and endless supreme divine power surged in his hands. He had made a decision in his heart. In that case, he would make Jian Wushuang look bad in the Great Clan Gathering and make him lose face in front of all the clans.","Seeing this, the other Supreme-beings looked even more amused. To them, Jian Wushuang was an anomaly, and they didn’t mind seeing Jian Wushuang embarrass himself in the universe banquet of all races.","Bang-!","A muffled sound exploded!","However, a shocking scene happened.","Jian Wushuang’s fist, which was wrapped in golden light, had directly blown apart the hands of the Shiba Supreme, inch by inch. Then, it crushed all the way and finally smashed into the chest of the Shiba Supreme.","One force breaks ten thousand techniques!","Bang! Bang!","It was as if the chest of the xunan Supreme martial artist had been hit by a huge hammer, and a short depression appeared. Then, his entire body flew out like a cannonball, rolling down the White jade stairs.","“How did this happen?”","“Isn’t Jian Wushuang a swordsman?”","“This...this physical strength is even more powerful than me, a Supreme who specializes in physical cultivation!!","In an instant, the Supreme martial artists on both sides of the White jade stairs let out a cry of surprise.","They looked at the expressionless Jian Wushuang, their eyes filled with shock and doubt.","“Can’t even withstand a single blow.”","Jian Wushuang withdrew his fist, shook his head, and continued to walk toward the White jade stairs.","According to the white-haired ancestor, the White jade stairs were only the periphery of the Great Clan Gathering. Although they had participated in the Great Clan Gathering, they could not even see the Lord’s face. They could only get some spiritual wine and fruits at the myriad Clan Gathering. If they were lucky, they might even hear a few words from the Lord when he gave lectures.","The universe’s myriad race gathering was a gathering of all races. Basically, the top-ranked races in the universe would receive a different number of admission tickets.","However, there were very few people who were lucky enough to enter the venue and see that Lord. In the past, only those who had obtained the qualification ticket on the Ancient Path of Stars or ranked in the top ten of the universe’s top forces had a chance.","As Jian Wushuang walked up step by step, a familiar voice suddenly came from in front of him.","“Jian Wushuang, how have you been?”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and saw a beautiful woman looking at him with a smile.","“And you are?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned and confused. He had never seen this woman before, but he felt that she was familiar.","“You don’t recognize me?”","The beautiful woman reached out and touched her face. A blue veil immediately appeared, covering her face below her eyes, only revealing her beautiful eyes.","“Lady Blue?”","Jian Wushuang was stunned at first, then he was surprised and said with a smile, “Lady Blue, what are you doing here?”","Jian Wushuang had a deep impression of Lady Blue and had a good impression of him.","“This is my master’s training ground. If I’m not here, where should I be?”","The beautiful woman waved her right hand and The Blue Veil disappeared. She covered her mouth and laughed.","“This is your master’s training hall?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was stunned again. He was a little confused and didn’t understand what he meant.","Wasn’t this Ling Xiao Palace that Lord’s territory?","The next moment.","Jian Wushuang asked in disbelief, “Lady Blue, you mean to say that your master is that Lord?”","“Hehe, you just thought of it?”","The beautiful woman winked at Jian Wushuang and said, “Jian Wushuang, you don’t have to call me Lady Blue. You can call me Bluey.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and cupped his hands, “Back then on the Ancient Path of Stars, miss Bluey had given me a few pointers.”","“You’re being too polite by saying thank you. Jian Wushuang, follow me into the high heaven society. My master will be out soon and he admires you.”","Bluey smiled at Jian Wushuang, then turned around and led Jian Wushuang across the white jade stone steps and into the main hall of towering Palace.","There were a total of seventy-eight tables in towering Palace’s main hall, and behind each table sat an expert who was at least a top Supreme.","As soon as Jian Wushuang walked in, countless eyes were fixed on him.","“Jian Wushuang?”","“Hmph, how hateful. I actually let this little thief escape with his life.”","“This little thief still dares to come to the universe myriad Clan Gathering. He really doesn’t know how to spell the word ‘death’.”","These gazes were extremely complicated. There was killing intent, hatred, and surprise.","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened and he glanced at the seventy-eight tables.","Ha, there were quite a few familiar faces in this Hall.","...","Supreme Bing Ye from the Great Void Temple, God Emperor Scarlet Sun from the Scarlet Sun Divine Kingdom, Blood Sky Hall Master from the Blood Sky Hall, Long Qing from the Dragon race...","The six forces that had participated in killing him had all arrived!","Other than that, there were also some old acquaintances.","“Jian Wushuang, you didn’t let me down. I’ve been waiting for you for a long time.”","The one who spoke was a white-haired man with an indifferent face. He was the Ninth Kalpa King.","However, at this moment, the Ninth Kalpa King, who had always been unsmiling, had a slight smile on his face.","“Jian Wushuang, you’ve become stronger again.”","Jian Wushuang looked at him and replied with a smile, “You’ve also become stronger.”","In these hundreds of thousands of years, the Ninth Kalpa King had broken through to the middle-stage Supreme martial artist!","Back when the Ninth Kalpa King had just broken through to the Supreme level, he had been able to kill an advanced Supreme. He had even been only a step away from being a top Supreme. Now that he had broken through to the middle Supreme level, his strength had probably taken another leap.","For a perfect chaotic lifeform like the Ninth Kalpa King, it was fine if he didn’t break through. But once he broke through, his strength would soar much more than ordinary people!","...","“Jian Wushuang, how about we spar after the universe myriad Clan Gathering is over?”","The Ninth Kalpa King said.","“I also have the same intention.”","Jian Wushuang nodded at him.","“Alliance master! You’re awake?”","At this moment, a surprised voice was heard from the other side.","It was the Overlord.","There was an empty seat beside him. Bluey said, “Jian Wushuang, that’s where you are. Hurry up and go.”","Jian Wushuang nodded at Bluey and then strode toward the Overlord."]},{"number":4389,"title":"Chapter 4389 Tian Luo Zi","paragraphs":["4389 Tian Luo Zi","“Jian Wushuang! You...you’re really awake?”","The Overlord looked at Jian Wushuang from head to toe and said in disbelief, his face slightly red.","He clearly remembered that before he left the ice cave, Jian Wushuang still looked like he was in danger. He even thought that Jian Wushuang’s awakening had failed.","“Oh, right. Jian Wushuang, why is your undying Overlord body different from mine?”","!!","He sized up Jian Wushuang and then asked in confusion.","He clearly remembered that his Overlord body did not have the ancient and mysterious divine patterns that Jian Wushuang had. His eyes did not turn purple-gold either.","Jian Wushuang smiled at him. It seemed that the Overlord still didn’t know what the chaotic domineering body was. However, he didn’t intend to explain it, otherwise, it would inevitably feel like a show-off.","Jian Wushuang was grateful to the Overlord from the bottom of his heart. If the Overlord had not begged the white-haired ancestor to save him, he would have been dead by now and would not have been able to appear in the feast of all races in the universe.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but sigh at the wonders of karma in the world. Back then, on the Ancient Path of Stars, he had killed Qiu Long and ended up attracting the attention of the dragon clan. The Overlord, who he had saved by accident, had also saved his life at the most critical moment and allowed him to awaken the chaotic domineering body, which had sublimated him to the extreme and advanced to the next level.","Every drink and peck became karma.","“I don’t know why it’s like this either. I guess it’s because of some kind of mutation.” Jian Wushuang replied with a smile.","“It’s a mutation...” The Overlord clicked his tongue, shook his head, and sighed, “your Overlord body’s aura feels much stronger than mine. If it’s a mutation, I’d like to have such a mutation too.”","“Jian Wushuang, what’s your next plan?” the Overlord asked after a pause.","“Plan?”","Jian Wushuang picked up a cup of spirit wine on the table and drank it. The corners of his mouth lifted into a cold smile.","“Since they didn’t kill me, it’s time to settle the score.”","The Overlord’s eyes narrowed slightly, but he nodded and said, “Jian Wushuang, I have already reached an agreement with the young clan head of the Moluo clan, the Saint of the Nine Star Holy Land, and some disciples from the top forces of the Sword Union. As long as you give the word, they will all come to help you.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “This matter is of great importance, we need to consider it carefully.”","Just as the two of them were conversing, an ear-piercing voice suddenly rang out beside them.","“You want to deal with the six forces with just a motley crew like you?”","“What?”","Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and looked over. He saw an ultimate Ruler sitting on the other side of the Overlord speaking in disdain.","This ultimate hegemon’s Azure hair was tied up, and he had a mustache by his lips. His face was filled with contempt.","“And who are you?”","Jian Wushuang asked indifferently.","Before this person could speak, the Overlord beside him replied with a serious expression, “Alliance master, he’s called Tian Luo Zi. He only came to the Ancient Path of Stars after you left. As soon as he arrived, he directly defeated the Sword Union and became the new Ruler of the Ancient Path of Stars. At that time, many people in the Sword Union turned to him, “In recent years, Tian Luo Zi has made a name for himself in the universe. He has even killed a Supreme. He is the only other person in the limelight besides you, Alliance leader.”","“Hehe, you’ve lost to me, but you still remember me very clearly.”","Tian Luo Zi looked at the Overlord with a sneer, then turned to Jian Wushuang and sneered, “Jian Wushuang, the universe has been boasting that you are the number one genius. Hmph, I think that’s just an undeserved reputation, just because you haven’t met me yet.”","Tian Luo Zi paused, glanced at Jian Wushuang and said provocatively, “Jian Wushuang, how about we have a fight after the universe myriad Clan Gathering is over? Let’s see who’s the real number one genius in the universe!”","“If I lose, I, Tian Luo Zi, am willing to submit to you and be used by you. But if you, Jian Wushuang, lose, hehe, then I’m sorry, you’ll have to stay as far away from me as you can in the future!”","“Jian Wushuang, how is it? Do you have the guts to fight me?”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang put down his wine cup calmly and shook his head, “I’m not interested.”","After that, Jian Wushuang ignored him and turned to Long Qing, who was staring at him.","“Long Qing, you didn’t expect that I would still be alive, did you?”","Jian Wushuang said.","To the current Jian Wushuang, apart from the top Supreme Masters, he did not care about the tianluo seed or the river south Supreme Master who had blocked his way. They were not on the same level.","She couldn’t even make him angry or have any other emotions.","He was like an elephant that did not care about the ants’ cries.","“Hmph, Jian Wushuang, don’t worry. You won’t live for long.”","Long Qing licked his lips, his eyes filled with hatred.","“You should be saying this to yourself.”","Jian Wushuang stared at him and replied coldly.","The ignored Tian Luo Zi’s face turned green and white.","However, no one would care about him.","The atmosphere in the hall seemed calm, but undercurrents had long been surging. The six major forces, led by the dragon clan, stared at Jian Wushuang, the Ninth Kalpa King, and the others. The killing intent in their eyes was almost tangible.","Everyone knew that once the universe meeting ended, the entire universe would be in an uproar!","Time passed slowly, and the main seat in the hall remained empty. Everyone was waiting silently for the arrival of the Master of the Universe myriad Clan Gathering.","After an unknown amount of time, the entire Ling Xiao Palace suddenly started to shake.","Countless sounds of the great Dao Rose up, and lotuses covered in Dao patterns formed in the air and bloomed.","Bluey, who was standing on both sides of the main seat, and another young man with red lips and white teeth suddenly looked into the distance. They knelt down and said, “Disciple Bluey welcomes master.”","“Disciple Blue welcomes master.”","In the sky above towering palace, countless auspicious clouds gathered together and finally condensed into an old man with long white eyebrows, white hair, and long ears!","This old man’s aura was ordinary, as if he was just an ordinary person. He was filled with a simple and unadorned feeling, but he also seemed to be the embodiment of the great Dao, giving people a feeling that they could not see through him no matter how much effort was put in.","His eyes were as bright as the stars, and he had a smile on his face. Just one look at him gave people an extremely friendly feeling. It was like a spring breeze blowing on the face, and all the noise in the heart was cleared.","...","After he appeared, auspicious clouds rose, cranes cried, and lotuses paved the way for him. The world seemed to be welcoming the lord of heaven and earth.","Ten thousand fathomless rays of light surged behind him, forming a light wheel.","Hualala!","At that moment, all the powerful warriors from all the races in towering Palace stood up and looked at the old man respectfully and reverently. They said in unison, “We’re waiting...welcome, Lord Cosmos God!”"]},{"number":4390,"title":"Chapter 4390 The Cosmos God","paragraphs":["4390 The Cosmos God","In an instant, the words ‘welcome, Cosmos God’ resounded through the Nine Heavens and shook the world.","At that moment, regardless of whether it was the proud dragon clan or the other arrogant people, they all looked at the white-haired elder with extreme respect.","He would know about it after breaking through to zhizun realm.","This Dao was the Dao of a Cosmos God!","“A Cosmos God? He...is it that Lord?”","Jian Wushuang lowered his head and looked at the old man from the corner of his eyes. He was shocked and disappointed at the same time.","Before meeting this Lord, he had once wondered if this Lord, who had a Supreme status in the universe and was regarded as a taboo by even the Supreme martial artists, could be his mysterious master.","The result was not what he had expected.","“Everyone, please take your seats.”","The Cosmos God took a step forward and landed on the main seat of the numinous Sky Hall. There was a faint smile on his face.","“Lord Cosmos God, how have you been recently?”","“Lord Cosmos God, I have some doubts regarding the nomological Dao recently. I was just about to ask you.”","Many of the Supreme existences who seemed to be familiar with the Cosmos Gods spoke up.","Even more Supreme martial artists were feeling apprehensive.","One would never understand the fearsomeness of a Cosmos God unless one became a Supreme.","With a single thought, thousands of rivers and thousands of mountains; with a single thought, the sea turned into fields.","The might of a Cosmos God was far beyond what they could imagine.","“No rush.”","The Cosmos God smiled and extended his hand into the void. In an instant, a pot of wine appeared on all seventy-eight tables in the hall.","“This wine is called soul formation wine. It’s a small gift I made when I was traveling around the world. You can all try it.”","As soon as he said that, everyone was overjoyed.","This was the spirit wine refined by the Lord Cosmos God. Its value was completely immeasurable. Even a single drop of it would probably be enough to cause a huge commotion in the outside world.","“Thank you, Lord eternal God, for your reward!”","The crowd expressed their gratitude one after another. Even Scarlet Sun Demon Master, who was a half-step unparalleled Supreme, had a strong excitement in his eyes.","Gulp.","Everyone picked up the wine pot and drank it carefully, afraid that even a drop would be wasted.","In an instant, after the spiritual wine entered their stomachs, many Supreme-beings’ faces turned red. Their supreme divine power surged, and countless rules of the great path evolved.","Jian Wushuang also picked up the wine and drank it. The wine was tasteless, but when it went down his throat, it made him salivate and turned into a touch of sweetness.","Before he had time to think, a soft current burst out in his body like a ball of fire, quickly passing through his eight extraordinary meridians and bones.","Suddenly, a sense of comfort surged through his body. Countless rules of the great path evolved around him and actually condensed into a physical form, forming the three flowers above his head.","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","In an instant, the Supreme martial artists who had been trapped for many years had an epiphany. Their realms soared and they broke through!","Jian Wushuang closed his eyes tightly. At that moment, he suddenly grabbed the threshold of the Supreme level, which was only a line away from him.","“Controlling a heavenly domain, transforming the power of heaven and earth for one’s own use, limitless and limitless, is the position of a Supreme!”","BOOM!","The voice of the great Dao exploded in Jian Wushuang’s mind like spring thunder!","Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to waste any time. While the great Dao intent was still there, he quickly began to comprehend.","Everyone else present did the same. They all sat cross-legged and frowned as they tried to comprehend the true meaning of the great Dao!","“Boom, boom, boom!”","“Hahaha, the realm that has trapped me for 300000 years has finally broken through!”","One of the senior Supreme martial artists let out a long roar, and his body became brilliant with countless Starlight circulating around him.","After drinking this cup of soul formation wine, he finally made progress and broke through to the top Supreme martial artist level!","Whoosh! Whoosh! Whoosh!","Time passed slowly. In the numinous Sky Hall, from time to time, one could hear someone’s long hiss. They were breaking through to the next realm!","Some immediately burst into tears of joy after breaking through, while others hurriedly kowtowed to the Cosmos Gods to express their gratitude.","“Ruler, complete!”","At that moment, the Overlord, who was standing beside Jian Wushuang, suddenly opened his eyes. A bright golden light flashed in his eyes!","His entire body let out a series of crackling sounds as his divine power transformed into supreme divine power. Endless Starlight and immortal radiance surrounded him.","It was like a piece of unpolished jade that had been completely washed away.","“Bang bang bang!”","In the distance, five-colored auspicious clouds gathered, and streaks of red lightning began to shuttle through them.","This was the Divine Ruler tribulation that could only be used when one broke through to the Ruler Realm!","“Little fellow, prepare for your tribulation.”","The Cosmos God smirked and looked at him. With a wave of his right hand, the Overlord floated up and stood in the void.","...","The silver snakes danced in the air, and the hall was filled with lightning. Bolts of five-colored lightning struck down, bombarding the Overlord.","“Boom! Boom! Boom!”","Instantly, the Overlord’s body was Bathed In Lightning, emitting a dazzling golden light. His aura did not weaken at all, but instead soared.","For most Ultimate Rulers who broke through to become Rulers, the Ruler Lightning Tribulation was not a tribulation, but a baptism!","A total of 18 thunderbolts struck down. A moment later, the world regained its clarity and the colorful auspicious clouds gradually dispersed.","The Overlord opened his eyes, his face full of irrepressible joy!","“Many thanks, Lord Cosmos God!”","He hurriedly knelt down before the Cosmos God and kowtowed three times.","“It’s fine. This is your own good fortune.”","The Cosmos God raised his hand. In an instant, a gentle force lifted the Overlord up and brought him back to the table.","As time passed, the wine was gradually digested. Almost everyone present had woken up from their enlightenment. Whether they had broken through or not, their faces were full of joy.","...","Only Jian Wushuang still had his eyes closed and his brows were tightly knitted.","The current him was already infinitely close to the supremacy stage.","If he was an ordinary person, he would have broken through to the Supreme level thousands of times. However, for some reason, perhaps because he was a perfect chaotic lifeform, it was much more difficult for him to break through than ordinary people.","It was as if there was an extremely thick, natural barrier between a Ruler and a Ruler. No matter how hard he tried to break through this barrier, he always felt as if he was just a little bit away from breaking through.","However, it was this little bit that he could not break through the barrier no matter how he summoned the divine power of the great path and the wine power refined by the divine wine.","After a while.","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes slowly and a hint of disappointment flashed in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang noticed the Overlord, who had just broken through to the Supreme-being realm, and cupped his hands in greeting. He forced a smile and said, “Congratulations on obtaining the Supreme Dao.”","The Overlord nodded happily, then looked at Jian Wushuang up and down. He asked with some doubt, “Jian Wushuang, your talent is thousands of times better than mine. I’ve already broken through to the Supreme level. You should have made a breakthrough, right?”","These words were a little hurtful...","“Who knows?” Jian Wushuang could only smile bitterly. maybe good things are always delayed.","The Overlord pondered for a while and then said, “Yes, Jian Wushuang, but I’ve heard that the more talented you are, the more difficult it is for you to break through to the Supreme level. For example, the number one genius from the East World 100000 chaos cycles ago, who had a rare talent, was unable to break through to the Supreme level. Another example is the Ninth Kalpa King of your Divine Life Palace. He only broke through to the Supreme level after staying in the chaos for dozens of chaos cycles.","“Geniuses like you all have a common trait, which is that you don’t break through. Once you break through to the Supreme martial artist realm, your strength will be countless times more powerful than the Supreme martial artists of the same stage!”"]},{"number":4391,"title":"Chapter 4391 The Competition","paragraphs":["4391 The Competition","Hearing the Overlord’s words, Jian Wushuang could only comfort himself in this way. He also had a faint premonition.","If he were to break through to the Supreme-being realm, the Supreme-being Lightning Tribulation would probably be completely different from that of ordinary people.","On the other side.","Long Qing’s entire body flickered with a golden light. He slowly opened his eyes, and a satisfied look appeared on his face.","After drinking that cup of Divine Wine, he had also broken through!","As of now, he was already half a step into the invincible Ruler level!","Jian Wushuang, you’d better pray that someone will come to save you after the Great Clan Gathering.","He looked at Jian Wushuang and licked his lips. There was a touch of cruelty in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang snorted and ignored him.","“Everyone, the time has come. It’s time for me to choose ten children.”","On the main seat, the Cosmos God stroked his beard and said with a smile when he saw that everyone had recovered.","Instantly, everyone’s expression changed, and a hint of fanaticism surged in their eyes.","The Dao imparting of a Cosmos God!","This was the greatest opportunity in this universe myriad race gathering!","Didn’t they risk thousands of miles to come to Ling Xiao Palace just to fight for these ten positions?","It could be said that almost all of the unparalleled Supremes in the cosmos had only obtained the opportunity to break through to the unparalleled supremacy realm after listening to the Dao lectures of the Cosmos Gods.","There was also Tarot supremacy, who had once dominated the universe and was given the title of the number one sword venerable in all of eternity. He had only gained his power after listening to the Dao in Ling Xiao Palace.","It could be said that more than half of the top experts in the entire universe came from Ling Xiao Palace!","How could they not be tempted by this?","The gaze of the Cosmos God swept across everyone’s faces. He smiled and said, “I don’t care about cultivation or how strong you are. If you want to be my helper, you only need to pass two tests.”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone’s pupils shrank slightly.","If it didn’t look at cultivation or combat power, what should it look at?","Everyone was puzzled but they didn’t probe further. They waited quietly for the Cosmos God to explain.","Fortunately, the Cosmos God had no intention of keeping them in suspense. He stroked his beard and smiled.","The first test will be your cultivation time. The shorter the time you have cultivated, the higher the chance you will become my listener.","As soon as he finished speaking, some of the senior Supreme martial artists’ expressions changed.","One had to know that among the Supreme martial artists present, which one of them had not been Well-Tempered and had settled down for countless years before they were qualified to enter this Ling Xiao Palace?","This was especially true for some of the more elite Rulers and half-step invincible Rulers, such as Ruler Bing Ye. He had spent 3000 chaos cycles in his training to reach his current position.","This comparison of cultivation time is only compared with the experts of the same realm in the Ling Xiao Palace today. Everyone, you don’t have to worry too much.","As soon as he finished speaking, many people present heaved a sigh of relief.","Supreme Bing Ye’s face, which had been ugly earlier, now had a smile on it.","Although he had trained for three thousand chaos cycles, Scarlet Sun Demon Master, who was seated next to him, had trained for five thousand chaos cycles. That was almost double the amount.","“Lord Cosmos God is wise.”","This arrangement is not only fair, but it also shows a person’s potential.","That’s right. Although some people have powerful cultivation, their innate talent and potential have long been exhausted. Even if they can listen to the Lord Cosmos God’s Dao lecture, the effect will be minimal. It’s better to give the opportunity to someone with potential.","Everyone chimed in.","Tian Luo Zi was overjoyed. Everyone present was a top-tier Supreme martial artist. If the ten spots were determined by comparing combat strength, he would have no hope at all. However, he was only shorter than those in the same realm. He was bursting with confidence!","He was now at the Ultimate Ruler Realm, and Jian Wushuang was the only one present who was at the same realm as him!","In other words, he only had one opponent, Jian Wushuang!","“Hahaha, it seems that this Dao listening boy will definitely have a place for me, the heavenly net disciple!”","Tian Luo Zi glanced at Jian Wushuang and was secretly happy.","He wasn’t sure if he could defeat Jian Wushuang, but in terms of cultivation time, he was confident that he could win the competition, let alone Jian Wushuang!","“I’ve only trained for tens of millions of years. I haven’t even trained for a single chaos cycle. Who could possibly have trained for less than me?”","“Jian Wushuang is a special life form. I heard that the higher the life level of special life forms, the harder it is for them to break through the shackles. I think Jian Wushuang must have used a few hundred hunduns to break through to the realm of the Ultimate Ruler, right?”","He thought to himself, and the more he thought, the wider the smile on his face became.","“Hmph, Jian Wushuang, today, I, Tian Luo Zi, will expose your fake genius title!”","On the other side, Jian Wushuang squinted his eyes and was a little dumbfounded.","“Comparing the time of cultivation?”","He counted with his fingers. It had probably been less than a million years since he started cultivating, right?","Clang.","The Cosmos God waved his hand and a huge piece of Jade appeared before everyone.","The jade was snow-white and was about the height of an adult. It exuded a cold air and in the middle of the Jade, there was an extremely clear ‘0’.","“Everyone, all you need to do is place your hands on it. This aging stone will automatically sense your cultivation time and display it on the surface. It’s definitely not fake.”","“Alright, let’s start from the strongest to the weakest. Let’s start with a half-step invincible Ruler.”","...","As soon as he finished speaking, all of the half-step unparalleled Supremes present exchanged glances with one another, and none of them moved.","In the end, it was Supreme Bing Ye who took a big step forward and placed his hand on the jade stone.","Hualala.","Immediately, the number ‘0’ on the Jade stone started to change.","Ding.","In the end, the number stopped at 3216 chaos cycles.","“Three thousand chaos cycles, huh?”","The Cosmos God nodded his head slightly. He had a warm smile on his face, making it impossible for others to guess what he was thinking.","“Next.”","A blood demon patriarch stepped forward and pressed his hand on the Jade stone.","He was also a half-step invincible Ruler, but the number displayed on the Jade stone was much higher tha Ruler Bing Ye’s. In the end, it had been fixed at 5000 chaos cycles.","...","Instantly, the blood demon race’s patriarch looked dejected and dejected. On the other hand, Supreme Bing Ye heaved a sigh of relief.","Time slowly passed. Some were happy, while others were sad. The vast majority of the half-step invincible Rulers present had trained for far longer tha Ruler Bing Ye had. Even the few who had trained for less time had only trained for a few hundred chaos cycles.","In the end, Long Qing, who had just broken through to the half-step unparalleled Supreme-being realm, finally entered the arena.","His face was filled with pride and superiority. He first shook his head disdainfully at Supreme Bing Ye and the others, as if he didn’t consider them his opponents at all. Then, he stretched out his big hand and pressed it on the time jade!","“196 chaos cycles!”","As soon as this number appeared, it was as if a stone had caused a Thousand Waves. Everyone present was shocked."]},{"number":4392,"title":"Chapter 4392 79.83 Million Years","paragraphs":["4392 79.83 Million Years","196 chaos cycles!","As soon as this number appeared, the faces of all the half-step unparalleled Supreme experts present changed.","Before Long Qing’s appearance, even half-step Rulers who had cultivated for the shortest period of time had lived for more than a thousand chaos cycles.","The difference between the two was too great!","196 chaos cycles...nearly 200 chaos cycles of cultivation. He was far too young and eye-catching, and he had dominated almost all of the other experts in the area!","One had to know that even some elementary-level Supremes or Ultimate Rulers might have cultivated for more than this amount of time.","Towering Palace’s main seat.","Bluey’s eyes flashed with a strange light as she said in a low voice, “Master, this Long Qing is truly formidable. He’s actually only trained for 196 chaos cycles before reaching his current level of power.”","The Cosmos God nodded slightly, stroked his beard, and laughed. “He’s indeed not bad. However, he’s a fourth generation bloodline of the dragon clan and was born with the body of a Ruler. It can be said that his starting point is much higher than others. Hence, it’s normal for him to have cultivated for a shorter period of time than others.”","“So it’s because of this?” Bluey raised her eyebrows, looking thoughtful.","With the end of Long Qing’s test, the competition between the half-step unparalleled Supremes had finally come to an end.","Long Qing had spent 196 chaos cycles of cultivation, firmly taking first place.","He looked around, his face full of pride.","After that, it was time for the comparison between the top Supreme martial artists.","This time, the one who took the lead was one of Jian Wushuang’s six enemies, Supreme Green Dog.","He had trained for 578 chaos cycles, narrowly defeating an alien expert and becoming the person with the shortest amount of time.","Then, there were senior Supreme, middle Supreme, and elementary Supreme ...","The further down one’s cultivation path, the more obvious the difference in cultivation time would be. After all, reaching the level of a half-step unparalleled Ruler was no longer something that could be achieved through ordinary luck and good fortune. Instead, it required a large amount of time to settle down.","However, for middle-grade and elementary-grade Supreme martial artists, their cultivation time could be greatly shortened by some heaven-defying fortune, so the gap between them was huge.","When it was time for the middle-grade supremacy test, the Ninth Kalpa King had taken 102 chaos cycles to come out on top, dazzling everyone for a time.","However, with Long Qing’s Pearl and Jade in front of him, it did not seem particularly shocking.","The preliminary Supreme-being contest was the most intense one. In the end, a foreign tribe powerhouse won first place, and the Overlord was slightly weaker and ranked second.","“Just three chaos cycles! It’s only been three chaos cycles!”","The Overlord clenched his fists tightly, his face full of unwillingness.","This was because it was very possible that he would lose the right to listen to the Dao just because of these three chaos cycles.","Finally, the competition between the Supreme martial artists had ended.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s name held a pivotal position in the universe or in this era.","The number one genius in the universe, the number one genius in all of history, and the body of a Ruler who had slaughtered Supremes!","There were too many labels on Jian Wushuang, so many that people could not ignore his existence!","Therefore, many people were curious about how long Jian Wushuang had been cultivating!","“I think Jian Wushuang has been cultivating for at least a thousand chaos cycles!”","Someone said with a burning gaze.","“That’s right. Jian Wushuang’s divine power, secret skill, universe law, and sword principle all require a lot of time to comprehend. Without a thousand chaos cycles, he won’t be able to fully comprehend them.”","Jian Wushuang was able to kill Supremes with his Ruler body. In addition to the Tarot Divine Sword and the Wuxu chaotic cauldron, his great Dao divine power and unimaginably high universe laws were indispensable. And these things just so happen to require an extremely long time to comprehend.","“But then again, if Jian Wushuang has really cultivated for a thousand chaos cycles, it’s not surprising that he’s been able to do this.”","Everyone was discussing.","Long Qing looked at Jian Wushuang with contempt and said, “Jian Wushuang, it took me 196 chaos cycles to become a half-step unparalleled Ruler. What about you?”","The Overlord, Ninth Kalpa King, and the others did not say anything. People always wanted to compare themselves. Speaking of which, they were also very curious about how many chaos cycles Jian Wushuang had cultivated for.","Jian Wushuang looked calm and did not speak. Just as he was about to go to the time Jade to test, Tian Luo Zi, who was sitting next to him, stood up and walked out.","He clenched his fists tightly and looked at Jian Wushuang with hatred.","Why?","Why was everyone paying attention to Jian Wushuang?","I’m clearly an Ultimate Ruler, and I’m also one of the candidates...but why is it that no one looks at me with any respect?","Why?","“Just because Jian Wushuang had killed a Supreme with his Ruler’s body? I, the Tian Luo Zi, can do it too!”","At this moment, Tian Luo Zi’s heart was filled with jealousy!","He wanted to prove to everyone that he was the true heaven’s favorite!","Jian Wushuang was just a fake genius who was not even as good as his finger!","As he thought of this, Tian Luo Zi stepped in front of the Jade and pressed on it!","Hualala!","In an instant, the number on the Jade stone began to rise rapidly!","Looking at the soaring numbers, he sneered.","“Fine. Today, I, Tian Luo Zi, will step on Jian Wushuang and prove my name as the number one genius in the world!”","...","BOOM!","The number on the Jade stone suddenly stopped!","Seventy-nine million eight hundred and thirty thousand years!","Not even a single chaos cycle had passed!","In an instant, the crowd, who had not paid much attention to the heavenly net seed, was shocked. Their eyes revealed a look of surprise!","“What? Seventy-nine million years? Not even a single chaos cycle?”","“Who is this kid? How can he be so talented?!”","“Tsk, tsk, tsk. It hasn’t even been a chaos cycle yet, but he’s already become an invincible Ruler who’s only a hair away from becoming a Ruler. His talent is unparalleled in all of history.”","“I know this person. His name is Tian Luo Zi. He’s a junior who recently emerged from the universe. He’s so talented that he’s not inferior to Jian Wushuang at all. He also killed a Supreme-being and has been in the limelight recently!”","“It hasn’t even been a chaos cycle yet, and he’s already on the verge of becoming a Ruler. If he’s given a bit more time to grow, he’ll probably become a major power.”","Many Supreme martial artists praised him. Even Long Qing’s eyes flashed with surprise. He extended an olive branch to the heavenly net Prince and invited him to become an outer disciple of the Dragon race.","...","All of a sudden, within Ling Xiao Palace, the heavenly Luo children were in high spirits and were in the limelight.","He enjoyed the praises of the Supreme martial artists around him, and a smug look appeared on his face.","This was the treatment that a heavenly net disciple should receive!","Jian Wushuang, what are you waiting for? it’s your turn.","Tian Luo Zi turned to Jian Wushuang and laughed sinisterly."]},{"number":4393,"title":"Chapter 4393 Shocking Everyone","paragraphs":["4393 Shocking Everyone","“Oh!”","Jian Wushuang looked at him expressionlessly and then walked to the Jade stone step by step in front of everyone’s eyes.","“Jian Wushuang, I’d like to see how long you’ve been cultivating!”","At this moment, Long Qing, Tian Luo Zi, and the others sneered.","“Little guy, press your hand on it.”","The Cosmos God stroked his beard and laughed.","Jian Wushuang nodded, took a deep breath, and pressed his hand on the Jade stone.","In an instant, the numbers that were originally zero began to change!","Everyone in the audience stared at the rapidly changing numbers.","Ding! Ding!","A crisp sound was heard.","Seven...!","When the first number appeared, everyone was stunned for a moment, and then a smile appeared on their faces.","“Seven hundred chaos cycles, huh?”","“Hahaha, what sort of genius is he? he’s trained for more than seven hundred chaos cycles, even longer than I have, and yet he’s still just a trifling Omega Ruler.”","“Jian Wushuang, I’ve only cultivated for tens of millions of years, but you’ve cultivated for more than seven hundred chaos cycles. What qualifications do you have to compete with me?”","That Tian Luo Zi laughed even more insolently.","However, in the next moment.","The smile on his face froze.","Seventy!","The second number slowly stopped.","“N-no, not 700 chaos cycles. It should have been 70 chaos cycles!”","Everyone present was stunned. Seventy chaos cycles wasn’t a very long period of time. Many of the Omega Rulers had spent more time training than that.","For example, the Ninth Kalpa King had been stuck at the Ultimate Ruler Realm for dozens of chaos cycles.","“Seventy chaos cycles, huh? Hmph, that’s all there is to it.”","Tian Luo Zi squinted his eyes and sneered in his heart.","Seventy chaos cycles was indeed quite young, but compared to his age of seventy-nine million years, he was still far, far too young.","Everyone’s eyes flickered and they sneered as they continued to look at the Jade.","The next moment!","On the jade stone, Jian Wushuang’s cultivation time was completely fixed!","Seven hundred thousand years!","In an instant, the entire place fell into a dead silence.","Some of them were still holding their wine glasses, some of them were still softly discussing with the people around them, and some of them were still sneering.","However, at this moment, it was as if a spell had been cast on everyone. They were all frozen in that moment, looking at the Jade stone with a dazed expression. Their eyes were so shocked that they were about to fall out.","The whole place fell into a short silence, and then immediately burst into an uproar!","“Seven hundred thousand years? I’m not seeing things, right?”","“Hiss! What kind of concept was seven hundred thousand years? It takes me a million years to enter closed-door cultivation!”","“Impossible! Absolutely impossible! How could Jian Wushuang have only cultivated for seven hundred thousand years?”","At this moment, everyone went crazy with shock.","They looked at the clear numbers on the jade stone in shock. It was as if a storm was raging in their minds!","Long Qing, who had been high-spirited and looking down on the others, suddenly looked gloomy. The faces of others, such as Scarlet Sun Demon Master, were even uglier.","“There must be a mistake! How could Jian Wushuang have only cultivated for seven hundred thousand years? There must be something wrong with the Jade stone, or Jian Wushuang must have used some secret skill to deceive everyone! I don’t believe it!”","The Tian Luo Zi’s face turned red as he shouted.","700,000 years!","Not even a fraction of his!","“Are you doubting me?”","The Cosmos God still had a warm smile on his face, but his eyes were narrowed.","Instantly, Tian Luo Zi trembled and knelt down, saying that he did not dare to.","As for the other Supreme martial artists, including Long Qing, their expressions changed slightly when they saw this. They looked at each other and lowered their heads, not King of Day to say a word. They were as silent as cicadas in winter.","It was just a thought, but it grew in their minds like wild grass.","Jian Wushuang had only cultivated for seven hundred thousand years, yet he had already attained the body of an Ultimate Ruler and killed a Supreme. If he were to cultivate for another seven million years, seventy million years, or even tens of thousands of chaos cycles, what would he be like?","Everyone didn’t dare to think about it anymore. They only felt a chill from head to toe, and their scalps went numb.","Only Jian Wushuang remained calm.","“Child, come here.”","...","The Cosmos God smiled and beckoned Jian Wushuang to come and sit down.","“Alright,” he said.","Facing a Cosmos God, Jian Wushuang did not dare to delay any further. He quickly walked over and sat down in front of him.","In the Ling Xiao Palace, many Supreme martial artists saw the Cosmos God calling Jian Wushuang ‘child’ and asking him to sit down. Their expressions were extremely complicated.","Long Qing and the others were even more jealous.","“Blue ‘er, you told me before that you found a good seedling on the Ancient Path of Stars. He’s him, right?”","The Cosmos God looked at Bluey and asked.","“Yes, master, I’m talking about him.”","Bluey replied respectfully.","“Yes, it’s indeed not bad.”","The Cosmos God stroked his beard in satisfaction. Following which, some blood sighed and laughed, “Good, it’s been a long time since such a talent has appeared in our cosmos.”","...","After some thought, the Cosmos God looked at Jian Wushuang and smiled kindly, “Child, are you willing to take this old man as your master?”","His words were shocking!","As soon as he finished speaking, it was as if a bomb had been dropped in Ling Xiao Palace. Everyone’s body trembled, and their expressions were extremely shocked!","The Lord Cosmos God had actually spoken personally and wanted Jian Wushuang to acknowledge him as his master?","At that moment, everyone looked at Jian Wushuang with jealousy in their eyes.","Jian Wushuang might not know what the word ‘Cosmos God’ meant, but they knew that the Cosmos God was the real heaven in the universe!","Once Jian Wushuang acknowledged a Cosmos God as his master, it would be equivalent to Jian Wushuang having an immunity medallion in the universe. His status would be extremely honorable!","At that time, not to mention the dragon clan and the other six forces dealing with Jian Wushuang, they would probably immediately kneel in front of him, kowtow, admit their mistakes, and beg for his forgiveness.","In front of a Cosmos God, even if the ancestral Dragon or the Phoenix ancestor were to revive, they would not dare to act impudently, much less the Dragon race!","What was a meteoric rise?","This was called reaching the heavens in one step! Moreover, he had reached the 33rd layer of heaven in one step!","“Alliance master!”","“Jian Wushuang!”","At this moment, the Overlord cried out in alarm. Even the Ninth Kalpa King could no longer remain calm as his eyes flickered wildly.","Tian Luo Zi, who had once again been forgotten by everyone, clenched his fists tightly and gritted his teeth. He was extremely jealous!","Under everyone’s burning gaze, Jian Wushuang, the person involved, was not in a hurry to agree after a shock. Instead, a hint of hesitation flashed across his face.","There was no need to doubt that the Cosmos Gods were very powerful and had very high statuses.","Once he acknowledged a Cosmos God as his master, it could be said that he would obtain the greatest fortune in the universe. He would probably be able to get wind and rain whenever he wanted. From then on, he would be able to run amuck without fear and would have endless benefits.","Jian Wushuang understood all of this.","But...","There was a flash of hesitation in Jian Wushuang’s eyes. Then, he cupped his hands with a determined look and said, “Lord Cosmos God, thank you for your praise. It’s just that this brat already has a master.”"]},{"number":4394,"title":"Chapter 4394 Setting up the World","paragraphs":["4394 Setting up the World","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone was stunned. Their envious faces were instantly petrified and they looked at Jian Wushuang in shock.","This...this was a rejection?","There were actually people who could reject a Cosmos God?","They looked at Jian Wushuang as if he was an idiot. Tian Luo Zi couldn’t help but laugh in his heart.","“Jian Wushuang, Oh Jian Wushuang, you can’t even grasp such a heaven-defying opportunity!”","He already had a master?","No matter how strong your teacher is, could he be stronger than the Lord Cosmos God?","At that moment, Jian Wushuang was once again labeled as ‘stupid’ in their hearts.","“Is that so?” On the other hand, the Cosmos God’s expression remained the same. He sized up Jian Wushuang thoughtfully.","Suddenly, he seemed to have discovered something. His eyes flashed as he said, “Child, come closer and let me take a look.”","Jian Wushuang was puzzled, but he still walked over obediently.","The Cosmos God stretched out his hand and touched Jian Wushuang’s glabella with his fingertip. He closed his eyes and fell into deep thought.","A gentle power flowed into Jian Wushuang’s divine body.","After a few breaths, the Cosmos God opened his eyes as a smile appeared on his lips once more.","“Hahaha, I see, I see, I understand now.”","He looked at Jian Wushuang again and his expression became interesting. He seemed to be talking to himself, but also to Jian Wushuang, “No wonder you didn’t want to accept me as your master. It turns out that you were already attacked by that old friend, so it’s normal for you to reject me.”","In towering Palace, the others were puzzled when they heard that. They did not understand what a Cosmos God meant.","Only Jian Wushuang could not help but be shocked!","“Lord Cosmos God, could it be that you know my master?” Jian Wushuang’s voice became a little rough as he stared at the Cosmos God.","Xuan Yi was the deepest secret in his heart, and also his greatest restraint.","The Cosmos God smiled but did not say anything. However, his voice rang in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“Your master...I’m more than just acquainted with him.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was shocked once again. He understood that perhaps the matter regarding his master was a great secret. That was why the Cosmos God had told him through voice transmission.","“Lord Cosmos God, can you tell me where my master is now?” Jian Wushuang said respectfully.","When the Cosmos God heard this, he muttered to himself for a moment before shaking his head and transmitting a message, “It’s been a long time since I’ve seen your master, so I naturally don’t know where he is. I only know that before he disappeared, he was setting up a big game of chess, placing chess pieces everywhere.”","Pausing for a moment, the Cosmos God smiled and continued, “Child, your master has always been a mysterious person. You don’t need to guess his whereabouts. If he needs you, he will naturally come to find you. What you need to do now is to do everything you can to increase your strength.”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could not help but look a little dazed.","Even the Lord Cosmos God did not know of his teacher’s whereabouts?","Furthermore, the Lord Cosmos God said that his master was setting up a chess game. Then what was the purpose of this chess game?","He...was he just a chess piece that his master had laid down?","For a moment, Jian Wushuang had mixed feelings.","After taking a deep breath, Jian Wushuang bowed deeply to the Cosmos God, cupped his hands, and said, “Thank you for your guidance, Lord Cosmos God.”","“It’s your karma that you can stand in front of me. There’s no need to thank me.” The Cosmos God laughed. “Alright. Jian Wushuang, you can leave now. Prepare for the second round of the test.”","“Yes.”","Jian Wushuang took his leave.","The Cosmos God raised his head and looked at everyone before saying, “Everyone, please come forward for the second part of the test. You are the top two in the monthly test.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the top three cultivators in the competition of cultivation years were overjoyed and walked out of their tables excitedly.","They knew that they had advanced to the second round!","As for those who were not in the top three, such as Supreme Bing Ye and Scarlet Sun Demon Master, their expressions changed slightly as if they had lost their parents.","They knew that their journey to the Great Clan Gathering had come to an end.","Tian Luo Zi was overjoyed when he heard that. There were only him and Jian Wushuang in the Ultimate Ruler Realm. According to the Cosmos God, didn’t that mean that he had also advanced to the second round?","He had just stood up and was about to walk out of the table.","Suddenly, the voice of the Cosmos God rang out once more.","Jian Wushuang alone is enough to reach the Ultimate Ruler Realm.","In an instant, Tian Luo Zi’s face turned red and he was extremely embarrassed.","All eyes were on him, full of mockery.","“I, I understand.”","Tian Luo Zi could only sit back down.","All of a sudden, including Jian Wushuang, sixteen experts stood in Ling Xiao Palace. Their aura was extremely powerful.","They sized each other up and understood in their hearts that out of these 16 people, six were destined to be eliminated. Only ten people would truly have the qualifications to listen to the Dao under the command of an Cosmos God.","The Cosmos God had a warm smile on his face as he swept his gaze across the faces of these 16 people. He spoke slowly, “The sixteen of you are the strongest in your respective realms and are also the most talented. You will be the future pillars of our universe, the undying cornerstones.”","“Now, I hope that you will seize the opportunity and complete the second round of the exam.”","As soon as these words fell, the sixteen people looked at each other, and their eyes gradually became serious.","“Then, let’s start with Long Qing.”","...","The Cosmos God spoke indifferently.","Long Qing took a step forward and clenched his fist, waiting for the right moment.","“Let me ask you, what is Dao?”","The Cosmos God then revealed the content of the second round of assessment.","Long Qing’s eyes narrowed, but he didn’t answer immediately. After thinking for a while, he said in a deep voice, “Lord Cosmos God, I believe that the Dao is to be invincible and to crush all enemies in the world! It’s to hold on to the beliefs in one’s heart and not turn back until you hit the south wall...”","Long Qing was describing his own Dao in thousands of words.","Just like his personality, his Dao was to seek revenge for the smallest grievance and to be invincible.","The Cosmos God listened quietly without any interruption. There was no emotion on his face.","Only after Long Qing had finished speaking did the Cosmos God take out a bamboo board and pass it to the disciple beside him for him to pass it to Long Qing.","“Wu Fang, tell me what you think is the Dao.”","The Cosmos God continued looking at the person beside Long Qing.","...","This man was also a half-step invincible Ruler, an alien outsider who had trained for a thousand chaos cycles and was ranked second among the half-step invincible Rulers.","“Yes!”","The Supreme martial artist named Wu Fang walked out and began to talk about the Dao he believed in.","“Dao is heaven and earth, Dao is the universe and stars...”","Time slowly passed, and in Ling Xiao Palace, people took turns to sing and talk, their domineering aura was unparalleled, as if they could swallow thousands of miles.","Some people talked about The Evolution of Chaos, while others talked about the rise of the universe. Each one spoke more grandly than the other, as if they were not competing in their understanding of Dao, but in who said that the pattern was the largest."]},{"number":4395,"title":"Chapter 4395 The Dao That I Understand","paragraphs":["4395 The Dao That I Understand","The expression on the Cosmos God’s face remained the same throughout, making it impossible to guess what he was thinking. Even if someone had described it better, he would only nod slightly.","For example, when the Ninth Kalpa King talked about his Dao, which was to die without regret, to act willfully, and to move forward with the world, the Cosmos God nodded slightly.","Finally, all the Supreme martial artists had finished their narration.","They looked at the emotionless Cosmos Gods and could not help but feel apprehensive. Some of them were upset that their performance just now was barely satisfactory. They could have done better. Some of them had confident looks on their faces and were certain that they would definitely be ranked at the top.","“Child, it’s your turn.”","After everyone had finished speaking, the Cosmos God looked at Jian Wushuang and said with a smile.","“Yes.”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and suppressed the throbbing in his heart. He kept himself calm and walked out of the crowd.","He knew in his heart that in terms of understanding of the Dao, he was definitely no match for the fifteen Supreme martial artists present.","To him, every single person present was an expert who had trained for no less than a hundred chaos cycles. There were even old monsters who had trained for more than a thousand chaos cycles.","No matter how arrogant Jian Wushuang was, he didn’t think that his Foundation would be deeper than those old monsters who had been through a long time.","However, it didn’t mean that Jian Wushuang was afraid and would lose without a fight.","In his heart, he also had his own understanding of the Dao.","“Child, are you ready?”","The Cosmos God laughed.","“I’m ready.” Jian Wushuang nodded seriously.","“Then come. Tell me about the Dao you understand.”","Ling Xiao Palace fell into silence.","Jian Wushuang was not in a hurry to answer. Instead, he raised his head and looked into the distance through the multicolored light. There was a touch of reminiscence in his eyes.","He began to recall everything he had seen and heard along the way.","When the other Supreme martial artists saw this, they immediately sneered in their hearts.","“He’s just putting on an act. Jian Wushuang has only cultivated for seven hundred thousand years. He’s still wet behind the ears. What does he know about Dao?”","“It’s true that Jian Wushuang is extremely talented, but his comprehension of Dao can’t be decided by talent.”","“That’s right. Let’s wait and see how Jian Wushuang will become a laughingstock.”","These Supreme martial artists shook their heads one after another, feeling a sense of superiority in their hearts.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang finally spoke.","His voice was calm, without any high spirits, nor was it deliberately low. It was as if he was calmly recounting something.","“The Dao I understand...”","“It’s not the primeval universe, nor is it the heaven and earth. It’s very ordinary and not noble. It’s like the wind that flows in the air, or the sand between your fingers. It seems impossible to hold, but it exists beside everyone.”","Dao is a very fair word. No matter if you are a mighty person who can destroy the world with a single step, or a young mortal who just carried a sword, they all have their own Dao.","“I, Jian Wushuang, rose from the dust of the mortal world. I have stepped on thousands of mountains and rivers and watched the waves of the human world. The Dao I think is the smoke rising from the kitchen chimneys of the countryside, the rain falling from the sky to moisten the weeds, the weeds growing out of the cracks of the stone to be chewed and swallowed by the old bull, and the old bull aging and then being cut up to be eaten.”","“It is the cycle of the heavenly laws, and it also breaks fate. It is the unseen world, and it is also the fickleness of the world.”","“It’s the Four Seasons of spring and autumn, it’s life and death, it’s the Buddha’s lowered brows, it’s also the Vajra’s angry eyes...”","“Everyone’s Dao is different, but everyone’s Dao leads to the same destination. One can turn the great Dao into a shore, while the process of chasing after the Dao is to control the wind and break the waves, crossing the sea of bitterness!”","“The greater world is full of vicissitudes and changes. One’s life is full of grass and trees. Even if one is at the corner of a well, as long as one’s heart is toward the stars and has a fearless heart, one can finally achieve the great Dao...”","Jian Wushuang spoke slowly. In his words, Dao seemed to be a very ordinary thing. It was not as Grand and great as what others said, nor was it full of the chaos of the universe and the firmament.","After he finished speaking, the entire place gradually fell into a brief silence.","This time, there was no mockery. Everyone frowned and carefully thought over Jian Wushuang’s words.","Since they had become Supremes, they were naturally not simple. Jian Wushuang’s words were like a key that opened a new door for them.","Each of them was high and mighty, each of them was an Overlord of a region. No matter where they went, they would be greeted with respect and agreement...","Their eyes were always looking up, unlike Jian Wushuang, who lowered his head to observe the human world.","Hence.","They suddenly realized that they might have neglected to see the ordinary among the ordinary!","At this moment, an ear-piercing voice suddenly rang out.","“What nonsense is this? Jian Wushuang, what nonsense are you talking about? In my opinion, Dao is very simple. What can make me stronger is Dao!”","The heavenly net disciple sneered with a mocking expression.","Before Jian Wushuang could say anything, the other Supreme Masters who had no grudges with Jian Wushuang suddenly turned to glare at him.","Just now, Jian Wushuang’s words gave them some inspiration. They were deep in thought when they were suddenly interrupted by Tian Luo Zi!","“A mere ant dares to talk about the great Dao?”","“This person is called Tian Luo Zi, right? With such a heart, what great things can he achieve?”","“You haven’t even touched the origin of Dao, yet you dare to say that others are talking nonsense?”","For a moment, the people who had no enmity with Jian Wushuang sneered.","Instantly, Tian Luo Zi’s face turned green and white in shock and fear.","As for the Cosmos God, he merely narrowed his eyes and waved his hand. A mighty force gushed out, and with a swipe, the heaven Luo seed disappeared, evaporating into thin air.","...","After doing all that, the Cosmos God smiled again and asked the disciple beside him to give the bamboo token to Jian Wushuang.","“Everyone, do you see the ten praying mats under me? These ten futons were the ten seats for listening to Dao. On the bamboo token I had my disciple give you, the numbers of the ten praying mats are displayed. You will sit on the mat you get the number. As for those who don’t have a number on their bamboo token, they are eliminated and can leave towering Palace after a while.”","Everyone’s pupils shrank.","Since the Cosmos God had said that one could choose which futon to sit on according to the number on the bamboo board, it was likely that the futon was not as simple as it seemed.","“This Lord once heard people say that the closer one is to the futon, the deeper one’s comprehension will be when listening to the Dao!”","One of the Supreme martial artists said with a burning gaze.","“Is that so?”","For a moment, everyone’s brows raised and they looked down at the bamboo board in their hands.","Jian Wushuang also turned over the bamboo board and looked down.","A number slowly twisted and condensed like a small snake!","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang’s body trembled!","..."]},{"number":4396,"title":"Chapter 4396 Listening to the Teachings of the Emperor","paragraphs":["4396 Listening to the Teachings of the Emperor","One!","The number on the bamboo board was an eye-catching ‘1’!","Jian Wushuang raised his head to look at the Cosmos God. Just as he was about to express his gratitude, he heard the voice of the Cosmos God in his mind.","“There’s no need to thank me. Although your Dao discussion can’t be said to be very in-depth, it’s outstanding in its uniqueness and ingenuity. I’ve arranged for you to be the first in line so that I can take care of the disciple of my old friend.”","!!","Jian Wushuang was not a pretentious person. He nodded and didn’t say anything else.","As for the other Supreme martial artists, they also saw the number that belonged to them.","“I’m the second?”","Long Qing squinted his eyes. At first, he looked a little happy, but then he seemed to have thought of something and snorted.","“Since I’m ranked second, who has the right to be ranked first?”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes also flickered. On his bamboo board, the number displayed was ‘three’!","“I’m sure everyone has seen their own numbers. Over there, please take your seats according to your respective rows. The others can leave.”","The Cosmos God laughed.","Immediately, the six people who didn’t get the numbered bamboo plate were disappointed.","The Overlord was among them.","He was born with an Overlord body and had proven his Dao with his strength. He had not cultivated for a long time, so his understanding of Dao was naturally not very deep.","“Alliance master, I’ll take my leave first.”","The Overlord couldn’t hide his disappointment.","“Alright,” he said.","Jian Wushuang nodded.","After a while, the people in Ling Xiao Palace had all dispersed, leaving only ten people.","“Take a seat.”","The Cosmos God waved his hand and ten green praying mats appeared beneath him.","These ten futons looked ordinary, but upon closer inspection, there was a faint charm of the great Dao in them.","The ten of them looked at each other, suppressed their excitement, and quickly sat down in their respective seats.","When Jian Wushuang sat down on the first futon, the other nine people’s expressions changed slightly. Long Qing clenched his fists tightly and his eyes revealed a touch of resentment.","What right did Jian Wushuang have to be above him and suppress him?","The next moment, Long Qing turned around and exchanged a look with Supreme Green Dog and the others. They had made up their minds to kill Jian Wushuang again after the universe meeting was over!","They could tell that the Lord Cosmos God was very fond of Jian Wushuang. The feelings that the Lord Cosmos God had for Jian Wushuang were almost beyond the surface. If Jian Wushuang had really taken the Lord Cosmos God as his master, they could forget about the enmity between them. However, since Jian Wushuang had not taken the Lord as his master, they believed that even if Jian Wushuang was killed, the Lord Cosmos God would not say anything.","After all, Cosmos Gods were universe Masters, and they had to pay attention to a technique of balance.","Bang!","When Jian Wushuang sat on the futon, he immediately felt a gentle power flowing from the futon and flowing through his body.","In an instant, Jian Wushuang felt as if he had opened his apertures. The five Qis gathered and the three flowers gathered.","Jian Wushuang could not help but feel surprised.","After that, the two disciples of the Cosmos God lit up two sandalwood incense to calm their minds and recuperate. They bowed and left, closing the door of the Lingxiao Palace.","Amidst the rising sandalwood incense, the Cosmos God slowly began his sermon.","“The beginning of the world begins from chaos...”","“The chaos is broken. and all things are reborn...”","...","Time passed by like a white stallion.","For Jian Wushuang and the other ten, the feast of all races in the universe had just begun, but for most people, it had already ended.","In the depths of the universe, where Cosmos Temple was.","The Hall Master of Cosmos Temple, Supreme Black feather, was wearing a purple-gold crown and a purple-gold Black robe as he sat on the throne.","Several Rulers were standing respectfully within the palace, quietly awaiting orders from Hei Yu Ruler.","“Everyone, Jian Wushuang and the Ninth Kalpa King from the Divine Life Palace are currently listening to the Dao in the Ling Xiao Palace. Once they finish listening to the Dao, I’m afraid that their strength will have a qualitative leap, especially Jian Wushuang, who is very likely to break through to the Supreme level.”","If the two of them return to the Divine Life Palace, they’ll be able to deal a devastating blow to Cosmos Temple with the help of the Blood Wave Supreme and the recovered Supreme Giant Axe.","“Rather than that, we might as well take the initiative and take the lead to kill Jian Wushuang and Jian Wushuang again. From then on, we’ll wipe out the great enemy of the universe!”","The Hei Yu Ruler’s voice was ice cold as he slowly spoke.","As soon as he finished speaking, the other Supreme martial artists looked at each other.","One of the Supreme martial artists hesitantly said, “Hall Master, the Divine Life Palace suffered great losses in the battle 30000 years ago, but we also suffered great losses. What can we use to fight the Divine Life Palace?”","The other Supreme martial artists also nodded in agreement.","Upon hearing this, Ruler blackfeathers gave a carefree smile and said, “Don’t worry. We won’t be the only ones to attack the Divine Life Palace. I’ve contacted the other six forces that attacked the Divine Life Palace 30000 years ago. Except for the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, the other forces are willing to join forces and destroy the Divine Life Palace!”","Last time, the Divine Life Palace was lucky enough to survive, but it was only because of the glory left behind by the battle of the catastrophe and the desperate battle of that old man Gai Fu.","“Now that we’ve used up the share of Izawa glory and the Divine Life Palace, and that old geezer Gai Fu has fallen into a deep sleep, who else can stop us?”","“So what if the Starry Sky Sword Sect’s Martial Sword Immortal attacked again? I can’t say that I can defeat her, but I can hold her back for a while. That’s enough time to flatten the current Divine Life Palace!”","...","A sinister smile appeared on the face of the Hei Yu Ruler.","When the other Supreme martial artists heard this, they immediately looked at each other and sneered.","At the same time.","Supreme Bing Ye, Scarlet Sun Demon Master, the Blood Sky Hall Master and the others had also returned to their respective forces to gather their forces and prepare for the final blow to the Divine Life Palace!","...","Time flew by and five years passed.","There was a solemn silence in towering Palace, and only the slow Dao-chanting of the Cosmos Gods could be heard.","“The Dao can be Dao, but it’s not eternal. The name can be named, but it’s not eternal. Nameless, the beginning of all things, famous, the mother of all things...mysterious beyond mysterious, the gate of all realms.”","Other than the Cosmos Gods who were still clear-headed, both Long Qing, a half-step unparalleled Supreme, and Jian Wushuang, an Ultimate Ruler, closed their eyes and entered the deepest level of comprehension.","Jian Wushuang closed his eyes tightly. He felt as if he had traveled through time and space and arrived at a time when the universe was still chaotic.","As the Cosmos God explained, the blurry primordial chaos World began to change gradually.","...","The clear air rose and formed the sky, while the foul air sank and formed the earth.","In the middle, the connate five elements Qi evolved into mountains, seas, flowers, birds, beasts, and insects. Gradually, all kinds of life were born in the chaos.","The first appearance of the universe was born.","Jian Wushuang’s mind became clearer and clearer. He was like a small fish, wandering in the long river of Dao and gradually clearing up the essence of power.","His body was surrounded by the radiance of the great Dao. Immortal radiance rose and Starlight flickered.","In Jian Wushuang’s body, the barrier between the Ultimate Ruler and the Supreme started to collapse.","Jian Wushuang began to step into a whole new realm."]},{"number":4397,"title":"Chapter 4397 The Arrival of the Supreme Lightning Tribulation","paragraphs":["4397 The Arrival of the Supreme Lightning Tribulation","In the blink of an eye, another five years had passed.","To a Supreme, five years was simply too short a period of time. It was just like taking a nap, and could be accomplished in the snap of a finger.","Time was the cheapest thing for them.","However, every second of the five years of the universe gathering was extremely precious.","!!","After the explanation by the Cosmos God ended, it was a long time before everyone slowly opened their eyes, as if they had just woken up from a dream.","“Is this the Great Dao?”","The crowd looked down at their palms and sighed.","In this short ten years of teaching, the harvest was unprecedented.","Although it did not directly increase one’s cultivation base, it opened up one’s vision, allowing everyone to see things that were not originally within their vision.","It could be said that this lecture had created the best foundation for his future advancement!","as long as I digest everything that the Lord Cosmos God has said, breaking through to the invincible Ruler realm will only be a matter of time!","Long Qing clenched his fists, his eyes filled with excitement.","The other Supreme martial artists were the same, their faces filled with joy.","The great Dao that the Cosmos Gods were talking about was like a key that completely opened up all the obstacles in their path, sweeping away all the obstacles on their path of cultivation!","“It could be said that the Cosmos God had paved a path that led straight to the great Dao for them!”","“No wonder the Supremes in the cosmos are trying so hard to become the children of the Cosmos Gods and have the opportunity to listen to the great Dao. This is simply too great!”","A veteran half-step unparalleled Supreme-being exclaimed in shock.","One had to know that to become a half-step unparalleled Supreme-being, they had no desire for almost all the opportunities in the universe, and they didn’t care about them.","To them, the only thing that could attract them was a breakthrough in their cultivation.","However, how could it be easy to take that step and become an invincible Ruler?","There were many Supremes in the universe, but only a few had ever become invincible Supremes and stood at the peak to overlook the entire universe.","It was unknown how many people had been stuck at this realm for their entire lives, unable to advance an inch.","As for the Cosmos Gods, they were like a teacher who had re-opened the path of their cultivation, allowing them to find their direction once again.","This might seem simple, but only those who were far superior to them in terms of cultivation could do it.","“We are extremely grateful to you, eternal God!”","After taking a deep breath, everyone knelt down before the Cosmos God and greeted him respectfully.","At this moment, even the proud Ninth Kalpa King’s eyes were filled with awe.","“It’s fine.”","The Cosmos God shook his head and turned to look at Jian Wushuang.","Only Jian Wushuang had not woken up.","Jian Wushuang was still sitting cross-legged on the futon. His eyebrows were tightly knitted together and waves of violent divine power burst out with him as the center. It was like a wave and it beat in all directions fiercely.","Right now, he was at the most crucial step in his breakthrough to the Supreme-being realm!","The barrier between the Ultimate Ruler and the Supreme Divine Realm had been shattered but it was still firmly resisting Jian Wushuang’s attack.","Once he succeeded, Jian Wushuang would obtain the Supreme great Dao!","If he failed, the barrier would reform and Jian Wushuang’s tens of thousands of years of accumulation would be in vain.","“Oh? Are you about to break through?”","The universal God raised his brows and smiled. “Alright, little guy, I’ll help you.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the Cosmos God stretched out his finger and pointed at the space between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows.","In an instant, a red lotus of the great path floated out from the tip of the Cosmos God’s finger and shot into the space between Jian Wushuang’s eyebrows!","Bang!","In an instant, the addition of the red lotus of the great path was like the last straw that broke the camel’s back. The barrier between the Ultimate Ruler Realm and the Divine Ruler Realm was shattered!","Jian Wushuang’s aura started to surge at an unprecedented speed!","He...he had finally stepped into the ranks of Supreme martial artists!","The dark clouds that were filled with lightning bolts started to gather from the distance.","“Good.”","Upon seeing this, the Cosmos God nodded his head in satisfaction. He then swept his gaze across Long Qing and the others before stroking his beard and chuckling, “Let’s end this Great Clan Gathering. I’m looking forward to seeing how much you’ve grown the next time I see you.”","After saying that, the Cosmos God waved his hand. The entire Ling Xiao Palace was like a fortress built on a beach. As the wind blew past, it gradually disappeared.","A few breaths later, the Cosmos God, along with the entire Ling Xiao Palace and his two disciples, disappeared from everyone’s sight.","Everyone’s surroundings also changed. Their surroundings turned into a bright starry sky, and Ling Xiao Palace was nowhere to be seen.","If it wasn’t for the fact that he could feel his comprehension of the great Dao increasing, everything would have felt like a dream.","“Rumble!!!”","More and more dark clouds gathered. It was as if all the dark clouds in the universe had gathered here. It was vast and mighty, covering the sky and the sun!","An extremely terrifying pressure descended on the entire area!","Even Long Qing and the other half-step unparalleled Supreme-beings were shocked by the pressure!","...","“Not good! Jian Wushuang is about to break through to the Supreme level!”","“Stop him! We can’t let him break through to the Supreme-being realm!”","Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog turned their heads abruptly and glared at Jian Wushuang with killing intent in their eyes.","Long Qing, I’ve received a message from our Hall Master. They’ve gathered and are about to attack the Divine Life Palace. We can’t let Jian Wushuang break through to the Supreme-being realm now!","“I know.”","Long Qing’s face turned extremely gloomy. He had witnessed Jian Wushuang’s talent and power with his own eyes. Jian Wushuang was able to kill an advanced Supreme when he was still in the Ultimate Ruler Realm. If he were to break through to the Supreme realm, how terrible would he be?","Once Jian Wushuang broke through to the Supreme level, he would be able to completely control the Tarot Divine Sword and unleash its full power. Moreover, his chaotic domineering body would be further improved!","At that time, no one in the entire universe would be able to stop him!","At that time, it would also be the beginning of the six major forces’ destruction!","“Kill!”","Long Qing said grimly. Then, he took a step forward and charged at Jian Wushuang!","...","Bang!","In an instant, the void exploded. He had broken through to a half-step unparalleled Supreme during this universe myriad race feast, and his strength had soared again!","He had to kill Jian Wushuang this time!","Clang!","However, before he could touch Jian Wushuang, a white-robed figure was already one step ahead of him. He stood in front of Jian Wushuang and waved his hand at him!","“Today, I, nine tribulations, am here. Who can hurt Jian Wushuang?”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s expression was cold. He casually struck out a palm and exchanged a blow with Long Qing!","“Rumble!”","In an instant, a destructive shock wave swept out from the point of collision, shattering the surrounding stars into fine powder!","Pfft!","Long Qing took three steps back and casually flicked away the strong wind that was coming at his face. His expression was instantly filled with shock and anger.","“Ninth Kalpa King, you dare to stop me?”","The Ninth Kalpa King was expressionless. First, he took a look at Jian Wushuang, who was safe and sound behind him. Then, he raised his eyes again to look at Long Qing and replied coldly, “Who do you think you are to dare to call me by my name?”","The Ninth Kalpa King was dressed in a white robe that was whiter than snow. His white hair fluttered in the wind, and he looked at Long Qing with an ancient indifference.","His pride was even greater than Jian Wushuang’s!","When he had just broken through to the Supreme-being level, his strength was only one step away from being a top-tier Supreme-being. Now that he had broken through to the middle-tier Supreme-being level, drank the divine tea at the Great Clan Gathering, and listened to the great Dao, his strength had increased by more than a tiny bit.","One should know that in terms of talent, the Ninth Kalpa King was only inferior to Jian Wushuang!","“What am I?”","Long Qing was so angry that he laughed out loud, and his eyes were filled with killing intent.","“Good, good, good, Ninth Kalpa King, since you’re courting death, don’t blame me for being merciless! You’ll be buried with Jian Wushuang!”","“Green Dog, let’s attack together and kill these two!”"]},{"number":4398,"title":"Chapter 4398 If the Heavens Go Against Me, It Will Die","paragraphs":["4398 If the Heavens Go Against Me, It Will Die","“Kill!”","Supreme Green Dog flipped his right hand, and a Black God slaying spear appeared in his hand.","He knew that it was not the time to delay. He had to kill Jian Wushuang before he went through the Lightning Tribulation. Otherwise, once Jian Wushuang made a breakthrough, it would be unknown who would win.","Bang!","!!","Supreme Green Dog took a step forward and suddenly turned into a shooting star, rushing toward the Ninth Kalpa King!","Before he even arrived, a cold light arrived!","Thousands of lightning bolts exploded!","On the other side, Long Qing also cast a secret skill and spat out a Crimson Cannonball that had been compressed to the limit!","The two of them attacked at the same time!","The Ninth Kalpa King stood in front of Jian Wushuang, his white hair fluttering in the wind.","Facing the two experts who were charging at him at the same time, his expression was neither happy nor sad. His hands instantly formed a seal!","“The first tribulation, great destruction seal!”","Rumble!","A terrifying aura instantly condensed in the void.","This power directly formed a huge heaven handprint and pressed down ruthlessly.","The giant handprint was covered in palm prints, and each palm print was full of Dao intent. Not only was there monstrous divine power, but there was also an extremely brutal and destructive aura brewing. It slammed ruthlessly onto the Green Dog’s body.","Bang!","As the two attacks collided, a star in the surroundings was shattered!","“Break!”","Supreme Green Dog roared in anger, and a surge of majestic supreme divine power condensed on the God slaying spear, ruthlessly stabbing into the center of the palm imprint that covered the sky!","A hole appeared in the palm print, and Supreme Green Dog was instantly sent flying!","After doing all this, the Ninth Kalpa King didn’t even look at Supreme Green Dog. He turned his head again and faced Long Qing!","The second tribulation, the great suppression seal!","“The third tribulation, great. Yellow Springs seal!”","After two consecutive palm strikes, the scene in front of them suddenly changed.","In the sky, five towering mountains materialized and pressed down with billions of gravitational forces!","On the ground, a yellow spring that seemed to have been taken from the nine Serenities gushed toward Long Qing with a destructive aura!","The sound of water surging could be heard. The yellow spring was like a giant python, coiling up and coiling around Long Qing!","The red cannonball shot out from Long Qing’s mouth shot into the yellow spring. It only created a spray of water before it disappeared.","For a moment, the Ninth Kalpa King was fighting one against two, and he was not at a disadvantage at all!","Ka-chak.","The yellow spring river spiraled up and wrapped around Long Qing. The extremely corrosive water of the yellow spring River instantly corroded Long Qing’s golden robe.","“Ninth Kalpa King!”","Long Qing’s pupils contracted as he growled.","He had never expected that the Ninth Kalpa King, who was only a middle-grade Supreme martial artist, would be so powerful that he could compete with him!","In the distance, Supreme Green Dog’s face was gloomy, and his eyes flickered with killing intent.","One was Jian Wushuang, the other was a Ninth Kalpa King. The Divine Life Palace contained the two most powerful heaven’s favorites of this era!","“If we don’t kill these two today, Cosmos Temple will not even be qualified to compete with the Divine Life Palace in the future!”","Supreme Green Dog’s mind quickly flashed with thoughts. Jian Wushuang and Ninth Kalpa King were like two bright Twin Stars, too dazzling.","A Ninth Kalpa King was already so difficult for them to deal with. If Jian Wushuang broke through to the Supreme-being realm, wouldn’t they be able to sweep the entire universe if they joined forces?","Great universe secret skill, God-killing!!","After taking a deep breath, Supreme Green Dog suddenly used his killing move!","Rumble!","Heaven and earth suddenly began to boil. Countless cracks appeared in the void, causing a void storm and space fragments!","Behind Supreme Green Dog, a huge phantom of a ghost God condensed.","The apparition had a dog’s head and a human’s face, like a Soul Reaper who had walked out of hell. It slowly opened its eyes.","A pair of scarlet eyes shot out like laser beams. The next moment, The Phantom of the ghost God raised his black arm and a 10000-feet-long God-killing spear was raised by him, shooting toward the Ninth Kalpa King!","Rumble!","Countless voids crumbled and were annihilated. A river of stars was directly cut into two pieces by the God-killing spear, creating a violent sonic boom in the air!","This spear was destructive and overbearing to the extreme!","When the Ninth Kalpa King saw this, even he could not help but change his expression.","“Innate divine ability, Demon God evolution!”","The Ninth Kalpa King let out a low groan and directly used his innate magical power as a perfect chaotic lifeform!","In an instant, the Ninth Kalpa King’s already strong and powerful aura skyrocketed again!","...","A terrifying aura swept out, creating a void storm. Countless gusts of wind whistled and exploded.","In the center of the storm, the Ninth Kalpa King’s skin turned dark, and a crisscrossing divine pattern appeared on his body. It was extremely strange, as if a demon from the nine nethers had descended.","Bang!","This spear finally came and ruthlessly hit the Ninth Kalpa King!","This spear attack was simply too powerful!","If it were in the past, the Ninth Kalpa King would naturally choose to retreat and avoid the sharp edge.","But now, he couldn’t retreat. He could only take it head-on!","It was because Jian Wushuang was behind him!","Bang!","In an instant, this spear directly exploded Ninth Kalpa King’s hands that were blocking. It exploded dozens of times in Ninth Kalpa King’s body!","Pfft!","...","The Ninth Kalpa King opened his mouth and spat out a mouthful of divine blood. His face instantly lost its color and became extremely pale.","Before he could recover...","“Roar!”","On the other side, Long Qing, who was entangled by the yellow spring River, finally revealed his true form after letting out a low roar. He transformed into a six-clawed Golden Dragon that was a hundred thousand feet long!","His eyes seemed to be spewing fire. With a casual pull of his claws, the yellow spring River water was directly torn into pieces.","“Ninth Kalpa King, you dare to attempt to defy the heavens? Go to hell!”","The next moment, Long Qing’s figure shuttled back and forth, directly crashing toward the Ninth Kalpa King!","“Going against the heavens?”","The Ninth Kalpa King wiped away the traces of divine blood at the corner of his mouth as if he had heard a funny joke. He said coldly, “Yinian...Divine Kingdom!”","Kacha!","In an instant, the power of a realm descended. The Ninth Kalpa King’s pitch-black hands tore, as if a scroll had been set off in the universe!","This was Ninth Kalpa King’s strongest unique skill. When he fought with Jian Wushuang, it was only a framework.","But now, this One Thought Divine Kingdom technique had completely matured!","Jian Wushuang’s improvement over the past tens of thousands of years was huge. How could his improvement as the Ninth Kalpa King be small?","Countless resplendent immortal radiance descended as mountains rose and stars flickered. In this divine kingdom, flowers, birds, beasts, insects, and rivers flowed, forming a world of its own!","The Ninth Kalpa King was like a god who controlled the world!","From the beginning to the end, his back was facing Jian Wushuang.","Even though his white clothes were stained with blood, even when he was facing two top Supreme martial artists, he did not retreat even half a step!","He didn’t speak much, but he exuded a boundless domineering aura!","Huala!","Then, the Ninth Kalpa King pulled hard, directly dragging Supreme Green Dog and Long Qing into the world of One Thought Divine Kingdom!","After taking a deep breath, the Ninth Kalpa King looked back at Jian Wushuang, who was breaking through to the Supreme level. A smile slowly appeared on his pale face, as if he was talking to himself, “Jian Wushuang, there aren’t many people that I, nine tribulations Wang pingsheng, think highly of. You count me in.”","“If I die, you take care of the Divine Life Palace for me. If I don’t die, let’s fight again!”","After saying that, the Ninth Kalpa King turned around and plunged into the One Thought Divine Kingdom with a resolute and decisive posture!","Even if he died ten thousand times, he would not regret it!","This was the Dao of the Ninth Kalpa King!","“In this vast universe, besides me, the Ninth Kalpa King, who would dare to hurt Jian Wushuang?”","“If Jian Wushuang can’t defeat them, I’ll defeat them. If Jian Wushuang can’t kill them, I’ll kill them!”","“If the heavens obey me, I’ll live. If the heavens defy me, I’ll kill them!!”","The Ninth Kalpa King’s cold voice came from the divine Kingdom."]},{"number":4399,"title":"Chapter 4399 Five Elements Divine Thunder!","paragraphs":["4399 Five Elements Divine Thunder!","At the same time.","The Lightning Tribulation in the starry sky had finally finished condensing.","This Lightning Tribulation was much longer than anyone else’s Supreme Lightning Tribulation. It took much longer to accumulate and was much more powerful than anyone else’s Lightning Tribulation!","The entire sky was filled with thunderclouds, and the terrifying power suppressed all directions. It was as if the ancient thunder God had awakened and was going to punish the world. Muffled sounds kept exploding!","Gusts of strong wind rose up, making a violent whistling sound. It scraped against his skin, cutting him painfully, as if there were wind demons roaring in his ears.","In the distance, some of the Supreme martial artists who had been comprehending the Dao and had yet to leave immediately exclaimed when they saw this.","“How...how can the power of the Lightning Tribulation be so terrifying?”","“As I recall, when I first broke through to the Ruler level, the Lightning Tribulation wasn’t as terrifying as this.”","“I’m afraid the Lightning Tribulation Jian Wushuang is going to pass won’t be simple!”","Lightning was generated in the void, crackling.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes and a ray of light flashed across his purple-gold pupils.","“Now, my divine power has all been converted into Ruler divine power. As long as I survive the Lightning Tribulation, I will truly be a Ruler!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he muttered to himself.","At this moment, he finally woke up.","Previously, he had been immersed in the Dao discussions of the Cosmos Gods and had been trying his best to break through the threshold of the Supreme-being realm.","He wasn’t clear about the outside world. He could only vaguely remember that someone had been protecting him.","“It’s...the Ninth Kalpa King?”","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed when he felt the remaining Battle Aura in the void and the One Thought Divine Kingdom that was born from the void.","“The Ninth Kalpa King is in danger!”","He could feel that the aura of the Ninth Kalpa King within the One Thought Divine Kingdom was gradually weakening.","In order to protect him, the Ninth Kalpa King fought one against two, holding Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog back.","However...","Although the Ninth Kalpa King was very talented, he was only a middle-grade Supreme martial artist. How could he be a match for Long Qing and the Green Dog?","Long Qing was a half-step unparalleled Supreme and a member of the Dragon race. As for the Green Dog, although it was only a peak Supreme, it had the God slaying spear, which was able to perfectly suppress the advantage of Aberrants.","“Long Qing! Green Dog!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with anger and a monstrous killing intent surged up!","Just as he was about to get up and make a move, he saw the Ninth Kalpa King in the One Thought Divine Kingdom. He seemed to have realized Jian Wushuang’s intention and said in a low voice, “Jian Wushuang! Don’t worry about me and quickly break through to the Supreme-being level!”","“If you don’t become a Supreme martial artist, not only will you and I die, but even the Divine Life Palace will be destroyed!”","“I’ve just received news that, apart from the Great Sun Divine Kingdom, the other five top forces have all attacked the Divine Life Palace!”","Jian Wushuang was shocked when he heard that.","“Good! Ninth Kalpa King, you must hold on!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. He wasn’t a pretentious person and he understood that he couldn’t help the situation with his current strength!","Only by experiencing the Lightning Tribulation and truly breaking through to the Supreme-being realm could he save the building from collapsing and turn the tide!","“Then come!”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and stared at the Lightning Tribulation in the sky.","“BOOM!”","A red lightning bolt as thick as a bucket and covered in flames struck down from the thunderclouds!","Five elements Lightning Tribulation!","This is the five elements Lightning Tribulation!","In an instant, the Supreme martial artists who were watching from a distance narrowed their eyes and exclaimed in low voices.","Jian Wushuang is in trouble now. The five elements Lightning Tribulation is linked and each of them is born. Its power is dozens of times that of an ordinary Lightning Tribulation!","Kacha!","The speed of the divine fourth Fire Thunder was extremely fast. At first glance, it seemed to be on the horizon, but in the next moment, it struck Jian Wushuang’s body!","Weng.","Instantly, Jian Wushuang groaned. The violent power of Thunderbolt and the surging flames almost instantly tore a crack in his divine body!","Endless power of lightning and fire poured into his body through the cracks, burning his internal organs!","“Break!”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes were filled with fighting spirit. He activated his chaotic domineering body and crushed the Fire Divine Thunder.","If he couldn’t get the chaotic domineering body, this divine fourth fire lightning would probably injure him severely in an instant!","But now, after he had awakened the chaotic domineering body, his divine body was more than a million times stronger than before.","In just a breath’s time, the cracks on his divine body had recovered, leaving only a black burn mark.","Bang!","The second sacred lightning bolt struck down!","The sea water divine lightning!","...","This time, Jian Wushuang didn’t take the beating passively. Instead, he flipped his right hand and directly used the Wuqi Divine Sword!","Split open the sky!!!","A blood-red sword light was instantly slashed out by Jian Wushuang, and it fiercely hit the sea water divine Thunder!","The sword drew a beautiful arc in the air and collided with the hai water divine lightning!","Kacha~!","The sea water divine lightning collapsed, and the sky-opening sword ray also shattered.","As if it had sensed Jian Wushuang’s intention to resist, the Lightning Tribulation seemed to be angry and made a loud noise.","“Bang! Bang!”","In an instant, the Yimu divine lightning and the bingtu divine lightning struck down from the thunderclouds at the same time!","For a moment, the world was covered in white light by the lightning.","“Good!”","...","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang’s expression turned grave.","“Sundering stars!”","Wuxu chaotic cauldron!","Jian Wushuang first struck out a ray of blue sword light and shattered the Yimu divine Thunder. Then, he turned over his right hand and took out the Wuxu chaotic cauldron again. He then smashed it toward the bingtu divine Thunder!","Bang!","An earth-shattering explosion was heard, and a huge mushroom cloud rose.","The Wuxu chaotic cauldron flew back and fell into Jian Wushuang’s hand. The bingtu divine thunder was also shattered!","“This is the last one!”","Jian Wushuang raised his head to look at the Lightning Tribulation, and the divine light in his eyes grew three inches!","Among the five elements, seventh metal was the most powerful killing element and was also the Qi of the five elements with the greatest attack power!","The last divine lightning was bound to surpass any of the previous divine lightning bolts, even their combined power!","Rumble!","In the thunderclouds, Silver Snakes slithered and slithered, and a murderous aura spread out.","“The divine thunder of gengjin is the most powerful. I wonder if Jian Wushuang can withstand it!”","Jian Wushuang is really a monster. “I’m afraid that no one can easily pass through the five elements divine Thunder, but it seems that Jian Wushuang is not having a hard time dealing with it!”","“BOOM!”","In the midst of their discussion, a bolt of golden lightning as thick as a tree suddenly struck down from the endless thunderclouds!","This golden divine lightning was extremely powerful. It was like the roar of a Thunder God, and the sound alone was deafening!","At this moment, everything in the world was replaced by this golden divine thunder!","“Come!”","Jian Wushuang laughed loudly. His black hair that reached his heels flew up and the divine patterns on his body glowed!","In the face of the divine Thunder of aged gold, he did not retreat but advanced instead. He leaped up and took the initiative to grab the divine thunder of aged gold!"]},{"number":4400,"title":"Chapter 4400 Primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation","paragraphs":["4400 Primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation","Bang!","Jian Wushuang’s hands glowed with golden light. He grabbed the divine gengjin thunder and pulled it hard!","Huala!","In an instant, countless lightning bolts exploded and Jian Wushuang’s face was covered in white light. The purple ‘Chuan’ character between his eyebrows was even more dazzling!","The electric snakes hit Jian Wushuang’s body like iron nails hitting a steel plate, making a crackling sound and countless sparks!","“H-how can this child’s divine body be so strong?”","Heaven-defying!!","In the distance, the pupils of the Supreme martial artists who had not left all shrank.","They were able to cultivate to the level of Supreme, so their judgment was naturally not bad. In their eyes, Jian Wushuang’s divine body was like a spotless treasure body without any flaws. It did not give the Geng metal divine Thunder any chance to take advantage of it.","Even they couldn’t easily take on this divine gengjin thunder!","“The Lightning Tribulation of the five elements is just so-so.”","Jian Wushuang stood in the air and laughed. The muscles on his arms bulged and he opened his mouth to swallow the divine gengjin thunder!","Peng peng peng!","After swallowing the divine Thunder of gengjin, it suddenly exploded in Jian Wushuang’s body like a cannonball.","However, Jian Wushuang only twisted his chaotic domineering body and completely crushed the divine lightning of gengjin.","Chaotic domineering body could be said to be the number one divine body in all of eternity!","The five elements thunder was nothing in front of the chaotic body.","As Jian Wushuang devoured the divine thunder of gengjin, his divine body became more and more brilliant.","“He...it actually swallowed the divine lightning?”","“Is he still a human?”","“This is the first time I’ve seen someone directly swallow the tribulation lightning during the tribulation!”","In the distance, countless Supreme martial artists were dumbfounded. They were so shocked that they could not speak.","This was the first time they had discovered that the Lightning Tribulation could be passed through like this.","Jian Wushuang landed from the sky and looked at the Lightning Tribulation with his hands behind his back.","Logically speaking, the five elements Lightning Tribulation should have dissipated after being struck by the five divine thunders.","However, the Lightning Tribulation above Jian Wushuang’s head did not dissipate. Instead, it became more and more condensed!","The black clouds pressed down on the city, and the Lightning Tribulation was so heavy that it seemed like the sky was going to collapse.","A pressure that was many times more terrifying than the previous one descended on the scene!","“What’s going on?”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang frowned.","The many Supreme martial artists in the distance were even more bewildered.","“Didn’t you pass the five elements Lightning Tribulation? Why haven’t the thunderclouds dispersed yet?”","“That’s right! This Lightning Tribulation is too abnormal!”","“Since ancient times, I’ve never heard of a Lightning Tribulation that doesn’t dissipate after transcending!”","Rumble!","At this moment, the Lightning Tribulation in the sky let out a roar that shook the Nine Heavens and ten lands like the angry god!","The roar turned corporeal and spread out in rings, shattering the endless void!","Countless lightning snakes as thick as a bowl shot through the dark clouds, terrifying to the extreme.","“This, this is the real Lightning Tribulation!”","The Lightning Tribulation is coming!!!","In an instant, countless Supreme martial artists cried out in horror.","Only now did they realize that the five elements Lightning Tribulation was just an appetizer. The real Lightning Tribulation was in front of them!","Suddenly, the phenomenon changed!","Among the thunderclouds, the great Dao evolved, chaos emerged, and illusory images of Dragons and phoenixes emerged, circling and roaring. In the thunderclouds, there seemed to be a giant from the ninth heaven holding a Thunder God hammer, staring at Jian Wushuang and wanting to kill him!","Countless thunderclaps exploded and produced muffled sounds. It was as if golden-armored men were beating the war drums in the ancient heavenly court. Everyone’s heart trembled with every sound.","Then, the five elements thunder gathered from all directions. In the end, it twisted and grew, then merged together to form a black divine Thunder that looked like the whip of the Thunder God!","After the divine black thunder condensed, a chaotic aura that transcended the immemorial era spread in all directions. In the distance, many Supreme martial artists who sensed this aura changed their expressions and said in disbelief, ”","“This...this is the Chaos Divine lightning!”","Chaos Divine lightning, the publicly acknowledged first Lightning Tribulation since ancient times!","“The chaos Lightning Tribulation only exists in legends. I can’t believe it actually exists!","“The primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation is too powerful. Even I, a peak Supreme, can’t withstand it. How can Jian Wushuang?”","“Is Jian Wushuang going to die in the chaos Lightning Tribulation?”","“Heaven-defying! This was too heaven-defying! I’m afraid Jian Wushuang is the first Ultimate Ruler to summon the primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation in all of history!”","“Kacha!!!”","...","The power of the thunderclouds was still growing stronger. It was like a disaster from the sky, turning everything under the thunderclouds into nothingness!","Under this pressure, even the Ninth Kalpa King’s One Thought Divine Kingdom could not be maintained and shattered.","The three figures escaped in a sorry state. They saw that the Ninth Kalpa King’s face was sallow, his white robe was covered with blood marks like Plum Flower petals, and his divine body was extremely weak.","Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog weren’t in a good state either. One of them had a few dragon scales peeled off, and the other God slaying spear was broken!","“Ninth Kalpa King, you deserve to die!”","Long Qing’s eyes flickered with killing intent, and he looked at the Ninth Kalpa King with shock and anger.","The Ninth Kalpa King ignored him and looked at Jian Wushuang. He could not help but frown.","“This is...Primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation?”","He narrowed his eyes and his expression changed slightly.","He was also a perfect chaotic lifeform, but he only had seven-colored Lightning Tribulation, which was much weaker than the chaos Lightning Tribulation.","At the same time, Long Qing and Supreme Green Dog had also noticed this scene.","...","“Not good! Jian Wushuang is going to cross his tribulation!” Long Qing’s pupils shrank, and he was about to move.","Supreme Green Dog pulled him back.","“Green Dog, what do you mean by this?” Long Qing asked, puzzled.","Long Qing, this is the primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation!","Supreme Green Dog stared at the thunderclouds above Jian Wushuang and said solemnly.","“Primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation?”","Long Qing didn’t react for a moment. After thinking about it for a while, his face suddenly changed.","“What? It was actually the primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation? Jian Wushuang actually attracted the primal Chaos Lightning Tribulation?”","He let out a low cry, and then, as if he had thought of something, the corners of his mouth pulled up into a big smile.","“Hahahaha, Jian Wushuang is dead for sure this time! The heavens are really helping me!”","Supreme Green Dog’s mouth also curved into a smile as he nodded, “That’s right. The chaos Lightning Tribulation is extremely rare. It is the most powerful Lightning Tribulation. Even I don’t dare to say that I can pass it. How can Jian Wushuang not die?”","Bang!","Just as they were discussing, the black divine Thunder finally finished charging up and struck down at Jian Wushuang!","In an instant, the wind demon roared and the Thunder God roared. The entire universe was blinded, and only the heaven-shaking black divine Thunder was left!"]}]);
